/-!
## Kernel construction and the real-variable multiplier estimates

Results from §4 ("Kernel construction and the real-variable multiplier estimates") of
`blueprints/discrete-sw.tex`. Throughout `E = EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)` with `n ≥ 1` where
needed, and `K = swKernel Ω`.

### Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): polar integration and a dyadic resolution

Polar integration (with the sphere measure `volume.toSphere` of Mathlib's cone construction):
* `integral_polar`: `∫_E f = ∫_{S × (0,∞)} f(rθ) d(σ × r^{n-1} dr)` (no integrability needed);
* `integral_polar_iterated`: for integrable `f`, `∫_E f = ∫_S ∫_0^∞ r^{n-1} f(rθ) dr dσ(θ)`;
* `integral_homog_mul_radial`: for `Ω` homogeneous of degree zero and any `b`,
  `∫ Ω(x) b(|x|) |x|^{-n} dx = (∫_0^∞ b(r) dr/r) (∫_S Ω dσ)`;
* `integral_swKernel_mul_radial_eq_zero`: hence `∫ K(x) b(|x|) dx = 0` for every radial factor.

The dyadic resolution:
* `dyadicEta` (`η`, smooth, radial, `1` on `|x| ≤ 1`, `0` on `|x| ≥ 2`, values in `[0,1]`) and
  `dyadicPsi` (`ψ(x) = η(x) - η(2x)`, smooth, nonnegative, supported in `1/2 ≤ |x| ≤ 2`),
  with the telescoping identity `sum_dyadicPsi`;
* `dyadicKernel Ω j = K_j`, `K_j(x) = K(x) ψ(2^{-j} x)` for `j : ℤ`, with
  `contDiff_dyadicKernel`, `norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le` (`‖∂^k K_j‖ ≤ C_k 2^{-j(n+k)}`),
  `support_dyadicKernel`, `dyadicKernel_L1` (uniform `L¹` bound), `integral_dyadicKernel`
  (`∫ K_j = 0`), `summable_tsum_norm_dyadicKernel_latEmbed_le` (lattice sums for `j ≥ 1`);
* `hasSum_dyadicKernel`: `∑_{j ≥ 1} K_j(x) = (1 - η(x)) K(x)` (4.2);
* `integral_eC_mul_dyadicKernel`, `integral_radialPoly_mul_eC_mul_dyadicKernel`: the radial
  cancellation (4.3).

### Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`): uniform signed dyadic multipliers and their limit

`𝓕` is Mathlib's Fourier transform `𝓕 f(ξ) = ∫ e(-x·ξ) f(x) dx` (the blueprint's transform
differs by the reflection `ξ ↦ -ξ`, which does not affect any of the bounds below).
* `norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le`: (4.4), `|𝓕 K_j(ξ)| ≤ C min(2^j|ξ|, (2^j|ξ|)⁻¹)`;
* `sum_min_two_zpow_le`: `∑_{j ∈ J} min(2^j t, (2^j t)⁻¹) ≤ C₀` uniformly in `t > 0`, `J`;
* `norm_fourier_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le`, `norm_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le`,
  `norm_fderiv_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le`: multiplier, size and gradient bounds for the finite
  sums `∑_{j ∈ J} c_j K_j` with `|c_j| ≤ 1`, uniform in `J` and `c`;
* `exists_eLpNorm_convolution_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le`: the uniform `L^p` bound, `1 < p < ∞`
  (from the Calderón–Zygmund theorem, Lemma 4.2);
* `dyadicSymbol` (`m_K = ∑_{j ≥ 1} 𝓕 K_j`) with `dyadicSymbol_spec` (absolute convergence,
  `m_K(0) = 0`, boundedness), `exists_eLpNorm_fourierInv_dyadicSymbol_mul_le` (the `L^p`
  multiplier bound on Schwartz inputs) and `fourierInv_dyadicSymbol_mul_eq_integral` (its kernel
  is `K (1 - η)`, with absolutely convergent integrals).
The proofs of (4.4) use that `K_0` is a Schwartz function with mean zero (its Fourier transform
is Schwartz and vanishes at `0`) and the scaling `𝓕 K_j(ξ) = 𝓕 K_0(2^j ξ)`; the limit statements
use pointwise convergence of `(∑_{j=1}^N K_j) * f` (via `𝓕⁻(𝓕H ⋅ 𝓕f) = H * f` and dominated
convergence on both sides) and Fatou's lemma.

### Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): a positive band-limited averaging kernel

* `bpBump` (`b`, a real even radial smooth bump supported in `|x| < 1/32`, so in the cube
  `[-1/32,1/32]^n`, with `b(0) = 1`; `bpBump_spec`), `bpU = 𝓕⁻ b`, `bpNorm = ∫ |ǔ|²`;
* `bpPhi` (`φ = |ǔ|² / ∫|ǔ|²`, `bpPhi_def`) with its Schwartz version `bpPhiS`
  (`coe_bpPhiS`); `bpPhi_nonneg`, `bpPhi_neg`, `integral_bpPhi`, `integrable_pow_mul_bpPhi`,
  `integral_coord_mul_bpPhi` (vanishing first moments), `fourier_bpPhi_eq_zero`
  (`supp 𝓕φ ⊆ [-1/16,1/16]^n`), `fourier_bpPhi_zero`;
* `bpPhiDil` (`φ_J`), `bpTau` (`τ_J`) with `fourier_bpPhiDil` (`𝓕 φ_J = τ_J`), `bpTau_eq_zero`,
  `bpTau_zero`, `integral_bpPhiDil`, `bpPhiDil_nonneg`;
* `bpPhiDil_le_envelope` (`φ_J ≤ C B_{2^J}`) and the maximal dominations
  `lintegral_bpPhiDil_mul_le_cubeMaximalEuclidean`, `tsum_bpPhiDil_latEmbed_mul_le_cubeMaximalInt`
  (sampled lattice kernel, `J ≥ 0`) and their `iSup` forms.
`𝓕 φ = (∫|ǔ|²)⁻¹ (b ⋆ b)` follows from the Schwartz product-convolution identity and Fourier
inversion; the support statement is then the support of the autocorrelation.

### Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`): signed smoothing errors for truncation

* `truncKernel Ω J = ∑_{j ≥ J} K_j` (locally a finite sum; `contDiff_truncKernel`,
  `norm_iteratedFDeriv_truncKernel_le`: `‖D^k 𝒦_J(x)‖ ≤ A_k (2^J + |x|)^{-n-k}`),
  `symbolKernel Ω = (1 - η) K = 𝒦`, `bpPhiDilC J = (φ_J : ℂ)`, and the smoothing errors
  `smoothErr Ω J = E_J = ∑_{j ≥ J} K_j - φ_J * 𝒦`;
* `smoothErr_hasSum`, `tendsto_eLpNorm_smoothErr_sub_partialSum`: the series (4.6), with the
  `L¹` bounds `C 2^{J-j}` (`j ≥ J`) and `C 2^{j-J}` (`j < J`), and its `L¹` convergence;
  `integrable_smoothErr`, `contDiff_smoothErr`, `hasFDerivAt_smoothErr`;
* `norm_smoothErr_le`: the decay bounds (4.5) for `E_J` and `∇E_J`;
* `fourier_smoothErr` (`∫ E_J = 0` and `𝓕 E_J = ∑_{j ≥ J} 𝓕 K_j - τ_J m_K`, the identity
  `m_{≥J} = τ_J m_K + Ê_J` of Lemma 10.1) and `norm_fourier_smoothErr_le`
  (`|𝓕 E_J(ξ)| ≤ C min(2^J|ξ|, (2^J|ξ|)⁻¹)`);
* `exists_eLpNorm_convolution_sum_smul_smoothErr_le`: the uniform `L^p` bound for finite signed
  sums `∑_{J ∈ S} c_J E_J`, `|c_J| ≤ 1`, from the Calderón–Zygmund theorem (Lemma 4.2).
The decay bounds are proved from the explicit form
`E_J = (𝒦_J - φ_J * 𝒦_J) - ∑_{1 ≤ j < J} φ_J * K_j`: second-order Taylor expansion, the vanishing
first moments of `φ_J` and Peetre's inequality for the first part, and the cancellation
`∫ K_j = 0` against the Schwartz decay of `∇φ_J` for the second.
-/

open MeasureTheory Real Set Metric
open scoped ContDiff

variable {n : ℕ}

/-! ### Polar integration -/

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), polar integration formula: for `n ≥ 1` and any
`f : E → F`, `∫_E f(x) dx = ∫_{S^{n-1} × (0,∞)} f(rθ) d(σ ⊗ r^{n-1} dr)(θ, r)`, where
`σ = volume.toSphere` is the cone measure `σ(A) = n vol{rθ : θ ∈ A, 0 < r < 1}`. -/
theorem integral_polar (hn : 1 ≤ n) {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℝ F]
    (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F) :
    ∫ x, f x = ∫ p : sphere (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1 × Ioi (0 : ℝ),
      f (p.2.1 • (p.1 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)))
        ∂((volume : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).toSphere.prod
          (Measure.volumeIoiPow (n - 1))) := by
  have : Nonempty (Fin n) := ⟨⟨0, hn⟩⟩
  calc
    (∫ x, f x) = ∫ x : ({0}ᶜ : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))), f x.1 ∂
          ((volume : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).comap (↑)) := by
      rw [integral_subtype_comap (measurableSet_singleton _).compl f,
        restrict_compl_singleton]
    _ = _ := by
      have := (Measure.measurePreserving_homeomorphUnitSphereProd
          (volume : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)))).integral_comp
          (Homeomorph.measurableEmbedding _)
          (f ∘ Subtype.val ∘ (homeomorphUnitSphereProd (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).symm)
      simpa using this

/-- Helper: integrating against `volumeIoiPow k` is integrating against `r^k dr` on `(0,∞)`. -/
theorem integral_volumeIoiPow {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℝ F]
    (k : ℕ) (g : ℝ → F) :
    ∫ r : Ioi (0 : ℝ), g r.1 ∂(Measure.volumeIoiPow k) = ∫ r in Ioi (0 : ℝ), r ^ k • g r := by
  simp only [Measure.volumeIoiPow, ENNReal.ofReal]
  rw [integral_withDensity_eq_integral_smul,
    integral_subtype_comap measurableSet_Ioi fun a ↦ Real.toNNReal (a ^ k) • g a,
    setIntegral_congr_fun measurableSet_Ioi fun x hx ↦ ?_]
  · rw [NNReal.smul_def, Real.coe_toNNReal _ (pow_nonneg (le_of_lt hx) _)]
  · exact (measurable_subtype_coe.pow_const _).real_toNNReal

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), polar integration for `Ω(x) b(|x|) |x|^{-n}`: if `Ω`
is homogeneous of degree zero and `n ≥ 1`, then for every `b : ℝ → ℂ`,
`∫_E Ω(x) b(|x|) |x|^{-n} dx = (∫_0^∞ b(r) dr/r) (∫_{S^{n-1}} Ω dσ)` (both sides are Bochner
integrals, so no integrability hypothesis is needed). -/
theorem integral_homog_mul_radial (hn : 1 ≤ n) {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (hΩ : ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), x ≠ 0 → ∀ t : ℝ, 0 < t → Ω (t • x) = Ω x)
    (b : ℝ → ℂ) :
    ∫ x, Ω x * b ‖x‖ / ((‖x‖ ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ) =
      (∫ r in Ioi (0 : ℝ), b r / r) *
        ∫ θ, Ω θ ∂((volume : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).toSphere) := by
  rw [integral_polar hn]
  have key : ∀ p : sphere (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1 × Ioi (0 : ℝ),
      Ω (p.2.1 • (p.1 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))) * b ‖p.2.1 • (p.1 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))‖
        / ((‖p.2.1 • (p.1 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))‖ ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ)
      = Ω p.1 * (b p.2.1 / ((p.2.1 ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ)) := by
    rintro ⟨⟨θ, hθ⟩, ⟨r, hr⟩⟩
    have hθ1 : ‖θ‖ = 1 := by simpa using hθ
    have hθ0 : θ ≠ 0 := by rintro rfl; simp at hθ1
    simp only [norm_smul, hθ1, mul_one, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (show (0:ℝ) < r from hr)]
    rw [hΩ θ hθ0 r hr, mul_div_assoc]
  simp_rw [key]
  rw [integral_prod_mul (fun θ : sphere (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1 => Ω θ)
    (fun r : Ioi (0:ℝ) => b r / ((r.1 ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ)), mul_comm]
  congr 1
  rw [integral_volumeIoiPow (n - 1) (fun r => b r / ((r ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ))]
  refine setIntegral_congr_fun measurableSet_Ioi fun r hr => ?_
  have hr0 : (r : ℂ) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast (ne_of_gt (show (0:ℝ) < r from hr))
  obtain ⟨m, rfl⟩ : ∃ m, n = m + 1 := ⟨n - 1, by omega⟩
  simp only [Nat.add_sub_cancel, Complex.real_smul]
  push_cast
  field_simp
  ring


/-- Helper: an integrable function on `E` is integrable in polar coordinates. -/
theorem integrable_polar_of_integrable {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F]
    [NormedSpace ℝ F] {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hf : Integrable f) :
    Integrable (fun p : sphere (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1 × Ioi (0 : ℝ) =>
      f (p.2.1 • (p.1 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))))
        ((volume : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).toSphere.prod
          (Measure.volumeIoiPow (n - 1))) := by
  have := (Measure.measurePreserving_homeomorphUnitSphereProd
      (volume : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)))).integrable_comp_emb
          (Homeomorph.measurableEmbedding _)
          (g := f ∘ Subtype.val ∘ (homeomorphUnitSphereProd (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).symm)
  have h2 : Integrable (fun x : ({0}ᶜ : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))) => f x.1)
      ((volume : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).comap (↑)) := by
    have := (integrableOn_iff_comap_subtypeVal (μ := volume) (f := f)
      (measurableSet_singleton (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).compl).1 hf.integrableOn
    simpa [Function.comp_def] using this
  have h3 := this.1 (by simpa only [Function.comp_def, Homeomorph.symm_apply_apply] using h2)
  simpa [Function.comp_def] using h3

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), polar integration, iterated form: for `n ≥ 1` and
integrable `f`, `∫_E f = ∫_{S^{n-1}} ∫_0^∞ r^{n-1} f(rθ) dr dσ(θ)`. -/
theorem integral_polar_iterated (hn : 1 ≤ n) {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F]
    [NormedSpace ℝ F] [CompleteSpace F] {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hf : Integrable f) :
    ∫ x, f x = ∫ θ, (∫ r in Ioi (0 : ℝ), r ^ (n - 1) • f (r • (θ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))))
      ∂((volume : Measure (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))).toSphere) := by
  rw [integral_polar hn, integral_prod _ (integrable_polar_of_integrable hf)]
  congr 1
  funext θ
  exact integral_volumeIoiPow (n - 1) (fun r => f (r • (θ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))))


/-! ### The cutoffs `η` and `ψ` -/

/-- The one-dimensional smooth profile `a(r) = smoothTransition((4 - r²)/3)` used to build `η`
(Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`)): `a = 1` on `[0,1]`, `a = 0` on `[2,∞)`, nonincreasing. -/
noncomputable def dyadicProfile (r : ℝ) : ℝ := smoothTransition ((4 - r ^ 2) / 3)

/-- Helper: `a(r) = 1` for `0 ≤ r ≤ 1`. -/
lemma dyadicProfile_eq_one {r : ℝ} (h0 : 0 ≤ r) (h : r ≤ 1) : dyadicProfile r = 1 :=
  smoothTransition.one_of_one_le (by nlinarith)

/-- Helper: `a(r) = 0` for `r ≥ 2`. -/
lemma dyadicProfile_eq_zero {r : ℝ} (h : 2 ≤ r) : dyadicProfile r = 0 :=
  smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by nlinarith)

/-- Helper: `a` is nonincreasing on `[0, ∞)`. -/
lemma dyadicProfile_antitoneOn {r s : ℝ} (h0 : 0 ≤ r) (h : r ≤ s) :
    dyadicProfile s ≤ dyadicProfile r :=
  smoothTransition.monotone (by nlinarith)

/-- The smooth radial cutoff `η(x) = a(|x|)` of Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`). -/
noncomputable def dyadicEta (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ := dyadicProfile ‖x‖

/-- The dyadic bump `ψ(x) = η(x) - η(2x)` of Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`). -/
noncomputable def dyadicPsi (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ :=
  dyadicEta x - dyadicEta ((2 : ℝ) • x)

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): `η` is smooth (everywhere, including at `0`). -/
theorem contDiff_dyadicEta : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (dyadicEta (n := n)) := by
  have : (dyadicEta (n := n)) = fun x => smoothTransition ((4 - ‖x‖ ^ 2) / 3) := rfl
  rw [this]
  exact (smoothTransition.contDiff (n := ⊤)).comp
    (((contDiff_const.sub (contDiff_norm_sq ℝ)).div_const _))

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): `η = 1` on `|x| ≤ 1`. -/
theorem dyadicEta_eq_one {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (h : ‖x‖ ≤ 1) : dyadicEta x = 1 :=
  dyadicProfile_eq_one (norm_nonneg _) h

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): `η = 0` on `|x| ≥ 2`. -/
theorem dyadicEta_eq_zero {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (h : 2 ≤ ‖x‖) : dyadicEta x = 0 :=
  dyadicProfile_eq_zero h

/-- Helper: `0 ≤ η ≤ 1`. -/
theorem dyadicEta_mem_Icc (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : dyadicEta x ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 :=
  ⟨smoothTransition.nonneg _, smoothTransition.le_one _⟩

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): `ψ` is smooth. -/
theorem contDiff_dyadicPsi : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (dyadicPsi (n := n)) :=
  contDiff_dyadicEta.sub (contDiff_dyadicEta.comp (contDiff_const_smul _))

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): `ψ ≥ 0`. -/
theorem dyadicPsi_nonneg (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : 0 ≤ dyadicPsi x := by
  have : ‖x‖ ≤ ‖(2 : ℝ) • x‖ := by
    rw [norm_smul]; norm_num; linarith [norm_nonneg x]
  exact sub_nonneg.2 (dyadicProfile_antitoneOn (norm_nonneg _) this)

/-- Helper: `ψ(x) = 0` for `|x| ≤ 1/2`. -/
theorem dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_le {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (h : ‖x‖ ≤ 1 / 2) :
    dyadicPsi x = 0 := by
  rw [dyadicPsi, dyadicEta_eq_one (by linarith), dyadicEta_eq_one, sub_self]
  rw [norm_smul]; norm_num; linarith

/-- Helper: `ψ(x) = 0` for `|x| ≥ 2`. -/
theorem dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_ge {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (h : 2 ≤ ‖x‖) :
    dyadicPsi x = 0 := by
  rw [dyadicPsi, dyadicEta_eq_zero h, dyadicEta_eq_zero, sub_self]
  rw [norm_smul]; norm_num; linarith

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): `ψ` is supported where `1/2 < |x| < 2`. -/
theorem support_dyadicPsi :
    Function.support (dyadicPsi (n := n)) ⊆ {x | 1 / 2 < ‖x‖ ∧ ‖x‖ < 2} := by
  intro x hx
  by_contra h
  simp only [mem_ofPred_eq, not_and_or, not_lt] at h
  rcases h with h | h
  · exact hx (dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_le h)
  · exact hx (dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_ge h)

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): the closed support of `ψ` lies in `1/2 ≤ |x| ≤ 2`. -/
theorem tsupport_dyadicPsi :
    tsupport (dyadicPsi (n := n)) ⊆ {x | 1 / 2 ≤ ‖x‖ ∧ ‖x‖ ≤ 2} := by
  refine closure_minimal (support_dyadicPsi.trans fun x hx => ⟨hx.1.le, hx.2.le⟩) ?_
  exact (isClosed_le continuous_const continuous_norm).inter
    (isClosed_le continuous_norm continuous_const)

/-- Helper: `ψ` is radial, `ψ(x) = a(|x|) - a(2|x|)`. -/
theorem dyadicPsi_eq_profile (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    dyadicPsi x = dyadicProfile ‖x‖ - dyadicProfile (2 * ‖x‖) := by
  simp [dyadicPsi, dyadicEta, norm_smul]

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), telescoping identity:
`∑_{j=1}^{J} ψ(2^{-j} x) = η(2^{-J} x) - η(x)` (indexed by `j + 1`, `j < J`). -/
theorem sum_dyadicPsi (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (J : ℕ) :
    ∑ j ∈ Finset.range J, dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-((j : ℤ) + 1)) • x) =
      dyadicEta ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-(J : ℤ)) • x) - dyadicEta x := by
  induction J with
  | zero => simp
  | succ J ih =>
    rw [Finset.sum_range_succ, ih, dyadicPsi, smul_smul]
    have : (2 : ℝ) * 2 ^ (-((J : ℤ) + 1)) = 2 ^ (-(J : ℤ)) := by
      rw [neg_add, zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero, zpow_neg_one]; ring
    rw [this]; push_cast; ring


/-! ### The dyadic kernels `K_j` -/

/-- The dyadic pieces `K_j(x) = K(x) ψ(2^{-j} x)`, `j ∈ ℤ`, of Blueprint Lemma 4.1
(`lem:dyadic`). -/
noncomputable def dyadicKernel (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (j : ℤ)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  swKernel Ω x * (dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) • x) : ℂ)

variable {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}

/-- Helper: homogeneity `K(tx) = t^{-n} K(x)` for `t > 0`. -/
lemma swKernel_smul
    (hΩ : ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), x ≠ 0 → ∀ t : ℝ, 0 < t → Ω (t • x) = Ω x)
    {t : ℝ} (ht : 0 < t) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    swKernel Ω (t • x) = (((t ^ n)⁻¹ : ℝ) : ℂ) * swKernel Ω x := by
  by_cases hx : x = 0
  · simp [swKernel, hx]
  have htx : t • x ≠ 0 := smul_ne_zero ht.ne' hx
  have hxn : (‖x‖ : ℂ) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast (norm_pos_iff.2 hx).ne'
  have htn : (t : ℂ) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast ht.ne'
  simp only [swKernel, htx, hx, ite_false, hΩ x hx t ht, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs,
    abs_of_pos ht]
  push_cast
  field_simp
  ring

/-- Helper: `K` is smooth off the origin. -/
lemma contDiffAt_swKernel (hΩ : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ Ω {0}ᶜ) {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
    (hx : x ≠ 0) : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ (swKernel Ω) x := by
  have h1 : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ Ω x := hΩ.contDiffAt (isOpen_compl_singleton.mem_nhds hx)
  have h2 : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ (fun y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => ((‖y‖ ^ n)⁻¹ : ℝ)) x :=
    ((contDiffAt_norm ℝ hx).pow n).inv (by positivity)
  have h3 : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ (fun y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => ((((‖y‖ ^ n)⁻¹ : ℝ)) : ℂ)) x :=
    Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.contDiffAt.comp x h2
  refine (h1.mul h3).congr_of_eventuallyEq ?_
  filter_upwards [isOpen_compl_singleton.mem_nhds hx] with y hy
  simp [swKernel, show y ≠ 0 from hy, div_eq_mul_inv]

/-- Helper: the scaling identity `K_j(x) = 2^{-jn} K_0(2^{-j} x)`. -/
lemma dyadicKernel_eq_smul
    (hΩ : ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), x ≠ 0 → ∀ t : ℝ, 0 < t → Ω (t • x) = Ω x)
    (j : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    dyadicKernel Ω j x = ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j)) ^ n • dyadicKernel Ω 0 ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) • x) := by
  have hc : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ (-j) := by positivity
  rw [dyadicKernel, dyadicKernel, swKernel_smul hΩ hc, neg_zero, zpow_zero, one_smul,
    Complex.real_smul]
  have : ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j)) ^ n ≠ 0 := by positivity
  push_cast
  field_simp

/-- Helper: `K_0(x) = 0` for `|x| ≤ 1/2`. -/
lemma dyadicKernel_zero_eq_zero_of_le {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (h : ‖x‖ ≤ 1 / 2) :
    dyadicKernel Ω 0 x = 0 := by
  simp [dyadicKernel, dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_le h]

/-- Helper: `K_0(x) = 0` for `|x| ≥ 2`. -/
lemma dyadicKernel_zero_eq_zero_of_ge {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (h : 2 ≤ ‖x‖) :
    dyadicKernel Ω 0 x = 0 := by
  simp [dyadicKernel, dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_ge h]

/-- Helper: `K_0` is smooth on all of `E` (it vanishes near `0`). -/
lemma contDiff_dyadicKernel_zero (hΩ : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ Ω {0}ᶜ) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (dyadicKernel Ω 0) := by
  rw [contDiff_iff_contDiffAt]
  intro x
  by_cases hx : x = 0
  · subst hx
    refine (contDiffAt_const (c := (0 : ℂ))).congr_of_eventuallyEq ?_
    filter_upwards [ball_mem_nhds (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 1 / 2)]
      with y hy
    rw [mem_ball_zero_iff] at hy
    exact dyadicKernel_zero_eq_zero_of_le hy.le
  · have h2 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
        ((dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-(0 : ℤ)) • y) : ℝ) : ℂ)) :=
      Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.comp (contDiff_dyadicPsi.comp (contDiff_const_smul _))
    exact (contDiffAt_swKernel hΩ hx).mul h2.contDiffAt

/-- Helper: `K_0` has compact support. -/
lemma hasCompactSupport_dyadicKernel_zero : HasCompactSupport (dyadicKernel Ω 0) := by
  refine HasCompactSupport.intro (isCompact_closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 2) ?_
  intro x hx
  rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, not_le] at hx
  exact dyadicKernel_zero_eq_zero_of_ge hx.le

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): each `K_j` is smooth on all of `E`. -/
theorem contDiff_dyadicKernel (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (dyadicKernel Ω j) := by
  have : dyadicKernel Ω j =
      fun x => ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j)) ^ n • dyadicKernel Ω 0 ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) • x) :=
    funext (dyadicKernel_eq_smul hΩ.2.1 j)
  rw [this]
  exact ((contDiff_dyadicKernel_zero hΩ.1).comp (contDiff_const_smul _)).const_smul _

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), (4.1), derivative bounds: for every order `k` there is
`C_k` with `‖D^k K_j(x)‖ ≤ C_k 2^{-j(n+k)}` for all `j ∈ ℤ` and `x ∈ E`. -/
theorem norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (k : ℕ) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ (j : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + k)) := by
  have h0 := contDiff_dyadicKernel_zero hΩ.1
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ :=
    (h0.continuous_iteratedFDeriv (m := k) (by simp)).bounded_above_of_compact_support
    (hasCompactSupport_dyadicKernel_zero.iteratedFDeriv k)
  refine ⟨C, fun j x => ?_⟩
  set c : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) with hc_def
  have hc : 0 < c := by positivity
  let L : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) →L[ℝ] EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) :=
    c • ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ _
  have hL : ‖L‖ ≤ c := by
    calc ‖L‖ ≤ ‖c‖ * ‖ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))‖ :=
          norm_smul_le c (ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)))
      _ ≤ ‖c‖ * 1 := by gcongr; exact ContinuousLinearMap.norm_id_le
      _ = c := by rw [mul_one, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos hc]
  have hfun : dyadicKernel Ω j = fun x => c ^ n • (dyadicKernel Ω 0 ∘ L) x :=
    funext (dyadicKernel_eq_smul hΩ.2.1 j)
  have hcomp : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (dyadicKernel Ω 0 ∘ L) := h0.comp L.contDiff
  rw [hfun, iteratedFDeriv_const_smul_apply' (hcomp.of_le (by simp)).contDiffAt,
    L.iteratedFDeriv_comp_right h0 x (by simp), norm_smul]
  have hC0 : 0 ≤ C := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hC 0)
  calc ‖c ^ n‖ * ‖(iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω 0) (L x)).compContinuousLinearMap
        fun _ => L‖
      ≤ c ^ n * (C * ∏ _i : Fin k, ‖L‖) := by
        rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity)]
        gcongr
        exact (ContinuousMultilinearMap.norm_compContinuousLinearMap_le _ _).trans
          (by gcongr; exact hC _)
    _ ≤ c ^ n * (C * c ^ k) := by
        rw [Finset.prod_const, Finset.card_univ, Fintype.card_fin]
        gcongr
    _ = C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + k)) := by
        rw [hc_def, ← zpow_natCast, ← zpow_natCast, ← zpow_mul, ← zpow_mul, mul_left_comm,
          ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero, mul_add]

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): `K_j` is supported where `2^{j-1} < |x| < 2^{j+1}`. -/
theorem support_dyadicKernel (j : ℤ) :
    Function.support (dyadicKernel Ω j) ⊆
      {x | (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - 1) < ‖x‖ ∧ ‖x‖ < (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1)} := by
  intro x hx
  have hψ : dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) • x) ≠ 0 := by
    intro h; apply hx; rw [dyadicKernel, h]; simp
  have h := support_dyadicPsi hψ
  simp only [mem_ofPred_eq, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs,
    zpow_neg] at h
  rw [abs_of_pos (by positivity)] at h
  have h2 : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ j := by positivity
  rw [zpow_sub_one₀ two_ne_zero, zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero]
  constructor
  · have := h.1
    rw [inv_mul_eq_div, lt_div_iff₀ h2] at this
    nlinarith
  · have := h.2
    rw [inv_mul_eq_div, div_lt_iff₀ h2] at this
    linarith

/-- Helper: `K_j(x) = 0` for `|x| ≥ 2^{j+1}`. -/
lemma dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le (j : ℤ) {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
    (h : (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) ≤ ‖x‖) : dyadicKernel Ω j x = 0 := by
  by_contra hx
  exact absurd (support_dyadicKernel j hx).2 (not_lt.2 h)

/-- Helper: `K_j` has compact support. -/
theorem hasCompactSupport_dyadicKernel (j : ℤ) : HasCompactSupport (dyadicKernel Ω j) := by
  refine HasCompactSupport.intro
    (isCompact_closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1))) ?_
  intro x hx
  rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, not_le] at hx
  exact dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le j hx.le

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`): `K_j ∈ L¹(E)`. -/
theorem integrable_dyadicKernel (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) :
    Integrable (dyadicKernel Ω j) :=
  (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ j).continuous.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport
    (hasCompactSupport_dyadicKernel j)

/-- Helper: `‖K_j‖_{L¹} = ‖K_0‖_{L¹}` (dilation invariance). -/
theorem integral_norm_dyadicKernel (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) :
    ∫ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω j x‖ = ∫ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 x‖ := by
  have hc : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ (-j) := by positivity
  simp_rw [dyadicKernel_eq_smul hΩ.2.1 j, norm_smul]
  rw [integral_const_mul, Measure.integral_comp_smul volume (fun y => ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 y‖),
    finrank_euclideanSpace_fin, smul_eq_mul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity),
    abs_of_pos (by positivity), ← mul_assoc, mul_inv_cancel₀ (by positivity), one_mul]


/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), (4.1), `‖K_j‖_{L¹(E)} ≤ C` uniformly in `j ∈ ℤ`. -/
theorem dyadicKernel_L1 (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ j : ℤ, Integrable (dyadicKernel Ω j) ∧ ∫ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω j x‖ ≤ C ∧
      eLpNorm (dyadicKernel Ω j) 1 volume ≤ ENNReal.ofReal C := by
  refine ⟨∫ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 x‖, fun j => ⟨integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j,
    (integral_norm_dyadicKernel hΩ j).le, ?_⟩⟩
  rw [eLpNorm_one_eq_lintegral_enorm, ← integral_norm_dyadicKernel hΩ j,
    ofReal_integral_norm_eq_lintegral_enorm (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j)]
  exact (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j).1

/-! ### Cancellation (4.1), (4.3) -/

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), cancellation for radial factors: for `n ≥ 1`, admissible `Ω`
and every `b : ℝ → ℂ`, `∫_E K(x) b(|x|) dx = 0`. (The blueprint assumes `b` supported away from
zero; this holds for arbitrary `b` since both sides are Bochner integrals.) -/
theorem integral_swKernel_mul_radial_eq_zero (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (b : ℝ → ℂ) :
    ∫ x, swKernel Ω x * b ‖x‖ = 0 := by
  have : (fun x => swKernel Ω x * b ‖x‖) = fun x => Ω x * b ‖x‖ / ((‖x‖ ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
    funext x
    by_cases hx : x = 0
    · subst hx
      obtain ⟨m, rfl⟩ : ∃ m, n = m + 1 := ⟨n - 1, by omega⟩
      simp [swKernel]
    · simp only [swKernel, hx, ite_false]
      ring
  rw [this, integral_homog_mul_radial hn hΩ.2.1, hΩ.2.2, mul_zero]

/-- Helper: the radial profile `r ↦ ψ(2^{-j} r e)` of `ψ(2^{-j} ·)`. -/
noncomputable def dyadicRadial (j : ℤ) (r : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  dyadicProfile ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) * r) - dyadicProfile (2 * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) * r))

/-- Helper: `K_j(x) = K(x) b_j(|x|)`. -/
lemma dyadicKernel_eq_radial (j : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    dyadicKernel Ω j x = swKernel Ω x * (dyadicRadial j ‖x‖ : ℂ) := by
  rw [dyadicKernel, dyadicPsi_eq_profile, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs,
    abs_of_pos (by positivity), dyadicRadial]

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), (4.1): `∫_E K_j = 0` for every `j ∈ ℤ` (`n ≥ 1`). -/
theorem integral_dyadicKernel (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) :
    ∫ x, dyadicKernel Ω j x = 0 := by
  simp_rw [dyadicKernel_eq_radial j]
  exact integral_swKernel_mul_radial_eq_zero hn hΩ (fun r => (dyadicRadial j r : ℂ))

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), (4.3), first identity: for every real `μ` and `j ∈ ℤ`,
`∫_E e(μ P(x)) K_j(x) dx = 0`, where `P = radialPoly n d`. -/
theorem integral_eC_mul_dyadicKernel (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (d : ℕ) (μ : ℝ)
    (j : ℤ) : ∫ x, eC (μ * radialPoly n d x) * dyadicKernel Ω j x = 0 := by
  have : (fun x => eC (μ * radialPoly n d x) * dyadicKernel Ω j x) = fun x =>
      swKernel Ω x * (fun r : ℝ => (dyadicRadial j r : ℂ) * eC (μ * r ^ (2 * d))) ‖x‖ := by
    funext x
    rw [dyadicKernel_eq_radial, radialPoly_eq_norm_pow]
    ring
  rw [this]
  exact integral_swKernel_mul_radial_eq_zero hn hΩ
    (fun r : ℝ => (dyadicRadial j r : ℂ) * eC (μ * r ^ (2 * d)))

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), (4.3), second identity: for every real `μ` and `j ∈ ℤ`,
`∫_E P(x) e(μ P(x)) K_j(x) dx = 0`, where `P = radialPoly n d`. -/
theorem integral_radialPoly_mul_eC_mul_dyadicKernel (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω)
    (d : ℕ) (μ : ℝ) (j : ℤ) :
    ∫ x, (radialPoly n d x : ℂ) * eC (μ * radialPoly n d x) * dyadicKernel Ω j x = 0 := by
  have : (fun x => (radialPoly n d x : ℂ) * eC (μ * radialPoly n d x) * dyadicKernel Ω j x) =
      fun x => swKernel Ω x *
        (fun r : ℝ => ((r ^ (2 * d) : ℝ) : ℂ) * (dyadicRadial j r : ℂ) * eC (μ * r ^ (2 * d)))
          ‖x‖ := by
    funext x
    rw [dyadicKernel_eq_radial, radialPoly_eq_norm_pow]
    ring
  rw [this]
  exact integral_swKernel_mul_radial_eq_zero hn hΩ
    (fun r : ℝ => ((r ^ (2 * d) : ℝ) : ℂ) * (dyadicRadial j r : ℂ) * eC (μ * r ^ (2 * d)))

/-! ### The dyadic resolution (4.2) -/

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), finite form of (4.2):
`∑_{j=1}^{J} K_j(x) = (η(2^{-J} x) - η(x)) K(x)`. -/
theorem sum_range_dyadicKernel (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (J : ℕ) :
    ∑ j ∈ Finset.range J, dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1) x =
      ((dyadicEta ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-(J : ℤ)) • x) - dyadicEta x : ℝ) : ℂ) * swKernel Ω x := by
  simp only [dyadicKernel]
  rw [← Finset.mul_sum, ← Complex.ofReal_sum, sum_dyadicPsi, mul_comm]

/-- Helper: `2^{-j} = (2^j)⁻¹`. -/
lemma two_zpow_neg_natCast (j : ℕ) : (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(j : ℤ)) = ((2 : ℝ) ^ j)⁻¹ := by
  rw [zpow_neg, zpow_natCast]

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), (4.2): for every `x`, `∑_{j ≥ 1} K_j(x) = (1 - η(x)) K(x)`
(the series is indexed by `j + 1`, `j ∈ ℕ`, and has finitely many nonzero terms). -/
theorem hasSum_dyadicKernel (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    HasSum (fun j : ℕ => dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1) x)
      ((1 - dyadicEta x : ℝ) * swKernel Ω x) := by
  obtain ⟨N, hN⟩ := pow_unbounded_of_one_lt ‖x‖ (by norm_num : (1 : ℝ) < 2)
  have hz : ∀ j ∉ Finset.range N, dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1) x = 0 := by
    intro j hj
    rw [Finset.mem_range, not_lt] at hj
    have hj' : ‖x‖ < 2 ^ j := hN.trans_le (pow_le_pow_right₀ (by norm_num) hj)
    rw [dyadicKernel, dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_le, Complex.ofReal_zero, mul_zero]
    rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity),
      show -((j : ℤ) + 1) = -((j + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ) by push_cast; ring, two_zpow_neg_natCast,
      pow_succ, inv_mul_le_iff₀ (by positivity)]
    nlinarith
  have h1 : dyadicEta ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-(N : ℤ)) • x) = 1 := by
    apply dyadicEta_eq_one
    rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity), two_zpow_neg_natCast,
      inv_mul_le_iff₀ (by positivity)]
    linarith
  have : HasSum (fun j : ℕ => dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1) x) _ := hasSum_sum_of_ne_finset_zero hz
  rwa [sum_range_dyadicKernel, h1] at this

/-! ### Lattice sums -/

/-- Helper: the sup bound `|K_j(x)| ≤ C 2^{-jn}` with `C ≥ 0`. -/
theorem norm_dyadicKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (j : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖dyadicKernel Ω j x‖ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ 0
  have hC0 : 0 ≤ C := by
    have h := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hC 0 0)
    exact nonneg_of_mul_nonneg_left h (by positivity)
  refine ⟨C, hC0, fun j x => ?_⟩
  have := hC j x
  rwa [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero, Nat.cast_zero, add_zero] at this

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.1 (`lem:dyadic`), lattice bound: there is `C` with
`∑_{y ∈ ℤⁿ} |K_j(y)| ≤ C` for all `j ≥ 1` (the sum is summable, having finitely many nonzero
terms). -/
theorem summable_tsum_norm_dyadicKernel_latEmbed_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ j : ℤ, 1 ≤ j →
      Summable (fun y : Fin n → ℤ => ‖dyadicKernel Ω j (latEmbed y)‖) ∧
        ∑' y : Fin n → ℤ, ‖dyadicKernel Ω j (latEmbed y)‖ ≤ C := by
  obtain ⟨C0, hC0, hK⟩ := norm_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  refine ⟨C0 * 8 ^ n, fun j hj => ?_⟩
  lift j to ℕ using (by omega)
  set R : ℕ := 2 ^ (j + 1) with hR
  let S : Finset (Fin n → ℤ) := Finset.Icc (fun _ => -(R : ℤ)) (fun _ => (R : ℤ))
  have hzero : ∀ y ∉ S, ‖dyadicKernel Ω j (latEmbed y)‖ = 0 := by
    intro y hy
    rw [norm_eq_zero]
    apply dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le
    have : ∃ i, (R : ℤ) < |y i| := by
      by_contra h
      push Not at h
      apply hy
      rw [Finset.mem_Icc]
      exact ⟨fun i => (abs_le.1 (h i)).1, fun i => (abs_le.1 (h i)).2⟩
    obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := this
    calc (2 : ℝ) ^ ((j : ℤ) + 1) = (R : ℝ) := by
          rw [hR]; push_cast; rw [← zpow_natCast]; push_cast; rfl
      _ ≤ |(y i : ℝ)| := by exact_mod_cast hi.le
      _ = ‖latEmbed y i‖ := by simp
      _ ≤ ‖latEmbed y‖ := PiLp.norm_apply_le _ _
  refine ⟨summable_of_ne_finset_zero hzero, ?_⟩
  rw [tsum_eq_sum hzero]
  have hcard : (S.card : ℝ) = (2 * R + 1 : ℝ) ^ n := by
    simp only [S, Pi.card_Icc, Int.card_Icc, Finset.prod_const, Finset.card_univ,
      Fintype.card_fin]
    have : ((R : ℤ) + 1 - -(R : ℤ)).toNat = 2 * R + 1 := by omega
    rw [this]; push_cast; ring
  have hterm : ∀ y ∈ S, ‖dyadicKernel Ω j (latEmbed y)‖ ≤ C0 * (((2 : ℝ) ^ j) ^ n)⁻¹ := by
    intro y _
    have := hK j (latEmbed y)
    rwa [show -((j : ℤ)) * (n : ℤ) = -((j * n : ℕ) : ℤ) by push_cast; ring,
      two_zpow_neg_natCast, pow_mul] at this
  calc ∑ y ∈ S, ‖dyadicKernel Ω j (latEmbed y)‖ ≤ ∑ _y ∈ S, C0 * (((2 : ℝ) ^ j) ^ n)⁻¹ :=
        Finset.sum_le_sum hterm
    _ = (2 * R + 1 : ℝ) ^ n * (C0 * (((2 : ℝ) ^ j) ^ n)⁻¹) := by
        rw [Finset.sum_const, nsmul_eq_mul, hcard]
    _ ≤ (8 * 2 ^ j : ℝ) ^ n * (C0 * (((2 : ℝ) ^ j) ^ n)⁻¹) := by
        gcongr
        have h1 : (1 : ℝ) ≤ 2 ^ j := one_le_pow₀ (by norm_num)
        rw [hR]; push_cast; rw [pow_succ]; linarith
    _ = C0 * 8 ^ n := by
        rw [mul_pow]; field_simp

/-! ### Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`): uniform signed dyadic multipliers and their limit -/

open scoped FourierTransform RealInnerProductSpace Convolution


/-- Helper: the two-sided geometric weights `2^{-|m|}`, `m ∈ ℤ`, are summable. -/
lemma summable_two_zpow_neg_abs : Summable (fun m : ℤ => (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|m|)) := by
  have h : Summable (fun m : ℕ => ((1 : ℝ) / 2) ^ m) := summable_geometric_two
  apply Summable.of_nat_of_neg
  · refine h.congr fun m => ?_
    rw [Nat.abs_cast, zpow_neg, zpow_natCast, one_div, inv_pow]
  · refine h.congr fun m => ?_
    rw [abs_neg, Nat.abs_cast, zpow_neg, zpow_natCast, one_div, inv_pow]

/-- The constant `∑_{m ∈ ℤ} 2^{-|m|}` bounding the shifted two-sided geometric sums. -/
noncomputable def geomZ : ℝ := ∑' m : ℤ, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|m|)

/-- Helper: `∑_{j ∈ J} 2^{-|j - k|} ≤ ∑_{m ∈ ℤ} 2^{-|m|}` for every finite `J ⊆ ℤ`. -/
lemma sum_two_zpow_neg_abs_sub_le (J : Finset ℤ) (k : ℤ) :
    ∑ j ∈ J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - k|) ≤ geomZ := by
  have hs : Summable (fun j : ℤ => (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - k|)) :=
    ((Equiv.subRight k).summable_iff (f := fun m : ℤ => (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|m|))).2
      summable_two_zpow_neg_abs
  calc ∑ j ∈ J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - k|) ≤ ∑' j : ℤ, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - k|) :=
        hs.sum_le_tsum J (fun _ _ => by positivity)
    _ = geomZ := (Equiv.subRight k).tsum_eq (fun m : ℤ => (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|m|))

/-- Helper: `0 ≤ geomZ`. -/
lemma geomZ_nonneg : 0 ≤ geomZ := tsum_nonneg fun _ => by positivity

/-- Helper: if `2^k ≤ t < 2^{k+1}` then `min(2^j t, (2^j t)⁻¹) ≤ 2 ⋅ 2^{-|j + k|}`. -/
lemma min_le_two_zpow {t : ℝ} {k : ℤ} (hk : t ∈ Ico ((2 : ℝ) ^ k) (2 ^ (k + 1))) (j : ℤ) :
    min (2 ^ j * t) (2 ^ j * t)⁻¹ ≤ 2 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - -k|) := by
  have h2 : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ j := by positivity
  have hlo : (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + k) ≤ 2 ^ j * t := by
    rw [zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]; exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hk.1 h2.le
  have hhi : 2 ^ j * t < (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + k + 1) := by
    rw [add_assoc, zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]; exact mul_lt_mul_of_pos_left hk.2 h2
  rw [sub_neg_eq_add]
  rcases le_or_gt 0 (j + k) with hm | hm
  · rw [abs_of_nonneg hm]
    refine (min_le_right _ _).trans ?_
    have : ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * t)⁻¹ ≤ 2 ^ (-(j + k)) := by
      rw [zpow_neg]; exact inv_anti₀ (by positivity) hlo
    have h3 : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2 ^ (-(j + k)) := by positivity
    linarith
  · rw [abs_of_neg hm, neg_neg]
    refine (min_le_left _ _).trans (hhi.le.trans ?_)
    rw [zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero, mul_comm]

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), the geometric-series step: there is `C₀` with
`∑_{j ∈ J} min(2^j t, (2^j t)⁻¹) ≤ C₀` for every `t > 0` and every finite `J ⊆ ℤ`. -/
theorem sum_min_two_zpow_le :
    ∃ C₀ : ℝ, ∀ t : ℝ, 0 < t → ∀ J : Finset ℤ,
      ∑ j ∈ J, min (2 ^ j * t) (2 ^ j * t)⁻¹ ≤ C₀ := by
  refine ⟨2 * geomZ, fun t ht J => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨k, hk⟩ := exists_mem_Ico_zpow ht (by norm_num : (1 : ℝ) < 2)
  calc ∑ j ∈ J, min (2 ^ j * t) (2 ^ j * t)⁻¹ ≤ ∑ j ∈ J, 2 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - -k|) :=
        Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => min_le_two_zpow hk j
    _ = 2 * ∑ j ∈ J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - -k|) := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
    _ ≤ 2 * geomZ := by gcongr; exact sum_two_zpow_neg_abs_sub_le J (-k)



/-- Helper: `𝓕 K_j (0) = ∫ K_j = 0`. -/
lemma fourier_dyadicKernel_apply_zero (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) :
    𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) 0 = 0 := by
  rw [Real.fourier_eq]
  simpa using integral_dyadicKernel hn hΩ j

/-- Helper: `|𝓕 K_0 (ζ)| ≤ C min(|ζ|, |ζ|⁻¹)` (`K_0` is a Schwartz function with mean zero). -/
lemma norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_zero_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ ζ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
      ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω 0) ζ‖ ≤ C * min ‖ζ‖ ‖ζ‖⁻¹ := by
  set S := hasCompactSupport_dyadicKernel_zero.toSchwartzMap (contDiff_dyadicKernel_zero hΩ.1)
    with hS
  have hSe : ((𝓕 S : SchwartzMap _ ℂ) : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) =
      𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω 0) := rfl
  set L := SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 0 1 (𝓕 S)
  set D := SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 1 0 (𝓕 S)
  have hL0 : 0 ≤ L := apply_nonneg _ _
  have hL : ∀ ζ, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω 0) ζ‖ ≤ L * ‖ζ‖ := by
    intro ζ
    have h := Convex.norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_fderiv_le (s := univ) (C := L)
      (f := ((𝓕 S : SchwartzMap _ ℂ) : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ))
      (fun x _ => (𝓕 S).differentiableAt) (fun x _ => ?_) convex_univ (mem_univ 0) (mem_univ ζ)
    · rwa [hSe, fourier_dyadicKernel_apply_zero hn hΩ 0, sub_zero, sub_zero] at h
    · rw [← norm_iteratedFDeriv_one]; exact SchwartzMap.norm_iteratedFDeriv_le_seminorm ℝ _ 1 x
  have hD : ∀ ζ, ‖ζ‖ * ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω 0) ζ‖ ≤ D := fun ζ => by
    have := SchwartzMap.norm_pow_mul_le_seminorm ℝ (𝓕 S) 1 ζ
    rwa [pow_one, hSe] at this
  refine ⟨max L D, le_max_of_le_left hL0, fun ζ => ?_⟩
  rcases eq_or_ne ζ 0 with rfl | hζ
  · simp [fourier_dyadicKernel_apply_zero hn hΩ 0]
  have hζ' : 0 < ‖ζ‖ := norm_pos_iff.2 hζ
  rcases le_total ‖ζ‖ ‖ζ‖⁻¹ with h | h
  · rw [min_eq_left h]
    exact (hL ζ).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (le_max_left _ _) hζ'.le)
  · rw [min_eq_right h]
    have : ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω 0) ζ‖ ≤ D * ‖ζ‖⁻¹ := by
      rw [le_mul_inv_iff₀ hζ', mul_comm]; exact hD ζ
    exact this.trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (le_max_right _ _) (by positivity))

/-- Helper: the scaling identity `𝓕 K_j (ξ) = 𝓕 K_0 (2^j ξ)`. -/
lemma fourier_dyadicKernel_eq (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ = 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω 0) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ) := by
  set c : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) with hc_def
  have hc : 0 < c := by positivity
  let g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun y => 𝐞 (-⟪c⁻¹ • y, ξ⟫) • dyadicKernel Ω 0 y
  have h1 : ∀ x, 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • dyadicKernel Ω j x = c ^ n • g (c • x) := by
    intro x
    simp only [g, dyadicKernel_eq_smul hΩ.2.1 j x, inv_smul_smul₀ hc.ne', ← hc_def]
    simp only [Circle.smul_def, Complex.real_smul]
    ring
  rw [Real.fourier_eq, Real.fourier_eq]
  simp_rw [h1]
  rw [integral_smul, Measure.integral_comp_smul, finrank_euclideanSpace_fin, smul_smul,
    abs_of_pos (by positivity), mul_inv_cancel₀ (by positivity), one_smul]
  refine integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_)
  simp only [g, real_inner_smul_left, real_inner_smul_right, hc_def, zpow_neg, inv_inv]

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), (4.4): there is `C` with
`|𝓕 K_j (ξ)| ≤ C min(2^j |ξ|, (2^j |ξ|)⁻¹)` for all `j ∈ ℤ` and `ξ ∈ E` (at `ξ = 0` the
right side is `0`, and indeed `𝓕 K_j (0) = ∫ K_j = 0`). Here `𝓕` is Mathlib's Fourier
transform `𝓕 f (ξ) = ∫ e(-x·ξ) f(x) dx`. -/
theorem norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (j : ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ‖ ≤ C * min (2 ^ j * ‖ξ‖) (2 ^ j * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹ := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_zero_le hn hΩ
  refine ⟨C, hC0, fun j ξ => ?_⟩
  rw [fourier_dyadicKernel_eq hΩ j ξ]
  have := hC ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)
  rwa [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity)] at this

/-- Helper: the closed support of `K_j` lies in `2^{j-1} ≤ |x| ≤ 2^{j+1}`. -/
lemma tsupport_dyadicKernel (j : ℤ) :
    tsupport (dyadicKernel Ω j) ⊆
      {x | (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - 1) ≤ ‖x‖ ∧ ‖x‖ ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1)} := by
  refine closure_minimal ((support_dyadicKernel j).trans fun x hx => ⟨hx.1.le, hx.2.le⟩) ?_
  exact (isClosed_le continuous_const continuous_norm).inter
    (isClosed_le continuous_norm continuous_const)

/-- Helper: the pointwise derivative bound with the dyadic weight: if `2^{k₀} ≤ |x| < 2^{k₀+1}`
then `‖D^k K_j(x)‖ ≤ 2 C_k 2^{n+k} 2^{-|j - k₀|} |x|^{-n-k}`. -/
lemma norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le_weight {k : ℕ} {C : ℝ} (hC0 : 0 ≤ C)
    (hC : ∀ (j : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + k)))
    {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} {k₀ : ℤ}
    (hk₀ : ‖x‖ ∈ Ico ((2 : ℝ) ^ k₀) (2 ^ (k₀ + 1))) (j : ℤ) :
    ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤
      2 * C * 2 ^ (n + k) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - k₀|) / ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) := by
  have hx : 0 < ‖x‖ := lt_of_lt_of_le (by positivity) hk₀.1
  by_cases hs : x ∈ Function.support (iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω j))
  · obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := tsupport_dyadicKernel j (support_iteratedFDeriv_subset k hs)
    have hjk1 : j - 1 < k₀ + 1 :=
      (zpow_lt_zpow_iff_right₀ (by norm_num : (1 : ℝ) < 2)).1 (h1.trans_lt hk₀.2)
    have hjk2 : k₀ ≤ j + 1 :=
      (zpow_le_zpow_iff_right₀ (by norm_num : (1 : ℝ) < 2)).1 (hk₀.1.trans h2)
    have habs : |j - k₀| ≤ 1 := abs_le.2 ⟨by omega, by omega⟩
    have hw : (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ 2 ^ (-|j - k₀|) := by
      calc (1 / 2 : ℝ) = 2 ^ (-1 : ℤ) := by norm_num
        _ ≤ 2 ^ (-|j - k₀|) := zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) (by omega)
    have hj : (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) ≤ 2 / ‖x‖ := by
      rw [le_div_iff₀ hx, zpow_neg, inv_mul_le_iff₀ (by positivity)]
      rw [zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero] at h2; linarith
    have hpow : (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + k)) ≤ (2 / ‖x‖) ^ (n + k) := by
      rw [zpow_mul, show ((n : ℤ) + k) = ((n + k : ℕ) : ℤ) by push_cast; ring, zpow_natCast]
      exact pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity) hj _
    calc ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ C * (2 / ‖x‖) ^ (n + k) :=
          (hC j x).trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hpow hC0)
      _ = 2 * C * 2 ^ (n + k) * (1 / 2) / ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) := by rw [div_pow]; ring
      _ ≤ 2 * C * 2 ^ (n + k) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - k₀|) / ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) := by gcongr
  · rw [Function.notMem_support.1 hs, norm_zero]
    positivity

/-- Helper: for every order `k` there is `B_k` with
`∑_{j ∈ J} ‖D^k K_j(x)‖ ≤ B_k |x|^{-n-k}` for every finite `J ⊆ ℤ` and `x ≠ 0` (bounded overlap
of the annular supports). -/
lemma sum_norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (k : ℕ) :
    ∃ B : ℝ, 0 ≤ B ∧ ∀ (J : Finset ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)), x ≠ 0 →
      ∑ j ∈ J, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ B / ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ k
  have hC0 : 0 ≤ C := by
    have h := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hC 0 0)
    exact nonneg_of_mul_nonneg_left h (by positivity)
  refine ⟨2 * C * 2 ^ (n + k) * geomZ, by have := geomZ_nonneg; positivity,
    fun J x hx => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨k₀, hk₀⟩ := exists_mem_Ico_zpow (norm_pos_iff.2 hx) (by norm_num : (1 : ℝ) < 2)
  calc ∑ j ∈ J, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖
      ≤ ∑ j ∈ J, 2 * C * 2 ^ (n + k) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - k₀|) / ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) :=
        Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le_weight hC0 hC hk₀ j
    _ = 2 * C * 2 ^ (n + k) * (∑ j ∈ J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - k₀|)) / ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) := by
        rw [Finset.mul_sum, Finset.sum_div]
    _ ≤ 2 * C * 2 ^ (n + k) * geomZ / ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) := by
        gcongr; exact sum_two_zpow_neg_abs_sub_le J k₀

/-- Helper: the Fourier transform of a finite signed dyadic sum,
`𝓕(∑_{j ∈ J} c_j K_j) = ∑_{j ∈ J} c_j 𝓕 K_j`. -/
lemma fourier_sum_smul_dyadicKernel (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (J : Finset ℤ) (c : ℤ → ℂ)
    (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    𝓕 (∑ j ∈ J, c j • dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ = ∑ j ∈ J, c j * 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ := by
  have hi : ∀ j, Integrable (fun v : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
      𝐞 (-⟪v, ξ⟫) • dyadicKernel Ω j v) :=
    fun j => (Real.fourierIntegral_convergent_iff ξ).2 (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j)
  simp only [Real.fourier_eq, Finset.sum_apply, Pi.smul_apply, Finset.smul_sum]
  rw [integral_finsetSum _ (fun j _ => ?_)]
  · refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun j _ => ?_
    rw [← integral_const_mul]
    refine integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun v => ?_)
    simp only [Circle.smul_def, smul_eq_mul]
    ring
  · refine ((hi j).const_mul (c j)).congr (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun v => ?_)
    simp only [Circle.smul_def, smul_eq_mul]
    ring

/-- Helper: `∑_{j ∈ J} |𝓕 K_j(ξ)| ≤ A` uniformly in `ξ` and finite `J ⊆ ℤ`. -/
lemma sum_norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ A : ℝ, 0 ≤ A ∧ ∀ (J : Finset ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ∑ j ∈ J, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ‖ ≤ A := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨C₀, hC₀⟩ := sum_min_two_zpow_le
  refine ⟨C * max C₀ 0, mul_nonneg hC0 (le_max_right _ _), fun J ξ => ?_⟩
  rcases eq_or_ne ξ 0 with rfl | hξ
  · simp only [fourier_dyadicKernel_apply_zero hn hΩ, norm_zero, Finset.sum_const_zero]
    exact mul_nonneg hC0 (le_max_right _ _)
  calc ∑ j ∈ J, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ‖
      ≤ ∑ j ∈ J, C * min (2 ^ j * ‖ξ‖) (2 ^ j * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹ := Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => hC j ξ
    _ = C * ∑ j ∈ J, min (2 ^ j * ‖ξ‖) (2 ^ j * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹ := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
    _ ≤ C * max C₀ 0 := by
        gcongr; exact (hC₀ ‖ξ‖ (norm_pos_iff.2 hξ) J).trans (le_max_left _ _)

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), multiplier bound for the finite sums: there is `A`
such that for every finite `J ⊆ ℤ` and all coefficients `|c_j| ≤ 1`,
`|𝓕(∑_{j ∈ J} c_j K_j)(ξ)| ≤ A` for every `ξ`. -/
theorem norm_fourier_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ A : ℝ, 0 ≤ A ∧ ∀ (J : Finset ℤ) (c : ℤ → ℂ), (∀ j, ‖c j‖ ≤ 1) →
      ∀ ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ‖𝓕 (∑ j ∈ J, c j • dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ‖ ≤ A := by
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := sum_norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  refine ⟨A, hA0, fun J c hc ξ => ?_⟩
  rw [fourier_sum_smul_dyadicKernel hΩ]
  refine (norm_sum_le _ _).trans ((Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => ?_).trans (hA J ξ))
  rw [norm_mul]
  exact mul_le_of_le_one_left (norm_nonneg _) (hc j)

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), size bound for the finite sums: there is `B` such
that for every finite `J ⊆ ℤ` and all `|c_j| ≤ 1`, `|∑_{j ∈ J} c_j K_j(x)| ≤ B |x|^{-n}` for
`x ≠ 0`. -/
theorem norm_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ B : ℝ, 0 ≤ B ∧ ∀ (J : Finset ℤ) (c : ℤ → ℂ), (∀ j, ‖c j‖ ≤ 1) →
      ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), x ≠ 0 →
        ‖(∑ j ∈ J, c j • dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ B / ‖x‖ ^ n := by
  obtain ⟨B, hB0, hB⟩ := sum_norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ 0
  refine ⟨B, hB0, fun J c hc x hx => ?_⟩
  have h := hB J x hx
  simp only [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero, add_zero] at h
  rw [Finset.sum_apply]
  refine (norm_sum_le _ _).trans ((Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => ?_).trans h)
  rw [Pi.smul_apply, norm_smul]
  exact mul_le_of_le_one_left (norm_nonneg _) (hc j)

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), gradient bound for the finite sums: there is `B` such
that for every finite `J ⊆ ℤ` and all `|c_j| ≤ 1`, `∑_{j ∈ J} c_j K_j` is differentiable and
`|∇(∑_{j ∈ J} c_j K_j)(x)| ≤ B |x|^{-n-1}` for `x ≠ 0`. -/
theorem norm_fderiv_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ B : ℝ, 0 ≤ B ∧ ∀ (J : Finset ℤ) (c : ℤ → ℂ), (∀ j, ‖c j‖ ≤ 1) →
      ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), x ≠ 0 →
        DifferentiableAt ℝ (∑ j ∈ J, c j • dyadicKernel Ω j) x ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (∑ j ∈ J, c j • dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ B / ‖x‖ ^ (n + 1) := by
  obtain ⟨B, hB0, hB⟩ := sum_norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ 1
  refine ⟨B, hB0, fun J c hc x hx => ?_⟩
  have hd : ∀ j, HasFDerivAt (c j • dyadicKernel Ω j)
      (c j • fderiv ℝ (dyadicKernel Ω j) x) x := fun j =>
    (((contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ j).differentiable (by simp)) x).hasFDerivAt.const_smul (c j)
  have hs := HasFDerivAt.sum (u := J) fun j _ => hd j
  refine ⟨hs.differentiableAt, ?_⟩
  rw [hs.fderiv]
  refine (norm_sum_le _ _).trans ((Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => ?_).trans (hB J x hx))
  rw [norm_smul, norm_iteratedFDeriv_one]
  exact mul_le_of_le_one_left (norm_nonneg _) (hc j)


/-! ### Lemma 4.3: uniform `L^p` bounds for the signed dyadic sums -/

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), first assertion: for `1 < p < ∞` there is `C_p` such
that for every finite `J ⊆ ℤ` and all coefficients `|c_j| ≤ 1`, convolution with
`∑_{j ∈ J} c_j K_j` satisfies `‖(∑_{j ∈ J} c_j K_j) * f‖_p ≤ C_p ‖f‖_p` for all `f ∈ L^p(E)`. -/
theorem exists_eLpNorm_convolution_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω)
    {p : ℝ} (hp : 1 < p) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (J : Finset ℤ) (c : ℤ → ℂ), (∀ j, ‖c j‖ ≤ 1) →
      ∀ f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ, MemLp f (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume →
        eLpNorm ((∑ j ∈ J, c j • dyadicKernel Ω j) ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] f)
            (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume ≤
          ENNReal.ofReal C * eLpNorm f (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume := by
  obtain ⟨Cp, hCp, h⟩ := exists_eLpNorm_convolution_le_of_norm_fourier_le (n := n) (by omega) hp
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := norm_fourier_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨B, hB0, hB⟩ := norm_fderiv_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  refine ⟨Cp * max A B, mul_nonneg hCp.le (le_max_of_le_left hA0), fun J c hc f hf => ?_⟩
  refine h _ (max A B) ?_ (fun x hx => (hB J c hc x hx).1) (fun x hx => ?_) (fun ξ => ?_) f hf
  · exact integrable_finsetSum' _ fun j _ => (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j).smul (c j)
  · exact (hB J c hc x hx).2.trans (div_le_div_of_nonneg_right (le_max_right _ _) (by positivity))
  · exact (hA J c hc ξ).trans (le_max_left _ _)

/-! ### Lemma 4.3: the limit symbol `m_K` -/

/-- Helper: the shift `j ↦ j + 1` as an embedding `ℕ ↪ ℤ`. -/
def succIntEmb : ℕ ↪ ℤ := ⟨fun j => (j : ℤ) + 1, fun a b h => by simpa using h⟩

/-- The limit symbol `m_K(ξ) = ∑_{j ≥ 1} 𝓕 K_j(ξ)` of Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`)
(the series is indexed by `j + 1`, `j ∈ ℕ`; it converges absolutely by (4.4)). -/
noncomputable def dyadicSymbol (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  ∑' j : ℕ, 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1)) ξ

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), the limit symbol: there is `A` such that for every `ξ`
the series `∑_{j ≥ 1} 𝓕 K_j(ξ)` converges absolutely with `∑_{j ≥ 1} |𝓕 K_j(ξ)| ≤ A`, its sum
is `m_K(ξ)`, `m_K(0) = 0`, and `|m_K(ξ)| ≤ A`. -/
theorem dyadicSymbol_spec (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ A : ℝ, 0 ≤ A ∧ (∀ ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
      Summable (fun j : ℕ => ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1)) ξ‖) ∧
      ∑' j : ℕ, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1)) ξ‖ ≤ A ∧
      HasSum (fun j : ℕ => 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1)) ξ) (dyadicSymbol Ω ξ) ∧
      ‖dyadicSymbol Ω ξ‖ ≤ A) ∧ dyadicSymbol Ω 0 = 0 := by
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := sum_norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  have hu : ∀ ξ (u : Finset ℕ), ∑ j ∈ u, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1)) ξ‖ ≤ A :=
    fun ξ u => by
      have := hA (u.map succIntEmb) ξ
      rw [Finset.sum_map] at this
      exact this
  refine ⟨A, hA0, fun ξ => ?_, ?_⟩
  · have hs : Summable (fun j : ℕ => ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1)) ξ‖) :=
      summable_of_sum_le (fun _ => norm_nonneg _) (hu ξ)
    have ht : ∑' j : ℕ, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1)) ξ‖ ≤ A :=
      Real.tsum_le_of_sum_le (fun _ => norm_nonneg _) (hu ξ)
    exact ⟨hs, ht, hs.of_norm.hasSum, (norm_tsum_le_tsum_norm hs).trans ht⟩
  · simp [dyadicSymbol, fourier_dyadicKernel_apply_zero hn hΩ]

/-- Helper: the partial kernels `∑_{j=1}^{N} K_j`, written as a signed dyadic sum with
coefficients `1`. -/
noncomputable def dyadicPartialKernel (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (N : ℕ) :
    EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ :=
  ∑ j ∈ (Finset.range N).map succIntEmb, (fun _ : ℤ => (1 : ℂ)) j • dyadicKernel Ω j

/-- Helper: `(∑_{j=1}^{N} K_j)(y) = ∑_{j < N} K_{j+1}(y)`. -/
lemma dyadicPartialKernel_apply (N : ℕ) (y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    dyadicPartialKernel Ω N y = ∑ j ∈ Finset.range N, dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1) y := by
  simp only [dyadicPartialKernel, Finset.sum_apply, Finset.sum_map, one_smul]
  rfl

/-- Helper: `𝓕(∑_{j=1}^{N} K_j) = ∑_{j < N} 𝓕 K_{j+1}`. -/
lemma fourier_dyadicPartialKernel (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (N : ℕ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    𝓕 (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N) ξ =
      ∑ j ∈ Finset.range N, 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1)) ξ := by
  rw [dyadicPartialKernel, fourier_sum_smul_dyadicKernel hΩ, Finset.sum_map]
  simp only [one_mul]
  rfl

/-- Helper: the partial kernels are integrable. -/
lemma integrable_dyadicPartialKernel (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (N : ℕ) :
    Integrable (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N) :=
  integrable_finsetSum' _ fun j _ => (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j).smul _

/-- Helper: the partial kernels are continuous. -/
lemma continuous_dyadicPartialKernel (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (N : ℕ) :
    Continuous (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N) := by
  have : dyadicPartialKernel Ω N = fun y => ∑ j ∈ Finset.range N, dyadicKernel Ω ((j : ℤ) + 1) y :=
    funext (dyadicPartialKernel_apply N)
  rw [this]
  exact continuous_finsetSum _ fun j _ => (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ _).continuous

/-- Helper: for an integrable kernel `H` with bounded Fourier transform and a Schwartz function
`f`, `𝓕⁻(𝓕H ⋅ 𝓕f) = H * f` (everywhere). -/
lemma fourierInv_fourier_mul_eq_convolution {H : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (hH : Integrable H) {A : ℝ} (hA : ∀ ξ, ‖𝓕 H ξ‖ ≤ A)
    (f : SchwartzMap (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ℂ) :
    𝓕⁻ (fun ξ => 𝓕 H ξ * 𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) ξ) =
      H ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) := by
  have h1 : (fun ξ => 𝓕 H ξ * 𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) ξ) =
      𝓕 (H ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)) :=
    funext fun ξ => (Real.fourier_mul_convolution_eq hH f.integrable ξ).symm
  have hcont : Continuous (𝓕 H) :=
    VectorFourier.fourierIntegral_continuous Real.continuous_fourierChar continuous_inner hH
  rw [h1]
  refine Continuous.fourierInv_fourier_eq ?_ ?_ ?_
  · exact BddAbove.continuous_convolution_right_of_integrable _
      ⟨SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 0 0 f, fun x ⟨y, hy⟩ => hy ▸ SchwartzMap.norm_le_seminorm ℝ f y⟩
      hH f.continuous
  · exact hH.integrable_convolution _ f.integrable
  · rw [← h1]
    exact (𝓕 f).integrable.bdd_mul hcont.aestronglyMeasurable (ae_of_all _ hA)

/-- Helper: for a Schwartz `f` and every `x`,
`(∑_{j=1}^{N} K_j) * f (x) → 𝓕⁻(m_K ⋅ 𝓕f)(x)` as `N → ∞`. -/
lemma tendsto_convolution_dyadicPartialKernel (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω)
    (f : SchwartzMap (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ℂ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    Filter.Tendsto (fun N => (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
        (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)) x) Filter.atTop
      (nhds (𝓕⁻ (fun ξ => dyadicSymbol Ω ξ * 𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) ξ) x)) := by
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := norm_fourier_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨A', -, hA', -⟩ := dyadicSymbol_spec hn hΩ
  have hPA : ∀ N ξ, ‖𝓕 (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N) ξ‖ ≤ A := fun N ξ =>
    hA _ (fun _ => (1 : ℂ)) (fun _ => by simp) ξ
  have heq : ∀ N, (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
      (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)) x = 𝓕⁻ (fun ξ => 𝓕 (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N) ξ *
        𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) ξ) x := fun N => by
    rw [fourierInv_fourier_mul_eq_convolution (integrable_dyadicPartialKernel hΩ N) (hPA N) f]
  simp_rw [heq, Real.fourierInv_eq]
  have hfF : Integrable (𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)) := (𝓕 f).integrable
  have hfFc : Continuous (𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)) := (𝓕 f).continuous
  have hec : Continuous (fun ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => 𝐞 ⟪ξ, x⟫) :=
    Real.continuous_fourierChar.comp (continuous_id.inner continuous_const)
  refine MeasureTheory.tendsto_integral_of_dominated_convergence
    (fun ξ => A * ‖𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) ξ‖) (fun N => ?_) (hfF.norm.const_mul A)
    (fun N => ae_of_all _ fun ξ => ?_) (ae_of_all _ fun ξ => ?_)
  · have hc : Continuous (𝓕 (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N)) :=
      VectorFourier.fourierIntegral_continuous Real.continuous_fourierChar continuous_inner
        (integrable_dyadicPartialKernel hΩ N)
    exact (hec.smul (hc.mul hfFc)).aestronglyMeasurable
  · rw [Circle.norm_smul, norm_mul]
    exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hPA N ξ) (norm_nonneg _)
  · have := (hA' ξ).2.2.1.tendsto_sum_nat
    simp_rw [fourier_dyadicPartialKernel hΩ]
    exact (this.mul_const _).const_smul _

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), second assertion (multiplier bound): for
`1 < p < ∞` there is `C_p` with `‖𝓕⁻(m_K ⋅ 𝓕f)‖_p ≤ C_p ‖f‖_p` for every Schwartz function
`f` on `E`. -/
theorem exists_eLpNorm_fourierInv_dyadicSymbol_mul_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω)
    {p : ℝ} (hp : 1 < p) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ f : SchwartzMap (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ℂ,
      eLpNorm (𝓕⁻ (fun ξ => dyadicSymbol Ω ξ * 𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) ξ))
          (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal C *
          eLpNorm (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := exists_eLpNorm_convolution_sum_smul_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ hp
  refine ⟨C, hC0, fun f => ?_⟩
  refine eLpNorm_le_of_tendsto_of_eLpNorm_le (fun N => ?_)
    (ae_of_all _ fun x => tendsto_convolution_dyadicPartialKernel hn hΩ f x)
    (fun N => hC _ (fun _ => (1 : ℂ)) (fun _ => by simp) _ (f.memLp _ _))
  exact (BddAbove.continuous_convolution_right_of_integrable _
    ⟨SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 0 0 f, fun x ⟨y, hy⟩ => hy ▸ SchwartzMap.norm_le_seminorm ℝ f y⟩
    (integrable_dyadicPartialKernel hΩ N) f.continuous).aestronglyMeasurable

/-- Helper: `|K(y)| ≤ M` for `|y| ≥ 1`. -/
lemma exists_norm_swKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ M : ℝ, 0 ≤ M ∧ ∀ y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), 1 ≤ ‖y‖ → ‖swKernel Ω y‖ ≤ M := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := (isCompact_sphere (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1).exists_bound_of_continuousOn
    (hΩ.1.continuousOn.mono fun y hy => by
      simp only [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm] at hy
      simp only [mem_compl_iff, mem_singleton_iff]
      rintro rfl; simp at hy)
  refine ⟨max C 0, le_max_right _ _, fun y hy => ?_⟩
  have hy0 : y ≠ 0 := by rintro rfl; simp at hy; linarith
  have hpos : 0 < ‖y‖ := norm_pos_iff.2 hy0
  have hΩy : Ω y = Ω (‖y‖⁻¹ • y) := (hΩ.2.1 y hy0 _ (inv_pos.2 hpos)).symm
  have hs : ‖y‖⁻¹ • y ∈ sphere (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1 := by
    rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm, norm_smul, norm_inv, norm_norm, inv_mul_cancel₀ hpos.ne']
  have h1 : (1 : ℝ) ≤ ‖y‖ ^ n := one_le_pow₀ hy
  simp only [swKernel, hy0, ite_false, norm_div, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs,
    abs_of_pos (pow_pos hpos n)]
  rw [div_le_iff₀ (by positivity), hΩy]
  calc ‖Ω (‖y‖⁻¹ • y)‖ ≤ max C 0 := (hC _ hs).trans (le_max_left _ _)
    _ = max C 0 * 1 := (mul_one _).symm
    _ ≤ max C 0 * ‖y‖ ^ n := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h1 (le_max_right _ _)

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.3 (`lem:signedK`), third assertion (identification of the kernel): for
every Schwartz function `f` and every `x ∈ E`, the integral
`∫ (1 - η(y)) K(y) f(x - y) dy` converges absolutely and equals `𝓕⁻(m_K ⋅ 𝓕f)(x)`; i.e. the
kernel of the multiplier `m_K` on Schwartz inputs is `𝒦 = K (1 - η)`. -/
theorem fourierInv_dyadicSymbol_mul_eq_integral (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω)
    (f : SchwartzMap (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ℂ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    Integrable (fun y => ((1 - dyadicEta y : ℝ) : ℂ) * swKernel Ω y * f (x - y)) ∧
      𝓕⁻ (fun ξ => dyadicSymbol Ω ξ * 𝓕 (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) ξ) x =
        ∫ y, ((1 - dyadicEta y : ℝ) : ℂ) * swKernel Ω y * f (x - y) := by
  obtain ⟨M, hM0, hM⟩ := exists_norm_swKernel_le hΩ
  set 𝒦 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun y => ((1 - dyadicEta y : ℝ) : ℂ) * swKernel Ω y
    with h𝒦
  have hlimK : ∀ y, Filter.Tendsto (fun N => dyadicPartialKernel Ω N y) Filter.atTop
      (nhds (𝒦 y)) := fun y => by
    simp_rw [dyadicPartialKernel_apply]
    exact (hasSum_dyadicKernel y).tendsto_sum_nat
  have h𝒦m : AEStronglyMeasurable 𝒦 volume :=
    aestronglyMeasurable_of_tendsto_ae Filter.atTop
      (fun N => (continuous_dyadicPartialKernel hΩ N).aestronglyMeasurable)
      (ae_of_all _ hlimK)
  have h𝒦b : ∀ y, ‖𝒦 y‖ ≤ M := fun y => by
    by_cases hy : ‖y‖ ≤ 1
    · simp [𝒦, dyadicEta_eq_one hy, hM0]
    · have hη := dyadicEta_mem_Icc y
      rw [norm_mul, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (by linarith [hη.2])]
      have := hM y (le_of_not_ge hy)
      nlinarith [norm_nonneg (swKernel Ω y), hη.1]
  have hPb : ∀ N y, ‖dyadicPartialKernel Ω N y‖ ≤ ‖𝒦 y‖ := fun N y => by
    have h := sum_range_dyadicKernel (Ω := Ω) y N
    rw [dyadicPartialKernel_apply, h]
    simp only [𝒦, norm_mul, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs]
    refine mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right ?_ (norm_nonneg _)
    have h1 := dyadicEta_mem_Icc ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-(N : ℤ)) • y)
    have h2 := dyadicEta_mem_Icc y
    have h3 : dyadicEta y ≤ dyadicEta ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-(N : ℤ)) • y) := by
      refine dyadicProfile_antitoneOn (norm_nonneg _) ?_
      rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity)]
      refine mul_le_of_le_one_left (norm_nonneg _) ?_
      exact zpow_le_one_of_nonpos₀ (by norm_num) (by omega)
    rw [abs_of_nonneg (by linarith), abs_of_nonneg (by linarith [h2.2])]
    linarith [h1.2]
  have hfx : Integrable (fun y => f (x - y)) := f.integrable.comp_sub_left x
  have hint : Integrable (fun y => 𝒦 y * f (x - y)) :=
    hfx.bdd_mul h𝒦m (ae_of_all _ h𝒦b)
  refine ⟨hint, ?_⟩
  have hconv : ∀ N, (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
      (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)) x = ∫ y, dyadicPartialKernel Ω N y * f (x - y) :=
    fun N => by rw [convolution_def]; simp only [ContinuousLinearMap.mul_apply']
  have hlim : Filter.Tendsto (fun N => (dyadicPartialKernel Ω N ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ,
      volume] (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)) x) Filter.atTop
      (nhds (∫ y, 𝒦 y * f (x - y))) := by
    simp_rw [hconv]
    refine MeasureTheory.tendsto_integral_of_dominated_convergence
      (fun y => M * ‖f (x - y)‖) (fun N => ?_) (hfx.norm.const_mul M)
      (fun N => ae_of_all _ fun y => ?_) (ae_of_all _ fun y => ?_)
    · exact ((continuous_dyadicPartialKernel hΩ N).mul
        (f.continuous.comp (continuous_const.sub continuous_id))).aestronglyMeasurable
    · rw [norm_mul]
      exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right ((hPb N y).trans (h𝒦b y)) (norm_nonneg _)
    · exact (hlimK y).mul_const _
  exact tendsto_nhds_unique (tendsto_convolution_dyadicPartialKernel hn hΩ f x) hlim


/-! ### Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): a positive band-limited averaging kernel -/

open scoped SchwartzMap ComplexConjugate

/-- The radii `1/64 < 1/32` of the radial bump `b` of Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`). -/
noncomputable def bpBumpData : ContDiffBump (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :=
  ⟨1 / 64, 1 / 32, by norm_num, by norm_num⟩

/-- The bump `b` of Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): a real, even, smooth radial bump
supported in the ball of radius `1/32` (hence in the cube `[-1/32, 1/32]^n`), equal to `1` near
`0`, as a complex Schwartz function. -/
noncomputable def bpBump : 𝓢(EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ℂ) :=
  HasCompactSupport.toSchwartzMap (f := fun x => ((bpBumpData (n := n) x : ℝ) : ℂ))
    (bpBumpData.hasCompactSupport.comp_left Complex.ofReal_zero)
    (Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.comp bpBumpData.contDiff)

/-- Helper: `b` is the complexification of the real bump. -/
lemma bpBump_apply (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bpBump x = ((bpBumpData (n := n) x : ℝ) : ℂ) := rfl

/-- Helper: `b(x) = 0` for `|x| ≥ 1/32`. -/
lemma bpBump_eq_zero {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (h : 1 / 32 ≤ ‖x‖) : bpBump x = 0 := by
  rw [bpBump_apply, ContDiffBump.zero_of_le_dist]
  · simp
  · simpa [bpBumpData] using h

/-- Helper: `b` is even. -/
lemma bpBump_neg (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : bpBump (-x) = bpBump x := by
  simp [bpBump_apply, ContDiffBump.neg]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`), the choice of `b`: `b` is real-valued, even,
nonzero (`b(0) = 1`), and supported in the cube `[-1/32, 1/32]^n`. -/
theorem bpBump_spec :
    (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), bpBump x = ((bpBump x).re : ℂ)) ∧
    (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), bpBump (-x) = bpBump x) ∧
    bpBump (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) = 1 ∧
    (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∃ i, 1 / 32 < |x i|) → bpBump x = 0) := by
  refine ⟨fun x => by simp [bpBump_apply], bpBump_neg, ?_, fun x ⟨i, hi⟩ => bpBump_eq_zero ?_⟩
  · rw [bpBump_apply, ContDiffBump.one_of_mem_closedBall]
    · simp
    · simp [bpBumpData]
  · have h1 : |x i| ≤ ‖x‖ := by simpa [Real.norm_eq_abs] using PiLp.norm_apply_le x i
    linarith

/-- The function `ǔ = 𝓕⁻ b` of Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`). -/
noncomputable def bpU : 𝓢(EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ℂ) := 𝓕⁻ bpBump

/-- Helper: `ǔ(x) = ∫ e(v·x) b(v) dv`. -/
lemma bpU_apply (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bpU x = ∫ v, 𝐞 ⟪v, x⟫ • bpBump v := by
  rw [bpU, SchwartzMap.fourierInv_coe, Real.fourierInv_eq]

/-- Helper: `ǔ` is even since `b` is. -/
lemma bpU_neg (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : bpU (-x) = bpU x := by
  rw [bpU_apply, bpU_apply, ← integral_neg_eq_self]
  congr 1; ext v
  rw [bpBump_neg, inner_neg_neg]

/-- Helper: `ǔ` is real-valued since `b` is real and even. -/
lemma conj_bpU (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : conj (bpU x) = bpU x := by
  conv_rhs => rw [← bpU_neg x]
  rw [bpU_apply, bpU_apply, ← integral_conj]
  congr 1; ext v
  simp only [Circle.smul_def, smul_eq_mul, map_mul, bpBump_apply, Complex.conj_ofReal,
    inner_neg_right]
  congr 1
  exact Circle.star_addChar _

/-- The autocorrelation `b ⋆ b` of Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`), as a Schwartz
function. -/
noncomputable def bpConv : 𝓢(EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ℂ) :=
  SchwartzMap.convolution (ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ) bpBump bpBump

/-- Helper: the product-convolution identity `𝓕⁻(b ⋆ b) = ǔ ⋅ ǔ`. -/
lemma fourierInv_bpConv_apply (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    𝓕⁻ (bpConv (n := n)) x = bpU x * bpU x := by
  rw [SchwartzMap.fourierInv_coe, Real.fourierInv_eq_fourier_neg, ← SchwartzMap.fourier_coe,
    bpConv, SchwartzMap.fourier_convolution, bpU, SchwartzMap.fourierInv_coe,
    Real.fourierInv_eq_fourier_neg, ← SchwartzMap.fourier_coe]
  simp

/-- Helper: `ǔ ⋅ ǔ = |ǔ|²` (as `ǔ` is real). -/
lemma bpU_mul_self (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bpU x * bpU x = ((‖bpU (n := n) x‖ ^ 2 : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
  conv_lhs => arg 2; rw [← conj_bpU x]
  rw [Complex.mul_conj, Complex.normSq_eq_norm_sq]

/-- The normalization `∫_E |ǔ|²` of Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`). -/
noncomputable def bpNorm : ℝ := ∫ x, ‖(bpU (n := n)) x‖ ^ 2

/-- Helper: `|ǔ|²` is integrable. -/
lemma integrable_norm_bpU_sq : Integrable (fun x => ‖(bpU (n := n)) x‖ ^ 2) := by
  refine ((𝓕⁻ (bpConv (n := n))).integrable.norm).congr (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => ?_)
  simp only [fourierInv_bpConv_apply, bpU_mul_self, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs]
  exact abs_of_nonneg (by positivity)

/-- Helper: `∫ |ǔ|² > 0` (`ǔ ≠ 0` because `𝓕 ǔ = b ≠ 0`). -/
lemma bpNorm_pos : 0 < bpNorm (n := n) := by
  have hb : 𝓕 (bpU (n := n)) = bpBump := by simp [bpU]
  obtain ⟨x, hx⟩ : ∃ x, bpU (n := n) x ≠ 0 := by
    by_contra h
    simp only [not_exists, not_not] at h
    have : bpU (n := n) = 0 := by ext x; simp [h x]
    have h0 := (bpBump_spec (n := n)).2.2.1
    rw [← hb, this, FourierTransform.fourier_zero] at h0
    exact zero_ne_one h0
  exact integral_pos_of_integrable_nonneg_nonzero (x := x) (by fun_prop) integrable_norm_bpU_sq
    (fun _ => by positivity) (by simpa using hx)

/-- The kernel `φ(x) = |ǔ(x)|² / ∫_E |ǔ|²`, `ǔ = 𝓕⁻ b`, of Blueprint Construction 4.4
(`con:phi`), as a real-valued function (its Schwartz version is `bpPhiS`). -/
noncomputable def bpPhi (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ :=
  ‖(bpU (n := n)) x‖ ^ 2 / bpNorm (n := n)

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`), definition of `φ`:
`φ(x) = |𝓕⁻ b (x)|² / ∫_E |𝓕⁻ b|²`. -/
theorem bpPhi_def (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bpPhi x = ‖(𝓕⁻ bpBump : 𝓢(EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ℂ)) x‖ ^ 2 /
      ∫ y, ‖(𝓕⁻ bpBump : 𝓢(EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ℂ)) y‖ ^ 2 := rfl

/-- The complex Schwartz function `(∫|ǔ|²)⁻¹ 𝓕⁻(b ⋆ b)`, which equals `φ`
(`coe_bpPhiS`). -/
noncomputable def bpPhiS : 𝓢(EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ℂ) :=
  ((bpNorm (n := n) : ℂ)⁻¹) • 𝓕⁻ (bpConv (n := n))

/-- Helper: pointwise form of `coe_bpPhiS`. -/
lemma bpPhiS_apply (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : bpPhiS x = (bpPhi x : ℂ) := by
  simp only [bpPhiS, smul_apply, fourierInv_bpConv_apply, bpU_mul_self, bpPhi,
    smul_eq_mul, Complex.ofReal_div]
  ring

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `φ` is a Schwartz function, namely (the
complexification of) `φ` is the Schwartz function `bpPhiS`. -/
theorem coe_bpPhiS : (bpPhiS : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) = fun x => (bpPhi x : ℂ) :=
  funext bpPhiS_apply

/-- Helper: `𝓕 φ = (∫|ǔ|²)⁻¹ (b ⋆ b)` (Fourier inversion on Schwartz space). -/
lemma fourier_bpPhiS : 𝓕 (bpPhiS (n := n)) = ((bpNorm (n := n) : ℂ)⁻¹) • bpConv := by
  rw [bpPhiS, FourierTransform.fourier_smul, FourierTransform.fourier_fourierInv_eq]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `φ ≥ 0`. -/
theorem bpPhi_nonneg (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : 0 ≤ bpPhi x :=
  div_nonneg (by positivity) bpNorm_pos.le

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `φ` is even, `φ(-x) = φ(x)`. -/
theorem bpPhi_neg (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : bpPhi (-x) = bpPhi x := by
  rw [bpPhi, bpPhi, bpU_neg]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `∫_E φ = 1`. -/
theorem integral_bpPhi : ∫ x, bpPhi (n := n) x = 1 := by
  rw [show (fun x => bpPhi (n := n) x) = fun x => ‖(bpU (n := n)) x‖ ^ 2 / bpNorm (n := n)
    from rfl, integral_div]
  exact div_self bpNorm_pos.ne'

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): all moments are finite, `|x|^k φ(x)` is integrable
for every `k` (in particular `φ` and `x_i φ(x)` are integrable). -/
theorem integrable_pow_mul_bpPhi (k : ℕ) :
    Integrable (fun x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => ‖x‖ ^ k * bpPhi x) := by
  refine (bpPhiS.integrable_pow_mul volume k).congr (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => ?_)
  simp only [bpPhiS_apply, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (bpPhi_nonneg x)]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): the first moments vanish,
`∫_E x_i φ(x) dx = 0` for every `i`. -/
theorem integral_coord_mul_bpPhi (i : Fin n) :
    ∫ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), x i * bpPhi x = 0 := by
  have h := integral_neg_eq_self (fun x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => x i * bpPhi x) volume
  simp only [PiLp.neg_apply, bpPhi_neg, neg_mul, integral_neg] at h
  linarith

/-- Helper: `𝓕 φ (ξ) = (∫|ǔ|²)⁻¹ ∫ b(t) b(ξ - t) dt`. -/
lemma fourier_bpPhi_apply (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    𝓕 (fun x => (bpPhi x : ℂ)) ξ =
      (bpNorm (n := n) : ℂ)⁻¹ * ∫ t, bpBump t * bpBump (ξ - t) := by
  rw [← coe_bpPhiS, ← SchwartzMap.fourier_coe, fourier_bpPhiS, smul_apply, bpConv,
    SchwartzMap.convolution_apply, convolution_def]
  simp

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `supp 𝓕φ ⊆ [-1/16, 1/16]^n`, i.e. `𝓕 φ (ξ) = 0`
as soon as `|ξ_i| > 1/16` for some `i` (`𝓕` is Mathlib's Fourier transform). -/
theorem fourier_bpPhi_eq_zero {ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (h : ∃ i, 1 / 16 < |ξ i|) :
    𝓕 (fun x => (bpPhi x : ℂ)) ξ = 0 := by
  obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := h
  rw [fourier_bpPhi_apply]
  have : ∀ t, bpBump t * bpBump (ξ - t) = 0 := by
    intro t
    by_cases ht : 1 / 32 ≤ ‖t‖
    · rw [bpBump_eq_zero ht, zero_mul]
    · rw [bpBump_eq_zero (x := ξ - t) ?_, mul_zero]
      have h1 : |t i| ≤ ‖t‖ := by simpa [Real.norm_eq_abs] using PiLp.norm_apply_le t i
      have h2 : |(ξ - t) i| ≤ ‖ξ - t‖ := by
        simpa [Real.norm_eq_abs] using PiLp.norm_apply_le (ξ - t) i
      have h3 : |ξ i| ≤ |(ξ - t) i| + |t i| := by
        simpa using abs_add_le ((ξ - t) i) (t i)
      linarith
  simp [this]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `𝓕 φ (0) = ∫ φ = 1`. -/
theorem fourier_bpPhi_zero : 𝓕 (fun x => (bpPhi (n := n) x : ℂ)) 0 = 1 := by
  rw [Real.fourier_eq]
  simp [integral_complex_ofReal, integral_bpPhi]

/-- The dilates `φ_J(x) = 2^{-Jn} φ(2^{-J} x)`, `J ∈ ℤ`, of Blueprint Construction 4.4
(`con:phi`). -/
noncomputable def bpPhiDil (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ :=
  (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(J * n)) * bpPhi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) • x)

/-- The multipliers `τ_J(ξ) = 𝓕φ(2^J ξ)`, `J ∈ ℤ`, of Blueprint Construction 4.4
(`con:phi`). -/
noncomputable def bpTau (J : ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  𝓕 (fun x => (bpPhi x : ℂ)) ((2 : ℝ) ^ J • ξ)

/-- Helper: `2^{-Jn} = (2^{-J})^n`. -/
lemma two_zpow_neg_mul_natCast_eq_pow (J : ℤ) :
    (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(J * n)) = ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J)) ^ n := by
  rw [← zpow_natCast, ← zpow_mul, neg_mul]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `φ_J ≥ 0`. -/
theorem bpPhiDil_nonneg (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : 0 ≤ bpPhiDil J x :=
  mul_nonneg (by positivity) (bpPhi_nonneg _)

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `τ_J = 𝓕 φ_J`, i.e.
`𝓕 φ_J (ξ) = 𝓕 φ (2^J ξ)`. -/
theorem fourier_bpPhiDil (J : ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    𝓕 (fun x => (bpPhiDil J x : ℂ)) ξ = bpTau J ξ := by
  set c : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) with hc_def
  have hc : 0 < c := by positivity
  let g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun y => 𝐞 (-⟪c⁻¹ • y, ξ⟫) • (bpPhi y : ℂ)
  have h1 : ∀ x, 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • (bpPhiDil J x : ℂ) = c ^ n • g (c • x) := by
    intro x
    simp only [g, bpPhiDil, inv_smul_smul₀ hc.ne', two_zpow_neg_mul_natCast_eq_pow, ← hc_def]
    simp only [Circle.smul_def, Complex.real_smul]
    push_cast
    ring
  rw [bpTau, Real.fourier_eq, Real.fourier_eq]
  simp_rw [h1]
  rw [integral_smul, Measure.integral_comp_smul, finrank_euclideanSpace_fin, smul_smul,
    abs_of_pos (by positivity), mul_inv_cancel₀ (by positivity), one_smul]
  refine integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_)
  simp only [g, real_inner_smul_left, real_inner_smul_right, hc_def, zpow_neg, inv_inv]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `supp τ_J ⊆ [-2^{-J}/16, 2^{-J}/16]^n`. -/
theorem bpTau_eq_zero (J : ℤ) {ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
    (h : ∃ i, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) / 16 < |ξ i|) : bpTau J ξ = 0 := by
  obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := h
  refine fourier_bpPhi_eq_zero ⟨i, ?_⟩
  have h2 : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
  rw [PiLp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, abs_mul, abs_of_pos h2]
  rw [zpow_neg, div_lt_iff₀ (by norm_num)] at hi
  have h3 := mul_lt_mul_of_pos_left hi h2
  rw [mul_inv_cancel₀ h2.ne'] at h3
  linarith

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `τ_J(0) = 1`. -/
theorem bpTau_zero (J : ℤ) : bpTau J (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) = 1 := by
  rw [bpTau, smul_zero, fourier_bpPhi_zero]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`): `∫_E φ_J = 1` for every `J ∈ ℤ`. -/
theorem integral_bpPhiDil (J : ℤ) : ∫ x, bpPhiDil (n := n) J x = 1 := by
  have h := fourier_bpPhiDil (n := n) J 0
  rw [bpTau_zero, Real.fourier_eq] at h
  simp only [inner_zero_right, neg_zero, AddChar.map_zero_eq_one, one_smul,
    integral_complex_ofReal] at h
  exact_mod_cast h

/-- The explicit constant `C = 2^{n+1} max_{k ≤ n+1} ‖φ‖_{k,0}` in `φ(x) ≤ C (1 + |x|)^{-n-1}`
(Blueprint Construction 4.4, `con:phi`). -/
noncomputable def bpPhiConst (n : ℕ) : ℝ :=
  2 ^ (n + 1) * (Finset.Iic (n + 1, 0)).sup (fun m => SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ m.1 m.2)
    (bpPhiS (n := n))

/-- Helper: the constant `bpPhiConst n` is nonnegative. -/
lemma bpPhiConst_nonneg : 0 ≤ bpPhiConst n := mul_nonneg (by positivity) (apply_nonneg _ _)

/-- Helper: the Schwartz decay `φ(x) ≤ C (1 + |x|)^{-n-1}`. -/
lemma bpPhi_le (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bpPhi x ≤ bpPhiConst n * ((1 + ‖x‖) ^ (n + 1))⁻¹ := by
  have h := SchwartzMap.one_add_le_sup_seminorm_apply (𝕜 := ℝ) (m := (n + 1, 0)) le_rfl le_rfl
    (bpPhiS (n := n)) x
  rw [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero, bpPhiS_apply, Complex.norm_real,
    Real.norm_of_nonneg (bpPhi_nonneg x)] at h
  rw [le_mul_inv_iff₀ (by positivity), mul_comm]
  exact h

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`), domination by the envelope of Lemma 2.4
(`lem:maximal`): `φ_J(x) ≤ C B_{2^J}(x)` for all `J ∈ ℤ` and `x ∈ E`, with
`C = bpPhiConst n`. -/
theorem bpPhiDil_le_envelope (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bpPhiDil J x ≤ bpPhiConst n * envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) x := by
  have hc : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ (-J) := by positivity
  calc bpPhiDil J x ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(J * n)) * (bpPhiConst n *
        ((1 + ‖(2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) • x‖) ^ (n + 1))⁻¹) :=
        mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (bpPhi_le _) (by positivity)
    _ = bpPhiConst n * envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) x := by
      rw [envelope, norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg hc.le, two_zpow_neg_mul_natCast_eq_pow,
        zpow_neg, div_eq_inv_mul, inv_pow]
      ring

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`), "in particular" (on `E`, via Lemma 2.4
`lem:maximal`): `(|φ_J| * |f|)(x) = ∫ φ_J(y) |f(x - y)| dy ≤ C 𝖬 f(x)` for every `J ∈ ℤ`,
`x ∈ E` and a.e. strongly measurable `f`, with `C = bpPhiConst n * envelopeConst n`. -/
theorem lintegral_bpPhiDil_mul_le_cubeMaximalEuclidean {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F]
    (J : ℤ) {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hf : AEStronglyMeasurable f volume)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ∫⁻ y, ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiDil J y) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n * envelopeConst n) * cubeMaximalEuclidean n f x := by
  have hR : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
  calc ∫⁻ y, ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiDil J y) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ
      ≤ ∫⁻ y, ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n) *
          (ENNReal.ofReal (envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) y) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ) := by
        refine lintegral_mono fun y => ?_
        rw [← mul_assoc, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul bpPhiConst_nonneg]
        gcongr
        exact bpPhiDil_le_envelope J y
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n) *
          ∫⁻ y, ENNReal.ofReal (envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) y) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ :=
        lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top
    _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n) *
          (ENNReal.ofReal (envelopeConst n) * cubeMaximalEuclidean n f x) := by
        gcongr
        exact lintegral_envelope_mul_le_cubeMaximalEuclidean hR hf x
    _ = _ := by rw [ENNReal.ofReal_mul bpPhiConst_nonneg, mul_assoc]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`), "in particular" (on `E`), maximal form:
`sup_J (φ_J * |f|)(x) ≤ C 𝖬 f(x)` with `C = bpPhiConst n * envelopeConst n`. -/
theorem iSup_lintegral_bpPhiDil_mul_le_cubeMaximalEuclidean {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F]
    {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hf : AEStronglyMeasurable f volume)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ⨆ J : ℤ, ∫⁻ y, ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiDil J y) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n * envelopeConst n) * cubeMaximalEuclidean n f x :=
  iSup_le fun J => lintegral_bpPhiDil_mul_le_cubeMaximalEuclidean J hf x

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`), "in particular" for the sampled lattice kernel
(on `G = ℤⁿ`, via Lemma 2.4 `lem:maximal`): for `J ≥ 0`,
`∑_y φ_J(y) |f(x - y)| ≤ C 𝖬 f(x)` with `C = bpPhiConst n * envelopeConst n`. -/
theorem tsum_bpPhiDil_latEmbed_mul_le_cubeMaximalInt {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F]
    {J : ℤ} (hJ : 0 ≤ J) (f : (Fin n → ℤ) → F) (x : Fin n → ℤ) :
    ∑' y, ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiDil J (latEmbed y)) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n * envelopeConst n) * cubeMaximalInt n f x := by
  have hR : (1 : ℝ) ≤ 2 ^ J := one_le_zpow₀ (by norm_num) hJ
  calc ∑' y, ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiDil J (latEmbed y)) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ
      ≤ ∑' y, ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n) *
          (ENNReal.ofReal (latEnvelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) y) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ) := by
        refine ENNReal.tsum_le_tsum fun y => ?_
        rw [← mul_assoc, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul bpPhiConst_nonneg]
        gcongr
        exact bpPhiDil_le_envelope J (latEmbed y)
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n) *
          ∑' y, ENNReal.ofReal (latEnvelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) y) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ :=
        ENNReal.tsum_mul_left
    _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n) *
          (ENNReal.ofReal (envelopeConst n) * cubeMaximalInt n f x) := by
        gcongr
        exact tsum_envelope_mul_le_cubeMaximalInt hR f x
    _ = _ := by rw [ENNReal.ofReal_mul bpPhiConst_nonneg, mul_assoc]

/-- Blueprint Construction 4.4 (`con:phi`), lattice maximal form:
`sup_{J ≥ 0} ∑_y φ_J(y) |f(x - y)| ≤ C 𝖬 f(x)` on `G = ℤⁿ`, with
`C = bpPhiConst n * envelopeConst n`. -/
theorem iSup_tsum_bpPhiDil_latEmbed_mul_le_cubeMaximalInt {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F]
    (f : (Fin n → ℤ) → F) (x : Fin n → ℤ) :
    ⨆ (J : ℤ) (_ : 0 ≤ J), ∑' y, ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiDil J (latEmbed y)) * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal (bpPhiConst n * envelopeConst n) * cubeMaximalInt n f x :=
  iSup₂_le fun _ hJ => tsum_bpPhiDil_latEmbed_mul_le_cubeMaximalInt hJ f x

/-! ## Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`): signed smoothing errors for truncation -/

/-- The truncated kernel `∑_{j ≥ J} K_j` of Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`), as the
series `∑_{i ∈ ℕ} K_{J+i}` (at each point only finitely many terms are nonzero). -/
noncomputable def truncKernel (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (J : ℤ)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  ∑' i : ℕ, dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) x

/-- Helper: `K_j(x) = 0` for `|x| ≤ 2^{j-1}`. -/
lemma dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_norm_le (j : ℤ) {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
    (h : ‖x‖ ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - 1)) : dyadicKernel Ω j x = 0 := by
  by_contra hx
  exact absurd (support_dyadicKernel j hx).1 (not_lt.2 h)

/-- Helper: on `|w| ≤ 2^{J+N-1}` the truncated kernel is the finite sum `∑_{i < N} K_{J+i}`. -/
lemma truncKernel_eq_sum (J : ℤ) (N : ℕ) {w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
    (hw : ‖w‖ ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (J + N - 1)) :
    truncKernel Ω J w = ∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) w := by
  unfold truncKernel
  apply tsum_eq_sum
  intro i hi
  rw [Finset.mem_range, not_lt] at hi
  apply dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_norm_le
  refine hw.trans (zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) ?_)
  have : (N : ℤ) ≤ i := by exact_mod_cast hi
  omega

/-- Helper: every radius is below some `2^{J+N-1}`. -/
lemma exists_lt_two_zpow_add (J : ℤ) (r : ℝ) : ∃ N : ℕ, r < (2 : ℝ) ^ (J + N - 1) := by
  obtain ⟨m, hm⟩ := pow_unbounded_of_one_lt r (by norm_num : (1 : ℝ) < 2)
  refine ⟨(m + 1 - J).toNat, hm.trans_le ?_⟩
  rw [← zpow_natCast]
  exact zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) (by omega)

/-- Helper: locally the truncated kernel is a finite sum of the `K_{J+i}`. -/
lemma truncKernel_eventuallyEq_sum (J : ℤ) (w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ∃ N : ℕ, truncKernel Ω J =ᶠ[nhds w]
      fun v => ∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) v := by
  obtain ⟨N, hN⟩ := exists_lt_two_zpow_add J (‖w‖ + 1)
  refine ⟨N, ?_⟩
  filter_upwards [ball_mem_nhds w one_pos] with v hv
  apply truncKernel_eq_sum
  have : ‖v‖ ≤ ‖w‖ + dist v w := by
    have := norm_le_norm_add_norm_sub' v w
    rw [dist_eq_norm]; linarith [norm_sub_rev v w]
  rw [mem_ball] at hv
  linarith

/-- Helper: `∑_{i ≥ 0} K_{J+i}(x)` has finitely many nonzero terms and sums to the truncated
kernel. -/
lemma hasSum_truncKernel (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    HasSum (fun i : ℕ => dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) x) (truncKernel Ω J x) := by
  obtain ⟨N, hN⟩ := exists_lt_two_zpow_add J ‖x‖
  rw [truncKernel_eq_sum J N hN.le]
  apply hasSum_sum_of_ne_finset_zero
  intro i hi
  rw [Finset.mem_range, not_lt] at hi
  apply dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_norm_le
  refine hN.le.trans (zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) ?_)
  have : (N : ℤ) ≤ i := by exact_mod_cast hi
  omega

/-- Helper: the truncated kernel is smooth. -/
theorem contDiff_truncKernel (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (J : ℤ) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (truncKernel Ω J) := by
  rw [contDiff_iff_contDiffAt]
  intro w
  obtain ⟨N, hN⟩ := truncKernel_eventuallyEq_sum (Ω := Ω) J w
  refine ContDiffAt.congr_of_eventuallyEq ?_ hN
  exact (ContDiff.sum fun i _ => contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ _).contDiffAt

/-- Helper: `2^{-jm} ≤ 2^{-Jm} 2^{-|j - J|}` for `j ≥ J`, `m ≥ 1`. -/
lemma two_zpow_neg_mul_le {J j : ℤ} (h : J ≤ j) {m : ℕ} (hm : 1 ≤ m) :
    (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * (m : ℤ)) ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J * (m : ℤ)) * 2 ^ (-|j - J|) := by
  rw [← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero, abs_of_nonneg (by omega)]
  apply zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num)
  have : (j - J) * 1 ≤ (j - J) * (m : ℤ) :=
    mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (by exact_mod_cast hm) (by omega)
  nlinarith

/-- Helper: for every order `k` (with `n + k ≥ 1`) there is `A` with
`∑_{i ∈ s} ‖D^k K_{J+i}(x)‖ ≤ A (2^J + |x|)^{-n-k}` for all `J`, finite `s ⊆ ℕ` and `x`. -/
lemma sum_norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_add_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (k : ℕ)
    (hk : 1 ≤ n + k) :
    ∃ A : ℝ, 0 ≤ A ∧ ∀ (J : ℤ) (s : Finset ℕ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ∑ i ∈ s, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) x‖ ≤
        A / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J + ‖x‖) ^ (n + k) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ k
  have hC0 : 0 ≤ C := by
    have h := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hC 0 0)
    exact nonneg_of_mul_nonneg_left h (by positivity)
  obtain ⟨B, hB0, hB⟩ := sum_norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ k
  refine ⟨2 ^ (n + k) * (C * geomZ + B), by have := geomZ_nonneg; positivity,
    fun J s x => ?_⟩
  set R : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ J with hR
  have hR0 : 0 < R := by positivity
  let emb : ℕ ↪ ℤ := ⟨fun i => J + i, fun a b h => by simpa using h⟩
  -- first bound: `C geomZ R^{-(n+k)}`
  have h1 : ∑ i ∈ s, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) x‖ ≤
      C * geomZ / R ^ (n + k) := by
    calc ∑ i ∈ s, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) x‖
        ≤ ∑ j ∈ s.map emb, C * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J * ((n + k : ℕ) : ℤ)) * 2 ^ (-|j - J|)) := by
          rw [Finset.sum_map]
          refine Finset.sum_le_sum fun i _ => (hC _ x).trans ?_
          refine mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left ?_ hC0
          have := two_zpow_neg_mul_le (J := J) (j := J + i) (by omega) hk
          change _ ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J * ((n + k : ℕ) : ℤ)) * 2 ^ (-|(J + i) - J|)
          push_cast at this ⊢
          exact this
      _ = C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J * ((n + k : ℕ) : ℤ)) * ∑ j ∈ s.map emb, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - J|) := by
          rw [Finset.mul_sum]; exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun _ _ => by ring
      _ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J * ((n + k : ℕ) : ℤ)) * geomZ := by
          gcongr; exact sum_two_zpow_neg_abs_sub_le _ J
      _ = C * geomZ / R ^ (n + k) := by
          rw [hR, ← zpow_natCast, ← zpow_mul, neg_mul, zpow_neg]; ring
  rcases le_or_gt ‖x‖ R with hx | hx
  · calc _ ≤ C * geomZ / R ^ (n + k) := h1
      _ ≤ 2 ^ (n + k) * (C * geomZ) / (R + ‖x‖) ^ (n + k) := by
          rw [div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) (by positivity)]
          have : (R + ‖x‖) ^ (n + k) ≤ 2 ^ (n + k) * R ^ (n + k) := by
            rw [← mul_pow]; exact pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity) (by linarith) _
          have := geomZ_nonneg
          nlinarith [mul_nonneg hC0 geomZ_nonneg]
      _ ≤ _ := by
          gcongr; have := geomZ_nonneg; nlinarith [mul_nonneg hC0 geomZ_nonneg]
  · have hx0 : x ≠ 0 := by rintro rfl; simp at hx; linarith
    have h2 := hB (s.map emb) x hx0
    rw [Finset.sum_map] at h2
    calc _ ≤ B / ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) := h2
      _ ≤ 2 ^ (n + k) * B / (R + ‖x‖) ^ (n + k) := by
          have hxp : 0 < ‖x‖ := norm_pos_iff.2 hx0
          rw [div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) (by positivity)]
          have : (R + ‖x‖) ^ (n + k) ≤ 2 ^ (n + k) * ‖x‖ ^ (n + k) := by
            rw [← mul_pow]; exact pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity) (by linarith) _
          nlinarith
      _ ≤ _ := by
          gcongr; have := geomZ_nonneg; nlinarith [mul_nonneg hC0 geomZ_nonneg]

/-- Helper: derivative bounds for the truncated kernel,
`‖D^k (∑_{j ≥ J} K_j)(x)‖ ≤ A_k (2^J + |x|)^{-n-k}` uniformly in `J ∈ ℤ`. -/
theorem norm_iteratedFDeriv_truncKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (k : ℕ) (hk : 1 ≤ n + k) :
    ∃ A : ℝ, 0 ≤ A ∧ ∀ (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (truncKernel Ω J) x‖ ≤ A / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J + ‖x‖) ^ (n + k) := by
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := sum_norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_add_le hΩ k hk
  refine ⟨A, hA0, fun J x => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨N, hN⟩ := truncKernel_eventuallyEq_sum (Ω := Ω) J x
  rw [(hN.iteratedFDeriv ℝ k).eq_of_nhds, iteratedFDeriv_fun_sum_apply
    (fun i _ => (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ _).contDiffAt.of_le (by simp))]
  exact (norm_sum_le _ _).trans (hA J _ x)

/-! ### Complex dilates of `φ` -/

/-- The complexification `x ↦ (φ_J(x) : ℂ)` of the dilates of Blueprint Construction 4.4
(`con:phi`), used as a convolution kernel. -/
noncomputable def bpPhiDilC (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ := (bpPhiDil J x : ℂ)

/-- Helper: `φ_J(x) = c^n φ(c x)` with `c = 2^{-J}`, in terms of the Schwartz function
`bpPhiS`. -/
lemma bpPhiDilC_eq (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bpPhiDilC J x = ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J)) ^ n • bpPhiS ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) • x) := by
  rw [bpPhiDilC, bpPhiDil, bpPhiS_apply, two_zpow_neg_mul_natCast_eq_pow, Complex.real_smul]
  push_cast; ring

/-- Helper: `φ_J` is even. -/
lemma bpPhiDil_neg (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : bpPhiDil J (-x) = bpPhiDil J x := by
  rw [bpPhiDil, bpPhiDil, smul_neg, bpPhi_neg]

/-- Helper: `φ` is continuous. -/
lemma continuous_bpPhi : Continuous (bpPhi (n := n)) :=
  ((bpU (n := n)).continuous.norm.pow 2).div_const _

/-- Helper: `φ_J` is continuous. -/
lemma continuous_bpPhiDil (J : ℤ) : Continuous (bpPhiDil (n := n) J) :=
  continuous_const.mul (continuous_bpPhi.comp (continuous_const_smul _))

/-- Helper: `φ_J` is smooth (complex form). -/
lemma contDiff_bpPhiDilC (J : ℤ) : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (bpPhiDilC (n := n) J) := by
  have : bpPhiDilC (n := n) J =
      fun x => ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J)) ^ n • bpPhiS ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) • x) := funext (bpPhiDilC_eq J)
  rw [this]
  exact ((bpPhiS (n := n)).smooth ⊤ |>.comp (contDiff_const_smul _)).const_smul _

/-- Helper: scaling of derivatives, `‖D^k (c^n S(c ·))(x)‖ ≤ c^{n+k} ‖D^k S(c x)‖`. -/
lemma norm_iteratedFDeriv_dilate_le {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℝ F]
    {S : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hS : ContDiff ℝ ∞ S) (k : ℕ) {c : ℝ} (hc : 0 < c)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (fun y => c ^ n • S (c • y)) x‖ ≤
      c ^ (n + k) * ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k S (c • x)‖ := by
  let L : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) →L[ℝ] EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) :=
    c • ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ _
  have hL : ‖L‖ ≤ c := by
    calc ‖L‖ ≤ ‖c‖ * ‖ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))‖ :=
          norm_smul_le c (ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)))
      _ ≤ ‖c‖ * 1 := by gcongr; exact ContinuousLinearMap.norm_id_le
      _ = c := by rw [mul_one, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos hc]
  have hfun : (fun y => c ^ n • S (c • y)) = fun y => c ^ n • (S ∘ L) y := rfl
  have hcomp : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (S ∘ L) := hS.comp L.contDiff
  rw [hfun, iteratedFDeriv_const_smul_apply' (hcomp.of_le (by simp)).contDiffAt,
    L.iteratedFDeriv_comp_right hS x (by simp), norm_smul]
  calc ‖c ^ n‖ * ‖(iteratedFDeriv ℝ k S (L x)).compContinuousLinearMap fun _ => L‖
      ≤ c ^ n * (‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k S (L x)‖ * ∏ _i : Fin k, ‖L‖) := by
        rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity)]
        gcongr
        exact ContinuousMultilinearMap.norm_compContinuousLinearMap_le _ _
    _ ≤ c ^ n * (‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k S (L x)‖ * c ^ k) := by
        rw [Finset.prod_const, Finset.card_univ, Fintype.card_fin]
        gcongr
    _ = c ^ (n + k) * ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k S (c • x)‖ := by
        rw [pow_add]; simp only [L, smul_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.id_apply]
        ring

/-- Helper: derivative bounds for the dilates, `‖D^k φ_J(x)‖ ≤ Q 2^{-J(n+k)} (1+|x|/2^J)^{-N}`
uniformly in `J ∈ ℤ`. -/
lemma norm_iteratedFDeriv_bpPhiDilC_le (k N : ℕ) :
    ∃ Q : ℝ, 0 ≤ Q ∧ ∀ (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (bpPhiDilC J) x‖ ≤
        Q / (((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + k) * (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N) := by
  set Q := 2 ^ N * (Finset.Iic (N, k)).sup (fun m => SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ m.1 m.2)
    (bpPhiS (n := n))
  have hQ : 0 ≤ Q := mul_nonneg (by positivity) (apply_nonneg _ _)
  refine ⟨Q, hQ, fun J x => ?_⟩
  set c : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) with hc_def
  have hc : 0 < c := by positivity
  have hfun : bpPhiDilC (n := n) J = fun y => c ^ n • bpPhiS (c • y) := funext (bpPhiDilC_eq J)
  have h1 := norm_iteratedFDeriv_dilate_le ((bpPhiS (n := n)).smooth ⊤) k hc x
  rw [← hfun] at h1
  have h2 := SchwartzMap.one_add_le_sup_seminorm_apply (𝕜 := ℝ) (m := (N, k)) le_rfl le_rfl
    (bpPhiS (n := n)) (c • x)
  have hcx : ‖c • x‖ = ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J := by
    rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg hc.le, hc_def, zpow_neg, inv_mul_eq_div]
  rw [hcx] at h2
  have hpos : 0 < (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N := by positivity
  have h3 : ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (⇑bpPhiS) (c • x)‖ ≤ Q / (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N := by
    rw [le_div_iff₀ hpos, mul_comm]; exact h2
  calc ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (bpPhiDilC J) x‖ ≤ c ^ (n + k) * (Q / (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N) :=
        h1.trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h3 (by positivity))
    _ = Q / (((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + k) * (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N) := by
        rw [hc_def, zpow_neg, inv_pow]; field_simp

/-- Helper: `φ_J` is integrable. -/
lemma integrable_bpPhiDil (J : ℤ) : Integrable (bpPhiDil (n := n) J) := by
  have h := ((integrable_pow_mul_bpPhi (n := n) 0).comp_smul
    (show (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) ≠ 0 by positivity)).const_mul ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-(J * n)))
  refine h.congr (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => ?_)
  simp [bpPhiDil]

/-- Helper: `φ_J` is integrable (complex form). -/
lemma integrable_bpPhiDilC (J : ℤ) : Integrable (bpPhiDilC (n := n) J) :=
  (integrable_bpPhiDil J).ofReal

/-- Helper: `∫ φ_J = 1` (complex form). -/
lemma integral_bpPhiDilC (J : ℤ) : ∫ x, bpPhiDilC (n := n) J x = 1 := by
  simp only [bpPhiDilC, integral_complex_ofReal, integral_bpPhiDil, Complex.ofReal_one]

/-- Helper: `‖φ_J(x)‖ = φ_J(x)` (complex form). -/
lemma norm_bpPhiDilC (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖bpPhiDilC J x‖ = bpPhiDil J x := by
  rw [bpPhiDilC, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_of_nonneg (bpPhiDil_nonneg J x)]

/-- The weighted moments `∫ |u|^k (1 + |u|)^N φ(u) du` of `φ`. -/
noncomputable def bpMoment (n k N : ℕ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ‖u‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N * bpPhi u

/-- Helper: `|u|^k (1 + |u|)^N φ(u)` is integrable. -/
lemma integrable_moment_bpPhi (k N : ℕ) :
    Integrable (fun u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => ‖u‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N * bpPhi u) := by
  refine (((integrable_pow_mul_bpPhi k).add (integrable_pow_mul_bpPhi (k + N))).const_mul
    (2 ^ N)).mono'
    (((continuous_norm.pow k).mul ((continuous_const.add continuous_norm).pow N)).mul
      continuous_bpPhi).aestronglyMeasurable (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun u => ?_)
  have hφ := bpPhi_nonneg u
  have h1 : (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N ≤ 2 ^ N * (1 + ‖u‖ ^ N) := by
    rcases le_total ‖u‖ 1 with h | h
    · calc (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N ≤ 2 ^ N := pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity) (by linarith) _
        _ ≤ 2 ^ N * (1 + ‖u‖ ^ N) := by
          have : 0 ≤ ‖u‖ ^ N := by positivity
          nlinarith [pow_pos (show (0:ℝ) < 2 by norm_num) N]
    · calc (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N ≤ (2 * ‖u‖) ^ N := pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity) (by linarith) _
        _ = 2 ^ N * ‖u‖ ^ N := mul_pow _ _ _
        _ ≤ 2 ^ N * (1 + ‖u‖ ^ N) := by
          nlinarith [pow_pos (show (0:ℝ) < 2 by norm_num) N]
  rw [Real.norm_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
  calc ‖u‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N * bpPhi u ≤ ‖u‖ ^ k * (2 ^ N * (1 + ‖u‖ ^ N)) * bpPhi u := by
        gcongr
    _ = 2 ^ N * (‖u‖ ^ k * bpPhi u + ‖u‖ ^ (k + N) * bpPhi u) := by ring

/-- Helper: `bpMoment n k N ≥ 0`. -/
lemma bpMoment_nonneg (k N : ℕ) : 0 ≤ bpMoment n k N :=
  integral_nonneg fun u => mul_nonneg (by positivity) (bpPhi_nonneg u)

/-- Helper: scaling of the moments,
`∫ |z|^k (1 + |z|/2^J)^N φ_J(z) dz = 2^{Jk} ∫ |u|^k (1 + |u|)^N φ(u) du`, with integrability. -/
lemma integral_moment_bpPhiDil (J : ℤ) (k N : ℕ) :
    Integrable (fun z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
        ‖z‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N * bpPhiDil J z) ∧
      ∫ z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ‖z‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N * bpPhiDil J z =
        ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ k * bpMoment n k N := by
  set c : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) with hc_def
  have hc : 0 < c := by positivity
  have hcR : c * 2 ^ J = 1 := by rw [hc_def, zpow_neg, inv_mul_cancel₀ (by positivity)]
  let g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ := fun u =>
    ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ k * c ^ n * (‖u‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N * bpPhi u)
  have hfun : (fun z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
      ‖z‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N * bpPhiDil J z) = fun z => g (c • z) := by
    funext z
    have h1 : ‖c • z‖ = ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J := by
      rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg hc.le, hc_def, zpow_neg, inv_mul_eq_div]
    simp only [g, bpPhiDil, two_zpow_neg_mul_natCast_eq_pow, ← hc_def]
    rw [h1, div_pow]
    field_simp
  have hg : Integrable g := (integrable_moment_bpPhi k N).const_mul _
  refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
  · rw [hfun]; exact hg.comp_smul hc.ne'
  · rw [hfun, Measure.integral_comp_smul, finrank_euclideanSpace_fin, smul_eq_mul,
      integral_const_mul, bpMoment, abs_of_pos (by positivity)]
    have : (c ^ n)⁻¹ * c ^ n = 1 := inv_mul_cancel₀ (by positivity)
    calc (c ^ n)⁻¹ * (((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ k * c ^ n *
          ∫ u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ‖u‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N * bpPhi u)
        = ((c ^ n)⁻¹ * c ^ n) * (((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ k *
          ∫ u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ‖u‖ ^ k * (1 + ‖u‖) ^ N * bpPhi u) := by ring
      _ = _ := by rw [this, one_mul]

section Taylor
variable {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℝ F]

/-- Helper: first-order mean value bound along the segment `[x, x - z]`. -/
lemma norm_sub_le_of_norm_fderiv_segment {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F}
    (hf : Differentiable ℝ f) {x z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} {M : ℝ}
    (hM : ∀ t ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, ‖fderiv ℝ f (x - t • z)‖ ≤ M) {s : ℝ} (hs : s ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1) :
    ‖f (x - s • z) - f x‖ ≤ M * ‖z‖ * s := by
  have hd : ∀ t : ℝ, HasDerivAt (fun t : ℝ => f (x - t • z)) (fderiv ℝ f (x - t • z) (-z)) t := by
    intro t
    have h1 : HasDerivAt (fun t : ℝ => x - t • z) (-z) t := by
      simpa using ((hasDerivAt_id t).smul_const z).const_sub x
    exact (hf _).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt t h1
  have := norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_deriv_le_segment' (f := fun t : ℝ => f (x - t • z))
    (a := 0) (b := 1) (C := M * ‖z‖) (fun t _ => (hd t).hasDerivWithinAt) (fun t ht => ?_) s hs
  · simpa using this
  · refine (ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _).trans ?_
    rw [norm_neg]
    exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hM t (Ico_subset_Icc_self ht)) (norm_nonneg _)

/-- Helper: second-order Taylor bound
`‖f(x - z) - f(x) + Df(x) z‖ ≤ M |z|²` if `‖D²f‖ ≤ M` on the segment `[x, x - z]`. -/
lemma norm_taylor_two_le {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hf : ContDiff ℝ 2 f)
    {x z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} {M : ℝ}
    (hM : ∀ t ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 2 f (x - t • z)‖ ≤ M) :
    ‖f (x - z) - f x + fderiv ℝ f x z‖ ≤ M * ‖z‖ ^ 2 := by
  have hdf : Differentiable ℝ f := hf.differentiable (by norm_num)
  have hdf' : Differentiable ℝ (fderiv ℝ f) :=
    (hf.fderiv_right (m := 1) (by norm_num)).differentiable (by norm_num)
  have hM' : ∀ t ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ f) (x - t • z)‖ ≤ M := by
    intro t ht
    rw [← norm_iteratedFDeriv_one, norm_iteratedFDeriv_fderiv]
    exact hM t ht
  have hstep : ∀ s ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, ‖fderiv ℝ f (x - s • z) - fderiv ℝ f x‖ ≤ M * ‖z‖ :=
    fun s hs => (norm_sub_le_of_norm_fderiv_segment hdf' hM' hs).trans
      (by
        have hM0 : 0 ≤ M := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hM 0 (by simp))
        have : M * ‖z‖ * s ≤ M * ‖z‖ * 1 :=
          mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hs.2 (by positivity)
        linarith)
  let g : ℝ → F := fun t => f (x - t • z) + t • fderiv ℝ f x z
  have hd : ∀ t : ℝ, HasDerivAt g (fderiv ℝ f (x - t • z) (-z) + fderiv ℝ f x z) t := by
    intro t
    have h1 : HasDerivAt (fun t : ℝ => x - t • z) (-z) t := by
      simpa using ((hasDerivAt_id t).smul_const z).const_sub x
    have h2 := (hdf _).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt t h1
    have h3 : HasDerivAt (fun t : ℝ => t • fderiv ℝ f x z) ((1 : ℝ) • fderiv ℝ f x z) t :=
      (hasDerivAt_id t).smul_const _
    rw [one_smul] at h3
    exact h2.add h3
  have := norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_deriv_le_segment' (f := g) (a := 0) (b := 1)
    (C := M * ‖z‖ ^ 2) (fun t _ => (hd t).hasDerivWithinAt) (fun t ht => ?_) 1 (by simp)
  · simpa [g, sub_eq_add_neg, add_comm, add_left_comm, add_assoc] using this
  · have : fderiv ℝ f (x - t • z) (-z) + fderiv ℝ f x z =
        (fderiv ℝ f x - fderiv ℝ f (x - t • z)) z := by
      rw [show (fderiv ℝ f x - fderiv ℝ f (x - t • z)) z =
        fderiv ℝ f x z - fderiv ℝ f (x - t • z) z from rfl, map_neg]; abel
    rw [this]
    refine (ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _).trans ?_
    rw [norm_sub_rev, pow_two, ← mul_assoc]
    exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hstep t (Ico_subset_Icc_self ht)) (norm_nonneg _)

end Taylor

/-- Helper: Peetre's inequality in the form
`(1 + |x - t z|/ρ)^{-N} ≤ (1 + |z|/R)^N (1 + |x|/ρ)^{-N}` for `0 < R ≤ ρ`, `t ∈ [0,1]`. -/
lemma inv_one_add_pow_le {R ρ : ℝ} (hR : 0 < R) (hRρ : R ≤ ρ) (N : ℕ)
    (x z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) {t : ℝ} (ht : t ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1) :
    1 / (1 + ‖x - t • z‖ / ρ) ^ N ≤ (1 + ‖z‖ / R) ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N := by
  have hρ : 0 < ρ := hR.trans_le hRρ
  have h1 : ‖x‖ ≤ ‖x - t • z‖ + t * ‖z‖ := by
    have := norm_le_norm_add_norm_sub' x (t • z)
    rw [norm_sub_rev] at this
    have h := norm_le_norm_sub_add x (t • z)
    rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg ht.1] at h
    linarith
  have h2 : t * ‖z‖ / ρ ≤ ‖z‖ / R := by
    rw [div_le_div_iff₀ hρ hR]
    have : t * ‖z‖ * R ≤ 1 * ‖z‖ * R :=
      mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right ht.2 (norm_nonneg _)) hR.le
    nlinarith [norm_nonneg z]
  have key : 1 + ‖x‖ / ρ ≤ (1 + ‖x - t • z‖ / ρ) * (1 + ‖z‖ / R) := by
    have h3 : ‖x‖ / ρ ≤ ‖x - t • z‖ / ρ + t * ‖z‖ / ρ := by
      rw [← add_div]; exact div_le_div_of_nonneg_right h1 hρ.le
    have : 0 ≤ ‖x - t • z‖ / ρ * (‖z‖ / R) := by positivity
    nlinarith
  rw [div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) (by positivity), one_mul, ← mul_pow]
  exact pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity) (key.trans_eq (mul_comm _ _)) _

section Convolution
variable {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℂ F]

/-- Helper: differentiation under the integral sign for `x ↦ ∫ g(t) h(x - t) dt` with `g`
integrable and `h` of class `C¹` with bounded values and derivative. -/
lemma hasFDerivAt_integral_smul_sub [CompleteSpace F] {g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (hg : Integrable g) {h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hh : ContDiff ℝ 1 h) {M0 M1 : ℝ}
    (hh0 : ∀ v, ‖h v‖ ≤ M0) (hh1 : ∀ v, ‖fderiv ℝ h v‖ ≤ M1) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    HasFDerivAt (fun x => ∫ t, g t • h (x - t)) (∫ t, g t • fderiv ℝ h (x - t)) x := by
  have hc : Continuous h := hh.continuous
  have hc' : Continuous (fderiv ℝ h) := hh.continuous_fderiv (by norm_num)
  refine hasFDerivAt_integral_of_dominated_of_fderiv_le (𝕜 := ℝ) (μ := volume)
    (F := fun x t => g t • h (x - t)) (F' := fun x t => g t • fderiv ℝ h (x - t)) (s := univ)
    (bound := fun t => ‖g t‖ * M1)
    Filter.univ_mem (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_) ?_ ?_ ?_ (hg.norm.mul_const M1) ?_
  · exact hg.aestronglyMeasurable.smul
      (hc.comp (continuous_const.sub continuous_id)).aestronglyMeasurable
  · refine (hg.norm.mul_const M0).mono'
      (hg.aestronglyMeasurable.smul
        (hc.comp (continuous_const.sub continuous_id)).aestronglyMeasurable)
      (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun t => ?_)
    rw [norm_smul]; exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hh0 _) (norm_nonneg _)
  · exact hg.aestronglyMeasurable.smul
      (hc'.comp (continuous_const.sub continuous_id)).aestronglyMeasurable
  · refine Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun t y _ => ?_
    rw [norm_smul]; exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hh1 _) (norm_nonneg _)
  · refine Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun t y _ => ?_
    have h1 := (hh.differentiable (by norm_num) (y - t)).hasFDerivAt.comp y
      ((hasFDerivAt_id y).sub_const t)
    have h2 := h1.const_smul (g t)
    rw [ContinuousLinearMap.comp_id] at h2
    exact h2

/-- Helper: continuity of `x ↦ ∫ g(t) h(x - t) dt` for integrable `g` and bounded continuous
`h`. -/
lemma continuous_integral_smul_sub [CompleteSpace F] {g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (hg : Integrable g) {h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hc : Continuous h) {M0 : ℝ}
    (hh0 : ∀ v, ‖h v‖ ≤ M0) : Continuous (fun x => ∫ t, g t • h (x - t)) := by
  refine continuous_of_dominated (bound := fun t => ‖g t‖ * M0) (fun y => ?_) (fun y => ?_)
    (hg.norm.mul_const M0) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun t => ?_)
  · exact hg.aestronglyMeasurable.smul
      (hc.comp (continuous_const.sub continuous_id)).aestronglyMeasurable
  · refine Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun t => ?_
    rw [norm_smul]; exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hh0 _) (norm_nonneg _)
  · exact continuous_const.smul (hc.comp (continuous_id.sub continuous_const))

end Convolution

section Smoothing
variable {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℂ F]

/-- Helper: the first moments of `φ_J` vanish against any linear map,
`∫ φ_J(z) L(z) dz = 0` (`φ_J` is even). -/
lemma integral_bpPhiDilC_smul_clm [CompleteSpace F] (J : ℤ) (L : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) →L[ℝ] F) :
    ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • L z = 0 := by
  have h := integral_neg_eq_self (fun z => bpPhiDilC J z • L z) volume
  have hodd : ∀ z, bpPhiDilC J (-z) • L (-z) = -(bpPhiDilC J z • L z) := by
    intro z; rw [bpPhiDilC, bpPhiDil_neg, map_neg, smul_neg]; rfl
  simp only [hodd, integral_neg] at h
  set I := ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • L z
  have h2 : (2 : ℂ) • I = 0 := by
    rw [two_smul]; nth_rewrite 1 [← h]; exact neg_add_cancel I
  exact (smul_eq_zero.1 h2).resolve_left two_ne_zero

/-- Helper: `z ↦ φ_J(z) T(x - z)` is integrable for bounded continuous `T`. -/
lemma integrable_bpPhiDilC_smul_sub {T : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hT : Continuous T)
    {M0 : ℝ} (hT0 : ∀ w, ‖T w‖ ≤ M0) (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    Integrable (fun z => bpPhiDilC J z • T (x - z)) := by
  refine ((integrable_bpPhiDilC J).norm.mul_const M0).mono'
    ((integrable_bpPhiDilC J).aestronglyMeasurable.smul
      (hT.comp (continuous_const.sub continuous_id)).aestronglyMeasurable)
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)
  rw [norm_smul]; exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hT0 _) (norm_nonneg _)

/-- Helper: `z ↦ φ_J(z) L(z)` is integrable for a continuous linear map `L`. -/
lemma integrable_bpPhiDilC_smul_clm (J : ℤ) (L : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) →L[ℝ] F) :
    Integrable (fun z => bpPhiDilC J z • L z) := by
  refine ((integral_moment_bpPhiDil J 1 0).1.const_mul ‖L‖).mono'
    ((integrable_bpPhiDilC J).aestronglyMeasurable.smul L.continuous.aestronglyMeasurable)
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)
  rw [norm_smul, norm_bpPhiDilC]
  have := L.le_opNorm z
  have hφ := bpPhiDil_nonneg J z
  simp only [pow_one, pow_zero, mul_one]
  nlinarith

/-- Helper: `a ≥ 0` if some norm is bounded by `a / (1 + r)^N`. -/
lemma nonneg_of_norm_le_div {G : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup G] {a r : ℝ} {N : ℕ} (hr : 0 ≤ r)
    {y : G}
    (h : ‖y‖ ≤ a / (1 + r) ^ N) : 0 ≤ a := by
  have hp : 0 < (1 + r) ^ N := by positivity
  have := mul_nonneg ((norm_nonneg _).trans h) hp.le
  rwa [div_mul_cancel₀ _ hp.ne'] at this

/-- Helper (first-order smoothing error): if `‖DT(w)‖ ≤ a (1 + |w|/ρ)^{-N}` with
`2^J ≤ ρ`, then `‖T(x) - (φ_J * T)(x)‖ ≤ a (1 + |x|/ρ)^{-N} 2^J M_{1,N}`. -/
lemma norm_sub_integral_bpPhiDilC_smul_le_one [CompleteSpace F] {T : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F}
    (hT : ContDiff ℝ 1 T) {M0 : ℝ} (hT0 : ∀ w, ‖T w‖ ≤ M0) (J : ℤ) {ρ a : ℝ}
    (hρ : (2 : ℝ) ^ J ≤ ρ) {N : ℕ}
    (hT1 : ∀ w, ‖fderiv ℝ T w‖ ≤ a / (1 + ‖w‖ / ρ) ^ N) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖T x - ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • T (x - z)‖ ≤
      a / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N * ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * bpMoment n 1 N) := by
  have hR : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
  have hρ0 : 0 < ρ := hR.trans_le hρ
  have ha : 0 ≤ a := nonneg_of_norm_le_div (by positivity) (hT1 0)
  have hi1 := integrable_bpPhiDilC_smul_sub hT.continuous hT0 J x
  have hi2 := (integrable_bpPhiDilC (n := n) J).smul_const (T x)
  have h1 : ∫ z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), bpPhiDilC J z • T x = T x := by
    rw [integral_smul_const, integral_bpPhiDilC, one_smul]
  have hrem : T x - ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • T (x - z) =
      ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • (T x - T (x - z)) := by
    simp_rw [smul_sub]; rw [integral_sub hi2 hi1, h1]
  rw [hrem]
  have hmom := integral_moment_bpPhiDil (n := n) J 1 N
  have hb : ∀ z, ‖bpPhiDilC J z • (T x - T (x - z))‖ ≤
      a / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N * (‖z‖ ^ 1 * (1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N * bpPhiDil J z) := by
    intro z
    rw [norm_smul, norm_bpPhiDilC]
    have hM : ∀ t ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, ‖fderiv ℝ T (x - t • z)‖ ≤
        a * ((1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N) := by
      intro t ht
      refine (hT1 _).trans ?_
      rw [div_eq_mul_one_div a]
      exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (inv_one_add_pow_le hR hρ N x z ht) ha
    have h := norm_sub_le_of_norm_fderiv_segment (hT.differentiable (by norm_num)) hM
      (s := 1) (by simp)
    rw [one_smul, norm_sub_rev] at h
    have hφ := bpPhiDil_nonneg J z
    calc bpPhiDil J z * ‖T x - T (x - z)‖
        ≤ bpPhiDil J z * (a * ((1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N) * ‖z‖ * 1) :=
          mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h hφ
      _ = _ := by ring
  refine (norm_integral_le_of_norm_le (hmom.1.const_mul _) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hb)).trans
    (le_of_eq ?_)
  rw [integral_const_mul, hmom.2, pow_one]

/-- Helper (second-order smoothing error): if `‖D²T(w)‖ ≤ a (1 + |w|/ρ)^{-N}` with
`2^J ≤ ρ`, then `‖T(x) - (φ_J * T)(x)‖ ≤ a (1 + |x|/ρ)^{-N} 2^{2J} M_{2,N}` (Taylor's formula
and the vanishing first moments of `φ_J`). -/
lemma norm_sub_integral_bpPhiDilC_smul_le_two [CompleteSpace F] {T : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F}
    (hT : ContDiff ℝ 2 T) {M0 : ℝ} (hT0 : ∀ w, ‖T w‖ ≤ M0) (J : ℤ) {ρ a : ℝ}
    (hρ : (2 : ℝ) ^ J ≤ ρ) {N : ℕ}
    (hT2 : ∀ w, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 2 T w‖ ≤ a / (1 + ‖w‖ / ρ) ^ N)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖T x - ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • T (x - z)‖ ≤
      a / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N * (((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ 2 * bpMoment n 2 N) := by
  have hR : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
  have hρ0 : 0 < ρ := hR.trans_le hρ
  have ha : 0 ≤ a := nonneg_of_norm_le_div (by positivity) (hT2 0)
  set D := fderiv ℝ T x
  have hi1 := integrable_bpPhiDilC_smul_sub hT.continuous hT0 J x
  have hi2 := (integrable_bpPhiDilC (n := n) J).smul_const (T x)
  have hi3 := integrable_bpPhiDilC_smul_clm J D
  have h1 : ∫ z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), bpPhiDilC J z • T x = T x := by
    rw [integral_smul_const, integral_bpPhiDilC, one_smul]
  have hrem : T x - ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • T (x - z) =
      -∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • (T (x - z) - T x + D z) := by
    have e : ∀ z, bpPhiDilC J z • (T (x - z) - T x + D z) =
        (bpPhiDilC J z • T (x - z) - bpPhiDilC J z • T x) + bpPhiDilC J z • D z := fun z => by
      rw [smul_add, smul_sub]
    have hsum : ∫ z, (bpPhiDilC J z • T (x - z) - bpPhiDilC J z • T x + bpPhiDilC J z • D z) =
        (∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • T (x - z)) - T x := by
      have := integral_add (hi1.sub hi2) hi3
      simp only [Pi.sub_apply] at this
      rw [this, integral_sub hi1 hi2, h1, integral_bpPhiDilC_smul_clm, add_zero]
    simp_rw [e]
    rw [hsum]
    abel
  rw [hrem, norm_neg]
  have hmom := integral_moment_bpPhiDil (n := n) J 2 N
  have hb : ∀ z, ‖bpPhiDilC J z • (T (x - z) - T x + D z)‖ ≤
      a / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N * (‖z‖ ^ 2 * (1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N * bpPhiDil J z) := by
    intro z
    rw [norm_smul, norm_bpPhiDilC]
    have hM : ∀ t ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 2 T (x - t • z)‖ ≤
        a * ((1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N) := by
      intro t ht
      refine (hT2 _).trans ?_
      rw [div_eq_mul_one_div a]
      exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (inv_one_add_pow_le hR hρ N x z ht) ha
    have h := norm_taylor_two_le hT hM
    have hφ := bpPhiDil_nonneg J z
    calc bpPhiDil J z * ‖T (x - z) - T x + D z‖
        ≤ bpPhiDil J z * (a * ((1 + ‖z‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / ρ) ^ N) * ‖z‖ ^ 2) :=
          mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h hφ
      _ = _ := by ring
  refine (norm_integral_le_of_norm_le (hmom.1.const_mul _) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hb)).trans
    (le_of_eq ?_)
  rw [integral_const_mul, hmom.2]

/-- Helper (cancellation against a mean-zero kernel): if `L` is integrable, vanishes for
`|w| > R` and has integral zero, and `‖Dh(v)‖ ≤ b (1 + |v|/R)^{-N}`, then
`‖∫ L(w) h(x - w) dw‖ ≤ b 2^N (1 + |x|/R)^{-N} ∫ |w| |L(w)| dw`. -/
lemma norm_integral_smul_sub_le_of_integral_eq_zero [CompleteSpace F]
    {L : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (hL : Integrable L) {R : ℝ} (hR : 0 < R) (hLs : ∀ w, R < ‖w‖ → L w = 0)
    (hL0 : ∫ w, L w = 0) {h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hh : ContDiff ℝ 1 h) {M0 : ℝ}
    (hh0 : ∀ v, ‖h v‖ ≤ M0) {b : ℝ} {N : ℕ} (hh1 : ∀ v, ‖fderiv ℝ h v‖ ≤ b / (1 + ‖v‖ / R) ^ N)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    Integrable (fun w => ‖w‖ * ‖L w‖) ∧
    ‖∫ w, L w • h (x - w)‖ ≤ b * 2 ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / R) ^ N * ∫ w, ‖w‖ * ‖L w‖ := by
  have hb : 0 ≤ b := nonneg_of_norm_le_div (by positivity) (hh1 0)
  have hwL : ∀ w, ‖w‖ * ‖L w‖ ≤ R * ‖L w‖ := by
    intro w
    rcases le_or_gt ‖w‖ R with hw | hw
    · exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hw (norm_nonneg _)
    · rw [hLs w hw, norm_zero, mul_zero, mul_zero]
  have hint : Integrable (fun w => ‖w‖ * ‖L w‖) :=
    (hL.norm.const_mul R).mono' (continuous_norm.aestronglyMeasurable.mul hL.norm.1)
      (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun w => by
        rw [Real.norm_of_nonneg (by positivity)]; exact hwL w)
  refine ⟨hint, ?_⟩
  have hi1 : Integrable (fun w => L w • h (x - w)) := by
    refine (hL.norm.mul_const M0).mono'
      (hL.aestronglyMeasurable.smul
        (hh.continuous.comp (continuous_const.sub continuous_id)).aestronglyMeasurable)
      (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)
    rw [norm_smul]; exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hh0 _) (norm_nonneg _)
  have hi2 : Integrable (fun w => L w • h x) := hL.smul_const _
  have h0 : ∫ w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), L w • h x = 0 := by
    rw [integral_smul_const, hL0, zero_smul]
  have heq : ∫ w, L w • h (x - w) = ∫ w, L w • (h (x - w) - h x) := by
    simp_rw [smul_sub]; rw [integral_sub hi1 hi2, h0, sub_zero]
  rw [heq]
  have hbd : ∀ w, ‖L w • (h (x - w) - h x)‖ ≤ b * 2 ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / R) ^ N * (‖w‖ * ‖L w‖) := by
    intro w
    rw [norm_smul]
    rcases le_or_gt ‖w‖ R with hw | hw
    · have hM : ∀ t ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, ‖fderiv ℝ h (x - t • w)‖ ≤ b * 2 ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / R) ^ N := by
        intro t ht
        refine (hh1 _).trans ?_
        have h1 := inv_one_add_pow_le hR le_rfl N x w ht
        have h2 : (1 + ‖w‖ / R) ^ N ≤ 2 ^ N := by
          apply pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity)
          have : ‖w‖ / R ≤ 1 := by rw [div_le_one hR]; exact hw
          linarith
        calc b / (1 + ‖x - t • w‖ / R) ^ N = b * (1 / (1 + ‖x - t • w‖ / R) ^ N) := by ring
          _ ≤ b * ((1 + ‖w‖ / R) ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / R) ^ N) := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h1 hb
          _ ≤ b * (2 ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / R) ^ N) := by gcongr
          _ = _ := by ring
      have hmv := norm_sub_le_of_norm_fderiv_segment (hh.differentiable (by norm_num)) hM
        (s := 1) (by simp)
      rw [one_smul] at hmv
      calc ‖L w‖ * ‖h (x - w) - h x‖ ≤ ‖L w‖ * (b * 2 ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / R) ^ N * ‖w‖ * 1) :=
            mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hmv (norm_nonneg _)
        _ = _ := by ring
    · rw [hLs w hw, norm_zero, zero_mul, mul_zero, mul_zero]
  refine (norm_integral_le_of_norm_le (hint.const_mul _) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hbd)).trans
    (le_of_eq ?_)
  rw [integral_const_mul]

end Smoothing

/-! ### The smoothing errors `E_J` -/

/-- The kernel `𝒦 = (1 - η) K` of the multiplier `m_K` (Blueprint Lemma 4.3, `lem:signedK`). -/
noncomputable def symbolKernel (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  ((1 - dyadicEta x : ℝ) : ℂ) * swKernel Ω x

/-- The smoothing errors `E_J = ∑_{j ≥ J} K_j - φ_J * 𝒦` of Blueprint Lemma 4.5
(`lem:smootherrors`), where `𝒦 = (1 - η) K` and `φ_J * 𝒦 (x) = ∫ φ_J(t) 𝒦(x - t) dt`. -/
noncomputable def smoothErr (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (J : ℤ) :
    EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ :=
  truncKernel Ω J - bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] symbolKernel Ω

/-- Helper: `(φ_J * g)(x) = ∫ φ_J(t) g(x - t) dt`. -/
lemma bpPhiDilC_convolution_apply (J : ℤ) (g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    (bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] g) x =
      ∫ t, bpPhiDilC J t • g (x - t) := by
  rw [convolution_def]; simp only [ContinuousLinearMap.mul_apply', smul_eq_mul]

/-- Helper: `∫ φ(t) g(x - t) dt = ∫ g(w) φ(x - w) dw` (change of variables). -/
lemma integral_smul_sub_comm (φ g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ∫ t, φ t • g (x - t) = ∫ w, g w • φ (x - w) := by
  rw [← integral_sub_left_eq_self (fun w => g w • φ (x - w)) volume x]
  simp only [sub_sub_cancel, smul_eq_mul, mul_comm]

/-- Helper: `𝒦 = ∑_{j ≥ 1} K_j`, split at `J ≥ 1`: `𝒦 = ∑_{j ≥ J} K_j + ∑_{1 ≤ j < J} K_j`. -/
lemma symbolKernel_eq_truncKernel_add {J : ℤ} (hJ : 1 ≤ J) (w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    symbolKernel Ω w = truncKernel Ω J w + ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, dyadicKernel Ω j w := by
  obtain ⟨k, rfl⟩ : ∃ k : ℕ, J = k + 1 := ⟨(J - 1).toNat, by omega⟩
  have hs := hasSum_dyadicKernel (Ω := Ω) w
  have hIco : Finset.Ico (1 : ℤ) ((k : ℤ) + 1) = (Finset.range k).map succIntEmb := by
    ext j
    simp only [Finset.mem_Ico, Finset.mem_map, Finset.mem_range]
    constructor
    · rintro ⟨h1, h2⟩
      refine ⟨(j - 1).toNat, by omega, ?_⟩
      change ((j - 1).toNat : ℤ) + 1 = j
      omega
    · rintro ⟨i, hi, rfl⟩
      change 1 ≤ (i : ℤ) + 1 ∧ (i : ℤ) + 1 < k + 1
      omega
  rw [hIco, Finset.sum_map, symbolKernel, ← hs.tsum_eq,
    ← hs.summable.sum_add_tsum_nat_add k, add_comm]
  congr 1
  unfold truncKernel
  congr 1; ext i; congr 1; push_cast; ring

/-- Helper: `K_j` is bounded, `‖K_j‖ ≤ C 2^{-jn}`, and `‖DK_j‖ ≤ C 2^{-j(n+1)}`. -/
lemma norm_fderiv_dyadicKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (j : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖fderiv ℝ (dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ 1
  have hC0 : 0 ≤ C := by
    have h := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hC 0 0)
    exact nonneg_of_mul_nonneg_left h (by positivity)
  refine ⟨C, hC0, fun j x => ?_⟩
  have := hC j x
  rwa [norm_iteratedFDeriv_one, Nat.cast_one] at this

/-- Helper: `A / (R + r)^m = (A / R^m) / (1 + r/R)^m` for `R > 0`. -/
lemma div_add_pow_eq {A R : ℝ} (r : ℝ) (hR : 0 < R) (m : ℕ) :
    A / (R + r) ^ m = A / R ^ m / (1 + r / R) ^ m := by
  rw [div_div, ← mul_pow, mul_add, mul_one, mul_div_cancel₀ _ hR.ne']

/-- Helper: the truncated kernels and their derivatives are bounded:
`‖D^k 𝒦_J(w)‖ ≤ A (2^J)^{-n-k}` and `‖D^k 𝒦_J(w)‖ ≤ (A (2^J)^{-n-k}) (1 + |w|/2^J)^{-n-k}`. -/
lemma norm_iteratedFDeriv_truncKernel_le' (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (k : ℕ) :
    ∃ A : ℝ, 0 ≤ A ∧ ∀ (J : ℤ) (w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (truncKernel Ω J) w‖ ≤
        A / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + k) / (1 + ‖w‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ (n + k) ∧
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (truncKernel Ω J) w‖ ≤ A / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + k) := by
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_truncKernel_le hΩ k (by omega)
  refine ⟨A, hA0, fun J w => ?_⟩
  have hR : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
  have h1 := hA J w
  rw [div_add_pow_eq _ hR] at h1
  refine ⟨h1, h1.trans ?_⟩
  apply div_le_self (by positivity)
  have : 0 ≤ ‖w‖ / 2 ^ J := by positivity
  exact one_le_pow₀ (by linarith)

/-- Helper: `‖φ_J‖ ≤ Q (2^J)^{-n}` and `‖Dφ_J‖ ≤ Q (2^J)^{-n-1}` (bounds used for dominated
differentiation). -/
lemma exists_bound_bpPhiDilC (k : ℕ) :
    ∃ Q : ℝ, 0 ≤ Q ∧ ∀ (J : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ k (bpPhiDilC J) x‖ ≤ Q / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + k) := by
  obtain ⟨Q, hQ0, hQ⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_bpPhiDilC_le (n := n) k 0
  exact ⟨Q, hQ0, fun J x => by simpa using hQ J x⟩

/-- Helper: `∑_{1 ≤ j < J} 2^{j+1} ≤ 2 geomZ 2^J`. -/
lemma sum_Ico_two_zpow_le (J : ℤ) :
    ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) ≤ 2 * geomZ * 2 ^ J := by
  calc ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1)
      = ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, 2 * 2 ^ J * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - J|) := by
        refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun j hj => ?_
        rw [Finset.mem_Ico] at hj
        rw [abs_of_neg (by omega), neg_neg, mul_assoc, ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero,
          ← zpow_one_add₀ two_ne_zero]
        congr 1; ring
    _ = 2 * 2 ^ J * ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (-|j - J|) := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
    _ ≤ 2 * 2 ^ J * geomZ := by gcongr; exact sum_two_zpow_neg_abs_sub_le _ J
    _ = 2 * geomZ * 2 ^ J := by ring

/-- Helper: `∫ |w| |K_j(w)| dw ≤ 2^{j+1} ∫ |K_0|`. -/
lemma integral_norm_mul_norm_dyadicKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) :
    Integrable (fun w => ‖w‖ * ‖dyadicKernel Ω j w‖) ∧
    ∫ w, ‖w‖ * ‖dyadicKernel Ω j w‖ ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) * ∫ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 x‖ := by
  have hb : ∀ w, ‖w‖ * ‖dyadicKernel Ω j w‖ ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) * ‖dyadicKernel Ω j w‖ := by
    intro w
    rcases le_or_gt ‖w‖ ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1)) with hw | hw
    · exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hw (norm_nonneg _)
    · rw [dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le j hw.le, norm_zero, mul_zero, mul_zero]
  have hi := (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j).norm.const_mul ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1))
  have hint : Integrable (fun w => ‖w‖ * ‖dyadicKernel Ω j w‖) :=
    hi.mono' (continuous_norm.aestronglyMeasurable.mul
      (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j).norm.1) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun w => by
        rw [Real.norm_of_nonneg (by positivity)]; exact hb w)
  refine ⟨hint, (integral_mono hint hi hb).trans ?_⟩
  rw [integral_const_mul, integral_norm_dyadicKernel hΩ j]

/-- Helper: the cancellation bound for `∫ K_j(w) h(x - w) dw`, `j < J`, with `h` varying on
scale `2^J`. -/
lemma norm_integral_dyadicKernel_smul_sub_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω)
    {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℂ F] [CompleteSpace F]
    {J j : ℤ} (hjJ : j < J) {h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F} (hh : ContDiff ℝ 1 h)
    {M0 b : ℝ} (hh0 : ∀ v, ‖h v‖ ≤ M0) {N : ℕ}
    (hh1 : ∀ v, ‖fderiv ℝ h v‖ ≤ b / (1 + ‖v‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖∫ w, dyadicKernel Ω j w • h (x - w)‖ ≤
      b * 2 ^ N / (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ N * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) * ∫ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 x‖) := by
  have hR : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
  have hb : 0 ≤ b := nonneg_of_norm_le_div (by positivity) (hh1 0)
  have hsupp : ∀ w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), 2 ^ J < ‖w‖ → dyadicKernel Ω j w = 0 := by
    intro w hw
    refine dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le j (le_trans ?_ hw.le)
    exact zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) (by omega)
  obtain ⟨-, h1⟩ := norm_integral_smul_sub_le_of_integral_eq_zero (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j)
    hR hsupp (integral_dyadicKernel hn hΩ j) hh hh0 hh1 x
  refine h1.trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (integral_norm_mul_norm_dyadicKernel_le hΩ j).2
    (by positivity))

/-- Helper: bounds on the truncated kernel as a function (value and first derivative). -/
lemma truncKernel_bounds (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (J : ℤ) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (truncKernel Ω J) ∧ (∃ M, ∀ w, ‖truncKernel Ω J w‖ ≤ M) ∧
      (∃ M, ∀ w, ‖fderiv ℝ (truncKernel Ω J) w‖ ≤ M) := by
  obtain ⟨A0, -, hA0⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_truncKernel_le' hn hΩ 0
  obtain ⟨A1, -, hA1⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_truncKernel_le' hn hΩ 1
  refine ⟨contDiff_truncKernel hΩ J, ⟨A0 / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + 0), fun w => ?_⟩,
    ⟨A1 / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + 1), fun w => ?_⟩⟩
  · have := (hA0 J w).2; rwa [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero] at this
  · have := (hA1 J w).2; rwa [norm_iteratedFDeriv_one] at this

/-- Helper: bounds on `φ_J` as a function (value, first and second derivative). -/
lemma bpPhiDilC_bounds (J : ℤ) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (bpPhiDilC (n := n) J) ∧ (∃ M, ∀ w, ‖bpPhiDilC (n := n) J w‖ ≤ M) ∧
      (∃ M, ∀ w, ‖fderiv ℝ (bpPhiDilC (n := n) J) w‖ ≤ M) := by
  obtain ⟨Q0, -, hQ0⟩ := exists_bound_bpPhiDilC (n := n) 0
  obtain ⟨Q1, -, hQ1⟩ := exists_bound_bpPhiDilC (n := n) 1
  refine ⟨contDiff_bpPhiDilC J, ⟨Q0 / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + 0), fun w => ?_⟩,
    ⟨Q1 / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + 1), fun w => ?_⟩⟩
  · have := hQ0 J w; rwa [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero] at this
  · have := hQ1 J w; rwa [norm_iteratedFDeriv_one] at this

/-- Helper: `K_j` is bounded. -/
lemma dyadicKernel_bounded (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) :
    ∃ M, ∀ w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), ‖dyadicKernel Ω j w‖ ≤ M := by
  obtain ⟨C, -, hC⟩ := norm_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  exact ⟨C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n), hC j⟩

/-- Helper: the explicit formula
`E_J(x) = (𝒦_J(x) - ∫ φ_J(z) 𝒦_J(x - z) dz) - ∑_{1 ≤ j < J} ∫ K_j(w) φ_J(x - w) dw`,
where `𝒦_J = ∑_{j ≥ J} K_j`. -/
lemma smoothErr_eq (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) {J : ℤ} (hJ : 1 ≤ J) :
    smoothErr Ω J = fun x =>
      (truncKernel Ω J x - ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • truncKernel Ω J (x - z)) -
        ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, ∫ w, dyadicKernel Ω j w • bpPhiDilC J (x - w) := by
  funext x
  obtain ⟨hTc, ⟨M, hM⟩, -⟩ := truncKernel_bounds hn hΩ J
  have hi1 := integrable_bpPhiDilC_smul_sub hTc.continuous hM J x
  have hi2 : ∀ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, Integrable (fun z => bpPhiDilC J z • dyadicKernel Ω j (x - z)) :=
    fun j _ => by
      obtain ⟨Mj, hMj⟩ := dyadicKernel_bounded hΩ j
      exact integrable_bpPhiDilC_smul_sub (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ j).continuous hMj J x
  rw [smoothErr, Pi.sub_apply, bpPhiDilC_convolution_apply]
  simp_rw [symbolKernel_eq_truncKernel_add hJ, smul_add, Finset.smul_sum]
  rw [integral_add hi1 (integrable_finsetSum _ hi2), integral_finsetSum _ hi2]
  simp_rw [integral_smul_sub_comm (bpPhiDilC J) (dyadicKernel Ω _) x]
  abel

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`), termwise differentiation: for `J ≥ 1`, `E_J` is
differentiable at every `x`, with
`DE_J(x) = (D𝒦_J(x) - ∫ φ_J(z) D𝒦_J(x - z) dz) - ∑_{1 ≤ j < J} ∫ K_j(w) Dφ_J(x - w) dw`,
`𝒦_J = ∑_{j ≥ J} K_j`. -/
lemma hasFDerivAt_smoothErr (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) {J : ℤ} (hJ : 1 ≤ J)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    HasFDerivAt (smoothErr Ω J)
      ((fderiv ℝ (truncKernel Ω J) x -
          ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • fderiv ℝ (truncKernel Ω J) (x - z)) -
        ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, ∫ w, dyadicKernel Ω j w • fderiv ℝ (bpPhiDilC J) (x - w)) x := by
  rw [smoothErr_eq hn hΩ hJ]
  obtain ⟨hTc, ⟨M, hM⟩, ⟨M', hM'⟩⟩ := truncKernel_bounds hn hΩ J
  obtain ⟨hPc, ⟨P, hP⟩, ⟨P', hP'⟩⟩ := bpPhiDilC_bounds (n := n) J
  refine ((((hTc.differentiable (by simp)) x).hasFDerivAt).sub
    (hasFDerivAt_integral_smul_sub (integrable_bpPhiDilC J) (hTc.of_le (by simp)) hM hM' x)).sub
    (HasFDerivAt.fun_sum fun j _ => ?_)
  exact hasFDerivAt_integral_smul_sub (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j) (hPc.of_le (by simp)) hP hP' x

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`), regularity: for `J ≥ 1`, `E_J` is continuously
differentiable (`C¹`); see `hasFDerivAt_smoothErr` for the derivative. -/
theorem contDiff_smoothErr (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) {J : ℤ} (hJ : 1 ≤ J) :
    ContDiff ℝ 1 (smoothErr Ω J) := by
  rw [contDiff_one_iff_hasFDerivAt]
  refine ⟨_, ?_, hasFDerivAt_smoothErr hn hΩ hJ⟩
  obtain ⟨hTc, -, ⟨M', hM'⟩⟩ := truncKernel_bounds hn hΩ J
  obtain ⟨hPc, -, ⟨P', hP'⟩⟩ := bpPhiDilC_bounds (n := n) J
  refine ((hTc.continuous_fderiv (by simp)).sub (continuous_integral_smul_sub
    (integrable_bpPhiDilC J) (hTc.continuous_fderiv (by simp)) hM')).sub
    (continuous_finsetSum _ fun j _ => ?_)
  exact continuous_integral_smul_sub (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j)
    (hPc.continuous_fderiv (by simp)) hP'

/-- Helper: combining two bounds with the weights `(1 + |x|/R)^{-m}` and `(1 + |x|/R)^{-m-1}`. -/
lemma add_le_div_of_le {a b X Y C D u : ℝ} {m : ℕ} (hD : 0 < D) (hu : 1 ≤ u) (hY : 0 ≤ Y)
    (hXY : X + Y ≤ C) (ha : a ≤ X / (D * u ^ m)) (hb : b ≤ Y / (D * u ^ (m + 1))) :
    a + b ≤ C / (D * u ^ m) := by
  have hu0 : 0 < u := by linarith
  have h1 : Y / (D * u ^ (m + 1)) ≤ Y / (D * u ^ m) :=
    div_le_div_of_nonneg_left hY (by positivity)
      (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (pow_le_pow_right₀ hu (by omega)) hD.le)
  calc a + b ≤ X / (D * u ^ m) + Y / (D * u ^ m) := by linarith
    _ = (X + Y) / (D * u ^ m) := by rw [add_div]
    _ ≤ C / (D * u ^ m) := div_le_div_of_nonneg_right hXY (by positivity)

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`), (4.5): there is `C` such that for all `J ≥ 1`,
with `R = 2^J`, and all `x ∈ E`,
`|E_J(x)| ≤ C R^{-n} (1 + |x|/R)^{-n-2}` and `|∇E_J(x)| ≤ C R^{-n-1} (1 + |x|/R)^{-n-3}`
(`E_J` is differentiable, `contDiff_smoothErr`). -/
theorem norm_smoothErr_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ J : ℤ, 1 ≤ J → ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
      ‖smoothErr Ω J x‖ ≤ C / (((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ n * (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ (n + 2)) ∧
      ‖fderiv ℝ (smoothErr Ω J) x‖ ≤
        C / (((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + 1) * (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ (n + 3)) := by
  obtain ⟨A2, hA2, hA2'⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_truncKernel_le' hn hΩ 2
  obtain ⟨A3, hA3, hA3'⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_truncKernel_le' hn hΩ 3
  obtain ⟨Q1, hQ1, hQ1'⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_bpPhiDilC_le (n := n) 1 (n + 3)
  obtain ⟨Q2, hQ2, hQ2'⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_bpPhiDilC_le (n := n) 2 (n + 4)
  set C1 := ∫ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 x‖ with hC1_def
  have hC1 : 0 ≤ C1 := integral_nonneg fun _ => norm_nonneg _
  have hG : 0 ≤ geomZ := geomZ_nonneg
  have hM2 := bpMoment_nonneg (n := n) 2 (n + 2)
  have hM3 := bpMoment_nonneg (n := n) 2 (n + 3)
  set X1 := A2 * bpMoment n 2 (n + 2)
  set Y1 := Q1 * 2 ^ (n + 3) * C1 * (2 * geomZ)
  set X2 := A3 * bpMoment n 2 (n + 3)
  set Y2 := Q2 * 2 ^ (n + 4) * C1 * (2 * geomZ)
  have hX1 : 0 ≤ X1 := by positivity
  have hY1 : 0 ≤ Y1 := by positivity
  have hX2 : 0 ≤ X2 := by positivity
  have hY2 : 0 ≤ Y2 := by positivity
  refine ⟨X1 + Y1 + X2 + Y2, by positivity, fun J hJ x => ?_⟩
  set R : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ J with hR_def
  have hR : 0 < R := by positivity
  set u := 1 + ‖x‖ / R with hu_def
  have hu : 1 ≤ u := by have : 0 ≤ ‖x‖ / R := by positivity
                        linarith
  have hu0 : 0 < u := by linarith
  obtain ⟨hTc, ⟨M, hM⟩, ⟨M', hM'⟩⟩ := truncKernel_bounds hn hΩ J
  obtain ⟨hPc, ⟨P, hP⟩, ⟨P', hP'⟩⟩ := bpPhiDilC_bounds (n := n) J
  -- the sum over `1 ≤ j < J`
  have hsum : ∀ c : ℝ, 0 ≤ c → ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, c * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) * C1) ≤
      c * C1 * (2 * geomZ) * R := by
    intro c hc
    calc ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, c * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) * C1)
        = c * C1 * ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) := by
          rw [Finset.mul_sum]; exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun _ _ => by ring
      _ ≤ c * C1 * (2 * geomZ * R) := by gcongr; exact sum_Ico_two_zpow_le J
      _ = c * C1 * (2 * geomZ) * R := by ring
  refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
  · -- size bound
    have hA : ‖truncKernel Ω J x - ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • truncKernel Ω J (x - z)‖ ≤
        X1 / (R ^ n * u ^ (n + 2)) := by
      have := norm_sub_integral_bpPhiDilC_smul_le_two (hTc.of_le (by simp)) hM J le_rfl
        (a := A2 / R ^ (n + 2)) (N := n + 2) (fun w => (hA2' J w).1) x
      refine this.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
      rw [← hu_def]
      field_simp
      ring
    have hB : ‖∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, ∫ w, dyadicKernel Ω j w • bpPhiDilC J (x - w)‖ ≤
        Y1 / (R ^ n * u ^ (n + 3)) := by
      refine (norm_sum_le _ _).trans ?_
      have hj : ∀ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, ‖∫ w, dyadicKernel Ω j w • bpPhiDilC J (x - w)‖ ≤
          Q1 / R ^ (n + 1) * 2 ^ (n + 3) / u ^ (n + 3) * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) * C1) := by
        intro j hj
        exact norm_integral_dyadicKernel_smul_sub_le hn hΩ (Finset.mem_Ico.1 hj).2
          (hPc.of_le (by simp)) hP (b := Q1 / R ^ (n + 1)) (N := n + 3)
          (fun v => by rw [← norm_iteratedFDeriv_one, div_div]; exact hQ1' J v) x
      refine (Finset.sum_le_sum hj).trans ((hsum _ (by positivity)).trans (le_of_eq ?_))
      field_simp
      ring
    rw [smoothErr_eq hn hΩ hJ]
    refine (norm_sub_le _ _).trans ?_
    exact add_le_div_of_le (by positivity) hu (by positivity) (by linarith) hA hB
  · -- gradient bound
    rw [(hasFDerivAt_smoothErr hn hΩ hJ x).fderiv]
    have hA : ‖fderiv ℝ (truncKernel Ω J) x -
        ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • fderiv ℝ (truncKernel Ω J) (x - z)‖ ≤
        X2 / (R ^ (n + 1) * u ^ (n + 3)) := by
      have := norm_sub_integral_bpPhiDilC_smul_le_two
        (hTc.fderiv_right (m := 2) (by simp)) hM' J le_rfl
        (a := A3 / R ^ (n + 3)) (N := n + 3)
        (fun w => by rw [norm_iteratedFDeriv_fderiv]; exact (hA3' J w).1) x
      refine this.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
      rw [← hu_def]
      field_simp
      ring
    have hB : ‖∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J,
        ∫ w, dyadicKernel Ω j w • fderiv ℝ (bpPhiDilC J) (x - w)‖ ≤
        Y2 / (R ^ (n + 1) * u ^ (n + 3 + 1)) := by
      refine (norm_sum_le _ _).trans ?_
      have hj : ∀ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J,
          ‖∫ w, dyadicKernel Ω j w • fderiv ℝ (bpPhiDilC J) (x - w)‖ ≤
          Q2 / R ^ (n + 2) * 2 ^ (n + 4) / u ^ (n + 4) * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) * C1) := by
        intro j hj
        exact norm_integral_dyadicKernel_smul_sub_le hn hΩ (Finset.mem_Ico.1 hj).2
          (hPc.fderiv_right (m := 1) (by simp)) hP' (b := Q2 / R ^ (n + 2)) (N := n + 4)
          (fun v => by
            rw [← norm_iteratedFDeriv_one, norm_iteratedFDeriv_fderiv, div_div]
            exact hQ2' J v) x
      refine (Finset.sum_le_sum hj).trans ((hsum _ (by positivity)).trans (le_of_eq ?_))
      field_simp
      ring
    refine (norm_sub_le _ _).trans ?_
    exact add_le_div_of_le (by positivity) hu (by positivity) (by linarith) hA hB

/-! ### The series (4.6) -/

/-- Helper: `2^{-(J+i)n} ≤ 2^{-Jn} (1/2)^i` for `n ≥ 1`. -/
lemma two_zpow_neg_add_mul_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (J : ℤ) (i : ℕ) :
    (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(J + i) * (n : ℤ)) ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J * (n : ℤ)) * (1 / 2) ^ i := by
  have := two_zpow_neg_mul_le (J := J) (j := J + i) (by omega) hn
  refine this.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
  congr 1
  rw [show J + (i : ℤ) - J = i by ring, Nat.abs_cast, zpow_neg, zpow_natCast, one_div, inv_pow]

/-- Helper: pointwise bound for the terms `K_j - φ_J * K_j`, `j ≥ J`:
`|K_j - φ_J * K_j|(x) ≤ C 2^{J-j} B_{2^j}(x)`. -/
lemma norm_dyadicKernel_sub_convolution_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ J j : ℤ, J ≤ j → ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
      ‖(dyadicKernel Ω j - bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
          dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (J - j) * envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ j) x := by
  obtain ⟨Cd, hCd0, hCd⟩ := norm_fderiv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  have hM := bpMoment_nonneg (n := n) 1 (n + 1)
  refine ⟨Cd * 3 ^ (n + 1) * bpMoment n 1 (n + 1), by positivity, fun J j hjJ x => ?_⟩
  set ρ : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ j with hρ_def
  have hρ : 0 < ρ := by positivity
  have hRρ : (2 : ℝ) ^ J ≤ ρ := zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) hjJ
  obtain ⟨Mj, hMj⟩ := dyadicKernel_bounded hΩ j
  have hd : ∀ w, ‖fderiv ℝ (dyadicKernel Ω j) w‖ ≤
      Cd * 3 ^ (n + 1) / ρ ^ (n + 1) / (1 + ‖w‖ / ρ) ^ (n + 1) := by
    intro w
    by_cases hw : w ∈ tsupport (dyadicKernel Ω j)
    · have hw2 := (tsupport_dyadicKernel j hw).2
      have h3 : (1 + ‖w‖ / ρ) ^ (n + 1) ≤ 3 ^ (n + 1) := by
        apply pow_le_pow_left₀ (by positivity)
        have : ‖w‖ / ρ ≤ 2 := by
          rw [div_le_iff₀ hρ]; rw [zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero] at hw2; linarith
        linarith
      have hc : Cd * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) = Cd / ρ ^ (n + 1) := by
        rw [hρ_def, ← zpow_natCast, ← zpow_mul, div_eq_mul_inv, ← zpow_neg]; push_cast; ring_nf
      refine (hCd j w).trans ?_
      rw [hc, div_div, div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) (by positivity)]
      calc Cd * (ρ ^ (n + 1) * (1 + ‖w‖ / ρ) ^ (n + 1))
          ≤ Cd * (ρ ^ (n + 1) * 3 ^ (n + 1)) := by gcongr
        _ = Cd * 3 ^ (n + 1) * ρ ^ (n + 1) := by ring
    · rw [Function.notMem_support.1 (fun h => hw (support_fderiv_subset ℝ h)), norm_zero]
      positivity
  have h := norm_sub_integral_bpPhiDilC_smul_le_one
    ((contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ j).of_le (by simp)) hMj J hRρ hd x
  rw [Pi.sub_apply, bpPhiDilC_convolution_apply]
  refine h.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
  rw [envelope, hρ_def, zpow_sub₀ two_ne_zero]
  field_simp
  ring

/-- Helper: pointwise bound for the terms `φ_J * K_j`, `j < J`:
`|φ_J * K_j|(x) ≤ C 2^{j-J} B_{2^J}(x)`. -/
lemma norm_convolution_dyadicKernel_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ J j : ℤ, j < J → ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
      ‖(bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤
        C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - J) * envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) x := by
  obtain ⟨Q1, hQ1, hQ1'⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_bpPhiDilC_le (n := n) 1 (n + 1)
  set C1 := ∫ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 x‖ with hC1_def
  have hC1 : 0 ≤ C1 := integral_nonneg fun _ => norm_nonneg _
  refine ⟨Q1 * 2 ^ (n + 2) * C1, by positivity, fun J j hjJ x => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨hPc, ⟨P, hP⟩, -⟩ := bpPhiDilC_bounds (n := n) J
  have hR : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
  have h := norm_integral_dyadicKernel_smul_sub_le hn hΩ hjJ (hPc.of_le (by simp)) hP
    (b := Q1 / ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + 1)) (N := n + 1)
    (fun v => by rw [← norm_iteratedFDeriv_one, div_div]; exact hQ1' J v) x
  rw [bpPhiDilC_convolution_apply, integral_smul_sub_comm]
  refine h.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
  rw [envelope, zpow_sub₀ two_ne_zero, zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero]
  field_simp
  ring

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`), the series (4.6) and its absolute convergence in
`L¹`: there is `C` such that for every `J ≥ 1`
* for `j ≥ J`, `K_j - φ_J * K_j` is integrable with `‖K_j - φ_J * K_j‖_1 ≤ C 2^{J-j}`;
* for `j < J`, `φ_J * K_j` is integrable with `‖φ_J * K_j‖_1 ≤ C 2^{j-J}`;
* pointwise, `∑_{j ≥ J} (K_j - φ_J * K_j)(x) = E_J(x) + ∑_{1 ≤ j < J} (φ_J * K_j)(x)`, i.e.
  `E_J = ∑_{j ≥ J} (K_j - φ_J * K_j) - ∑_{1 ≤ j < J} φ_J * K_j`
(here `φ_J * g (x) = ∫ φ_J(t) g(x - t) dt`). -/
theorem smoothErr_hasSum (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ J : ℤ, 1 ≤ J →
      (∀ j : ℤ, J ≤ j →
        Integrable (dyadicKernel Ω j - bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
          dyadicKernel Ω j) ∧
        ∫ x, ‖(dyadicKernel Ω j - bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
          dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (J - j)) ∧
      (∀ j : ℤ, j < J →
        Integrable (bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j) ∧
        ∫ x, ‖(bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤
          C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - J)) ∧
      ∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
        HasSum (fun i : ℕ => (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) -
            bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) x)
          (smoothErr Ω J x + ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J,
            (bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j) x) := by
  obtain ⟨C₁, hC₁, h₁⟩ := norm_dyadicKernel_sub_convolution_le hΩ
  obtain ⟨C₂, hC₂, h₂⟩ := norm_convolution_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨Cb, hCb0, hCb⟩ := norm_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  have hE : 0 ≤ envelopeConst n := by unfold envelopeConst; positivity
  refine ⟨(C₁ + C₂) * envelopeConst n, by positivity, fun J hJ => ⟨fun j hj => ?_,
    fun j hj => ?_, fun x => ?_⟩⟩
  · have hint : Integrable (dyadicKernel Ω j - bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
        dyadicKernel Ω j) :=
      (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j).sub
        ((integrable_bpPhiDilC J).integrable_convolution _ (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j))
    refine ⟨hint, ?_⟩
    obtain ⟨hei, hel⟩ := integrable_envelope_and_integral_le (n := n)
      (show (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ j by positivity)
    calc ∫ x, ‖(dyadicKernel Ω j - bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
          dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖
        ≤ ∫ x, C₁ * (2 : ℝ) ^ (J - j) * envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ j) x :=
          integral_mono hint.norm (hei.const_mul _) (h₁ J j hj)
      _ = C₁ * (2 : ℝ) ^ (J - j) * ∫ x, envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ j) x := integral_const_mul _ _
      _ ≤ C₁ * (2 : ℝ) ^ (J - j) * envelopeConst n := by gcongr
      _ ≤ (C₁ + C₂) * envelopeConst n * (2 : ℝ) ^ (J - j) := by
          have : 0 ≤ C₂ * envelopeConst n * (2 : ℝ) ^ (J - j) := by positivity
          nlinarith
  · have hint : Integrable (bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
        dyadicKernel Ω j) :=
      (integrable_bpPhiDilC J).integrable_convolution _ (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j)
    refine ⟨hint, ?_⟩
    obtain ⟨hei, hel⟩ := integrable_envelope_and_integral_le (n := n)
      (show (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J by positivity)
    calc ∫ x, ‖(bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖
        ≤ ∫ x, C₂ * (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - J) * envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) x :=
          integral_mono hint.norm (hei.const_mul _) (h₂ J j hj)
      _ = C₂ * (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - J) * ∫ x, envelope n ((2 : ℝ) ^ J) x := integral_const_mul _ _
      _ ≤ C₂ * (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - J) * envelopeConst n := by gcongr
      _ ≤ (C₁ + C₂) * envelopeConst n * (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - J) := by
          have : 0 ≤ C₁ * envelopeConst n * (2 : ℝ) ^ (j - J) := by positivity
          nlinarith
  · -- the pointwise identity
    have hK := hasSum_truncKernel (Ω := Ω) J x
    have hconv : HasSum (fun i : ℕ => ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) (x - z))
        (∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • truncKernel Ω J (x - z)) := by
      refine hasSum_integral_of_dominated_convergence
        (fun i z => ‖bpPhiDilC J z‖ * (Cb * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J * (n : ℤ))) * (1 / 2) ^ i)
        (fun i => ?_) (fun i => Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)
        (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => summable_geometric_two.mul_left _) ?_
        (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z =>
          (hasSum_truncKernel J (x - z)).const_smul (bpPhiDilC J z))
      · exact (integrable_bpPhiDilC J).aestronglyMeasurable.smul
          ((contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ _).continuous.comp
            (continuous_const.sub continuous_id)).aestronglyMeasurable
      · rw [norm_smul, mul_assoc, mul_assoc]
        refine mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left ((hCb _ _).trans ?_) (norm_nonneg _)
        exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (two_zpow_neg_add_mul_le hn J i) hCb0
      · simp_rw [tsum_mul_left, tsum_geometric_two]
        exact ((integrable_bpPhiDilC J).norm.mul_const _).mul_const _
    have heq : smoothErr Ω J x + ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J,
        (bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j) x =
        truncKernel Ω J x - ∫ z, bpPhiDilC J z • truncKernel Ω J (x - z) := by
      rw [smoothErr_eq hn hΩ hJ]
      simp_rw [bpPhiDilC_convolution_apply, integral_smul_sub_comm (bpPhiDilC J)
        (dyadicKernel Ω _) x]
      abel
    rw [heq]
    refine (hK.sub hconv).congr_fun fun i => ?_
    rw [Pi.sub_apply, bpPhiDilC_convolution_apply]

/-! ### Integrability, integral zero, and the Fourier transform of `E_J` -/

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`): for `J ≥ 1`, `E_J` is integrable. -/
theorem integrable_smoothErr (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) {J : ℤ} (hJ : 1 ≤ J) :
    Integrable (smoothErr Ω J) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := norm_smoothErr_le hn hΩ
  have hR : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
  refine ((integrable_envelope_and_integral_le (n := n) hR).1.const_mul C).mono'
    (contDiff_smoothErr hn hΩ hJ).continuous.aestronglyMeasurable
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => (hC J hJ x).1.trans ?_)
  rw [envelope, ← mul_inv, ← div_eq_mul_inv]
  have hu : 1 ≤ 1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J := by
    have : 0 ≤ ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J := by positivity
    linarith
  exact div_le_div_of_nonneg_left hC0 (by positivity)
    (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (pow_le_pow_right₀ hu (by omega)) (by positivity))

/-- Helper: `𝓕(f - g) = 𝓕 f - 𝓕 g` for integrable `f, g`. -/
lemma fourier_sub_apply {f g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hf : Integrable f)
    (hg : Integrable g) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    𝓕 (f - g) ξ = 𝓕 f ξ - 𝓕 g ξ := by
  simp only [Real.fourier_eq, Pi.sub_apply, smul_sub]
  exact integral_sub ((Real.fourierIntegral_convergent_iff ξ).2 hf)
    ((Real.fourierIntegral_convergent_iff ξ).2 hg)

/-- Helper: `𝓕(∑_{i ∈ s} c_i f_i) = ∑_{i ∈ s} c_i 𝓕 f_i` for integrable `f_i`. -/
lemma fourier_finsetSum_smul {ι : Type*} (s : Finset ι) (c : ι → ℂ)
    {f : ι → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hf : ∀ i ∈ s, Integrable (f i))
    (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    𝓕 (∑ i ∈ s, c i • f i) ξ = ∑ i ∈ s, c i * 𝓕 (f i) ξ := by
  simp only [Real.fourier_eq, Finset.sum_apply, Pi.smul_apply, Finset.smul_sum]
  rw [integral_finsetSum _ (fun i hi => ?_)]
  · refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun i _ => ?_
    rw [← integral_const_mul]
    refine integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun v => ?_)
    simp only [Circle.smul_def, smul_eq_mul]
    ring
  · refine (((Real.fourierIntegral_convergent_iff ξ).2 (hf i hi)).const_mul (c i)).congr
      (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun v => ?_)
    simp only [Circle.smul_def, smul_eq_mul]
    ring

/-- Helper: splitting `∑_{i ≥ 0} g(i + 1) = ∑_{1 ≤ j < J} g(j) + ∑_{i ≥ 0} g(J + i)` for
`J ≥ 1`. -/
lemma tsum_succ_eq_sum_Ico_add_tsum {g : ℤ → ℂ} (hg : Summable fun i : ℕ => g (i + 1))
    {J : ℤ} (hJ : 1 ≤ J) :
    ∑' i : ℕ, g (i + 1) = ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, g j + ∑' i : ℕ, g (J + i) := by
  obtain ⟨k, rfl⟩ : ∃ k : ℕ, J = k + 1 := ⟨(J - 1).toNat, by omega⟩
  have hIco : Finset.Ico (1 : ℤ) ((k : ℤ) + 1) = (Finset.range k).map succIntEmb := by
    ext j
    simp only [Finset.mem_Ico, Finset.mem_map, Finset.mem_range]
    constructor
    · rintro ⟨h1, h2⟩
      refine ⟨(j - 1).toNat, by omega, ?_⟩
      change ((j - 1).toNat : ℤ) + 1 = j
      omega
    · rintro ⟨i, hi, rfl⟩
      change 1 ≤ (i : ℤ) + 1 ∧ (i : ℤ) + 1 < k + 1
      omega
  rw [hIco, Finset.sum_map, ← hg.sum_add_tsum_nat_add k]
  congr 1
  congr 1; ext i; congr 1; push_cast; ring

/-- Helper: bounds for `τ_J(ξ) = 𝓕φ(2^J ξ)`: `|τ_J| ≤ S₀`, `|τ_J(ξ)| 2^J |ξ| ≤ S₁` and
`|1 - τ_J(ξ)| ≤ L 2^J |ξ|`. -/
lemma norm_bpTau_le :
    ∃ S₀ S₁ L : ℝ, 0 ≤ S₀ ∧ 0 ≤ S₁ ∧ 0 ≤ L ∧ ∀ (J : ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖bpTau J ξ‖ ≤ S₀ ∧ ‖bpTau J ξ‖ * ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * ‖ξ‖) ≤ S₁ ∧
        ‖1 - bpTau J ξ‖ ≤ L * ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * ‖ξ‖) := by
  set Φ : SchwartzMap (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ℂ := 𝓕 (bpPhiS (n := n))
  have hΦ : 𝓕 (fun x => (bpPhi (n := n) x : ℂ)) = ⇑Φ := by
    rw [← coe_bpPhiS, ← SchwartzMap.fourier_coe]
  have hΦ0 : Φ 0 = 1 := by rw [← hΦ]; exact fourier_bpPhi_zero
  set L := SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 0 1 Φ
  have hL : ∀ ζ, ‖Φ ζ - Φ 0‖ ≤ L * ‖ζ‖ := by
    intro ζ
    have h := Convex.norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_fderiv_le (s := univ) (C := L)
      (f := (Φ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ))
      (fun x _ => Φ.differentiableAt) (fun x _ => ?_) convex_univ (mem_univ 0) (mem_univ ζ)
    · simpa using h
    · rw [← norm_iteratedFDeriv_one]; exact SchwartzMap.norm_iteratedFDeriv_le_seminorm ℝ _ 1 x
  refine ⟨SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 0 0 Φ, SchwartzMap.seminorm ℝ 1 0 Φ, L, apply_nonneg _ _,
    apply_nonneg _ _, apply_nonneg _ _, fun J ξ => ?_⟩
  have hτ : bpTau J ξ = Φ ((2 : ℝ) ^ J • ξ) := by rw [bpTau, hΦ]
  have hn : ‖(2 : ℝ) ^ J • ξ‖ = (2 : ℝ) ^ J * ‖ξ‖ := by
    rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
  rw [hτ]
  refine ⟨SchwartzMap.norm_le_seminorm ℝ Φ _, ?_, ?_⟩
  · have := SchwartzMap.norm_pow_mul_le_seminorm ℝ Φ 1 ((2 : ℝ) ^ J • ξ)
    rw [pow_one, hn] at this
    linarith
  · have := hL ((2 : ℝ) ^ J • ξ)
    rw [hΦ0, hn, norm_sub_rev] at this
    exact this

/-- Helper: finite sums `∑_{i ∈ u} |𝓕 K_{J+i}(ξ)| ≤ A`. -/
lemma sum_norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_add_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ A : ℝ, 0 ≤ A ∧ ∀ (J : ℤ) (u : Finset ℕ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ∑ i ∈ u, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ‖ ≤ A := by
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := sum_norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  refine ⟨A, hA0, fun J u ξ => ?_⟩
  have := hA (u.map ⟨fun i : ℕ => J + i, fun a b h => by simpa using h⟩) ξ
  rwa [Finset.sum_map] at this

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`) and Lemma 10.1 (`m_{≥J} = τ_J m_K + Ê_J`), Fourier
side: for `J ≥ 1`, `E_J` is integrable with `∫ E_J = 0`, its Fourier transform is continuous,
as is the right-hand side below, and for every `ξ` the series `∑_{j ≥ J} 𝓕K_j(ξ)` converges
absolutely with
`𝓕 E_J(ξ) = ∑_{j ≥ J} 𝓕 K_j(ξ) - τ_J(ξ) m_K(ξ)` (Mathlib's `𝓕`, `𝓕 f(ξ) = ∫ e(-x·ξ) f(x) dx`). -/
theorem fourier_smoothErr (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) {J : ℤ} (hJ : 1 ≤ J) :
    Integrable (smoothErr Ω J) ∧ ∫ x, smoothErr Ω J x = 0 ∧
      Continuous (𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J)) ∧
      Continuous (fun ξ => ∑' i : ℕ, 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ - bpTau J ξ * dyadicSymbol Ω ξ) ∧
      ∀ ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
        Summable (fun i : ℕ => ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ‖) ∧
        𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ =
          ∑' i : ℕ, 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ - bpTau J ξ * dyadicSymbol Ω ξ := by
  have hE := integrable_smoothErr hn hΩ hJ
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := sum_norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_add_le hn hΩ
  have hsa : ∀ ξ, Summable (fun i : ℕ => ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ‖) := fun ξ =>
    summable_of_sum_le (fun _ => norm_nonneg _) (hA J · ξ)
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := smoothErr_hasSum hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨hD, hP, hs⟩ := hC J hJ
  set D : ℕ → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun i =>
    dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) - bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
      dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) with hD_def
  set P : ℤ → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun j =>
    bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j with hP_def
  have hτ : ∀ ξ, 𝓕 (bpPhiDilC (n := n) J) ξ = bpTau J ξ := fun ξ => fourier_bpPhiDil J ξ
  have hFP : ∀ j ξ, 𝓕 (P j) ξ = bpTau J ξ * 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ := fun j ξ => by
    rw [hP_def, Real.fourier_mul_convolution_eq (integrable_bpPhiDilC J)
      (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j), hτ]
  have hFD : ∀ i ξ, 𝓕 (D i) ξ = (1 - bpTau J ξ) * 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ := fun i ξ => by
    rw [hD_def, fourier_sub_apply (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ _)
      ((integrable_bpPhiDilC J).integrable_convolution _ (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ _))]
    rw [show 𝓕 (bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ = _
      from hFP (J + i) ξ]
    ring
  have hDi : ∀ i, Integrable (D i) := fun i => (hD (J + i) (by omega)).1
  have hPi : ∀ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, Integrable (P j) :=
    fun j hj => (hP j (Finset.mem_Ico.1 hj).2).1
  -- pointwise series representation
  have hEx : ∀ x, smoothErr Ω J x = ∑' i, D i x - ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, P j x := fun x => by
    rw [(hs x).tsum_eq]; ring
  have hformula : ∀ ξ, 𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ =
      ∑' i : ℕ, 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ - bpTau J ξ * dyadicSymbol Ω ξ := by
    intro ξ
    -- the `L¹`-summable series of Fourier integrands
    have hsum : HasSum (fun i => ∫ x, 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • D i x)
        (∫ x, ∑' i, 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • D i x) := by
      refine hasSum_integral_of_summable_integral_norm
        (fun i => (Real.fourierIntegral_convergent_iff ξ).2 (hDi i)) ?_
      refine Summable.of_nonneg_of_le (fun i => integral_nonneg fun _ => norm_nonneg _)
        (fun i => ?_) (summable_geometric_two.mul_left C)
      simp only [Circle.norm_smul]
      refine (hD (J + i) (by omega)).2.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
      rw [show J - (J + (i : ℤ)) = -(i : ℤ) by ring, zpow_neg, zpow_natCast, one_div, inv_pow]
    have hFE : 𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ = (∫ x, ∑' i, 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • D i x) -
        ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, ∫ x, 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • P j x := by
      rw [Real.fourier_eq]
      have hi2 : ∀ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, Integrable (fun x => 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • P j x) :=
        fun j hj => (Real.fourierIntegral_convergent_iff ξ).2 (hPi j hj)
      have hi1 : Integrable (fun x => ∑' i, 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • D i x) := by
        have h1 : Integrable (fun x => 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • (smoothErr Ω J x +
            ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, P j x)) :=
          (Real.fourierIntegral_convergent_iff ξ).2 (hE.add (integrable_finsetSum _ hPi))
        refine h1.congr (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => ?_)
        simp only [Circle.smul_def, smul_eq_mul]
        rw [tsum_mul_left, (hs x).tsum_eq]
      rw [← integral_finsetSum _ hi2, ← integral_sub hi1 (integrable_finsetSum _ hi2)]
      refine integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => ?_)
      simp only [Circle.smul_def, smul_eq_mul]
      rw [hEx x, tsum_mul_left, ← Finset.mul_sum]
      ring
    rw [hFE, ← hsum.tsum_eq]
    simp_rw [← Real.fourier_eq, hFD, hFP]
    obtain ⟨A', -, hA', -⟩ := dyadicSymbol_spec hn hΩ
    rw [dyadicSymbol, tsum_succ_eq_sum_Ico_add_tsum (g := fun j => 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ)
      (hA' ξ).1.of_norm hJ, tsum_mul_left, ← Finset.mul_sum]
    ring
  have hcont : Continuous (𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J)) :=
    VectorFourier.fourierIntegral_continuous Real.continuous_fourierChar continuous_inner hE
  refine ⟨hE, ?_, hcont, (funext hformula) ▸ hcont, fun ξ => ⟨hsa ξ, hformula ξ⟩⟩
  have h0 := hformula 0
  obtain ⟨-, -, -, hm0⟩ := dyadicSymbol_spec hn hΩ
  simp only [fourier_dyadicKernel_apply_zero hn hΩ, tsum_zero, hm0,
    mul_zero, sub_zero] at h0
  rw [Real.fourier_eq] at h0
  simpa using h0

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`), Fourier bound: there is `C` such that for all
`J ≥ 1` and `ξ`, with `R = 2^J`, `|𝓕 E_J(ξ)| ≤ C min(R|ξ|, (R|ξ|)⁻¹)`. -/
theorem norm_fourier_smoothErr_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ J : ℤ, 1 ≤ J → ∀ ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
      ‖𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ‖ ≤ C * min (2 ^ J * ‖ξ‖) (2 ^ J * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹ := by
  obtain ⟨S₀, S₁, L, hS₀, hS₁, hL, hτ⟩ := norm_bpTau_le (n := n)
  obtain ⟨A, hA0, hA⟩ := sum_norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_add_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨A', hA'0, hA'⟩ := sum_norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨Ck, hCk0, hCk⟩ := norm_fourier_dyadicKernel_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨Am, -, hmK, -⟩ := dyadicSymbol_spec hn hΩ
  have hG := geomZ_nonneg
  refine ⟨L * A + S₀ * Ck * geomZ + (1 + S₀) * (2 * Ck) + S₁ * A', by positivity,
    fun J hJ ξ => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨-, -, -, -, hF⟩ := fourier_smoothErr hn hΩ hJ
  obtain ⟨hsa, hformula⟩ := hF ξ
  set R : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ J with hR_def
  have hR : 0 < R := by positivity
  set t := R * ‖ξ‖ with ht_def
  have ht0 : 0 ≤ t := by positivity
  set T := ∑' i : ℕ, 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ
  set B := ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ
  have hsplit : 𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ = (1 - bpTau J ξ) * T - bpTau J ξ * B := by
    rw [hformula, dyadicSymbol, tsum_succ_eq_sum_Ico_add_tsum
      (g := fun j => 𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ) (hmK ξ).1.of_norm hJ]
    ring
  have hT1 : ‖T‖ ≤ A :=
    (norm_tsum_le_tsum_norm hsa).trans (Real.tsum_le_of_sum_le (fun _ => norm_nonneg _)
      (hA J · ξ))
  have hB1 : ‖B‖ ≤ A' := (norm_sum_le _ _).trans (hA' _ ξ)
  have hB2 : ‖B‖ ≤ Ck * geomZ * t := by
    refine (norm_sum_le _ _).trans ?_
    calc ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω j) ξ‖
        ≤ ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, Ck * ‖ξ‖ / 2 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) := by
          refine Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => (hCk j ξ).trans ?_
          rw [zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero]
          have := min_le_left ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * ‖ξ‖) (2 ^ j * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹
          nlinarith
      _ = Ck * ‖ξ‖ / 2 * ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
      _ ≤ Ck * ‖ξ‖ / 2 * (2 * geomZ * R) := by
          gcongr; exact sum_Ico_two_zpow_le J
      _ = Ck * geomZ * t := by rw [ht_def]; ring
  have hmain : ‖𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ‖ ≤ ‖1 - bpTau J ξ‖ * ‖T‖ + ‖bpTau J ξ‖ * ‖B‖ := by
    rw [hsplit, ← norm_mul, ← norm_mul]; exact norm_sub_le _ _
  obtain ⟨hτ0, hτ1, hτ2⟩ := hτ J ξ
  rcases le_or_gt t 1 with ht1 | ht1
  · have hmin : min (2 ^ J * ‖ξ‖) (2 ^ J * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹ = t := by
      rw [← hR_def, ← ht_def]
      apply min_eq_left
      rcases eq_or_lt_of_le ht0 with h | h
      · rw [← h, inv_zero]
      · exact ht1.trans (one_le_inv₀ h |>.2 ht1)
    rw [hmin]
    calc ‖𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ‖ ≤ ‖1 - bpTau J ξ‖ * ‖T‖ + ‖bpTau J ξ‖ * ‖B‖ := hmain
      _ ≤ (L * t) * A + S₀ * (Ck * geomZ * t) := by
          gcongr
      _ ≤ (L * A + S₀ * Ck * geomZ + (1 + S₀) * (2 * Ck) + S₁ * A') * t := by
          have : 0 ≤ ((1 + S₀) * (2 * Ck) + S₁ * A') * t := by positivity
          nlinarith
  · have ht : 0 < t := by linarith
    have hmin : min (2 ^ J * ‖ξ‖) (2 ^ J * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹ = t⁻¹ := by
      rw [← hR_def, ← ht_def]
      exact min_eq_right (by rw [inv_le_iff_one_le_mul₀ ht]; nlinarith)
    rw [hmin]
    have hξ : 0 < ‖ξ‖ := by
      by_contra h
      have : ‖ξ‖ = 0 := le_antisymm (not_lt.1 h) (norm_nonneg _)
      rw [ht_def, this, mul_zero] at ht; exact lt_irrefl _ ht
    have hT2 : ‖T‖ ≤ 2 * Ck * t⁻¹ := by
      have hb : ∀ i : ℕ, ‖𝓕 (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) ξ‖ ≤ Ck * t⁻¹ * (1 / 2) ^ i := by
        intro i
        refine (hCk _ ξ).trans ?_
        rw [mul_assoc]
        refine mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left ((min_le_right _ _).trans (le_of_eq ?_)) hCk0
        rw [zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero, zpow_natCast, ht_def, hR_def, one_div, inv_pow]
        field_simp
      refine (norm_tsum_le_tsum_norm hsa).trans ?_
      refine (hsa.tsum_le_tsum hb (summable_geometric_two.mul_left _)).trans (le_of_eq ?_)
      rw [tsum_mul_left, tsum_geometric_two]; ring
    have h1τ : ‖1 - bpTau J ξ‖ ≤ 1 + S₀ := (norm_sub_le _ _).trans (by simp [hτ0])
    have hτ' : ‖bpTau J ξ‖ ≤ S₁ * t⁻¹ := by
      rw [le_mul_inv_iff₀ ht]; exact hτ1
    calc ‖𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ‖ ≤ ‖1 - bpTau J ξ‖ * ‖T‖ + ‖bpTau J ξ‖ * ‖B‖ := hmain
      _ ≤ (1 + S₀) * (2 * Ck * t⁻¹) + S₁ * t⁻¹ * A' := by gcongr
      _ ≤ (L * A + S₀ * Ck * geomZ + (1 + S₀) * (2 * Ck) + S₁ * A') * t⁻¹ := by
          have : 0 ≤ (L * A + S₀ * Ck * geomZ) * t⁻¹ := by positivity
          nlinarith

/-- Helper: `v^{n+1} (1 + v)^{-n-3} ≤ min(v, v⁻¹)` for `v ≥ 0`. -/
lemma pow_div_one_add_pow_le_min {v : ℝ} (hv : 0 ≤ v) :
    v ^ (n + 1) / (1 + v) ^ (n + 3) ≤ min v v⁻¹ := by
  have h1 : 0 < (1 + v) ^ (n + 3) := by positivity
  have hle : v ≤ 1 + v := by linarith
  refine le_min ?_ ?_
  · rw [div_le_iff₀ h1]
    calc v ^ (n + 1) = v * v ^ n := by ring
      _ ≤ v * (1 + v) ^ (n + 3) := by
          gcongr
          exact (pow_le_pow_left₀ hv hle n).trans (pow_le_pow_right₀ (by linarith) (by omega))
  · rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hv with h | h
    · rw [← h]; simp
    · rw [div_le_iff₀ h1, ← div_eq_inv_mul, le_div_iff₀ h]
      calc v ^ (n + 1) * v = v ^ (n + 2) := by ring
        _ ≤ (1 + v) ^ (n + 2) := pow_le_pow_left₀ hv hle _
        _ ≤ (1 + v) ^ (n + 3) := pow_le_pow_right₀ (by linarith) (by omega)

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`), uniform `L^p` bound for finite signed sums: for
`1 < p < ∞` there is `C_p` such that for every finite set `S` of integers `J ≥ 1`, all
coefficients `|c_J| ≤ 1`, and all `f ∈ L^p(E)`,
`‖(∑_{J ∈ S} c_J E_J) * f‖_p ≤ C_p ‖f‖_p`. -/
theorem exists_eLpNorm_convolution_sum_smul_smoothErr_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω)
    {p : ℝ} (hp : 1 < p) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (S : Finset ℤ), (∀ J ∈ S, 1 ≤ J) → ∀ c : ℤ → ℂ, (∀ J, ‖c J‖ ≤ 1) →
      ∀ f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ, MemLp f (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume →
        eLpNorm ((∑ J ∈ S, c J • smoothErr Ω J) ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] f)
            (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume ≤
          ENNReal.ofReal C * eLpNorm f (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume := by
  obtain ⟨Cp, hCp, h⟩ := exists_eLpNorm_convolution_le_of_norm_fourier_le (n := n) (by omega) hp
  obtain ⟨CF, hCF0, hCF⟩ := norm_fourier_smoothErr_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨CD, hCD0, hCD⟩ := norm_smoothErr_le hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨C₀, hC₀⟩ := sum_min_two_zpow_le
  set A := CF * max C₀ 0
  set B := CD * max C₀ 0
  have hA0 : 0 ≤ A := mul_nonneg hCF0 (le_max_right _ _)
  have hB0 : 0 ≤ B := mul_nonneg hCD0 (le_max_right _ _)
  refine ⟨Cp * max A B, mul_nonneg hCp.le (le_max_of_le_left hA0), fun S hS c hc f hf => ?_⟩
  -- the sum over `S` of the dyadic weights
  have hmin : ∀ t : ℝ, 0 ≤ t → ∑ J ∈ S, min ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * t) ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * t)⁻¹ ≤
      max C₀ 0 := by
    intro t ht
    rcases eq_or_lt_of_le ht with h0 | h0
    · simp [← h0]
    have := hC₀ t h0 (S.map (Equiv.neg ℤ).toEmbedding)
    rw [Finset.sum_map] at this
    exact this.trans (le_max_left _ _)
  have hminJ : ∀ t : ℝ, 0 ≤ t → ∑ J ∈ S, min ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * t) ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * t)⁻¹ ≤
      max C₀ 0 := by
    intro t ht
    rcases eq_or_lt_of_le ht with h0 | h0
    · simp [← h0]
    exact (hC₀ t h0 S).trans (le_max_left _ _)
  have hd : ∀ x, ∀ J ∈ S, HasFDerivAt (c J • smoothErr Ω J)
      (c J • fderiv ℝ (smoothErr Ω J) x) x := fun x J hJ =>
    (((contDiff_smoothErr hn hΩ (hS J hJ)).differentiable (by norm_num)) x).hasFDerivAt.const_smul
      (c J)
  have hsd : ∀ x, HasFDerivAt (∑ J ∈ S, c J • smoothErr Ω J)
      (∑ J ∈ S, c J • fderiv ℝ (smoothErr Ω J) x) x := fun x => HasFDerivAt.sum (hd x)
  refine h _ (max A B) ?_ (fun x _ => (hsd x).differentiableAt) (fun x hx => ?_)
    (fun ξ => ?_) f hf
  · exact integrable_finsetSum' _ fun J hJ => (integrable_smoothErr hn hΩ (hS J hJ)).smul (c J)
  · -- gradient bound
    rw [(hsd x).fderiv]
    have hr : 0 < ‖x‖ := norm_pos_iff.2 hx
    have hterm : ∀ J ∈ S, ‖c J • fderiv ℝ (smoothErr Ω J) x‖ ≤
        CD * min ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * ‖x‖) ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * ‖x‖)⁻¹ / ‖x‖ ^ (n + 1) := by
      intro J hJ
      rw [norm_smul]
      refine (mul_le_of_le_one_left (norm_nonneg _) (hc J)).trans ((hCD J (hS J hJ) x).2.trans ?_)
      have hR : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ J := by positivity
      have hv := pow_div_one_add_pow_le_min (n := n) (v := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * ‖x‖) (by positivity)
      have heq : (2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * ‖x‖ = ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J := by rw [zpow_neg, inv_mul_eq_div]
      rw [heq] at hv ⊢
      rw [mul_div_assoc]
      refine mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left ?_ hCD0
      calc (((2 : ℝ) ^ J) ^ (n + 1) * (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ (n + 3))⁻¹
          = (‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ (n + 1) / (1 + ‖x‖ / 2 ^ J) ^ (n + 3) / ‖x‖ ^ (n + 1) := by
            rw [div_pow]; field_simp
        _ ≤ _ := div_le_div_of_nonneg_right hv (by positivity)
    calc ‖∑ J ∈ S, c J • fderiv ℝ (smoothErr Ω J) x‖
        ≤ ∑ J ∈ S, CD * min ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * ‖x‖) ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * ‖x‖)⁻¹ / ‖x‖ ^ (n + 1) :=
          (norm_sum_le _ _).trans (Finset.sum_le_sum hterm)
      _ = CD * (∑ J ∈ S, min ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * ‖x‖) ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-J) * ‖x‖)⁻¹) / ‖x‖ ^ (n + 1) := by
          rw [Finset.mul_sum, Finset.sum_div]
      _ ≤ CD * max C₀ 0 / ‖x‖ ^ (n + 1) := by gcongr; exact hmin _ hr.le
      _ ≤ max A B / ‖x‖ ^ (n + 1) := by gcongr; exact le_max_right _ _
  · rw [fourier_finsetSum_smul S c (fun J hJ => integrable_smoothErr hn hΩ (hS J hJ))]
    calc ‖∑ J ∈ S, c J * 𝓕 (smoothErr Ω J) ξ‖
        ≤ ∑ J ∈ S, CF * min ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * ‖ξ‖) ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹ := by
          refine (norm_sum_le _ _).trans (Finset.sum_le_sum fun J hJ => ?_)
          rw [norm_mul]
          exact (mul_le_of_le_one_left (norm_nonneg _) (hc J)).trans (hCF J (hS J hJ) ξ)
      _ = CF * ∑ J ∈ S, min ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * ‖ξ‖) ((2 : ℝ) ^ J * ‖ξ‖)⁻¹ := by
          rw [Finset.mul_sum]
      _ ≤ CF * max C₀ 0 := by gcongr; exact hminJ _ (norm_nonneg _)
      _ ≤ max A B := le_max_left _ _

/-- Blueprint Lemma 4.5 (`lem:smootherrors`), (4.6) as an `L¹` limit: for `J ≥ 1` the partial
sums `∑_{J ≤ j < J + N} (K_j - φ_J * K_j) - ∑_{1 ≤ j < J} φ_J * K_j` converge to `E_J` in
`L¹(E)` as `N → ∞`. -/
theorem tendsto_eLpNorm_smoothErr_sub_partialSum (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) {J : ℤ}
    (hJ : 1 ≤ J) :
    Filter.Tendsto (fun N : ℕ => eLpNorm (smoothErr Ω J -
        (∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, (dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) -
          bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω (J + i)) -
        ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J, bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
          dyadicKernel Ω j)) 1 volume) Filter.atTop (nhds 0) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := smoothErr_hasSum hn hΩ
  obtain ⟨hD, -, hs⟩ := hC J hJ
  set D : ℕ → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun i =>
    dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) - bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume]
      dyadicKernel Ω (J + i) with hD_def
  have hDi : ∀ i, Integrable (D i) := fun i => (hD (J + i) (by omega)).1
  have hDn : ∀ i, ∫ x, ‖D i x‖ ≤ C * (1 / 2) ^ i := fun i => by
    refine (hD (J + i) (by omega)).2.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
    rw [show J - (J + (i : ℤ)) = -(i : ℤ) by ring, zpow_neg, zpow_natCast, one_div, inv_pow]
  have hbound : ∀ N : ℕ, eLpNorm (smoothErr Ω J -
      (∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, D i - ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J,
        bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j)) 1 volume ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal (2 * C * (1 / 2) ^ N) := by
    intro N
    have htail : ∀ x, (smoothErr Ω J - (∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, D i - ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J,
        bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j)) x =
        ∑' i, D (i + N) x := by
      intro x
      have h1 := (hs x).tsum_eq
      have h2 := (hs x).summable.sum_add_tsum_nat_add N
      simp only [Pi.sub_apply, Finset.sum_apply]
      change ∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, D i x + ∑' i, D (i + N) x = ∑' i, D i x at h2
      rw [← h2] at h1
      linear_combination (-1 : ℂ) * h1
    have hmeas : AEStronglyMeasurable (smoothErr Ω J -
        (∑ i ∈ Finset.range N, D i - ∑ j ∈ Finset.Ico 1 J,
          bpPhiDilC J ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] dyadicKernel Ω j)) volume :=
      ((integrable_smoothErr hn hΩ hJ).sub ((integrable_finsetSum' _ fun i _ => hDi i).sub
        (integrable_finsetSum' _ fun j _ => (integrable_bpPhiDilC J).integrable_convolution _
          (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j)))).aestronglyMeasurable
    rw [eLpNorm_one_eq_lintegral_enorm hmeas]
    simp_rw [htail]
    calc ∫⁻ x, ‖∑' i, D (i + N) x‖ₑ ≤ ∫⁻ x, ∑' i, ‖D (i + N) x‖ₑ :=
          lintegral_mono fun x => enorm_tsum_le_tsum_enorm
      _ = ∑' i, ∫⁻ x, ‖D (i + N) x‖ₑ :=
          lintegral_tsum fun i => (hDi (i + N)).1.enorm
      _ = ∑' i, ENNReal.ofReal (∫ x, ‖D (i + N) x‖) := by
          congr 1; ext i; rw [ofReal_integral_norm_eq_lintegral_enorm (hDi (i + N))]
      _ ≤ ∑' i : ℕ, ENNReal.ofReal (C * (1 / 2) ^ N * (1 / 2) ^ i) := by
          refine ENNReal.tsum_le_tsum fun i => ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal ?_
          refine (hDn (i + N)).trans (le_of_eq ?_)
          rw [pow_add]; ring
      _ = ENNReal.ofReal (∑' i : ℕ, C * (1 / 2) ^ N * (1 / 2) ^ i) :=
          (ENNReal.ofReal_tsum_of_nonneg (fun i => by positivity)
            (summable_geometric_two.mul_left _)).symm
      _ = ENNReal.ofReal (2 * C * (1 / 2) ^ N) := by
          rw [tsum_mul_left, tsum_geometric_two]; ring_nf
  have hlim : Filter.Tendsto (fun N : ℕ => ENNReal.ofReal (2 * C * (1 / 2) ^ N))
      Filter.atTop (nhds 0) := by
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_zero]
    refine ENNReal.tendsto_ofReal ?_
    have := (tendsto_pow_atTop_nhds_zero_of_lt_one (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 1 / 2)
      (by norm_num)).const_mul (2 * C)
    simpa using this
  exact tendsto_of_tendsto_of_tendsto_of_le_of_le tendsto_const_nhds hlim
    (fun N => zero_le) hbound

end RealVariable

section Oscillation

/-!
## Oscillatory integrals and a continuous annular maximal estimate

Results from §5 ("Oscillatory integrals and a continuous annular maximal estimate") of
`blueprints/discrete-sw.tex`.

### Lemma 5.1 (`lem:oscint`): polynomial sublevel sets and oscillatory integrals

* `volume_sublevel_poly_le`: for `m ≥ 2` and a bounded interval `[α, β]`, if `Q` has degree at most
  `m - 1` and some coefficient of modulus at least `L > 0`, then
  `|{t ∈ [α, β] : |Q t| ≤ τ}| ≤ C (τ / L)^{1/(m-1)}` (Lagrange interpolation at well-separated
  points of the sublevel set); `sublevel_poly_const_eq_empty` is the degenerate case `m = 1`.
* `norm_integral_eC_poly_mul_le`: the one-dimensional oscillatory integral estimate
  `|∫_α^β e(F(t)) a(t) dt| ≤ C L^{-1/m} (sup |a| + ∫_α^β |a'|)` for a real polynomial `F` of
  degree at most `m` with a coefficient of index `≥ 1` of modulus at least `L ≥ 1`, and an amplitude
  that is continuous on `[α, β]` and differentiable on `(α, β)` with integrable derivative
  (boundary terms are included; the amplitude need not vanish at the endpoints).
* `norm_setIntegral_box_eC_mul_le`: the version on a fixed box in `E = EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)`,
  integrating the one-dimensional estimate along one coordinate by Fubini.

### Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): radial Fourier estimates (nonstationary regions)

Here `P = radialPoly n d`, `D = 2d`, and `𝓕` is Mathlib's Fourier transform (kernel `e(-x·ξ)`;
the blueprint's `e(+x·ξ)` amounts to `η ↦ -η`, which does not affect any norm bound).
* `radialOscAmp Ω = K ψ = K_0` (`radialOscAmp_eq`), `radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d = 2πi P K_0`,
  `radialOscInt d a t η = ∫ e(t P(z) - z·η) a(z) dz`, `radialOscPsi Ω d = Ψ`,
  `radialOscPhi Ω d j μ = Φ_{j,μ} = 𝓕 (e(μ P) K_j)`;
* `radialOscPhi_eq`: `Φ_{j,μ}(ξ) = Ψ(μ 2^{Dj}, 2^j ξ)`; `hasDerivAt_radialOscPsi`:
  `∂_t Ψ = Ψ_{2πi P K_0}`; `radialOscPsi_zero`: `Ψ(t, 0) = ∂_t Ψ(t, 0) = 0`;
* `IsRadialOscAmp` (smooth, vanishing off `1/2 ≤ |z| ≤ 2`, `∫ e(tP) a = 0` for all `t`), satisfied
  by `K_0` and `2πi P K_0` (`isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmp`, `isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmpDeriv`);
* `norm_integral_eC_mul_le_of_nonstationary`: the integration-by-parts mechanism
  `|∫ e(λ Φ(p, ·)) A(p, ·)| ≤ C_N λ^{-N}` for a compact family of phases that are nonstationary
  along an affine vector field `α z + b(p)` on the amplitudes' fixed compact support;
* the bounds: `norm_radialOscInt_le_bounded` (`|t| ≤ 2`: `C_N min(|η|, |η|^{-N})`),
  `norm_radialOscInt_le_small` (`|η| ≤ c|t|`: `C_N |η| |t|^{-N}`), `norm_radialOscInt_le_large`
  (`|η| ≥ C|t|`: `C_N |η|^{-N}`), `norm_radialOscInt_le` (trivial bound) and
  `norm_radialOscInt_le_norm` (`O(|η|)`), with `c = radialOscSmall d`, `C = radialOscLarge d`;
  packaged in `radialOscInt_estimates` and, for `Ψ` and `∂_t Ψ`, `radialOscPsi_estimates`.
The large-`|η|` bound integrates by parts along the constant field `η/|η|`, the small-`|η|` bound
along the radial field `z` (for the amplitudes `-2πi (z·η) a` of the `η`-derivative along the ray
from `0` to `η`, followed by the mean value inequality and `Ψ_a(t, 0) = 0`).

### Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): the stationary region and the square sums

* `norm_radialOscInt_le_middle` ((5.1), middle line): `|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C |t|^{-n/2}` for `|t| ≥ 1`,
  `c|t| ≤ |η| ≤ C|t|`; for `Ψ` and `∂_t Ψ` in `radialOscPsi_middle`. The proof takes the critical
  point `z₀` (`t ∇P(z₀) = η`), bounds the ball `|z - z₀| ≲ |t|^{-1/2}` trivially and each dyadic
  shell `|z - z₀| ≍ s` after the substitution `z = z₀ + s u`: the rescaled phase
  `Q(s, z₀, u) = s⁻² (P(z₀ + s u) - P(z₀) - s ∇P(z₀)·u)` (`radialOscQ`, smooth also at `s = 0`)
  is nonstationary along the radial field `u` on `1/2 ≤ |u| ≤ 2` uniformly in the compact set of
  parameters (`radialOscQ_fderiv_ge`, from the strong monotonicity of `z ↦ |z|^{D-2} z`), so the
  compact-family mechanism gives `C_N (|t| s²)^{-N}` per shell (`radialOsc_shell_bound`).
* `radialOscPhi_square` ((5.2)), `hasDerivAt_radialOscPhi_u` and `radialOscPhi_deriv_square`
  ((5.3)): the square sums over `j ∈ J` of `|Φ_{j, σ u 2^{ℓ - Dj}}(ξ)|²` and of
  `|∂_u Φ_{j, σ u 2^{ℓ - Dj}}(ξ)|²`.

### Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`): continuous annular maximal decay

Here `a = (j, μ)`, `k_a = e(μ P) K_j` (`bandKer`), `bandConv a f = k_a * f`, `IsBandAdm d T a`
means `T ≤ |μ| 2^{Dj} ≤ 2T`, and `contBandMax n d Ω T f = 𝔥_T f` is the supremum over admissible
`a`.
* `eLpNorm_contBandMax_le`: `‖𝔥_T f‖_p ≤ C_p T^{-σ_p} ‖f‖_p` for `1 < p < ∞`, `T ≥ 1`, with
  `σ_p = (2D)^{-1} min(1/p, 1/p')`.
* Steps: `enorm_bandConv_le_cubeMaximal` (domination by the cube maximal function);
  `band_eLpNorm_kernel_le_of_ttstar` (an abstract `TT*` bound: a bilinear bound for the kernel
  `H(x,x') = ∫ κ(x,y) conj κ(x',y) dy` bounds the operator `∫ κ(x,y) g(y) dy` on `L²`);
  `band_amp_osc` (Lemma 5.1, box version, for products of two dyadic kernels),
  `norm_bandTT_le_far`, `norm_bandTT_le_near`, `enorm_bandTT_le` (the pointwise bound for
  `H(a, b; h) = ∫ k_a(z) conj k_b(z + h) dz`); `eLpNorm_bandMax_finset_le_two` (`L²` decay
  `C T^{-1/(4D)}` for finite families via linearization); `eLpNorm_bandMax_finset_le`
  (Marcinkiewicz interpolation with weak `(1,1)` and `L^∞`); the passage to the full supremum uses
  continuity in `μ` and a rational parametrization of the admissible parameters.
-/

open MeasureTheory Real Polynomial Set

/-! ### Coefficient bounds for Lagrange interpolation -/

/-- Coefficient bound for a product of linear factors `c_j (X - y_j)` with `|y_j| ≤ R`. -/
lemma osc_coeff_prod_le {ι : Type*} (s : Finset ι) (c y : ι → ℝ) (R : ℝ) (hR : 0 ≤ R)
    (hy : ∀ j ∈ s, |y j| ≤ R) (k : ℕ) :
    |(∏ j ∈ s, (C (c j) * (X - C (y j)))).coeff k| ≤ ∏ j ∈ s, (|c j| * (1 + R)) := by
  classical
  induction s using Finset.induction_on generalizing k with
  | empty =>
    simp only [Finset.prod_empty, coeff_one]
    split_ifs <;> simp
  | insert j s hj ih =>
    have hy' : ∀ i ∈ s, |y i| ≤ R := fun i hi => hy i (Finset.mem_insert_of_mem hi)
    have hyj : |y j| ≤ R := hy j (Finset.mem_insert_self j s)
    have ih' := ih hy'
    set p := ∏ i ∈ s, (C (c i) * (X - C (y i)))
    set B := ∏ i ∈ s, (|c i| * (1 + R))
    have hB : 0 ≤ B := le_trans (abs_nonneg _) (ih' 0)
    rw [Finset.prod_insert hj, Finset.prod_insert hj]
    have hexp : C (c j) * (X - C (y j)) * p = C (c j) * (X * p) - C (c j * y j) * p := by
      rw [C_mul]; ring
    rw [hexp, coeff_sub, coeff_C_mul, coeff_C_mul]
    rcases k with _ | k
    · rw [coeff_X_mul_zero, mul_zero, zero_sub, abs_neg, abs_mul, abs_mul]
      have h1 := ih' 0
      calc |c j| * |y j| * |p.coeff 0| ≤ |c j| * R * B := by gcongr
        _ ≤ |c j| * (1 + R) * B := by gcongr; linarith
    · rw [coeff_X_mul]
      have h1 := ih' k
      have h2 := ih' (k + 1)
      calc |c j * p.coeff k - c j * y j * p.coeff (k + 1)|
          ≤ |c j| * |p.coeff k| + |c j| * |y j| * |p.coeff (k + 1)| := by
            refine (abs_sub _ _).trans ?_
            rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_mul]
        _ ≤ |c j| * B + |c j| * R * B := by gcongr
        _ = |c j| * (1 + R) * B := by ring

/-- Lagrange interpolation bound: if a polynomial of degree `< #s` is at most `τ` in modulus on a
set `s` of nodes in `[-R, R]` with pairwise separation at least `δ`, then every coefficient is at
most `#s τ ((1 + R) / δ)^(#s - 1)` in modulus. -/
lemma osc_coeff_le_of_nodes (s : Finset ℝ) (Q : ℝ[X]) (hdeg : Q.degree < s.card) {R δ τ : ℝ}
    (hR : 0 ≤ R) (hδ : 0 < δ) (hs : ∀ x ∈ s, |x| ≤ R)
    (hsep : ∀ x ∈ s, ∀ y ∈ s, x ≠ y → δ ≤ |x - y|) (hQ : ∀ x ∈ s, |Q.eval x| ≤ τ) (k : ℕ) :
    |Q.coeff k| ≤ s.card * τ * ((1 + R) / δ) ^ (s.card - 1) := by
  classical
  have hinj : Set.InjOn (id : ℝ → ℝ) s := Set.injOn_id _
  have hQeq := Lagrange.eq_interpolate (s := s) (v := id) hinj hdeg
  rw [hQeq, Lagrange.interpolate_apply, finsetSum_coeff]
  refine (Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _).trans ?_
  have hterm : ∀ i ∈ s, |(C (Q.eval (id i)) * Lagrange.basis s id i).coeff k|
      ≤ τ * ((1 + R) / δ) ^ (s.card - 1) := by
    intro i hi
    rw [coeff_C_mul, abs_mul]
    have hb : |(Lagrange.basis s id i).coeff k| ≤ ((1 + R) / δ) ^ (s.card - 1) := by
      have hbasis : Lagrange.basis s id i
          = ∏ j ∈ s.erase i, (C ((i - j)⁻¹) * (X - C j)) := rfl
      rw [hbasis]
      refine (osc_coeff_prod_le (s.erase i) (fun j => (i - j)⁻¹) id R hR
        (fun j hj => hs j (Finset.mem_of_mem_erase hj)) k).trans ?_
      rw [← Finset.card_erase_of_mem hi, ← Finset.prod_const]
      refine Finset.prod_le_prod₀ (fun j _ => by positivity) (fun j hj => ?_)
      have hji : j ≠ i := Finset.ne_of_mem_erase hj
      have hsepij : δ ≤ |i - j| := hsep i hi j (Finset.mem_of_mem_erase hj) (Ne.symm hji)
      rw [abs_inv, div_eq_mul_inv, mul_comm (1 + R)]
      gcongr
    have hQi : |Q.eval (id i)| ≤ τ := hQ i hi
    have hτ : 0 ≤ τ := le_trans (abs_nonneg _) hQi
    gcongr
  refine (Finset.sum_le_sum hterm).trans ?_
  rw [Finset.sum_const, nsmul_eq_mul, mul_assoc]

/-- Greedy selection: if `2 δ j < |E|` then `E` contains `j + 1` points with pairwise separation at
least `δ`. -/
lemma osc_exists_separated (E : Set ℝ) {δ : ℝ} (hδ : 0 < δ) :
    ∀ j : ℕ, ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ * j) < volume E →
      ∃ s : Finset ℝ, s.card = j + 1 ∧ (↑s : Set ℝ) ⊆ E ∧
        ∀ x ∈ s, ∀ y ∈ s, x ≠ y → δ ≤ |x - y| := by
  classical
  intro j
  induction j with
  | zero =>
    intro h
    have hne : E.Nonempty := by
      by_contra hE
      rw [Set.not_nonempty_iff_eq_empty] at hE
      rw [hE, measure_empty] at h
      exact (not_lt.mpr (zero_le (a := volume (∅ : Set ℝ)) )) (by simp at h)
    obtain ⟨z, hz⟩ := hne
    refine ⟨{z}, by simp, by simpa using hz, ?_⟩
    intro x hx y hy hxy
    simp only [Finset.mem_singleton] at hx hy
    exact absurd (hx.trans hy.symm) hxy
  | succ j ih =>
    intro h
    have hlt : ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ * j) < volume E := by
      refine lt_of_le_of_lt (ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal ?_) h
      push_cast
      nlinarith
    obtain ⟨s, hcard, hsE, hsep⟩ := ih hlt
    have hU : volume (⋃ x ∈ s, Metric.ball x δ) < volume E := by
      refine lt_of_le_of_lt (measure_biUnion_finset_le _ _) ?_
      simp only [Real.volume_ball]
      rw [Finset.sum_const, hcard, nsmul_eq_mul]
      refine lt_of_le_of_lt (le_of_eq ?_) h
      rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_natCast, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity)]
      congr 1
      push_cast
      ring
    have hnot : ¬ E ⊆ ⋃ x ∈ s, Metric.ball x δ := fun hsub =>
      (not_le.mpr hU) (measure_mono hsub)
    rw [Set.not_subset] at hnot
    obtain ⟨z, hzE, hzU⟩ := hnot
    simp only [Set.mem_iUnion, not_exists, Metric.mem_ball, not_lt] at hzU
    have hzs : z ∉ s := by
      intro hz
      have := hzU z hz
      rw [dist_self] at this
      linarith
    refine ⟨insert z s, by rw [Finset.card_insert_of_notMem hzs, hcard], ?_, ?_⟩
    · rw [Finset.coe_insert]
      exact Set.insert_subset hzE hsE
    · intro x hx y hy hxy
      rw [Finset.mem_insert] at hx hy
      rcases hx with rfl | hx <;> rcases hy with rfl | hy
      · exact absurd rfl hxy
      · have := hzU y hy
        rwa [Real.dist_eq] at this
      · have := hzU x hx
        rwa [Real.dist_eq, abs_sub_comm] at this
      · exact hsep x hx y hy hxy

/-- **Polynomial sublevel set bound.** Blueprint Lemma 5.1 (`lem:oscint`), first step of the proof:
for `m ≥ 2` and a bounded interval `[α, β]` there is `C = C(m, α, β) > 0` such that for every real
polynomial `Q` of degree at most `m - 1` having some coefficient of modulus at least `L > 0` (i.e.
`max_k |Q_k| ≥ L`) and every `τ ≥ 0`,
`|{t ∈ [α, β] : |Q(t)| ≤ τ}| ≤ C (τ / L)^{1/(m-1)}`. -/
theorem volume_sublevel_poly_le (m : ℕ) (hm : 2 ≤ m) (α β : ℝ) :
    ∃ C > 0, ∀ (Q : ℝ[X]) (L τ : ℝ), 0 < L → 0 ≤ τ → Q.natDegree ≤ m - 1 →
      (∃ k, L ≤ |Q.coeff k|) →
      volume {t ∈ Icc α β | |Q.eval t| ≤ τ}
        ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (C * (τ / L) ^ ((m : ℝ) - 1)⁻¹) := by
  set R : ℝ := max |α| |β| with hRdef
  have hR : 0 ≤ R := le_trans (abs_nonneg α) (le_max_left _ _)
  set d : ℕ := m - 1 with hd
  have hdpos : 0 < d := by omega
  have hdm : ((m : ℝ) - 1) = (d : ℝ) := by
    rw [hd, Nat.cast_sub (by omega : 1 ≤ m)]; simp
  set K : ℝ := m * (1 + R) ^ d with hK
  have hKpos : 0 < K := by positivity
  refine ⟨2 * m * K ^ (d : ℝ)⁻¹, by positivity, ?_⟩
  intro Q L τ hL hτ hdeg ⟨k, hk⟩
  rw [hdm]
  set S := {t ∈ Icc α β | |Q.eval t| ≤ τ} with hS
  have hSfin : volume S < ⊤ :=
    lt_of_le_of_lt (measure_mono (fun t ht => ht.1)) (by rw [Real.volume_Icc]; simp)
  set a := volume.real S with ha
  have hSa : volume S = ENNReal.ofReal a := by
    rw [ha, measureReal_def, ENNReal.ofReal_toReal hSfin.ne]
  rw [hSa]
  refine ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal ?_
  have ha0 : 0 ≤ a := measureReal_nonneg
  rcases ha0.eq_or_lt with ha0 | hapos
  · rw [← ha0]; positivity
  set δ := a / (2 * m) with hδ
  have hmpos : (0 : ℝ) < m := by exact_mod_cast (by omega : 0 < m)
  have hδpos : 0 < δ := by positivity
  have hlt : ENNReal.ofReal (2 * δ * (d : ℕ)) < volume S := by
    rw [hSa]
    refine (ENNReal.ofReal_lt_ofReal_iff hapos).2 ?_
    rw [← hdm, hδ]
    field_simp
    linarith
  obtain ⟨s, hcard, hsS, hsep⟩ := osc_exists_separated S hδpos d hlt
  have hdeg' : Q.degree < s.card := by
    rw [hcard]
    refine lt_of_le_of_lt (degree_le_natDegree) ?_
    exact_mod_cast (by omega : Q.natDegree < d + 1)
  have hsR : ∀ x ∈ s, |x| ≤ R := by
    intro x hx
    have hxI := (hsS hx).1
    rw [abs_le]
    constructor
    · have : -R ≤ α := by rw [neg_le]; exact le_trans (neg_le_abs α) (le_max_left _ _)
      linarith [hxI.1]
    · have : β ≤ R := le_trans (le_abs_self β) (le_max_right _ _)
      linarith [hxI.2]
  have hQs : ∀ x ∈ s, |Q.eval x| ≤ τ := fun x hx => (hsS hx).2
  have hcoeff := osc_coeff_le_of_nodes s Q hdeg' hR hδpos hsR hsep hQs k
  rw [hcard, Nat.add_sub_cancel] at hcoeff
  have hdm' : ((d + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) = m := by push_cast; rw [← hdm]; ring
  rw [hdm'] at hcoeff
  -- `L ≤ m τ ((1+R)/δ)^d`, hence `δ^d ≤ K τ / L`
  have hkey : δ ^ d ≤ K * (τ / L) := by
    have h1 : L ≤ m * τ * ((1 + R) ^ d / δ ^ d) := by rw [← div_pow]; linarith
    have hδd : 0 < δ ^ d := by positivity
    rw [hK, mul_div_assoc']
    rw [le_div_iff₀ hL]
    rw [mul_div_assoc', le_div_iff₀ hδd] at h1
    nlinarith
  have hroot : δ ≤ (K * (τ / L)) ^ (d : ℝ)⁻¹ := by
    have := Real.rpow_le_rpow (by positivity) hkey (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) ≤ (d : ℝ)⁻¹)
    rwa [Real.pow_rpow_inv_natCast hδpos.le hdpos.ne'] at this
  rw [Real.mul_rpow hKpos.le (by positivity)] at hroot
  rw [hδ, div_le_iff₀ (by positivity)] at hroot
  linarith

/-- The degenerate case `m = 1` of the sublevel set bound (Blueprint Lemma 5.1 (`lem:oscint`)): a
constant polynomial of modulus at least `L` has empty sublevel set at every height `τ < L`. -/
theorem sublevel_poly_const_eq_empty (α β : ℝ) (Q : ℝ[X]) (L τ : ℝ) (hτL : τ < L)
    (hdeg : Q.natDegree ≤ 0) (hcoeff : ∃ k, L ≤ |Q.coeff k|) :
    {t ∈ Icc α β | |Q.eval t| ≤ τ} = ∅ := by
  obtain ⟨k, hk⟩ := hcoeff
  rw [Polynomial.eq_C_of_natDegree_le_zero hdeg] at hk ⊢
  rcases k with _ | k
  · ext t
    simp only [eval_C, mem_ofPred_eq, mem_empty_iff_false, iff_false, not_and, not_le]
    intro _
    rw [coeff_C_zero] at hk
    linarith
  · rw [coeff_C_succ, abs_zero] at hk
    ext t
    simp only [eval_C, mem_ofPred_eq, mem_empty_iff_false, iff_false, not_and, not_le]
    intro _
    linarith [abs_nonneg (Q.coeff 0)]

/-! ### Integration by parts on an interval where the phase is nonstationary -/

/-- `|e(x)| = 1` (local copy, to avoid depending on the arithmetic module). -/
lemma osc_norm_eC (x : ℝ) : ‖eC x‖ = 1 := by
  unfold eC
  rw [Complex.norm_exp]
  simp

/-- The first-derivative test with boundary terms: if `|φ'| ≥ τ > 0` on `[p, q]` and `φ''` has a
fixed sign there, then `|∫_p^q e(φ) a| ≤ (4 sup|a| + ∫_p^q |a'|) / τ`. -/
lemma osc_norm_integral_ibp {p q τ M σ : ℝ} (hpq : p ≤ q) (hτ : 0 < τ) (hσ : |σ| = 1)
    {φ φ1 φ2 : ℝ → ℝ} (hφ : ∀ t, HasDerivAt φ (φ1 t) t) (hφ1 : ∀ t, HasDerivAt φ1 (φ2 t) t)
    (hφ2 : Continuous φ2) (hlow : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, τ ≤ |φ1 t|)
    (hsign : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, 0 ≤ σ * φ2 t)
    {a a' : ℝ → ℂ} (ha : ContinuousOn a (Icc p q)) (ha' : ∀ t ∈ Ioo p q, HasDerivAt a (a' t) t)
    (hai : IntervalIntegrable a' volume p q) (hM : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, ‖a t‖ ≤ M) :
    ‖∫ t in p..q, eC (φ t) * a t‖ ≤ (4 * M + ∫ t in p..q, ‖a' t‖) / τ := by
  have hφc : Continuous φ := continuous_iff_continuousAt.2 fun t => (hφ t).continuousAt
  have hφ1c : Continuous φ1 := continuous_iff_continuousAt.2 fun t => (hφ1 t).continuousAt
  have hMnn : 0 ≤ M := le_trans (norm_nonneg _) (hM p ⟨le_rfl, hpq⟩)
  have hne : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, φ1 t ≠ 0 := fun t ht h => by
    have := hlow t ht; rw [h, abs_zero] at this; linarith
  have huIcc : uIcc p q = Icc p q := uIcc_of_le hpq
  set c : ℂ := 2 * π * Complex.I with hcdef
  have hc0 : c ≠ 0 := by simp [c, pi_ne_zero, Complex.I_ne_zero]
  have hnc : ‖c‖ = 2 * π := by
    simp only [c, norm_mul, Complex.norm_I, mul_one, Complex.norm_ofNat, Complex.norm_real,
      Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos pi_pos]
  set w : ℝ → ℂ := fun t => (c * (φ1 t : ℂ))⁻¹ with hwdef
  set w' : ℝ → ℂ := fun t => -(c * (φ2 t : ℂ)) / (c * (φ1 t : ℂ)) ^ 2 with hw'def
  have hwne : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, c * (φ1 t : ℂ) ≠ 0 := fun t ht =>
    mul_ne_zero hc0 (by exact_mod_cast hne t ht)
  have hw : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, HasDerivAt w (w' t) t := by
    intro t ht
    have h1 : HasDerivAt (fun s => c * (φ1 s : ℂ)) (c * (φ2 t : ℂ)) t :=
      ((hφ1 t).ofReal_comp).const_mul c
    exact h1.fun_inv (hwne t ht)
  have hwc : ContinuousOn w (Icc p q) := fun t ht => (hw t ht).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt
  have hw'c : ContinuousOn w' (Icc p q) := by
    refine ContinuousOn.div ?_ ?_ (fun t ht => pow_ne_zero 2 (hwne t ht))
    · exact (continuous_const.mul (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp hφ2)).neg.continuousOn
    · exact ((continuous_const.mul (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp hφ1c)).pow 2).continuousOn
  set v : ℝ → ℂ := fun t => a t * w t with hvdef
  set v' : ℝ → ℂ := fun t => a' t * w t + a t * w' t with hv'def
  set u : ℝ → ℂ := fun t => eC (φ t) with hudef
  set u' : ℝ → ℂ := fun t => eC (φ t) * (c * (φ1 t : ℂ)) with hu'def
  have hu : ∀ t, HasDerivAt u (u' t) t := by
    intro t
    have h1 : HasDerivAt (fun s => c * (φ s : ℂ)) (c * (φ1 t : ℂ)) t :=
      ((hφ t).ofReal_comp).const_mul c
    exact h1.cexp
  have hu'c : Continuous u' := by
    refine Continuous.mul ?_ (continuous_const.mul (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp hφ1c))
    exact Complex.continuous_exp.comp (continuous_const.mul (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp hφc))
  have hint : ∫ t in p..q, eC (φ t) * a t = ∫ t in p..q, v t * u' t := by
    refine intervalIntegral.integral_congr (fun t ht => ?_)
    rw [huIcc] at ht
    have h := hwne t ht
    simp only [v, u', w]
    calc eC (φ t) * a t = eC (φ t) * a t * ((c * (φ1 t : ℂ))⁻¹ * (c * (φ1 t : ℂ))) := by
          rw [inv_mul_cancel₀ h, mul_one]
      _ = a t * (c * (φ1 t : ℂ))⁻¹ * (eC (φ t) * (c * (φ1 t : ℂ))) := by ring
  have hvc : ContinuousOn v (uIcc p q) := by rw [huIcc]; exact ha.mul hwc
  have hvv' : ∀ x ∈ Ioo (min p q) (max p q), HasDerivAt v (v' x) x := by
    rw [min_eq_left hpq, max_eq_right hpq]
    intro x hx
    exact (ha' x hx).mul (hw x (Ioo_subset_Icc_self hx))
  have hv'int : IntervalIntegrable v' volume p q := by
    refine (hai.mul_continuousOn (by rw [huIcc]; exact hwc)).add ?_
    refine ContinuousOn.intervalIntegrable ?_
    rw [huIcc]; exact ha.mul hw'c
  have hibp := intervalIntegral.integral_mul_deriv_eq_deriv_mul_of_hasDerivAt hvc
    (fun t _ => (hu t).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt) hvv' (fun t _ => hu t) hv'int
    (hu'c.intervalIntegrable p q)
  rw [hint, hibp]
  -- pointwise bounds
  have hwn : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, ‖w t‖ ≤ τ⁻¹ := by
    intro t ht
    simp only [w, norm_inv, norm_mul, hnc, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs]
    refine inv_anti₀ hτ ?_
    have := hlow t ht
    nlinarith [pi_gt_three, abs_nonneg (φ1 t)]
  have hw'n : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, ‖w' t‖ ≤ σ * φ2 t / φ1 t ^ 2 := by
    intro t ht
    have habs : |φ2 t| = σ * φ2 t := by
      rw [← abs_of_nonneg (hsign t ht), abs_mul, hσ, one_mul]
    have hpos : 0 < φ1 t ^ 2 := by have := hne t ht; positivity
    simp only [w', norm_div, norm_neg, norm_pow, norm_mul, hnc, Complex.norm_real,
      Real.norm_eq_abs]
    rw [habs, mul_pow, sq_abs, div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) hpos]
    have h0 : 0 ≤ σ * φ2 t * φ1 t ^ 2 := mul_nonneg (hsign t ht) hpos.le
    have h1 : 0 ≤ (2 * π) ^ 2 - 2 * π := by nlinarith [pi_gt_three]
    nlinarith [mul_nonneg h0 h1]
  have hvn : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, ‖v t‖ ≤ M * τ⁻¹ := by
    intro t ht
    simp only [v, norm_mul]
    exact mul_le_mul (hM t ht) (hwn t ht) (norm_nonneg _) hMnn
  have hv'n : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, ‖v' t‖ ≤ ‖a' t‖ * τ⁻¹ + M * (σ * φ2 t / φ1 t ^ 2) := by
    intro t ht
    refine (norm_add_le _ _).trans ?_
    rw [norm_mul, norm_mul]
    exact add_le_add (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hwn t ht) (norm_nonneg _))
      (mul_le_mul (hM t ht) (hw'n t ht) (norm_nonneg _) hMnn)
  -- the integral term
  have hgc : ContinuousOn (fun t => M * (σ * φ2 t / φ1 t ^ 2)) (uIcc p q) := by
    refine continuousOn_const.mul ((continuousOn_const.mul hφ2.continuousOn).div
      (hφ1c.continuousOn.pow 2) (fun t ht => pow_ne_zero 2 (hne t ?_)))
    rwa [huIcc] at ht
  have hG : ∀ t ∈ uIcc p q, HasDerivAt (fun s => -(M * σ) * (φ1 s)⁻¹)
      (M * (σ * φ2 t / φ1 t ^ 2)) t := by
    intro t ht
    rw [huIcc] at ht
    have h := ((hφ1 t).fun_inv (hne t ht)).const_mul (-(M * σ))
    convert h using 1
    ring
  have hGint := intervalIntegral.integral_eq_sub_of_hasDerivAt hG hgc.intervalIntegrable
  have hinv : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, |(φ1 t)⁻¹| ≤ τ⁻¹ := fun t ht => by
    rw [abs_inv]; exact inv_anti₀ hτ (hlow t ht)
  have hGbd : -(M * σ) * (φ1 q)⁻¹ - -(M * σ) * (φ1 p)⁻¹ ≤ 2 * M * τ⁻¹ := by
    have h1 := hinv p ⟨le_rfl, hpq⟩
    have h2 := hinv q ⟨hpq, le_rfl⟩
    have h3 : σ * ((φ1 p)⁻¹ - (φ1 q)⁻¹) ≤ 2 * τ⁻¹ := by
      refine (le_abs_self _).trans ?_
      rw [abs_mul, hσ, one_mul]
      refine (abs_sub _ _).trans ?_
      linarith
    nlinarith
  have hI : ∫ t in p..q, ‖v' t * u t‖ ≤ (∫ t in p..q, ‖a' t‖) * τ⁻¹ + 2 * M * τ⁻¹ := by
    have hcongr : ∫ t in p..q, ‖v' t * u t‖ = ∫ t in p..q, ‖v' t‖ := by
      refine intervalIntegral.integral_congr (fun t _ => ?_)
      simp only [u, norm_mul, osc_norm_eC, mul_one]
    rw [hcongr]
    refine (intervalIntegral.integral_mono_on hpq hv'int.norm
      ((hai.norm.mul_const τ⁻¹).add hgc.intervalIntegrable) hv'n).trans ?_
    rw [intervalIntegral.integral_add (hai.norm.mul_const τ⁻¹) hgc.intervalIntegrable,
      intervalIntegral.integral_mul_const, hGint]
    linarith
  have hnorm2 : ‖∫ t in p..q, v' t * u t‖ ≤ ∫ t in p..q, ‖v' t * u t‖ :=
    intervalIntegral.norm_integral_le_integral_norm hpq
  have hb1 : ‖v q * u q‖ ≤ M * τ⁻¹ := by
    rw [norm_mul]; simp only [u, osc_norm_eC, mul_one]; exact hvn q ⟨hpq, le_rfl⟩
  have hb2 : ‖v p * u p‖ ≤ M * τ⁻¹ := by
    rw [norm_mul]; simp only [u, osc_norm_eC, mul_one]; exact hvn p ⟨le_rfl, hpq⟩
  have htri : ‖v q * u q - v p * u p - ∫ t in p..q, v' t * u t‖
      ≤ ‖v q * u q‖ + ‖v p * u p‖ + ‖∫ t in p..q, v' t * u t‖ := by
    refine (norm_sub_le _ _).trans ?_
    have := norm_sub_le (v q * u q) (v p * u p)
    linarith
  rw [div_eq_mul_inv]
  linarith

/-! ### Splitting at the roots of `F' ∓ τ` and `F''` -/

/-- A real polynomial without roots in `(p, q)` keeps a positive sign there. -/
lemma osc_poly_pos_of_no_root (g : ℝ[X]) {p q t0 t1 : ℝ} (hroot : ∀ x ∈ Ioo p q, x ∉ g.roots)
    (h0 : t0 ∈ Ioo p q) (h1 : t1 ∈ Ioo p q) (hpos : 0 < g.eval t0) : 0 < g.eval t1 := by
  by_contra hneg
  push Not at hneg
  have hivt := intermediate_value_uIcc (a := t0) (b := t1) g.continuous.continuousOn
  have hmem : (0 : ℝ) ∈ uIcc (g.eval t0) (g.eval t1) := by
    rw [mem_uIcc]; right; exact ⟨hneg, hpos.le⟩
  obtain ⟨x, hx, hx0⟩ := hivt hmem
  have hxI : x ∈ Ioo p q := ordConnected_Ioo.uIcc_subset h0 h1 hx
  have hg0 : g ≠ 0 := by
    rintro rfl
    simp at hpos
  exact hroot x hxI ((mem_roots hg0).2 hx0)

/-- A real polynomial without roots in `(p, q)` keeps a negative sign there. -/
lemma osc_poly_neg_of_no_root (g : ℝ[X]) {p q t0 t1 : ℝ} (hroot : ∀ x ∈ Ioo p q, x ∉ g.roots)
    (h0 : t0 ∈ Ioo p q) (h1 : t1 ∈ Ioo p q) (hneg : g.eval t0 < 0) : g.eval t1 < 0 := by
  have hroot' : ∀ x ∈ Ioo p q, x ∉ (-g).roots := by
    intro x hx; rw [roots_neg]; exact hroot x hx
  have := osc_poly_pos_of_no_root (-g) hroot' h0 h1 (by rw [eval_neg]; linarith)
  rw [eval_neg] at this
  linarith

/-- An inequality between continuous functions on `(p, q)` extends to `[p, q]`. -/
lemma osc_le_on_Icc_of_Ioo {f g : ℝ → ℝ} (hf : Continuous f) (hg : Continuous g) {p q : ℝ}
    (hpq : p < q) (h : ∀ t ∈ Ioo p q, f t ≤ g t) : ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, f t ≤ g t := by
  have hcl : closure (Ioo p q) ⊆ {t | f t ≤ g t} :=
    closure_minimal (fun t ht => h t ht) (isClosed_le hf hg)
  rw [closure_Ioo hpq.ne] at hcl
  exact fun t ht => hcl ht

/-- The set of splitting points: roots of `F' - τ`, `F' + τ` and `F''`. -/
noncomputable def oscSplitPoints (F : ℝ[X]) (τ : ℝ) : Finset ℝ :=
  (derivative F - C τ : ℝ[X]).roots.toFinset ∪ (derivative F + C τ : ℝ[X]).roots.toFinset ∪
    (derivative (derivative F) : ℝ[X]).roots.toFinset

/-- There are at most `3m` splitting points when `deg F ≤ m`. -/
lemma card_oscSplitPoints_le (F : ℝ[X]) (τ : ℝ) {m : ℕ} (hF : F.natDegree ≤ m) :
    (oscSplitPoints F τ).card ≤ 3 * m := by
  have hD : (derivative F).natDegree ≤ m := (natDegree_derivative_le F).trans (by omega)
  have hD2 : (derivative (derivative F)).natDegree ≤ m :=
    (natDegree_derivative_le _).trans (by omega)
  have h1 : (derivative F - C τ).natDegree ≤ m :=
    (natDegree_sub_le _ _).trans (by rw [natDegree_C]; omega)
  have h2 : (derivative F + C τ).natDegree ≤ m :=
    (natDegree_add_le _ _).trans (by rw [natDegree_C]; omega)
  unfold oscSplitPoints
  have u1 := Finset.card_union_le ((derivative F - C τ : ℝ[X]).roots.toFinset ∪
    (derivative F + C τ : ℝ[X]).roots.toFinset) (derivative (derivative F) : ℝ[X]).roots.toFinset
  have u2 := Finset.card_union_le (derivative F - C τ : ℝ[X]).roots.toFinset
    (derivative F + C τ : ℝ[X]).roots.toFinset
  have e1 := (Multiset.toFinset_card_le (derivative F - C τ : ℝ[X]).roots).trans
    ((card_roots' _).trans h1)
  have e2 := (Multiset.toFinset_card_le (derivative F + C τ : ℝ[X]).roots).trans
    ((card_roots' _).trans h2)
  have e3 := (Multiset.toFinset_card_le (derivative (derivative F) : ℝ[X]).roots).trans
    ((card_roots' _).trans hD2)
  omega

/-- The estimate on one interval `[p, q] ⊆ [α, β]` containing no splitting point in its interior:
either `|F'| > τ` throughout (integration by parts) or `|F'| ≤ τ` throughout (trivial bound). -/
lemma osc_piece_le {F : ℝ[X]} {τ α β M : ℝ} (hτ : 0 < τ) {a a' : ℝ → ℂ}
    (ha : ContinuousOn a (Icc α β)) (ha' : ∀ t ∈ Ioo α β, HasDerivAt a (a' t) t)
    (hai : IntervalIntegrable a' volume α β) (hM : ∀ t ∈ Icc α β, ‖a t‖ ≤ M)
    {p q : ℝ} (hαp : α ≤ p) (hpq : p ≤ q) (hqβ : q ≤ β)
    (hS : ∀ s ∈ oscSplitPoints F τ, s ∉ Ioo p q) :
    ‖∫ t in p..q, eC (F.eval t) * a t‖
      ≤ 4 * (M + ∫ t in p..q, ‖a' t‖) * τ⁻¹
        + M * volume.real ({t | |(derivative F).eval t| ≤ τ} ∩ Ioc p q) := by
  have hsub : Icc p q ⊆ Icc α β := Icc_subset_Icc hαp hqβ
  have hMnn : 0 ≤ M := le_trans (norm_nonneg _) (hM p (hsub ⟨le_rfl, hpq⟩))
  have hIpq : 0 ≤ ∫ t in p..q, ‖a' t‖ :=
    intervalIntegral.integral_nonneg hpq (fun t _ => norm_nonneg _)
  have hVnn : 0 ≤ volume.real ({t | |(derivative F).eval t| ≤ τ} ∩ Ioc p q) :=
    measureReal_nonneg
  have hτi : 0 ≤ τ⁻¹ := inv_nonneg.2 hτ.le
  rcases hpq.eq_or_lt with hpq' | hpq'
  · subst hpq'
    rw [intervalIntegral.integral_same, norm_zero]
    positivity
  set D := derivative F with hDdef
  set D2 := derivative D with hD2def
  have hroot : ∀ g ∈ [D - C τ, D + C τ, D2], ∀ x ∈ Ioo p q, x ∉ g.roots := by
    intro g hg x hx hxg
    have hg0 : g ≠ 0 := fun h => by rw [h, roots_zero] at hxg; simp at hxg
    refine hS x ?_ hx
    unfold oscSplitPoints
    simp only [List.mem_cons, List.not_mem_nil, or_false] at hg
    rcases hg with rfl | rfl | rfl
    · exact Finset.mem_union_left _ (Finset.mem_union_left _ (Multiset.mem_toFinset.2 hxg))
    · exact Finset.mem_union_left _ (Finset.mem_union_right _ (Multiset.mem_toFinset.2 hxg))
    · exact Finset.mem_union_right _ (Multiset.mem_toFinset.2 hxg)
  have hr1 := hroot (D - C τ) (by simp)
  have hr2 := hroot (D + C τ) (by simp)
  have hr3 := hroot D2 (by simp)
  have hDc : Continuous fun t => |D.eval t| := continuous_abs.comp D.continuous
  by_cases hA : ∃ t0 ∈ Ioo p q, τ < |D.eval t0|
  · obtain ⟨t0, ht0, hτt0⟩ := hA
    have hall : ∀ t ∈ Ioo p q, τ ≤ |D.eval t| := by
      intro t ht
      rcases lt_abs.1 hτt0 with h | h
      · have := osc_poly_pos_of_no_root _ hr1 ht0 ht (by rw [eval_sub, eval_C]; linarith)
        rw [eval_sub, eval_C] at this
        exact le_trans (by linarith) (le_abs_self _)
      · have := osc_poly_neg_of_no_root _ hr2 ht0 ht (by rw [eval_add, eval_C]; linarith)
        rw [eval_add, eval_C] at this
        exact le_trans (by linarith) (neg_le_abs _)
    have hlow := osc_le_on_Icc_of_Ioo continuous_const hDc hpq' hall
    have hmid : (p + q) / 2 ∈ Ioo p q := ⟨by linarith, by linarith⟩
    have hsign : ∃ σ : ℝ, |σ| = 1 ∧ ∀ t ∈ Icc p q, 0 ≤ σ * D2.eval t := by
      rcases lt_trichotomy (D2.eval ((p + q) / 2)) 0 with h | h | h
      · refine ⟨-1, by simp, ?_⟩
        have hn : ∀ t ∈ Ioo p q, D2.eval t ≤ 0 := fun t ht =>
          (osc_poly_neg_of_no_root _ hr3 hmid ht h).le
        intro t ht
        have := osc_le_on_Icc_of_Ioo D2.continuous continuous_const hpq' hn t ht
        linarith
      · have hD20 : D2 = 0 := by
          by_contra hne
          exact hr3 _ hmid ((mem_roots hne).2 h)
        refine ⟨1, by simp, fun t _ => by rw [hD20]; simp⟩
      · refine ⟨1, by simp, ?_⟩
        have hn : ∀ t ∈ Ioo p q, 0 ≤ D2.eval t := fun t ht =>
          (osc_poly_pos_of_no_root _ hr3 hmid ht h).le
        intro t ht
        have := osc_le_on_Icc_of_Ioo continuous_const D2.continuous hpq' hn t ht
        linarith
    obtain ⟨σ, hσ, hσs⟩ := hsign
    have h := osc_norm_integral_ibp (φ := fun t => F.eval t) (φ1 := fun t => D.eval t)
      (φ2 := fun t => D2.eval t) hpq hτ hσ (fun t => F.hasDerivAt t) (fun t => D.hasDerivAt t)
      D2.continuous hlow hσs (ha.mono hsub)
      (fun t ht => ha' t (Ioo_subset_Ioo hαp hqβ ht))
      (hai.mono_set (by rw [uIcc_of_le hpq, uIcc_of_le (hαp.trans (hpq.trans hqβ))]; exact hsub))
      (fun t ht => hM t (hsub ht))
    refine h.trans ?_
    rw [div_eq_mul_inv]
    nlinarith [mul_nonneg hMnn hVnn, mul_nonneg hMnn hτi]
  · push Not at hA
    have hall := osc_le_on_Icc_of_Ioo hDc continuous_const hpq' hA
    have hV : volume.real ({t | |D.eval t| ≤ τ} ∩ Ioc p q) = q - p := by
      have hset : {t | |D.eval t| ≤ τ} ∩ Ioc p q = Ioc p q :=
        inter_eq_right.2 (fun t ht => hall t (Ioc_subset_Icc_self ht))
      rw [hset, Real.volume_real_Ioc_of_le hpq]
    rw [hV]
    have h : ‖∫ t in p..q, eC (F.eval t) * a t‖ ≤ M * |q - p| := by
      refine intervalIntegral.norm_integral_le_of_norm_le_const (fun t ht => ?_)
      rw [uIoc_of_le hpq] at ht
      rw [norm_mul, osc_norm_eC, one_mul]
      exact hM t (hsub (Ioc_subset_Icc_self ht))
    rw [abs_of_nonneg (by linarith)] at h
    refine h.trans ?_
    have : 0 ≤ 4 * (M + ∫ t in p..q, ‖a' t‖) * τ⁻¹ := by positivity
    linarith

/-- Induction on the number of splitting points in `(p, q)`: with `n` of them the integral over
`[p, q]` is at most `(n + 1)` times the one-piece bound, plus `M |{|F'| ≤ τ} ∩ (p, q]|`. -/
lemma osc_pieces_le {F : ℝ[X]} {τ α β M : ℝ} (hτ : 0 < τ) {a a' : ℝ → ℂ}
    (ha : ContinuousOn a (Icc α β)) (ha' : ∀ t ∈ Ioo α β, HasDerivAt a (a' t) t)
    (hai : IntervalIntegrable a' volume α β) (hM : ∀ t ∈ Icc α β, ‖a t‖ ≤ M) :
    ∀ n : ℕ, ∀ p q : ℝ, α ≤ p → p ≤ q → q ≤ β →
      ((oscSplitPoints F τ).filter (· ∈ Ioo p q)).card = n →
      ‖∫ t in p..q, eC (F.eval t) * a t‖
        ≤ (n + 1) * (4 * (M + ∫ t in p..q, ‖a' t‖) * τ⁻¹)
          + M * volume.real ({t | |(derivative F).eval t| ≤ τ} ∩ Ioc p q) := by
  classical
  intro n
  induction n using Nat.strong_induction_on with
  | _ n ih =>
  intro p q hαp hpq hqβ hcard
  set S := oscSplitPoints F τ
  set E := {t | |(derivative F).eval t| ≤ τ} with hEdef
  have hτi : 0 ≤ τ⁻¹ := inv_nonneg.2 hτ.le
  have hMnn : 0 ≤ M := le_trans (norm_nonneg _) (hM p ⟨hαp, hpq.trans hqβ⟩)
  by_cases hS : ∃ s ∈ S, s ∈ Ioo p q
  · obtain ⟨s, hsS, hs⟩ := hS
    set A := S.filter (· ∈ Ioo p s)
    set B := S.filter (· ∈ Ioo s q)
    have hdisj : Disjoint A B := by
      rw [Finset.disjoint_left]
      intro x hxA hxB
      have h1 := (Finset.mem_filter.1 hxA).2
      have h2 := (Finset.mem_filter.1 hxB).2
      exact absurd (h1.2.trans h2.1) (lt_irrefl _)
    have hsAB : s ∉ A ∪ B := by
      intro h
      rcases Finset.mem_union.1 h with h | h
      · exact lt_irrefl _ (Finset.mem_filter.1 h).2.2
      · exact lt_irrefl _ (Finset.mem_filter.1 h).2.1
    have hsubAB : insert s (A ∪ B) ⊆ S.filter (· ∈ Ioo p q) := by
      intro x hx
      rw [Finset.mem_insert] at hx
      rcases hx with rfl | hx
      · exact Finset.mem_filter.2 ⟨hsS, hs⟩
      · rcases Finset.mem_union.1 hx with h | h
        · obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := Finset.mem_filter.1 h
          exact Finset.mem_filter.2 ⟨h1, h2.1, h2.2.trans hs.2⟩
        · obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := Finset.mem_filter.1 h
          exact Finset.mem_filter.2 ⟨h1, hs.1.trans h2.1, h2.2⟩
    have hcardAB : A.card + B.card + 1 ≤ n := by
      have := Finset.card_le_card hsubAB
      rw [Finset.card_insert_of_notMem hsAB, Finset.card_union_of_disjoint hdisj, hcard] at this
      exact this
    have hps : p ≤ s := hs.1.le
    have hsq : s ≤ q := hs.2.le
    have ihA := ih A.card (by omega) p s hαp hps (hsq.trans hqβ) rfl
    have ihB := ih B.card (by omega) s q (hαp.trans hps) hsq hqβ rfl
    -- additivity of the three quantities
    have hfi : ∀ p' q', α ≤ p' → p' ≤ q' → q' ≤ β →
        IntervalIntegrable (fun t => eC (F.eval t) * a t) volume p' q' := by
      intro p' q' h1 h2 h3
      refine ContinuousOn.intervalIntegrable ?_
      rw [uIcc_of_le h2]
      refine ContinuousOn.mul ?_ (ha.mono (Icc_subset_Icc h1 h3))
      exact (Complex.continuous_exp.comp (continuous_const.mul
        (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp F.continuous))).continuousOn
    have hgi : ∀ p' q', α ≤ p' → p' ≤ q' → q' ≤ β →
        IntervalIntegrable (fun t => ‖a' t‖) volume p' q' := by
      intro p' q' h1 h2 h3
      refine hai.norm.mono_set ?_
      rw [uIcc_of_le h2, uIcc_of_le (h1.trans (h2.trans h3))]
      exact Icc_subset_Icc h1 h3
    have hsplit1 := intervalIntegral.integral_add_adjacent_intervals
      (hfi p s hαp hps (hsq.trans hqβ)) (hfi s q (hαp.trans hps) hsq hqβ)
    have hsplit2 := intervalIntegral.integral_add_adjacent_intervals
      (hgi p s hαp hps (hsq.trans hqβ)) (hgi s q (hαp.trans hps) hsq hqβ)
    have hEm : MeasurableSet E :=
      (isClosed_le (continuous_abs.comp (derivative F).continuous) continuous_const).measurableSet
    have hsplit3 : volume.real (E ∩ Ioc p q)
        = volume.real (E ∩ Ioc p s) + volume.real (E ∩ Ioc s q) := by
      rw [← Ioc_union_Ioc_eq_Ioc hps hsq, inter_union_distrib_left]
      refine measureReal_union ?_ (hEm.inter measurableSet_Ioc)
        (measure_ne_top_of_subset inter_subset_right (by simp))
        (measure_ne_top_of_subset inter_subset_right (by simp))
      exact (Ioc_disjoint_Ioc_of_le le_rfl).mono inter_subset_right inter_subset_right
    rw [← hsplit1, ← hsplit2, hsplit3]
    refine (norm_add_le _ _).trans ?_
    have hI1 : 0 ≤ ∫ t in p..s, ‖a' t‖ :=
      intervalIntegral.integral_nonneg hps (fun t _ => norm_nonneg _)
    have hI2 : 0 ≤ ∫ t in s..q, ‖a' t‖ :=
      intervalIntegral.integral_nonneg hsq (fun t _ => norm_nonneg _)
    set I1 := ∫ t in p..s, ‖a' t‖
    set I2 := ∫ t in s..q, ‖a' t‖
    have hk : ((A.card : ℝ) + B.card + 1) ≤ n := by exact_mod_cast hcardAB
    have hkA : (0 : ℝ) ≤ A.card := Nat.cast_nonneg _
    have hkB : (0 : ℝ) ≤ B.card := Nat.cast_nonneg _
    have key : ((A.card : ℝ) + 1) * (M + I1) + ((B.card : ℝ) + 1) * (M + I2)
        ≤ ((n : ℝ) + 1) * (M + (I1 + I2)) := by
      nlinarith [mul_nonneg (by linarith : (0 : ℝ) ≤ n - A.card - B.card - 1) hMnn,
        mul_nonneg (by linarith : (0 : ℝ) ≤ n - A.card) hI1,
        mul_nonneg (by linarith : (0 : ℝ) ≤ n - B.card) hI2]
    have key' := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right key (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 4 * τ⁻¹)
    nlinarith
  · push Not at hS
    have h := osc_piece_le hτ ha ha' hai hM hαp hpq hqβ (fun s hs hs' => hS s hs hs')
    refine h.trans ?_
    have h0 : 0 ≤ 4 * (M + ∫ t in p..q, ‖a' t‖) * τ⁻¹ := by
      have : 0 ≤ ∫ t in p..q, ‖a' t‖ :=
        intervalIntegral.integral_nonneg hpq (fun t _ => norm_nonneg _)
      positivity
    have hn : (0 : ℝ) ≤ n := Nat.cast_nonneg _
    nlinarith

/-- **One-dimensional oscillatory integral estimate.** Blueprint Lemma 5.1 (`lem:oscint`), first
assertion: for `m ≥ 2` and a bounded interval `[α, β]` there is `C = C(m, α, β) > 0` such that for
every real polynomial `F(t) = ∑_{k ≤ m} a_k t^k` of degree at most `m` with some coefficient
`|a_k| ≥ L ≥ 1`, `k ≥ 1` (in particular when `L = max_{1 ≤ k ≤ m} |a_k| ≥ 1`), and every amplitude
`a` continuous on `[α, β]`, differentiable on `(α, β)` with integrable derivative `a'` and
`|a| ≤ M` on `[α, β]`,
`|∫_α^β e(F(t)) a(t) dt| ≤ C L^{-1/m} (M + ∫_α^β |a'|)`.
The amplitude need not vanish at the endpoints (boundary terms are included). -/
theorem norm_integral_eC_poly_mul_le (m : ℕ) (hm : 2 ≤ m) (α β : ℝ) (hαβ : α ≤ β) :
    ∃ C > 0, ∀ (F : ℝ[X]) (L M : ℝ) (a a' : ℝ → ℂ), F.natDegree ≤ m → 1 ≤ L →
      (∃ k, 1 ≤ k ∧ L ≤ |F.coeff k|) → ContinuousOn a (Icc α β) →
      (∀ t ∈ Ioo α β, HasDerivAt a (a' t) t) → IntervalIntegrable a' volume α β →
      (∀ t ∈ Icc α β, ‖a t‖ ≤ M) →
      ‖∫ t in α..β, eC (F.eval t) * a t‖
        ≤ C * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * (M + ∫ t in α..β, ‖a' t‖) := by
  obtain ⟨C1, hC1, hsub⟩ := volume_sublevel_poly_le m hm α β
  refine ⟨4 * (3 * m + 1) + C1, by positivity, ?_⟩
  intro F L M a a' hF hL ⟨k, hk1, hk⟩ ha ha' hai hM
  have hLpos : 0 < L := by linarith
  have hmpos : (0 : ℝ) < m := by exact_mod_cast (by omega : 0 < m)
  set τ := L ^ (1 / (m : ℝ)) with hτdef
  have hτ : 0 < τ := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hLpos _
  have hMnn : 0 ≤ M := le_trans (norm_nonneg _) (hM α ⟨le_rfl, hαβ⟩)
  have hI : 0 ≤ ∫ t in α..β, ‖a' t‖ :=
    intervalIntegral.integral_nonneg hαβ (fun t _ => norm_nonneg _)
  set Lm := L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) with hLm
  have hLmpos : 0 < Lm := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hLpos _
  have hτinv : τ⁻¹ = Lm := by rw [hLm, Real.rpow_neg hLpos.le]
  -- the sublevel set of `F'`
  set D := derivative F
  have hDdeg : D.natDegree ≤ m - 1 := (natDegree_derivative_le F).trans (by omega)
  have hDcoeff : ∃ k', L ≤ |D.coeff k'| := by
    refine ⟨k - 1, ?_⟩
    rw [coeff_derivative, Nat.sub_add_cancel hk1, abs_mul]
    have hk' : (1 : ℝ) ≤ |((k - 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) + 1| := by
      rw [abs_of_nonneg (by positivity)]; linarith [(Nat.cast_nonneg (k - 1) : (0 : ℝ) ≤ _)]
    nlinarith [abs_nonneg (F.coeff k)]
  have hvol := hsub D L τ hLpos hτ.le hDdeg hDcoeff
  have hexp : (τ / L) ^ ((m : ℝ) - 1)⁻¹ = Lm := by
    have hm1 : (m : ℝ) - 1 ≠ 0 := by
      have : (2 : ℝ) ≤ m := by exact_mod_cast hm
      linarith
    rw [hτdef, ← Real.rpow_sub_one hLpos.ne', ← Real.rpow_mul hLpos.le, hLm]
    congr 1
    field_simp
    ring
  rw [hexp] at hvol
  have hV : volume.real ({t | |D.eval t| ≤ τ} ∩ Ioc α β) ≤ C1 * Lm := by
    rw [measureReal_def]
    refine ENNReal.toReal_le_of_le_ofReal (by positivity) ((measure_mono ?_).trans hvol)
    intro t ⟨h1, h2⟩
    exact ⟨Ioc_subset_Icc_self h2, h1⟩
  have hpieces := osc_pieces_le (F := F) hτ ha ha' hai hM _ α β le_rfl hαβ le_rfl rfl
  have hn : (((oscSplitPoints F τ).filter (· ∈ Ioo α β)).card : ℝ) ≤ 3 * m := by
    have := (Finset.card_filter_le (oscSplitPoints F τ) (· ∈ Ioo α β)).trans
      (card_oscSplitPoints_le F τ hF)
    exact_mod_cast this
  rw [hτinv] at hpieces
  refine hpieces.trans ?_
  have h1 : ((((oscSplitPoints F τ).filter (· ∈ Ioo α β)).card : ℝ) + 1)
      * (4 * (M + ∫ t in α..β, ‖a' t‖) * Lm)
      ≤ (3 * m + 1) * (4 * (M + ∫ t in α..β, ‖a' t‖) * Lm) :=
    mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (by linarith) (by positivity)
  have h2 : M * volume.real ({t | |D.eval t| ≤ τ} ∩ Ioc α β) ≤ M * (C1 * Lm) :=
    mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hV hMnn
  have h3 : M * (C1 * Lm) ≤ C1 * Lm * (M + ∫ t in α..β, ‖a' t‖) := by
    nlinarith [mul_nonneg (mul_nonneg hC1.le hLmpos.le) hI]
  nlinarith

/-! ### The box version -/

/-- **Oscillatory integral over a box, one coordinate at a time.** Blueprint Lemma 5.1
(`lem:oscint`), second assertion: fix `m ≥ 2`, `n` and `c > 0`, and let
`B = {x ∈ E : |x_j| ≤ c for all j}` with `E = EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)`. There is
`C = C(m, n, c) > 0` such that for every coordinate `i`, every phase `F : E → ℝ` whose restriction
to each `i`-slice through `B`, `t ↦ F(x with x_i := t)`, is a real polynomial of degree at most `m`
having some coefficient of index `k ≥ 1` of modulus at least `L ≥ 1` (the index may depend on the
slice), and every amplitude `A : E → ℂ` which on each such slice is continuous on `[-c, c]`,
differentiable on `(-c, c)` with integrable derivative `A'`, with `|A| ≤ M` on `B` and
`∫_{-c}^{c} |A'(x with x_i := t)| dt ≤ M` for each slice:
`|∫_B e(F(x)) A(x) dx| ≤ C L^{-1/m} M`.
No integrability hypothesis is needed (a non-integrable integrand has integral `0`). -/
theorem norm_setIntegral_box_eC_mul_le (n m : ℕ) (hm : 2 ≤ m) (c : ℝ) (hc : 0 < c) :
    ∃ C > 0, ∀ (i : Fin n) (F : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ)
      (A A' : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (L M : ℝ), 1 ≤ L →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) →
        ∃ P : ℝ[X], P.natDegree ≤ m ∧ (∃ k, 1 ≤ k ∧ L ≤ |P.coeff k|) ∧
          ∀ t, F (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t)) = P.eval t) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) →
        ContinuousOn (fun t => A (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t)))
          (Icc (-c) c)) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) → ∀ t ∈ Ioo (-c) c,
        HasDerivAt (fun s => A (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i s)))
          (A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t))) t) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) →
        IntervalIntegrable (fun t => A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t)))
          volume (-c) c) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) → ‖A x‖ ≤ M) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) →
        ∫ t in (-c)..c, ‖A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t))‖ ≤ M) →
      ‖∫ x in {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) | ∀ j, |x j| ≤ c}, eC (F x) * A x‖
        ≤ C * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * M := by
  obtain ⟨C1, hC1, h1D⟩ := norm_integral_eC_poly_mul_le m hm (-c) c (by linarith)
  refine ⟨2 * C1 * (2 * c) ^ (n - 1), by positivity, ?_⟩
  intro i F A A' L M hL hF hAc hAd hAi hM hA'
  set B := {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) | ∀ j, |x j| ≤ c} with hBdef
  have h0B : (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ∈ B := fun j => by simp [hc.le]
  have hMnn : 0 ≤ M := le_trans (norm_nonneg _) (hM 0 h0B)
  have hLpos : 0 < L := by linarith
  have hLm : 0 < L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hLpos _
  by_cases hint : IntegrableOn (fun x => eC (F x) * A x) B volume
  swap
  · rw [integral_undef hint, norm_zero]; positivity
  obtain ⟨n', rfl⟩ : ∃ n', n = n' + 1 := ⟨n - 1, by have := i.pos; omega⟩
  rw [Nat.add_sub_cancel]
  set box' : Set (Fin n' → ℝ) := Icc (fun _ => -c) (fun _ => c) with hbox'
  set Φ : ℝ × (Fin n' → ℝ) ≃ᵐ EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin (n' + 1)) :=
    (MeasurableEquiv.piFinSuccAbove (fun _ => ℝ) i).symm.trans
      (MeasurableEquiv.toLp 2 (Fin (n' + 1) → ℝ)) with hΦdef
  have hΦapp : ∀ z : ℝ × (Fin n' → ℝ), Φ z = WithLp.toLp 2 (Fin.insertNth i z.1 z.2) := by
    intro z; rfl
  have hΦ : MeasurePreserving Φ ((volume : Measure ℝ).prod (volume : Measure (Fin n' → ℝ)))
      volume := by
    have h1 := (volume_preserving_piFinSuccAbove (fun _ : Fin (n' + 1) => ℝ) i).symm
    have h2 := (EuclideanSpace.volume_preserving_symm_measurableEquiv_toLp (Fin (n' + 1))).symm
    exact h2.comp h1
  have hpre : Φ ⁻¹' B = Icc (-c) c ×ˢ box' := by
    ext ⟨t, y⟩
    simp only [mem_preimage, hΦapp, hBdef, mem_ofPred_eq, mem_prod, hbox', mem_Icc]
    rw [Fin.forall_iff_succAbove i]
    simp only [Fin.insertNth_apply_same, Fin.insertNth_apply_succAbove, abs_le,
      Pi.le_def]
    constructor
    · rintro ⟨h1, h2⟩
      exact ⟨h1, fun j => (h2 j).1, fun j => (h2 j).2⟩
    · rintro ⟨h1, h2, h3⟩
      exact ⟨h1, fun j => ⟨h2 j, h3 j⟩⟩
  set f : ℝ × (Fin n' → ℝ) → ℂ := fun z => eC (F (Φ z)) * A (Φ z) with hfdef
  have hint' : Integrable f ((volume.restrict (Icc (-c) c)).prod (volume.restrict box')) := by
    rw [Measure.prod_restrict, ← hpre]
    exact ((hΦ.restrict_preimage_emb Φ.measurableEmbedding B).integrable_comp_emb
      Φ.measurableEmbedding).2 hint
  rw [← hΦ.setIntegral_preimage_emb Φ.measurableEmbedding, hpre, ← Measure.prod_restrict,
    integral_prod_symm _ hint']
  -- the slice estimate
  have hslice : ∀ y ∈ box',
      ‖∫ t in Icc (-c) c, f (t, y)‖ ≤ 2 * C1 * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * M := by
    intro y hy
    set x0 := Φ (0, y) with hx0
    have hmemB : ∀ t ∈ Icc (-c) c, Φ (t, y) ∈ B := fun t ht => by
      rw [← mem_preimage, hpre]; exact ⟨ht, hy⟩
    have hx0B : x0 ∈ B := hmemB 0 ⟨by linarith, hc.le⟩
    have hsl : ∀ t, WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x0) i t) = Φ (t, y) := by
      intro t
      rw [hx0, hΦapp, hΦapp, WithLp.ofLp_toLp, Fin.update_insertNth]
    obtain ⟨P, hPdeg, hPk, hPeq⟩ := hF x0 hx0B
    have hAc0 := hAc x0 hx0B
    have hAd0 := hAd x0 hx0B
    have hAi0 := hAi x0 hx0B
    have hA'0 := hA' x0 hx0B
    simp only [hsl] at hAc0 hAd0 hAi0 hA'0
    have h := h1D P L M (fun t => A (Φ (t, y))) (fun t => A' (Φ (t, y))) hPdeg hL hPk hAc0 hAd0
      hAi0 (fun t ht => hM _ (hmemB t ht))
    have hfeq : ∫ t in Icc (-c) c, f (t, y) = ∫ t in (-c)..c, eC (P.eval t) * A (Φ (t, y)) := by
      rw [intervalIntegral.integral_of_le (by linarith), integral_Icc_eq_integral_Ioc]
      refine setIntegral_congr_fun measurableSet_Ioc (fun t _ => ?_)
      simp only [hfdef]
      rw [← hsl t, hPeq t]
    rw [hfeq]
    refine h.trans ?_
    have : M + ∫ t in (-c)..c, ‖A' (Φ (t, y))‖ ≤ 2 * M := by linarith
    calc C1 * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * (M + ∫ t in (-c)..c, ‖A' (Φ (t, y))‖)
        ≤ C1 * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * (2 * M) := by gcongr
      _ = 2 * C1 * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * M := by ring
  have hvol : volume box' < ⊤ := by
    rw [hbox', Real.volume_Icc_pi]
    exact ENNReal.prod_lt_top (fun _ _ => ENNReal.ofReal_lt_top)
  have hvolr : volume.real box' = (2 * c) ^ n' := by
    rw [measureReal_def, hbox', Real.volume_Icc_pi_toReal (fun _ => by linarith),
      Finset.prod_const, Finset.card_univ, Fintype.card_fin]
    ring_nf
  refine (norm_setIntegral_le_of_norm_le_const hvol hslice).trans ?_
  rw [hvolr]
  apply le_of_eq
  ring

/-! ### Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): radial Fourier estimates (nonstationary regions) -/

section RadialFourier

open Metric
open scoped ContDiff RealInnerProductSpace FourierTransform

variable {n : ℕ}

/-- Helper: `e'(x) = 2πi e(x)`. -/
lemma osc_hasDerivAt_eC (x : ℝ) : HasDerivAt eC (2 * π * Complex.I * eC x) x := by
  have h : HasDerivAt (fun t : ℝ => 2 * π * Complex.I * (t : ℂ)) (2 * π * Complex.I) x := by
    simpa using (Complex.ofRealCLM.hasDerivAt (x := x)).const_mul (2 * π * Complex.I)
  have := h.cexp
  change HasDerivAt (fun t : ℝ => Complex.exp (2 * π * Complex.I * t)) _ x
  convert this using 1
  simp only [eC]; ring

/-- Helper: `e` is smooth. -/
lemma osc_contDiff_eC : ContDiff ℝ ∞ eC := by
  change ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun t : ℝ => Complex.exp (2 * π * Complex.I * t))
  exact Complex.contDiff_exp.comp (contDiff_const.mul Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff)

/-- Helper: a continuous function vanishing off a compact set is integrable. -/
lemma osc_integrable_of_vanish {h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hc : Continuous h)
    {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))} (hS : IsCompact S) (hv : ∀ z, z ∉ S → h z = 0) :
    Integrable h :=
  hc.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport (HasCompactSupport.intro hS hv)

/-- Helper: a function vanishing off a closed set has vanishing derivative off that set. -/
lemma osc_fderiv_eq_zero_of_vanish {E F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [NormedSpace ℝ E]
    [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℝ F] {g : E → F} {S : Set E} (hS : IsClosed S)
    (hgS : ∀ z, z ∉ S → g z = 0) {z : E} (hz : z ∉ S) : fderiv ℝ g z = 0 := by
  have : g =ᶠ[nhds z] fun _ => 0 := by
    filter_upwards [hS.isOpen_compl.mem_nhds hz] with y hy using hgS y hy
  rw [this.fderiv_eq, fderiv_const_apply]

/-- A smooth substitute for the reciprocal: `oscRecip δ y = 1/y` for `|y| ≥ δ`. -/
noncomputable def oscRecip (δ y : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  y / (y ^ 2 + δ ^ 2 * smoothTransition (1 - y ^ 2 / δ ^ 2))

/-- Helper: the denominator of `oscRecip` is positive. -/
lemma oscRecip_denom_pos {δ : ℝ} (hδ : 0 < δ) (y : ℝ) :
    0 < y ^ 2 + δ ^ 2 * smoothTransition (1 - y ^ 2 / δ ^ 2) := by
  rcases eq_or_ne y 0 with rfl | hy
  · rw [smoothTransition.one_of_one_le (x := 1 - 0 ^ 2 / δ ^ 2) (by simp)]; positivity
  · have := smoothTransition.nonneg (1 - y ^ 2 / δ ^ 2); positivity

/-- Helper: `oscRecip δ` is smooth. -/
lemma contDiff_oscRecip {δ : ℝ} (hδ : 0 < δ) : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (oscRecip δ) := by
  change ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun y : ℝ => y / (y ^ 2 + δ ^ 2 * smoothTransition (1 - y ^ 2 / δ ^ 2)))
  exact contDiff_id.div ((contDiff_id.pow 2).add (contDiff_const.mul
    (smoothTransition.contDiff.comp (contDiff_const.sub ((contDiff_id.pow 2).div_const _)))))
    (fun y => (oscRecip_denom_pos hδ y).ne')

/-- Helper: `oscRecip δ y * y = 1` for `|y| ≥ δ`. -/
lemma oscRecip_mul_self {δ y : ℝ} (hδ : 0 < δ) (hy : δ ≤ |y|) : oscRecip δ y * y = 1 := by
  have hy2 : δ ^ 2 ≤ y ^ 2 := by nlinarith [abs_nonneg y, sq_abs y]
  have h0 : smoothTransition (1 - y ^ 2 / δ ^ 2) = 0 :=
    smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by rw [sub_nonpos, one_le_div (by positivity)]; exact hy2)
  have : y ≠ 0 := by intro h; rw [h, abs_zero] at hy; linarith
  rw [oscRecip, h0, mul_zero, add_zero]; field_simp

/-- Helper: integration by parts against the affine vector field `v(z) = α z + b`, whose
divergence is `α n`. -/
lemma osc_integral_fderiv_affine_mul {f G : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (hf : ContDiff ℝ 1 f) (hG : ContDiff ℝ 1 G) {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))}
    (hS : IsCompact S) (hGS : ∀ z, z ∉ S → G z = 0) (α : ℝ) (b : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ∫ z, fderiv ℝ f z (α • z + b) * G z =
      -∫ z, f z * (fderiv ℝ G z (α • z + b) + ((α * n : ℝ) : ℂ) * G z) := by
  set e : Fin n → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) := fun i => EuclideanSpace.single i 1 with he
  have hdecomp : ∀ z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), α • z + b = ∑ i, (α * z i) • e i + b := by
    intro z
    have := (EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ).sum_repr z
    nth_rewrite 1 [← this]
    simp [he, Finset.smul_sum, smul_smul]
  -- the coordinate multipliers
  let L : Fin n → (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) →L[ℝ] ℂ) := fun i =>
    Complex.ofRealCLM.comp (α • (EuclideanSpace.proj i : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) →L[ℝ] ℝ))
  have hL : ∀ i z, L i z = ((α * z i : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
    intro i z; simp [L]
  have hGd : ∀ z, HasFDerivAt G (fderiv ℝ G z) z :=
    fun z => (hG.differentiable one_ne_zero z).hasFDerivAt
  have hcf := hf.continuous_fderiv one_ne_zero
  have hcG := hG.continuous_fderiv one_ne_zero
  have hgi : ∀ i z, HasFDerivAt (fun y => L i y * G y) (L i z • fderiv ℝ G z + G z • L i) z :=
    fun i z => (L i).hasFDerivAt.mul (hGd z)
  have hgi' : ∀ i z, fderiv ℝ (fun y => L i y * G y) z (e i) = α * G z +
      ((α * z i : ℝ) : ℂ) * fderiv ℝ G z (e i) := by
    intro i z
    rw [(hgi i z).fderiv]
    simp [he, L]
    ring
  have hgiC : ∀ i, ContDiff ℝ 1 (fun y => L i y * G y) := fun i => (L i).contDiff.mul hG
  have hgiS : ∀ i z, z ∉ S → L i z * G z = 0 := fun i z hz => by simp [hGS z hz]
  have hint : ∀ (u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ), Continuous u →
      ∀ (g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ), Continuous g →
      (∀ z, z ∉ S → g z = 0) → Integrable (fun z => u z * g z) := by
    intro u hu g hg hgS
    exact osc_integrable_of_vanish (hu.mul hg) hS (fun z hz => by simp [hgS z hz])
  have hint' : ∀ (g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ), ContDiff ℝ 1 g →
      (∀ z, z ∉ S → g z = 0) → ∀ v, Integrable (fun z => f z * fderiv ℝ g z v) := by
    intro g hg hgS v
    refine hint f hf.continuous _ ((hg.continuous_fderiv one_ne_zero).clm_apply
      continuous_const) ?_
    intro z hz; simp [osc_fderiv_eq_zero_of_vanish hS.isClosed hgS hz]
  have hibp : ∀ (g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ), ContDiff ℝ 1 g → (∀ z, z ∉ S → g z = 0) →
      ∀ v, ∫ z, fderiv ℝ f z v * g z = -∫ z, f z * fderiv ℝ g z v := by
    intro g hg hgS v
    rw [integral_mul_fderiv_eq_neg_fderiv_mul_of_integrable, neg_neg]
    · exact hint _ ((hcf.clm_apply continuous_const)) g hg.continuous hgS
    · exact hint' g hg hgS v
    · exact hint f hf.continuous g hg.continuous hgS
    · exact fun z _ => hf.differentiable one_ne_zero z
    · exact fun z _ => hg.differentiable one_ne_zero z
  have h1 : ∀ z, fderiv ℝ f z (α • z + b) * G z =
      ∑ i, fderiv ℝ f z (e i) * (L i z * G z) + fderiv ℝ f z b * G z := by
    intro z
    rw [hdecomp z, map_add, map_sum, add_mul, Finset.sum_mul]
    congr 1
    refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun i _ => ?_
    rw [map_smul, hL, Complex.real_smul]; ring
  have h2 : ∀ z, f z * (fderiv ℝ G z (α • z + b) + ((α * n : ℝ) : ℂ) * G z) =
      ∑ i, f z * fderiv ℝ (fun y => L i y * G y) z (e i) + f z * fderiv ℝ G z b := by
    intro z
    simp_rw [hgi' _ z]
    rw [hdecomp z, map_add, map_sum, ← Finset.mul_sum, ← mul_add, Finset.sum_add_distrib]
    congr 1
    simp only [Finset.sum_const, Finset.card_univ, Fintype.card_fin, map_smul,
      Complex.real_smul, nsmul_eq_mul]
    push_cast; ring
  simp_rw [h1, h2]
  rw [integral_add, integral_finsetSum, integral_add, integral_finsetSum, hibp G hG hGS,
    neg_add, ← Finset.sum_neg_distrib]
  · congr 1
    refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun i _ => ?_
    exact hibp _ (hgiC i) (hgiS i) (e i)
  · exact fun i _ => hint' _ (hgiC i) (hgiS i) (e i)
  · exact integrable_finsetSum _ fun i _ => hint' _ (hgiC i) (hgiS i) (e i)
  · exact hint' G hG hGS b
  · exact fun i _ => hint _ (hcf.clm_apply continuous_const) _ (hgiC i).continuous (hgiS i)
  · exact integrable_finsetSum _ fun i _ =>
      hint _ (hcf.clm_apply continuous_const) _ (hgiC i).continuous (hgiS i)
  · exact hint _ (hcf.clm_apply continuous_const) G hG.continuous hGS

section Nonstationary

variable {P : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup P] [NormedSpace ℝ P]

/-- Helper for the integration-by-parts mechanism of Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`):
the derivative `w = ∂_v Φ_p(z)` of the phase `Φ_p = Φ(p, ·)` along the affine vector field
`v(z) = α z + b(p)`. -/
noncomputable def oscW (Φ : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ) (α : ℝ)
    (b : P → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ (fun z => Φ (q.1, z)) q.2 (α • q.2 + b q.1)

/-- Helper for Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): one integration by parts replaces the
amplitude `F` by `-(2πi)⁻¹ (∂_v (F/w) + (div v) F/w)` (with `1/w` smoothed off `|w| ≥ δ`). -/
noncomputable def oscStep (Φ : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ) (α : ℝ)
    (b : P → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (δ : ℝ) (F : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  -(2 * π * Complex.I)⁻¹ *
    (fderiv ℝ (fun z => F (q.1, z) * (oscRecip δ (oscW Φ α b (q.1, z)) : ℂ)) q.2
        (α • q.2 + b q.1) + ((α * n : ℝ) : ℂ) * (F q * (oscRecip δ (oscW Φ α b q) : ℂ)))

variable {Φ : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ} {α : ℝ} {b : P → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
  {δ : ℝ}

/-- Helper: `w` is smooth in `(p, z)`. -/
lemma contDiff_oscW (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (hb : ContDiff ℝ ∞ b) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (oscW Φ α b) := by
  have h1 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ fun q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
      fderiv ℝ (fun z => Φ (q.1, z)) q.2 :=
    ContDiff.fderiv (f := fun (q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) z => Φ (q.1, z))
      (g := Prod.snd) (hΦ.comp (contDiff_fst.fst.prodMk contDiff_snd)) contDiff_snd (by simp)
  exact h1.clm_apply ((contDiff_snd.const_smul α).add (hb.comp contDiff_fst))

/-- Helper: the new amplitude `oscStep F` is smooth. -/
lemma contDiff_oscStep (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (hb : ContDiff ℝ ∞ b) (hδ : 0 < δ)
    {F : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hF : ContDiff ℝ ∞ F) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (oscStep Φ α b δ F) := by
  have hg : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun q => (oscRecip δ (oscW Φ α b q) : ℂ)) :=
    Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.comp ((contDiff_oscRecip hδ).comp (contDiff_oscW hΦ hb))
  have h1 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ fun q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
      fderiv ℝ (fun z => F (q.1, z) * (oscRecip δ (oscW Φ α b (q.1, z)) : ℂ)) q.2 :=
    ContDiff.fderiv (f := fun (q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) z =>
        F (q.1, z) * (oscRecip δ (oscW Φ α b (q.1, z)) : ℂ))
      (g := Prod.snd) ((hF.mul hg).comp (contDiff_fst.fst.prodMk contDiff_snd)) contDiff_snd
      (by simp)
  exact contDiff_const.mul ((h1.clm_apply ((contDiff_snd.const_smul α).add
    (hb.comp contDiff_fst))).add (contDiff_const.mul (hF.mul hg)))

omit [NormedAddCommGroup P] [NormedSpace ℝ P] in
/-- Helper: `oscStep F` vanishes off `S` when `F` does. -/
lemma oscStep_vanish {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))} (hS : IsClosed S)
    {F : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hF : ∀ q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
      q.2 ∉ S → F q = 0) (q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (hq : q.2 ∉ S) :
    oscStep Φ α b δ F q = 0 := by
  rw [oscStep, osc_fderiv_eq_zero_of_vanish hS
    (g := fun z => F (q.1, z) * (oscRecip δ (oscW Φ α b (q.1, z)) : ℂ))
    (fun z hz => by simp [hF (q.1, z) hz]) hq, hF q hq]
  simp

/-- Helper: the iterated amplitudes are smooth and vanish off `S`. -/
lemma oscStep_iterate_props (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (hb : ContDiff ℝ ∞ b) (hδ : 0 < δ)
    {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))} (hS : IsClosed S)
    {F : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hF : ContDiff ℝ ∞ F)
    (hFS : ∀ q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), q.2 ∉ S → F q = 0) (m : ℕ) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ ((oscStep Φ α b δ)^[m] F) ∧
      ∀ q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), q.2 ∉ S → (oscStep Φ α b δ)^[m] F q = 0 := by
  induction m with
  | zero => exact ⟨hF, hFS⟩
  | succ m ih =>
    rw [Function.iterate_succ_apply']
    exact ⟨contDiff_oscStep hΦ hb hδ ih.1, oscStep_vanish hS ih.2⟩

/-- Helper: one integration by parts, `∫ e(λΦ_p) F_p = λ⁻¹ ∫ e(λΦ_p) (oscStep F)_p`. -/
lemma integral_oscStep (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (hb : ContDiff ℝ ∞ b) (hδ : 0 < δ)
    {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))} (hS : IsCompact S)
    {F : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hF : ContDiff ℝ ∞ F)
    (hFS : ∀ q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), q.2 ∉ S → F q = 0) (p : P)
    (hw : ∀ z ∈ S, δ ≤ |oscW Φ α b (p, z)|) {lam : ℝ} (hlam : lam ≠ 0) :
    ∫ z, eC (lam * Φ (p, z)) * F (p, z) =
      lam⁻¹ * ∫ z, eC (lam * Φ (p, z)) * oscStep Φ α b δ F (p, z) := by
  set G : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ :=
    fun z => F (p, z) * (oscRecip δ (oscW Φ α b (p, z)) : ℂ) with hG
  set f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun z => eC (lam * Φ (p, z)) with hfdef
  have hinc : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => (p, z)) :=
    contDiff_const.prodMk contDiff_id
  have hGc : ContDiff ℝ ∞ G := (hF.mul (Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.comp
    ((contDiff_oscRecip hδ).comp (contDiff_oscW hΦ hb)))).comp hinc
  have hGS : ∀ z, z ∉ S → G z = 0 := fun z hz => by simp [hG, hFS (p, z) hz]
  have hΦp : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun z => Φ (p, z)) := hΦ.comp hinc
  have hfc : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f := osc_contDiff_eC.comp (contDiff_const.mul hΦp)
  have hFeq : ∀ z, F (p, z) = (oscW Φ α b (p, z) : ℂ) * G z := by
    intro z
    by_cases hz : z ∈ S
    · have := oscRecip_mul_self hδ (hw z hz)
      simp only [hG]
      calc F (p, z) = F (p, z) *
          ((oscRecip δ (oscW Φ α b (p, z)) * oscW Φ α b (p, z) : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
            rw [this]; simp
        _ = _ := by push_cast; ring
    · simp [hG, hFS (p, z) hz]
  have hfd : ∀ z, fderiv ℝ f z (α • z + b p) =
      2 * π * Complex.I * lam * f z * oscW Φ α b (p, z) := by
    intro z
    have h1 : HasFDerivAt (fun z => lam * Φ (p, z)) (lam • fderiv ℝ (fun z => Φ (p, z)) z) z :=
      ((hΦp.differentiable (by simp) z).hasFDerivAt).const_mul lam
    have h2 := (osc_hasDerivAt_eC (lam * Φ (p, z))).hasFDerivAt.comp z h1
    rw [show f = eC ∘ (fun z => lam * Φ (p, z)) from rfl, h2.fderiv]
    simp [oscW]; ring
  have hrhs : ∀ z, oscStep Φ α b δ F (p, z) = -(2 * π * Complex.I)⁻¹ *
      (fderiv ℝ G z (α • z + b p) + ((α * n : ℝ) : ℂ) * G z) := fun z => rfl
  simp_rw [hrhs]
  have hIBP := osc_integral_fderiv_affine_mul (hfc.of_le (by simp)) (hGc.of_le (by simp)) hS hGS
    α (b p)
  have hc : (2 * π * Complex.I * lam) ≠ 0 := by
    simp [hlam, pi_ne_zero, Complex.I_ne_zero]
  have hc2 : (2 * π * Complex.I) ≠ 0 := by simp [pi_ne_zero, Complex.I_ne_zero]
  have hlamC : (lam : ℂ) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast hlam
  have hA : ∫ z, eC (lam * Φ (p, z)) * F (p, z) =
      (2 * π * Complex.I * lam)⁻¹ * ∫ z, fderiv ℝ f z (α • z + b p) * G z := by
    rw [← integral_const_mul]
    congr 1; funext z
    rw [hfd, hFeq]
    simp only [hfdef]
    field_simp
  rw [hA, hIBP]
  have hB : (fun z => eC (lam * Φ (p, z)) * (-(2 * π * Complex.I)⁻¹ *
      (fderiv ℝ G z (α • z + b p) + ((α * n : ℝ) : ℂ) * G z))) = fun z =>
      (-(2 * π * Complex.I)⁻¹) *
        (f z * (fderiv ℝ G z (α • z + b p) + ((α * n : ℝ) : ℂ) * G z)) := by
    funext z; simp only [hfdef]; ring
  rw [hB, integral_const_mul]
  push_cast; field_simp

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), the integration-by-parts mechanism (nonstationary
phase), for a compact family of phases. Let `Φ(p, z)` be a smooth real phase and `A(p, z)` a smooth
amplitude, both depending smoothly on a parameter `p`, with `A(p, ·)` vanishing off a fixed compact
set `S`. Let `v_p(z) = α z + b(p)` be an affine vector field (smooth in `p`), and suppose that for
`p` in a compact set `K` the phase is nonstationary along `v_p` on `S`: `|∂_{v_p} Φ(p, z)| ≥ δ > 0`.
Then for every `N` there is `C` with `|∫ e(λ Φ(p, z)) A(p, z) dz| ≤ C λ^{-N}` for all `p ∈ K` and
`λ > 0`. (Rescaling `Φ` by `λ` is how the blueprint's hypotheses `|∇F| ≥ L`, `‖D^k F‖ ≤ C_k L`
enter: the phases `F / L` range over a compact family.) -/
theorem norm_integral_eC_mul_le_of_nonstationary (hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Φ) (hb : ContDiff ℝ ∞ b)
    {A : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hA : ContDiff ℝ ∞ A)
    {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))} (hS : IsCompact S)
    (hAS : ∀ (p : P) (z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)), z ∉ S → A (p, z) = 0)
    {K : Set P} (hK : IsCompact K) (hδ : 0 < δ)
    (hw : ∀ p ∈ K, ∀ z ∈ S, δ ≤ |fderiv ℝ (fun z' => Φ (p, z')) z (α • z + b p)|) (N : ℕ) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ p ∈ K, ∀ lam : ℝ, 0 < lam →
      ‖∫ z, eC (lam * Φ (p, z)) * A (p, z)‖ ≤ C * (lam ^ N)⁻¹ := by
  have hAS' : ∀ q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), q.2 ∉ S → A q = 0 :=
    fun q hq => hAS q.1 q.2 hq
  obtain ⟨hFc, hFS⟩ := oscStep_iterate_props (α := α) hΦ hb hδ hS.isClosed hA hAS' N
  obtain ⟨M, hM⟩ := (hK.prod hS).exists_bound_of_continuousOn hFc.continuous.continuousOn
  refine ⟨M * volume.real S, fun p hp lam hlam => ?_⟩
  have hiter : ∀ m : ℕ, ∫ z, eC (lam * Φ (p, z)) * A (p, z) = (((lam ^ m)⁻¹ : ℝ) : ℂ) *
      ∫ z, eC (lam * Φ (p, z)) * (oscStep Φ α b δ)^[m] A (p, z) := by
    intro m
    induction m with
    | zero => simp
    | succ m ih =>
      obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := oscStep_iterate_props (α := α) hΦ hb hδ hS.isClosed hA hAS' m
      rw [ih, integral_oscStep hΦ hb hδ hS h1 h2 p (hw p hp) hlam.ne',
        Function.iterate_succ_apply', ← mul_assoc]
      congr 1; push_cast; rw [pow_succ, mul_inv]
  rw [hiter N, norm_mul, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_of_nonneg (by positivity), mul_comm]
  gcongr
  rw [← setIntegral_eq_integral_of_forall_compl_eq_zero (s := S)
    (fun z hz => by simp [hFS (p, z) hz])]
  refine norm_setIntegral_le_of_norm_le_const hS.measure_lt_top (fun z hz => ?_)
  rw [norm_mul, osc_norm_eC, one_mul]
  exact hM (p, z) ⟨hp, hz⟩

end Nonstationary
/-! ### The radial oscillatory integrals of Lemma 5.2 -/

section Radial

variable {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}

/-- The fixed amplitude `K_0 = K ψ` of Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`). -/
noncomputable def radialOscAmp (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  swKernel Ω z * (dyadicPsi z : ℂ)

/-- The amplitude `2πi P K_0` of `∂_t Ψ` in Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`). -/
noncomputable def radialOscAmpDeriv (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (d : ℕ)
    (z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  2 * π * Complex.I * (radialPoly n d z : ℂ) * radialOscAmp Ω z

/-- The oscillatory integral `Ψ_a(t, η) = ∫ e(t P(z) - z·η) a(z) dz` with a general amplitude `a`
(Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`); the blueprint uses `a = K_0` and `a = 2πi P K_0`). -/
noncomputable def radialOscInt (d : ℕ) (a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (t : ℝ)
    (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  ∫ z, eC (t * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, η⟫) * a z

/-- `Ψ(t, η) = ∫ e(t P(z) - z·η) K_0(z) dz` of Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`) (with
Mathlib's sign convention `e(-z·η)`; the blueprint's `e(+z·η)` is the reflection `η ↦ -η`). -/
noncomputable def radialOscPsi (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (d : ℕ) (t : ℝ)
    (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  ∫ z, eC (t * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, η⟫) * radialOscAmp Ω z

/-- `Φ_{j,μ} = 𝓕 (e(μ P) K_j)` of Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), with Mathlib's
Fourier transform `𝓕`. -/
noncomputable def radialOscPhi (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (d : ℕ) (j : ℤ) (μ : ℝ)
    (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  𝓕 (fun x => eC (μ * radialPoly n d x) * dyadicKernel Ω j x) ξ

/-- The closed annulus `1/2 ≤ |z| ≤ 2` containing the amplitudes' supports. -/
def radialOscAnnulus (n : ℕ) : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :=
  {z | 1 / 2 ≤ ‖z‖ ∧ ‖z‖ ≤ 2}

/-- The amplitude class of Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): smooth, vanishing off the
annulus `1/2 ≤ |z| ≤ 2`, with the radial cancellation `∫ e(t P) a = 0` for every `t`. Both
`K_0` and `2πi P K_0` belong to it. -/
def IsRadialOscAmp (d : ℕ) (a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) : Prop :=
  ContDiff ℝ ∞ a ∧ (∀ z, z ∉ radialOscAnnulus n → a z = 0) ∧
    ∀ t : ℝ, ∫ z, eC (t * radialPoly n d z) * a z = 0

/-- Helper: the annulus `1/2 ≤ |z| ≤ 2` is compact. -/
lemma isCompact_radialOscAnnulus : IsCompact (radialOscAnnulus n) := by
  have : radialOscAnnulus n = closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 2 ∩ {z | 1 / 2 ≤ ‖z‖} := by
    ext z; simp [radialOscAnnulus, and_comm]
  rw [this]
  exact (isCompact_closedBall _ _).inter_right (isClosed_le continuous_const continuous_norm)

/-- Helper: `P` is smooth. -/
lemma contDiff_radialPoly (d : ℕ) : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (radialPoly n d) := by
  have : radialPoly n d = fun x => (‖x‖ ^ 2) ^ d := by
    funext x; rw [radialPoly_eq_norm_pow, pow_mul]
  rw [this]
  exact (contDiff_norm_sq ℝ).pow d

/-- Helper: `K_0 = K ψ` is the dyadic piece `K_0` of Lemma 4.1. -/
lemma radialOscAmp_eq : radialOscAmp Ω = dyadicKernel Ω 0 := by
  funext z; simp [radialOscAmp, dyadicKernel]

/-- Helper: `Ψ = Ψ_{K_0}`. -/
lemma radialOscPsi_eq (d : ℕ) (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    radialOscPsi Ω d t η = radialOscInt d (radialOscAmp Ω) t η := rfl

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): `K_0` is an admissible amplitude. -/
theorem isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmp (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (d : ℕ) :
    IsRadialOscAmp d (radialOscAmp Ω) := by
  rw [radialOscAmp_eq]
  refine ⟨contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ 0, fun z hz => ?_, fun t => ?_⟩
  · simp only [radialOscAnnulus, mem_ofPred_eq, not_and_or, not_le] at hz
    rcases hz with h | h
    · exact dyadicKernel_zero_eq_zero_of_le h.le
    · exact dyadicKernel_zero_eq_zero_of_ge h.le
  · exact integral_eC_mul_dyadicKernel hn hΩ d t 0

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): `2πi P K_0` is an admissible amplitude. -/
theorem isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmpDeriv (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (d : ℕ) :
    IsRadialOscAmp d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d) := by
  obtain ⟨h1, h2, h3⟩ := isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmp hn hΩ d
  refine ⟨(contDiff_const.mul (Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.comp (contDiff_radialPoly d))).mul h1,
    fun z hz => by simp [radialOscAmpDeriv, h2 z hz], fun t => ?_⟩
  have := integral_radialPoly_mul_eC_mul_dyadicKernel hn hΩ d t 0
  rw [← radialOscAmp_eq] at this
  simp only [radialOscAmpDeriv]
  have e : (fun z => eC (t * radialPoly n d z) *
      (2 * π * Complex.I * (radialPoly n d z : ℂ) * radialOscAmp Ω z)) = fun z =>
      (2 * π * Complex.I) * ((radialPoly n d z : ℂ) * eC (t * radialPoly n d z) *
        radialOscAmp Ω z) := by
    funext z; ring
  rw [e, integral_const_mul, this, mul_zero]

/-- Helper: `𝐞 y = e(y)`. -/
lemma osc_fourierChar_eq_eC (y : ℝ) : ((𝐞 y : Circle) : ℂ) = eC y := by
  rw [Real.fourierChar_apply, eC]; push_cast; ring_nf

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), scaling formula:
`Φ_{j,μ}(ξ) = Ψ(μ 2^{Dj}, 2^j ξ)` with `D = 2d`, for every `j ∈ ℤ`, `μ ∈ ℝ` and `ξ`. -/
theorem radialOscPhi_eq (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (d : ℕ) (j : ℤ) (μ : ℝ)
    (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    radialOscPhi Ω d j μ ξ =
      radialOscPsi Ω d (μ * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * j)) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ) := by
  set c : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j) with hc_def
  have hc : 0 < c := by positivity
  let g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun y =>
    eC (μ * radialPoly n d (c⁻¹ • y) - ⟪c⁻¹ • y, ξ⟫) * dyadicKernel Ω 0 y
  have h1 : ∀ x, 𝐞 (-⟪x, ξ⟫) • (eC (μ * radialPoly n d x) * dyadicKernel Ω j x) =
      c ^ n • g (c • x) := by
    intro x
    simp only [g, dyadicKernel_eq_smul hΩ.2.1 j x, inv_smul_smul₀ hc.ne', ← hc_def]
    rw [Circle.smul_def, osc_fourierChar_eq_eC, sub_eq_add_neg, eC_add]
    simp only [Complex.real_smul, smul_eq_mul]
    ring
  rw [radialOscPhi, Real.fourier_eq]
  simp_rw [h1]
  rw [integral_smul, Measure.integral_comp_smul, finrank_euclideanSpace_fin, smul_smul,
    abs_of_pos (by positivity), mul_inv_cancel₀ (by positivity), one_smul, radialOscPsi]
  refine integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_)
  simp only [g, radialOscAmp_eq]
  congr 2
  rw [radialPoly_eq_norm_pow, radialPoly_eq_norm_pow, norm_smul, mul_pow, real_inner_smul_left,
    real_inner_smul_right, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity), hc_def, zpow_neg,
    inv_inv, ← zpow_natCast, ← zpow_mul]
  push_cast
  ring_nf
/-- Helper: differentiation under the integral sign of `∫ e(φ₀ + s φ₁) a` in `s`. -/
lemma osc_hasDerivAt_integral_eC {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (ha : Continuous a)
    {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))} (hS : IsCompact S) (haS : ∀ z, z ∉ S → a z = 0)
    {φ₀ φ₁ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ} (h₀ : Continuous φ₀) (h₁ : Continuous φ₁) (s : ℝ) :
    HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => ∫ z, eC (φ₀ z + s * φ₁ z) * a z)
      (∫ z, eC (φ₀ z + s * φ₁ z) * (2 * π * Complex.I * φ₁ z * a z)) s := by
  have hcont : ∀ s : ℝ, Continuous fun z => eC (φ₀ z + s * φ₁ z) :=
    fun s => osc_contDiff_eC.continuous.comp (h₀.add (continuous_const.mul h₁))
  have hbc : Continuous fun z => 2 * π * Complex.I * (φ₁ z : ℂ) * a z :=
    (continuous_const.mul (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp h₁)).mul ha
  have hbS : ∀ z, z ∉ S → 2 * π * Complex.I * (φ₁ z : ℂ) * a z = 0 :=
    fun z hz => by simp [haS z hz]
  refine (hasDerivAt_integral_of_dominated_loc_of_deriv_le (s := univ)
    (F := fun s z => eC (φ₀ z + s * φ₁ z) * a z)
    (F' := fun s z => eC (φ₀ z + s * φ₁ z) * (2 * π * Complex.I * φ₁ z * a z))
    (bound := fun z => ‖2 * π * Complex.I * (φ₁ z : ℂ) * a z‖) Filter.univ_mem
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun s => ((hcont s).mul ha).aestronglyMeasurable)
    (osc_integrable_of_vanish ((hcont s).mul ha) hS (fun z hz => by simp [haS z hz]))
    ((hcont s).mul hbc).aestronglyMeasurable
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z s _ => by rw [norm_mul, osc_norm_eC, one_mul])
    (osc_integrable_of_vanish hbc hS hbS).norm
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z s _ => ?_)).2
  have h1 : HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => φ₀ z + s * φ₁ z) (φ₁ z) s := by
    simpa using ((hasDerivAt_id s).mul_const (φ₁ z)).const_add (φ₀ z)
  have h2 := ((osc_hasDerivAt_eC (φ₀ z + s * φ₁ z)).scomp s h1).mul_const (a z)
  convert h2 using 1
  · rfl
  · rw [Complex.real_smul]; ring

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), `t`-derivative for a general amplitude:
`∂_t Ψ_a(t, η) = Ψ_{2πi P a}(t, η)`. -/
theorem hasDerivAt_radialOscInt_t (d : ℕ) {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : Continuous a) {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))} (hS : IsCompact S)
    (haS : ∀ z, z ∉ S → a z = 0) (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    HasDerivAt (fun t => radialOscInt d a t η)
      (radialOscInt d (fun z => 2 * π * Complex.I * (radialPoly n d z : ℂ) * a z) t η) t := by
  have := osc_hasDerivAt_integral_eC ha hS haS (φ₀ := fun z => -⟪z, η⟫)
    (φ₁ := radialPoly n d) (continuous_id.inner continuous_const).neg
    (contDiff_radialPoly d).continuous t
  unfold radialOscInt
  convert this using 1
  · funext t; congr 1; funext z; congr 2; ring
  · congr 1; funext z; congr 2; ring

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): `∂_t Ψ(t, η) = ∫ e(t P(z) - z·η) 2πi P(z) K_0(z) dz`
(differentiating in `t` changes the amplitude to `2πi P K_0`). -/
theorem hasDerivAt_radialOscPsi (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (d : ℕ) (t : ℝ)
    (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    HasDerivAt (fun t => radialOscPsi Ω d t η) (radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d) t η) t := by
  have hc : Continuous (radialOscAmp Ω) := by
    rw [radialOscAmp_eq]; exact (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ 0).continuous
  have hS : ∀ z, z ∉ closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 2 → radialOscAmp Ω z = 0 := by
    intro z hz
    rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, not_le] at hz
    rw [radialOscAmp_eq]; exact dyadicKernel_zero_eq_zero_of_ge hz.le
  have := hasDerivAt_radialOscInt_t d hc (isCompact_closedBall _ _) hS t η
  simpa only [radialOscPsi, radialOscInt, radialOscAmpDeriv, mul_assoc] using this

/-- Helper: the `η`-derivative along a ray, `∂_s Ψ_a(t, sη) = Ψ_{-2πi (z·η) a}(t, sη)`. -/
lemma hasDerivAt_radialOscInt_smul (d : ℕ) {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : Continuous a) {S : Set (EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))} (hS : IsCompact S)
    (haS : ∀ z, z ∉ S → a z = 0) (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (s : ℝ) :
    HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => radialOscInt d a t (s • η))
      (radialOscInt d (fun z => 2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪z, η⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a z) t (s • η)) s := by
  have := osc_hasDerivAt_integral_eC ha hS haS (φ₀ := fun z => t * radialPoly n d z)
    (φ₁ := fun z => -⟪z, η⟫) (continuous_const.mul (contDiff_radialPoly d).continuous)
    (continuous_id.inner continuous_const).neg s
  unfold radialOscInt
  convert this using 1
  · funext s; congr 1; funext z; rw [real_inner_smul_right]; congr 2; ring
  · congr 1; funext z; rw [real_inner_smul_right]; congr 2; ring

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), trivial bound `|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ ∫ |a|`. -/
theorem norm_radialOscInt_le (d : ℕ) (a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (t : ℝ)
    (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ ∫ z, ‖a z‖ := by
  refine (norm_integral_le_integral_norm _).trans (le_of_eq ?_)
  congr 1; funext z; rw [norm_mul, osc_norm_eC, one_mul]

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): `Ψ_a(t, 0) = 0` for amplitudes with the radial
cancellation. -/
theorem radialOscInt_zero {d : ℕ} {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a)
    (t : ℝ) : radialOscInt d a t 0 = 0 := by
  simpa [radialOscInt] using ha.2.2 t

/-- Helper: the mean value step `|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ sup_{0 ≤ s ≤ 1} |Ψ_{-2πi (z·η) a}(t, sη)|`. -/
lemma norm_radialOscInt_le_of_ray {d : ℕ} {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) {C : ℝ}
    (hC : ∀ s ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) 1,
      ‖radialOscInt d (fun z => 2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪z, η⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a z) t (s • η)‖ ≤ C) :
    ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C := by
  have h := norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_deriv_le_segment'
    (f := fun s : ℝ => radialOscInt d a t (s • η)) (a := 0) (b := 1)
    (fun s _ => (hasDerivAt_radialOscInt_smul d ha.1.continuous isCompact_radialOscAnnulus
      ha.2.1 t η s).hasDerivWithinAt) (fun s hs => hC s (Ico_subset_Icc_self hs)) 1
    ⟨zero_le_one, le_rfl⟩
  simpa [radialOscInt_zero ha] using h
/-- Helper: the derivative of the phase `z ↦ s P(z) - z·ζ` in the direction `v`. -/
lemma osc_fderiv_radialPhase (d : ℕ) (s : ℝ) (ζ z v : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    fderiv ℝ (fun z' => s * radialPoly n d z' - ⟪z', ζ⟫) z v =
      s * (2 * d * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ⟪z, v⟫) - ⟪v, ζ⟫ := by
  have hP := (radialPoly_hasGradientAt n d z).hasFDerivAt
  have hI : HasFDerivAt (fun z' : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => ⟪z', ζ⟫) (innerSL ℝ ζ) z := by
    have := (innerSL ℝ ζ).hasFDerivAt (x := z)
    convert this using 1
    funext z'; simp [real_inner_comm]
  have h : HasFDerivAt (fun z' => s * radialPoly n d z' - ⟪z', ζ⟫) _ z := (hP.const_mul s).sub hI
  rw [h.fderiv]
  simp [InnerProductSpace.toDual_apply_apply, real_inner_comm]

/-- The small constant `c = d / (2 · 4^d)` of Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.1). -/
noncomputable def radialOscSmall (d : ℕ) : ℝ := d / (2 * 4 ^ d)

/-- The large constant `C = 2d · 4^d` of Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.1). -/
noncomputable def radialOscLarge (d : ℕ) : ℝ := 2 * d * 4 ^ d

/-- Helper: `0 < c`. -/
lemma radialOscSmall_pos {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) : 0 < radialOscSmall d := by
  have : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
  unfold radialOscSmall; positivity

/-- Helper: `0 < C`. -/
lemma radialOscLarge_pos {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) : 0 < radialOscLarge d := by
  have : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
  unfold radialOscLarge; positivity

/-- Helper: `0 < c < C`. -/
lemma radialOscSmall_lt_large {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) : radialOscSmall d < radialOscLarge d := by
  have : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
  have h4 : (1 : ℝ) ≤ 4 ^ d := one_le_pow₀ (by norm_num)
  unfold radialOscSmall radialOscLarge
  rw [div_lt_iff₀ (by positivity)]
  have h5 : (1 : ℝ) ≤ 4 ^ d * 4 ^ d := one_le_mul_of_one_le_of_one_le h4 h4
  nlinarith [mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h5 (by linarith : (0 : ℝ) ≤ d)]

/-- Helper: nonstationarity for `|η| ≥ C|t|`, along the constant field `η/|η|`. -/
lemma osc_large_w {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {s : ℝ} (hs : |s| ≤ (radialOscLarge d)⁻¹)
    {ζ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (hζ : ‖ζ‖ = 1) {z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
    (hz : z ∈ radialOscAnnulus n) :
    1 / 2 ≤ |s * (2 * d * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ⟪z, ζ⟫) - ⟪ζ, ζ⟫| := by
  obtain ⟨m, rfl⟩ : ∃ m, d = m + 1 := ⟨d - 1, by omega⟩
  rw [show 2 * (m + 1) - 2 = 2 * m by omega]
  have hzz : ⟪ζ, ζ⟫ = 1 := by rw [real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq, hζ]; norm_num
  have hz2 : ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m) ≤ 4 ^ m := by
    calc ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m) ≤ 2 ^ (2 * m) := pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) hz.2 _
      _ = 4 ^ m := by rw [pow_mul]; norm_num
  have hin : |⟪z, ζ⟫| ≤ 2 := (abs_real_inner_le_norm z ζ).trans (by rw [hζ, mul_one]; exact hz.2)
  have hY : |2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m) * ⟪z, ζ⟫| ≤ 2 * (m + 1) * 4 ^ m * 2 := by
    rw [abs_mul, abs_of_nonneg (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m))]
    push_cast
    gcongr
  have hX : |s * (2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m) * ⟪z, ζ⟫)| ≤ 1 / 2 := by
    rw [abs_mul]
    calc |s| * |2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m) * ⟪z, ζ⟫|
        ≤ (radialOscLarge (m + 1))⁻¹ * (2 * (m + 1) * 4 ^ m * 2) :=
          mul_le_mul hs hY (abs_nonneg _) (inv_nonneg.2 (radialOscLarge_pos hd).le)
      _ = 1 / 2 := by unfold radialOscLarge; push_cast; field_simp; ring
  rw [hzz]
  have := le_abs_self (s * (2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m) * ⟪z, ζ⟫))
  rw [abs_sub_comm]
  exact le_trans (by linarith) (le_abs_self _)

/-- Helper: nonstationarity for `|η| ≤ c|t|`, along the radial field `z`. -/
lemma osc_small_w {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {σ : ℝ} (hσ : |σ| = 1)
    {ζ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (hζ : ‖ζ‖ ≤ radialOscSmall d) {z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
    (hz : z ∈ radialOscAnnulus n) :
    d / 4 ^ d ≤ |σ * (2 * d * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ⟪z, z⟫) - ⟪z, ζ⟫| := by
  obtain ⟨m, rfl⟩ : ∃ m, d = m + 1 := ⟨d - 1, by omega⟩
  have hpow : ‖z‖ ^ (2 * (m + 1) - 2) * ⟪z, z⟫ = ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m + 2) := by
    rw [show 2 * (m + 1) - 2 = 2 * m by omega, real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq, ← pow_add]
  rw [mul_assoc (2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ)), hpow]
  have hz2 : 1 / 4 ^ (m + 1) ≤ ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m + 2) := by
    calc (1 : ℝ) / 4 ^ (m + 1) = (1 / 2) ^ (2 * m + 2) := by
          rw [show 2 * m + 2 = 2 * (m + 1) by ring, pow_mul, one_div_pow, one_div_pow]; norm_num
      _ ≤ ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m + 2) := pow_le_pow_left₀ (by norm_num) hz.1 _
  have hin : |⟪z, ζ⟫| ≤ 2 * radialOscSmall (m + 1) :=
    (abs_real_inner_le_norm z ζ).trans (mul_le_mul hz.2 hζ (norm_nonneg _) (by norm_num))
  have hA : |σ * (2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m + 2))| =
      2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m + 2) := by
    rw [abs_mul, hσ, one_mul, abs_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
  have hB : 2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * (1 / 4 ^ (m + 1)) ≤
      2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m + 2) := by
    gcongr
  have hc : 2 * radialOscSmall (m + 1) = ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) / 4 ^ (m + 1) := by
    unfold radialOscSmall; field_simp
  have := abs_sub_abs_le_abs_sub (σ * (2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * ‖z‖ ^ (2 * m + 2))) ⟪z, ζ⟫
  rw [hA] at this
  have h3 : 2 * ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * (1 / 4 ^ (m + 1)) =
      2 * (((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) / 4 ^ (m + 1)) := by
    ring
  linarith

/-- Helper: `(p, z) ↦ f(p) P(z) - z·g(p)` is smooth. -/
lemma osc_contDiff_radialPhase (d : ℕ) {P : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup P] [NormedSpace ℝ P]
    {f : P → ℝ} {g : P → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) (hg : ContDiff ℝ ∞ g) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun q : P × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
      f q.1 * radialPoly n d q.2 - ⟪q.2, g q.1⟫) :=
  ((hf.comp contDiff_fst).mul ((contDiff_radialPoly d).comp contDiff_snd)).sub
    (contDiff_snd.inner ℝ (hg.comp contDiff_fst))

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.1) third line (for every `t`, in particular
`|t| ≥ 1`): with `C = radialOscLarge d`, for every `N` there is `C_N` with
`|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C_N |η|^{-N}` whenever `|η| ≥ C |t|`, for every admissible amplitude `a`. -/
theorem norm_radialOscInt_le_large {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) (N : ℕ) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      radialOscLarge d * |t| ≤ ‖η‖ → ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C * (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ := by
  have hCL := radialOscLarge_pos hd
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := norm_integral_eC_mul_le_of_nonstationary (P := ℝ × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))
    (Φ := fun q => q.1.1 * radialPoly n d q.2 - ⟪q.2, q.1.2⟫) (α := 0) (b := Prod.snd)
    (δ := 1 / 2) (A := fun q => a q.2) (S := radialOscAnnulus n)
    (K := closedBall (0 : ℝ) (radialOscLarge d)⁻¹ ×ˢ sphere (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1)
    (osc_contDiff_radialPhase d contDiff_fst contDiff_snd) contDiff_snd (ha.1.comp contDiff_snd)
    isCompact_radialOscAnnulus (fun p z hz => ha.2.1 z hz)
    ((isCompact_closedBall _ _).prod (isCompact_sphere _ _)) (by norm_num) (fun p hp z hz => by
      change 1 / 2 ≤ |fderiv ℝ (fun z' => p.1 * radialPoly n d z' - ⟪z', p.2⟫) z (0 • z + p.2)|
      rw [osc_fderiv_radialPhase, zero_smul, zero_add]
      have h1 := hp.1; have h2 := hp.2
      rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, Real.norm_eq_abs] at h1
      rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm] at h2
      exact osc_large_w hd h1 h2 hz) N
  refine ⟨max C 0, le_max_right _ _, fun t η h => ?_⟩
  rcases eq_or_ne η 0 with rfl | hη
  · have ht : t = 0 := by
      rw [norm_zero] at h
      exact abs_eq_zero.1 (le_antisymm (by nlinarith [abs_nonneg t]) (abs_nonneg t))
    subst ht
    rw [radialOscInt_zero ha, norm_zero]
    exact mul_nonneg (le_max_right _ _) (by positivity)
  · have hη' : 0 < ‖η‖ := norm_pos_iff.2 hη
    have hp : (t / ‖η‖, ‖η‖⁻¹ • η) ∈
        closedBall (0 : ℝ) (radialOscLarge d)⁻¹ ×ˢ sphere (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1 := by
      refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
      · rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_div, abs_norm,
          div_le_iff₀ hη', inv_mul_eq_div, le_div_iff₀ hCL, mul_comm]
        exact h
      · rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm, norm_smul, norm_inv, norm_norm, inv_mul_cancel₀ hη'.ne']
    have := hC _ hp ‖η‖ hη'
    have heq : radialOscInt d a t η =
        ∫ z, eC (‖η‖ * ((t / ‖η‖) * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, ‖η‖⁻¹ • η⟫)) * a z := by
      unfold radialOscInt; congr 1; funext z; congr 2
      rw [real_inner_smul_right]; field_simp
    rw [heq]
    exact this.trans (by gcongr; exact le_max_left _ _)
/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.1) first line (for every `t ≠ 0`, in particular
`|t| ≥ 1`): with `c = radialOscSmall d`, for every `N` there is `C_N` with
`|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C_N |η| |t|^{-N}` whenever `|η| ≤ c |t|`, for every admissible amplitude `a`. -/
theorem norm_radialOscInt_le_small {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) (N : ℕ) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)), t ≠ 0 →
      ‖η‖ ≤ radialOscSmall d * |t| → ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C * ‖η‖ * (|t| ^ N)⁻¹ := by
  have hcs := radialOscSmall_pos hd
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := norm_integral_eC_mul_le_of_nonstationary
    (P := ℝ × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))
    (Φ := fun q => q.1.1 * radialPoly n d q.2 - ⟪q.2, q.1.2.1⟫) (α := 1) (b := fun _ => 0)
    (δ := d / 4 ^ d)
    (A := fun q => 2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪q.2, q.1.2.2⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a q.2)
    (S := radialOscAnnulus n)
    (K := sphere (0 : ℝ) 1 ×ˢ (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (radialOscSmall d) ×ˢ
      closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1))
    (osc_contDiff_radialPhase d contDiff_fst (contDiff_fst.comp contDiff_snd)) contDiff_const
    ((contDiff_const.mul (Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.comp
      (contDiff_snd.inner ℝ (contDiff_snd.comp (contDiff_snd.comp contDiff_fst))).neg)).mul
      (ha.1.comp contDiff_snd))
    isCompact_radialOscAnnulus (fun p z hz => by simp [ha.2.1 z hz])
    ((isCompact_sphere _ _).prod ((isCompact_closedBall _ _).prod (isCompact_closedBall _ _)))
    (by have : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
        positivity) (fun p hp z hz => by
      change d / 4 ^ d ≤
        |fderiv ℝ (fun z' => p.1 * radialPoly n d z' - ⟪z', p.2.1⟫) z (1 • z + 0)|
      rw [osc_fderiv_radialPhase, one_smul, add_zero]
      have h1 := hp.1; have h2 := hp.2.1
      rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm, Real.norm_eq_abs] at h1
      rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff] at h2
      exact osc_small_w hd h1 h2 hz) N
  refine ⟨max C 0, le_max_right _ _, fun t η ht h => ?_⟩
  have ht' : 0 < |t| := abs_pos.2 ht
  rcases eq_or_ne η 0 with rfl | hη
  · rw [radialOscInt_zero ha, norm_zero, norm_zero, mul_zero, zero_mul]
  have hη' : 0 < ‖η‖ := norm_pos_iff.2 hη
  refine norm_radialOscInt_le_of_ray ha t η (fun s hs => ?_)
  have hp : (t / |t|, |t|⁻¹ • (s • η), ‖η‖⁻¹ • η) ∈
      sphere (0 : ℝ) 1 ×ˢ (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (radialOscSmall d) ×ˢ
        closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 1) := by
    refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_⟩
    · rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_div, abs_abs, div_self ht'.ne']
    · rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, norm_smul, norm_smul, norm_inv, Real.norm_eq_abs,
        Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_abs, abs_of_nonneg hs.1, inv_mul_le_iff₀ ht']
      calc s * ‖η‖ ≤ 1 * ‖η‖ := by gcongr; exact hs.2
        _ ≤ |t| * radialOscSmall d := by rw [one_mul, mul_comm]; exact h
    · rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, norm_smul, norm_inv, norm_norm, inv_mul_cancel₀ hη'.ne']
  have := hC _ hp |t| ht'
  have heq : radialOscInt d (fun z => 2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪z, η⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a z) t (s • η) =
      (‖η‖ : ℂ) * ∫ z, eC (|t| * ((t / |t|) * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, |t|⁻¹ • (s • η)⟫)) *
        (2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪z, ‖η‖⁻¹ • η⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a z) := by
    unfold radialOscInt
    rw [← integral_const_mul]
    congr 1; funext z
    have e1 : |t| * ((t / |t|) * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, |t|⁻¹ • (s • η)⟫) =
        t * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, s • η⟫ := by
      rw [real_inner_smul_right (x := z) (r := |t|⁻¹)]; field_simp
    have e2 : (-⟪z, ‖η‖⁻¹ • η⟫ : ℝ) = ‖η‖⁻¹ * (-⟪z, η⟫) := by
      rw [real_inner_smul_right]; ring
    rw [e1, e2]
    have : (‖η‖ : ℂ) ≠ 0 := by exact_mod_cast hη'.ne'
    push_cast
    field_simp
  rw [heq, norm_mul, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_of_nonneg (norm_nonneg _)]
  calc ‖η‖ * ‖∫ z, eC (|t| * ((t / |t|) * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, |t|⁻¹ • (s • η)⟫)) *
        (2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪z, ‖η‖⁻¹ • η⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a z)‖
      ≤ ‖η‖ * (C * (|t| ^ N)⁻¹) := by gcongr
    _ ≤ max C 0 * ‖η‖ * (|t| ^ N)⁻¹ := by
        have e : ‖η‖ * (C * (|t| ^ N)⁻¹) = C * ‖η‖ * (|t| ^ N)⁻¹ := by ring
        rw [e]
        gcongr
        exact le_max_left _ _

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), the `O(|η|)` bound (from `Ψ_a(t, 0) = 0` and bounded
first `η`-derivatives): `|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ 4π (∫ |a|) |η|` for all `t` and `η`. -/
theorem norm_radialOscInt_le_norm {d : ℕ} {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ (4 * π * ∫ z, ‖a z‖) * ‖η‖ := by
  have hai : Integrable a :=
    osc_integrable_of_vanish ha.1.continuous isCompact_radialOscAnnulus ha.2.1
  refine norm_radialOscInt_le_of_ray ha t η (fun s _ => ?_)
  refine (norm_radialOscInt_le d _ t (s • η)).trans ?_
  have hpt : ∀ z, ‖2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪z, η⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a z‖ ≤ ‖η‖ * (4 * π * ‖a z‖) := by
    intro z
    by_cases hz : z ∈ radialOscAnnulus n
    · have h1 : |⟪z, η⟫| ≤ 2 * ‖η‖ :=
        (abs_real_inner_le_norm z η).trans (by gcongr; exact hz.2)
      have e : ‖2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪z, η⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a z‖ = 2 * π * |⟪z, η⟫| * ‖a z‖ := by
        simp [abs_of_pos pi_pos]
      rw [e]
      nlinarith [mul_nonneg (sub_nonneg.2 h1) (mul_nonneg pi_pos.le (norm_nonneg (a z)))]
    · simp [ha.2.1 z hz]
  calc ∫ z, ‖2 * π * Complex.I * ((-⟪z, η⟫ : ℝ) : ℂ) * a z‖
      ≤ ∫ z, ‖η‖ * (4 * π * ‖a z‖) :=
        integral_mono_of_nonneg (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => norm_nonneg _)
          ((hai.norm.const_mul _).const_mul _) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hpt)
    _ = (4 * π * ∫ z, ‖a z‖) * ‖η‖ := by
        rw [integral_const_mul, integral_const_mul]; ring

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), bounded `t`: for every `N` there is `C_N` with
`|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C_N min(|η|, |η|^{-N})` whenever `|t| ≤ 2`, for every admissible amplitude `a`
(at `η = 0` the right side is `0`). -/
theorem norm_radialOscInt_le_bounded {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) (N : ℕ) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)), |t| ≤ 2 →
      ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C * min ‖η‖ (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ := by
  obtain ⟨Cc, hCc0, hCc⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_large hd ha N
  set M := ∫ z, ‖a z‖ with hM
  have hM0 : 0 ≤ M := integral_nonneg fun z => norm_nonneg _
  set R := 2 * radialOscLarge d with hR
  have hR1 : 1 ≤ R := by
    have : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
    have h4 : (1 : ℝ) ≤ 4 ^ d := one_le_pow₀ (by norm_num)
    rw [hR, radialOscLarge]; nlinarith
  have hL0 : 0 ≤ 4 * π * M := by positivity
  refine ⟨4 * π * M + M * R ^ N + Cc, by positivity, fun t η ht => ?_⟩
  rcases le_or_gt ‖η‖ 1 with h1 | h1
  · have hmin : min ‖η‖ (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ = ‖η‖ := by
      refine min_eq_left ?_
      rcases eq_or_lt_of_le (norm_nonneg η) with h0 | h0
      · rw [← h0]; positivity
      · exact h1.trans (one_le_inv₀ (by positivity) |>.2 (pow_le_one₀ h0.le h1))
    rw [hmin]
    refine (norm_radialOscInt_le_norm ha t η).trans ?_
    gcongr
    have : 0 ≤ M * R ^ N := by positivity
    linarith
  · have hpos : 0 < ‖η‖ := by linarith
    have hmin : min ‖η‖ (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ = (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ :=
      min_eq_right ((inv_le_one_of_one_le₀ (one_le_pow₀ h1.le)).trans h1.le)
    rw [hmin]
    have hinv : 0 ≤ (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ := by positivity
    rcases le_or_gt ‖η‖ R with h2 | h2
    · have hb : M ≤ M * R ^ N * (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ := by
        rw [mul_assoc]
        refine le_mul_of_one_le_right hM0 ?_
        rw [← div_eq_mul_inv, one_le_div (by positivity)]
        exact pow_le_pow_left₀ hpos.le h2 N
      refine (norm_radialOscInt_le d a t η).trans (hb.trans ?_)
      gcongr
      linarith
    · have hle : radialOscLarge d * |t| ≤ ‖η‖ := by
        have := radialOscLarge_pos hd
        calc radialOscLarge d * |t| ≤ radialOscLarge d * 2 := by gcongr
          _ = R := by rw [hR]; ring
          _ ≤ ‖η‖ := h2.le
      refine (hCc t η hle).trans ?_
      gcongr
      have : 0 ≤ M * R ^ N := by positivity
      linarith

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), the bounds proved here, for a general admissible
amplitude `a` (smooth, vanishing off `1/2 ≤ |z| ≤ 2`, `∫ e(tP) a = 0` for all `t`; this covers
`K_0` and `2πi P K_0`, i.e. both `Ψ` and `∂_t Ψ`). There are constants `0 < c < C` (namely
`radialOscSmall d` and `radialOscLarge d`, depending only on `d`) such that for every `N` there
is `C_N` with, for all `t` and `η`:
* `|t| ≤ 2 ⇒ |Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C_N min(|η|, |η|^{-N})`;
* `|t| ≥ 1, |η| ≤ c|t| ⇒ |Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C_N |η| |t|^{-N}` ((5.1), first line);
* `|t| ≥ 1, |η| ≥ C|t| ⇒ |Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C_N |η|^{-N}` ((5.1), third line);
* `|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C_N` (trivial bound).
(The stationary middle region of (5.1) is `norm_radialOscInt_le_middle`; the square sums are
`radialOscPhi_square`, `radialOscPhi_deriv_square`.) -/
theorem radialOscInt_estimates {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) :
    ∃ c C : ℝ, 0 < c ∧ c < C ∧ ∀ a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ, IsRadialOscAmp d a →
      ∀ N : ℕ, ∃ C' : ℝ, 0 ≤ C' ∧ ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
        (|t| ≤ 2 → ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C' * min ‖η‖ (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹) ∧
        (1 ≤ |t| → ‖η‖ ≤ c * |t| → ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C' * ‖η‖ * (|t| ^ N)⁻¹) ∧
        (1 ≤ |t| → C * |t| ≤ ‖η‖ → ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C' * (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹) ∧
        ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C' := by
  refine ⟨radialOscSmall d, radialOscLarge d, radialOscSmall_pos hd, radialOscSmall_lt_large hd,
    fun a ha N => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨C1, hC1, h1⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_bounded hd ha N
  obtain ⟨C2, hC2, h2⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_small hd ha N
  obtain ⟨C3, hC3, h3⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_large hd ha N
  set M := ∫ z, ‖a z‖
  have hM0 : 0 ≤ M := integral_nonneg fun z => norm_nonneg _
  refine ⟨C1 + C2 + C3 + M, by positivity, fun t η => ⟨fun ht => ?_, fun ht hη => ?_,
    fun ht hη => ?_, ?_⟩⟩
  · refine (h1 t η ht).trans ?_
    have : 0 ≤ min ‖η‖ (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ := le_min (norm_nonneg _) (by positivity)
    gcongr; linarith
  · have ht0 : t ≠ 0 := by rintro rfl; norm_num at ht
    refine (h2 t η ht0 hη).trans ?_
    gcongr; linarith
  · refine (h3 t η hη).trans ?_
    gcongr; linarith
  · refine (norm_radialOscInt_le d a t η).trans ?_
    linarith

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`): `Ψ(t, 0) = 0` and `∂_t Ψ(t, 0) = 0` for every `t`
(from the radial cancellation (4.3)); here `∂_t Ψ = Ψ_{2πi P K_0}` by `hasDerivAt_radialOscPsi`. -/
theorem radialOscPsi_zero (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (d : ℕ) (t : ℝ) :
    radialOscPsi Ω d t 0 = 0 ∧ radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d) t 0 = 0 :=
  ⟨radialOscInt_zero (isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmp hn hΩ d) t,
    radialOscInt_zero (isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmpDeriv hn hΩ d) t⟩

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), the bounded-`t` estimates and (5.1) first and third
lines, for both `Ψ` and `∂_t Ψ` (`∂_t Ψ(t, η) = radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d) t η`, see
`hasDerivAt_radialOscPsi`): there are fixed `0 < c < C` such that for every `N` there is `C_N` with,
for `F = Ψ` and `F = ∂_t Ψ` and all `t, η`:
`|t| ≤ 2 ⇒ |F(t, η)| ≤ C_N min(|η|, |η|^{-N})`;
`|t| ≥ 1, |η| ≤ c|t| ⇒ |F(t, η)| ≤ C_N |η| |t|^{-N}`;
`|t| ≥ 1, |η| ≥ C|t| ⇒ |F(t, η)| ≤ C_N |η|^{-N}`; and `|F(t, η)| ≤ C_N`. -/
theorem radialOscPsi_estimates (hn : 1 ≤ n) {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ c C : ℝ, 0 < c ∧ c < C ∧ ∀ N : ℕ, ∃ C' : ℝ, 0 ≤ C' ∧
      ∀ F ∈ ({radialOscPsi Ω d, radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d)} :
        Set (ℝ → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)), ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
        (|t| ≤ 2 → ‖F t η‖ ≤ C' * min ‖η‖ (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹) ∧
        (1 ≤ |t| → ‖η‖ ≤ c * |t| → ‖F t η‖ ≤ C' * ‖η‖ * (|t| ^ N)⁻¹) ∧
        (1 ≤ |t| → C * |t| ≤ ‖η‖ → ‖F t η‖ ≤ C' * (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹) ∧
        ‖F t η‖ ≤ C' := by
  obtain ⟨c, C, hc, hcC, h⟩ := radialOscInt_estimates (n := n) hd
  refine ⟨c, C, hc, hcC, fun N => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨C1, hC1, h1⟩ := h _ (isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmp hn hΩ d) N
  obtain ⟨C2, hC2, h2⟩ := h _ (isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmpDeriv hn hΩ d) N
  refine ⟨C1 + C2, by positivity, fun F hF t η => ?_⟩
  have hA : C1 ≤ C1 + C2 := by linarith
  have hB : C2 ≤ C1 + C2 := by linarith
  have hm : 0 ≤ min ‖η‖ (‖η‖ ^ N)⁻¹ := le_min (norm_nonneg _) (by positivity)
  rcases hF with rfl | rfl
  · obtain ⟨a1, a2, a3, a4⟩ := h1 t η
    exact ⟨fun ht => (a1 ht).trans (by gcongr), fun ht hη => (a2 ht hη).trans (by gcongr),
      fun ht hη => (a3 ht hη).trans (by gcongr), a4.trans hA⟩
  · obtain ⟨a1, a2, a3, a4⟩ := h2 t η
    exact ⟨fun ht => (a1 ht).trans (by gcongr), fun ht hη => (a2 ht hη).trans (by gcongr),
      fun ht hη => (a3 ht hη).trans (by gcongr), a4.trans hB⟩

end Radial

/-! ### Lemma 5.2: the stationary middle region of (5.1) -/

section RadialStationary

/-- The polynomial `G₂(x, y)` with `x^d - y^d - d y^{d-1} (x - y) = (x - y)² G₂(x, y)`. -/
noncomputable def oscG2 (d : ℕ) (x y : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i ∈ Finset.range d, (∑ j ∈ Finset.range i, x ^ j * y ^ (i - 1 - j)) * y ^ (d - 1 - i)

/-- Helper: the second-order Taylor identity `x^d - y^d - d y^{d-1} (x - y) = (x - y)² G₂(x, y)`. -/
lemma oscG2_spec (d : ℕ) (x y : ℝ) :
    x ^ d - y ^ d - d * y ^ (d - 1) * (x - y) = (x - y) ^ 2 * oscG2 d x y := by
  have h1 : (x - y) * oscG2 d x y = (∑ i ∈ Finset.range d, x ^ i * y ^ (d - 1 - i)) -
      d * y ^ (d - 1) := by
    rw [oscG2, Finset.mul_sum]
    have : ∀ i ∈ Finset.range d, (x - y) * ((∑ j ∈ Finset.range i, x ^ j * y ^ (i - 1 - j)) *
        y ^ (d - 1 - i)) = x ^ i * y ^ (d - 1 - i) - y ^ (d - 1) := by
      intro i hi
      have hi' : i < d := Finset.mem_range.1 hi
      rw [← mul_assoc, mul_comm (x - y), geom_sum₂_mul, sub_mul, ← pow_add,
        show i + (d - 1 - i) = d - 1 by omega]
    rw [Finset.sum_congr rfl this, Finset.sum_sub_distrib, Finset.sum_const, Finset.card_range,
      nsmul_eq_mul]
  have h2 := geom_sum₂_mul x y d
  linear_combination (-(x - y)) * h1 - h2

/-- The rescaled second-order remainder `Q(s, z₀, u)` of `P` at `z₀`:
`s² Q(s, z₀, u) = P(z₀ + s u) - P(z₀) - s ∇P(z₀)·u` (`radialOscQ_spec`). -/
noncomputable def radialOscQ (d : ℕ) (s : ℝ) (z₀ u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ :=
  (2 * ⟪z₀, u⟫ + s * ‖u‖ ^ 2) ^ 2 * oscG2 d (‖z₀ + s • u‖ ^ 2) (‖z₀‖ ^ 2) +
    d * (‖z₀‖ ^ 2) ^ (d - 1) * ‖u‖ ^ 2

/-- Helper: `P(z₀ + s u) - P(z₀) - s ∇P(z₀)·u = s² Q(s, z₀, u)`. -/
lemma radialOscQ_spec {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) (s : ℝ) (z₀ u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    radialPoly n d (z₀ + s • u) - radialPoly n d z₀ -
        s * (2 * d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ⟪z₀, u⟫) = s ^ 2 * radialOscQ d s z₀ u := by
  have hxy : ‖z₀ + s • u‖ ^ 2 - ‖z₀‖ ^ 2 = s * (2 * ⟪z₀, u⟫ + s * ‖u‖ ^ 2) := by
    rw [norm_add_sq_real, norm_smul, real_inner_smul_right, mul_pow, Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]
    ring
  have h1 := oscG2_spec d (‖z₀ + s • u‖ ^ 2) (‖z₀‖ ^ 2)
  rw [radialPoly_eq_norm_pow, radialPoly_eq_norm_pow, pow_mul, pow_mul,
    show 2 * d - 2 = 2 * (d - 1) by omega, pow_mul, radialOscQ]
  set x := ‖z₀ + s • u‖ ^ 2
  set y := ‖z₀‖ ^ 2
  set B := 2 * ⟪z₀, u⟫ + s * ‖u‖ ^ 2
  set G := oscG2 d x y
  have hB : B = 2 * ⟪z₀, u⟫ + s * ‖u‖ ^ 2 := rfl
  linear_combination h1 + (d * y ^ (d - 1) + (x - y + s * B) * G) * hxy

/-- Helper: `G₂` is a polynomial, hence smooth. -/
lemma contDiff_oscG2 (d : ℕ) {X : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup X] [NormedSpace ℝ X]
    {f g : X → ℝ} (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) (hg : ContDiff ℝ ∞ g) :
    ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun x => oscG2 d (f x) (g x)) := by
  unfold oscG2
  fun_prop

/-- Helper: `Q(s, z₀, u)` is smooth jointly in `(s, z₀, u)` (including at `s = 0`). -/
lemma contDiff_radialOscQ (d : ℕ) {X : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup X] [NormedSpace ℝ X]
    {f : X → ℝ} {g h : X → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) (hg : ContDiff ℝ ∞ g)
    (hh : ContDiff ℝ ∞ h) : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun x => radialOscQ d (f x) (g x) (h x)) := by
  unfold radialOscQ
  have h1 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun x => ‖g x + f x • h x‖ ^ 2) :=
    (contDiff_norm_sq ℝ).comp (hg.add (hf.smul hh))
  have h2 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun x => ‖g x‖ ^ 2) := (contDiff_norm_sq ℝ).comp hg
  have h3 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun x => ‖h x‖ ^ 2) := (contDiff_norm_sq ℝ).comp hh
  have h4 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun x => ⟪g x, h x⟫) := hg.inner ℝ hh
  exact ((((contDiff_const.mul h4).add (hf.mul h3)).pow 2).mul (contDiff_oscG2 d h1 h2)).add
    ((contDiff_const.mul (h2.pow _)).mul h3)

/-- Helper: strong monotonicity of `z ↦ |z|^m z`:
`|y|^m |x - y|² ≤ 2 ⟨|x|^m x - |y|^m y, x - y⟩`. -/
lemma osc_inner_pow_smul_mono (m : ℕ) (x y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖y‖ ^ m * ‖x - y‖ ^ 2 ≤ 2 * ⟪‖x‖ ^ m • x - ‖y‖ ^ m • y, x - y⟫ := by
  have e1 : ⟪‖x‖ ^ m • x - ‖y‖ ^ m • y, x - y⟫ =
      ‖x‖ ^ m * ‖x‖ ^ 2 - (‖x‖ ^ m + ‖y‖ ^ m) * ⟪x, y⟫ + ‖y‖ ^ m * ‖y‖ ^ 2 := by
    rw [inner_sub_left, inner_sub_right, inner_sub_right, real_inner_smul_left,
      real_inner_smul_left, real_inner_smul_left, real_inner_smul_left,
      real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq, real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq, real_inner_comm y x]
    ring
  have e2 : ‖x - y‖ ^ 2 = ‖x‖ ^ 2 - 2 * ⟪x, y⟫ + ‖y‖ ^ 2 := norm_sub_sq_real x y
  have h3 : 0 ≤ (‖x‖ ^ m - ‖y‖ ^ m) * (‖x‖ ^ 2 - ‖y‖ ^ 2) := by
    rcases le_total ‖x‖ ‖y‖ with h | h
    · exact mul_nonneg_of_nonpos_of_nonpos
        (sub_nonpos.2 (pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) h _))
        (sub_nonpos.2 (pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) h _))
    · exact mul_nonneg (sub_nonneg.2 (pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) h _))
        (sub_nonneg.2 (pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) h _))
  have h4 := mul_nonneg (pow_nonneg (norm_nonneg x) m) (sq_nonneg ‖x - y‖)
  rw [e1]
  rw [e2] at h4 ⊢
  nlinarith [h3, h4]

/-- Helper: for `s ≠ 0` the derivative of `u ↦ σ Q(s, z₀, u)` along the radial field `u` is
`σ s⁻² D ⟨|z|^{D-2} z - |z₀|^{D-2} z₀, z - z₀⟩` with `z = z₀ + s u`. -/
lemma radialOscQ_fderiv {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) (σ : ℝ) {s : ℝ} (hs : s ≠ 0)
    (z₀ u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    fderiv ℝ (fun u' => σ * radialOscQ d s z₀ u') u u =
      σ * (s ^ 2)⁻¹ * (2 * d) * ⟪‖z₀ + s • u‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) • (z₀ + s • u) -
        ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) • z₀, (z₀ + s • u) - z₀⟫ := by
  have hfun : (fun u' => σ * radialOscQ d s z₀ u') = fun u' => σ * (s ^ 2)⁻¹ *
      (radialPoly n d (z₀ + s • u') - radialPoly n d z₀ -
        s * (2 * d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ⟪z₀, u'⟫)) := by
    funext u'
    rw [radialOscQ_spec hd]
    field_simp
  have hP := (radialPoly_hasGradientAt n d (z₀ + s • u)).hasFDerivAt
  have hA : HasFDerivAt (fun u' : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => z₀ + s • u')
      (s • ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ _) u :=
    ((hasFDerivAt_id u).const_smul s).const_add z₀
  have hI : HasFDerivAt (fun u' : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => ⟪z₀, u'⟫) (innerSL ℝ z₀) u :=
    (innerSL ℝ z₀).hasFDerivAt
  have h := ((((hP.comp u hA).sub_const (radialPoly n d z₀)).sub
    ((hI.const_mul (2 * d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2))).const_mul s)).const_mul (σ * (s ^ 2)⁻¹))
  have h2 : HasFDerivAt (fun u' => σ * (s ^ 2)⁻¹ *
      (radialPoly n d (z₀ + s • u') - radialPoly n d z₀ -
        s * (2 * d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ⟪z₀, u'⟫))) _ u := h
  rw [hfun, h2.fderiv]
  simp only [FunLike.coe_smul, Pi.smul_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.comp_apply,
    FunLike.coe_sub, Pi.sub_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.id_apply,
    InnerProductSpace.toDual_apply_apply, innerSL_apply_apply, smul_eq_mul]
  rw [add_sub_cancel_left]
  simp only [inner_sub_left, real_inner_smul_left, real_inner_smul_right]
  ring

/-- Helper: nonstationarity of the rescaled phase along the radial field `u`:
`|∂_u (σ Q(s, z₀, ·))(u)| ≥ d |z₀|^{D-2} |u|²` for `|σ| = 1` and every `s` (at `s = 0` by
continuity). This is the blueprint's `|∇F(z)| ≥ c₁ |z - z₀|`, in rescaled form. -/
lemma radialOscQ_fderiv_ge {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {σ : ℝ} (hσ : |σ| = 1) (s : ℝ)
    (z₀ u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ‖u‖ ^ 2 ≤ |fderiv ℝ (fun u' => σ * radialOscQ d s z₀ u') u u| := by
  have key : ∀ s : ℝ, s ≠ 0 →
      d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ‖u‖ ^ 2 ≤ |fderiv ℝ (fun u' => σ * radialOscQ d s z₀ u') u u| := by
    intro s hs
    rw [radialOscQ_fderiv hd σ hs]
    have hm := osc_inner_pow_smul_mono (2 * d - 2) (z₀ + s • u) z₀
    rw [add_sub_cancel_left, norm_smul, mul_pow, Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs] at hm
    rw [add_sub_cancel_left]
    set X := ⟪‖z₀ + s • u‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) • (z₀ + s • u) - ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) • z₀, s • u⟫
    have hs2 : 0 < s ^ 2 := by positivity
    have hX : 0 ≤ X := by
      have : 0 ≤ ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * (s ^ 2 * ‖u‖ ^ 2) := by positivity
      linarith
    rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_mul, hσ, abs_of_pos (inv_pos.2 hs2), abs_of_nonneg hX,
      abs_of_nonneg (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2 * d), one_mul]
    rw [inv_mul_eq_div, div_mul_eq_mul_div, le_div_iff₀ hs2]
    nlinarith [hm, (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) ≤ d)]
  rcases ne_or_eq s 0 with hs | rfl
  · exact key s hs
  · have hΦ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun q : ℝ × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => σ * radialOscQ d q.1 z₀ q.2) :=
      contDiff_const.mul (contDiff_radialOscQ d contDiff_fst contDiff_const contDiff_snd)
    have hc : Continuous fun s : ℝ => |fderiv ℝ (fun u' => σ * radialOscQ d s z₀ u') u u| := by
      have := (contDiff_oscW (α := 1) (b := fun _ : ℝ => (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))) hΦ
        contDiff_const).continuous.comp (continuous_id.prodMk (continuous_const (y := u)))
      have e : (fun s : ℝ => fderiv ℝ (fun u' => σ * radialOscQ d s z₀ u') u u) =
          (oscW (fun q : ℝ × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => σ * radialOscQ d q.1 z₀ q.2) 1
            (fun _ => 0)) ∘ fun s => (s, u) := by
        funext s; simp [oscW]
      exact continuous_abs.comp (e ▸ this)
    refine ge_of_tendsto (((hc.tendsto 0).mono_left nhdsWithin_le_nhds :
      Filter.Tendsto _ (nhdsWithin (0 : ℝ) {0}ᶜ) _)) ?_
    exact eventually_nhdsWithin_of_forall fun s hs => key s hs

/-- Helper for Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.1) middle line: the uniform bound for
one dyadic shell `|z - z₀| ≍ s` around the critical point, after the substitution `z = z₀ + s u`:
`|∫ e(λ σ Q(s, z₀, u)) a(z₀ + s u) ψ(u) du| ≤ C_N λ^{-N}`, uniformly for `|σ| = 1`,
`0 ≤ s ≤ s_max`, `r₀ ≤ |z₀| ≤ r₁` and `λ > 0` (the shells' integration by parts along the vector
field, via the compact-family mechanism `norm_integral_eC_mul_le_of_nonstationary`). -/
lemma radialOsc_shell_bound {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) {r₀ : ℝ} (hr₀ : 0 < r₀) (r₁ smax : ℝ) (N : ℕ) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ σ : ℝ, |σ| = 1 → ∀ s ∈ Icc (0 : ℝ) smax,
      ∀ z₀ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), r₀ ≤ ‖z₀‖ → ‖z₀‖ ≤ r₁ → ∀ lam : ℝ, 0 < lam →
        ‖∫ u, eC (lam * (σ * radialOscQ d s z₀ u)) * (a (z₀ + s • u) * (dyadicPsi u : ℂ))‖ ≤
          C * (lam ^ N)⁻¹ := by
  have hK : IsCompact (sphere (0 : ℝ) 1 ×ˢ (Icc (0 : ℝ) smax ×ˢ
      (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) r₁ ∩ {z | r₀ ≤ ‖z‖}))) :=
    (isCompact_sphere _ _).prod (isCompact_Icc.prod
      ((isCompact_closedBall _ _).inter_right (isClosed_le continuous_const continuous_norm)))
  have hδ : 0 < d * r₀ ^ (2 * d - 2) / 4 := by
    have : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
    positivity
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := norm_integral_eC_mul_le_of_nonstationary
    (P := ℝ × ℝ × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))
    (Φ := fun q => q.1.1 * radialOscQ d q.1.2.1 q.1.2.2 q.2) (α := 1) (b := fun _ => 0)
    (δ := d * r₀ ^ (2 * d - 2) / 4)
    (A := fun q => a (q.1.2.2 + q.1.2.1 • q.2) * (dyadicPsi q.2 : ℂ))
    (S := radialOscAnnulus n)
    (contDiff_fst.fst.mul (contDiff_radialOscQ d contDiff_fst.snd.fst contDiff_fst.snd.snd
      contDiff_snd)) contDiff_const
    ((ha.1.comp (contDiff_fst.snd.snd.add (contDiff_fst.snd.fst.smul contDiff_snd))).mul
      (Complex.ofRealCLM.contDiff.comp (contDiff_dyadicPsi.comp contDiff_snd)))
    isCompact_radialOscAnnulus (fun p z hz => by
      simp only [radialOscAnnulus, mem_ofPred_eq, not_and_or, not_le] at hz
      rcases hz with h | h
      · simp [dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_le h.le]
      · simp [dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_ge h.le])
    hK hδ (fun p hp z hz => by
      change d * r₀ ^ (2 * d - 2) / 4 ≤
        |fderiv ℝ (fun z' => p.1 * radialOscQ d p.2.1 p.2.2 z') z (1 • z + 0)|
      rw [one_smul, add_zero]
      have h1 := hp.1
      rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm, Real.norm_eq_abs] at h1
      refine le_trans ?_ (radialOscQ_fderiv_ge hd h1 p.2.1 p.2.2 z)
      have h2 : r₀ ≤ ‖p.2.2‖ := hp.2.2.2
      have h3 : (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ 2 ≤ ‖z‖ ^ 2 := pow_le_pow_left₀ (by norm_num) hz.1 2
      have h4 : r₀ ^ (2 * d - 2) ≤ ‖p.2.2‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) := pow_le_pow_left₀ hr₀.le h2 _
      have : (0 : ℝ) ≤ d := by positivity
      calc (d : ℝ) * r₀ ^ (2 * d - 2) / 4 = d * r₀ ^ (2 * d - 2) * (1 / 2) ^ 2 := by ring
        _ ≤ d * ‖p.2.2‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ‖z‖ ^ 2 := by gcongr) N
  refine ⟨max C 0, le_max_right _ _, fun σ hσ s hs z₀ h0 h1 lam hlam => ?_⟩
  have hp : (σ, s, z₀) ∈ sphere (0 : ℝ) 1 ×ˢ (Icc (0 : ℝ) smax ×ˢ
      (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) r₁ ∩ {z | r₀ ≤ ‖z‖})) :=
    ⟨by rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm, Real.norm_eq_abs]; exact hσ, hs,
      mem_closedBall_zero_iff.2 h1, h0⟩
  exact (hC _ hp lam hlam).trans (by gcongr; exact le_max_left _ _)

/-- Helper: the affine change of variables `z = z₀ + s u`, `∫ g = s^n ∫ g(z₀ + s u)` (`s > 0`). -/
lemma osc_integral_eq_smul_integral_affine {F : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedSpace ℝ F]
    (g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → F) (z₀ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) {s : ℝ} (hs : 0 < s) :
    ∫ z, g z = s ^ n • ∫ u, g (z₀ + s • u) := by
  rw [Measure.integral_comp_smul volume (fun x => g (z₀ + x)), integral_add_left_eq_self,
    finrank_euclideanSpace_fin, smul_smul, abs_of_pos (by positivity),
    mul_inv_cancel₀ (by positivity), one_smul]

/-- Helper: the critical point `z₀` of the phase `t P(z) - z·η` (`t ∇P(z₀) = η`) for
`c₀|t| ≤ |η| ≤ C₀|t|`; its norm lies in a fixed compact interval `[r₀, r₁] ⊆ (0, ∞)`. -/
lemma radialOsc_exists_crit {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {c₀ : ℝ} (hc₀ : 0 < c₀) (C₀ : ℝ) :
    ∃ r₀ r₁ : ℝ, 0 < r₀ ∧ ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)), t ≠ 0 → c₀ * |t| ≤ ‖η‖ →
      ‖η‖ ≤ C₀ * |t| → ∃ z₀ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), r₀ ≤ ‖z₀‖ ∧ ‖z₀‖ ≤ r₁ ∧
        η = (t * (2 * d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2))) • z₀ := by
  have hd' : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
  set m : ℕ := 2 * d - 1 with hm
  have hm0 : m ≠ 0 := by omega
  refine ⟨(c₀ / (2 * d)) ^ ((m : ℝ)⁻¹), (C₀ / (2 * d)) ^ ((m : ℝ)⁻¹),
    Real.rpow_pos_of_pos (by positivity) _, fun t η ht h1 h2 => ?_⟩
  have hT : 0 < |t| := abs_pos.2 ht
  have hη : 0 < ‖η‖ := lt_of_lt_of_le (by positivity) h1
  set v := ‖η‖ / (2 * d * |t|) with hv
  have hv0 : 0 ≤ v := by positivity
  set r := v ^ ((m : ℝ)⁻¹) with hr
  have hr0 : 0 ≤ r := Real.rpow_nonneg hv0 _
  have hrm : r ^ m = v := Real.rpow_inv_natCast_pow hv0 hm0
  set σ := t / |t| with hσ
  have hσ1 : |σ| = 1 := by rw [hσ, abs_div, abs_abs, div_self hT.ne']
  refine ⟨(σ * r / ‖η‖) • η, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;>
    have hnorm : ‖(σ * r / ‖η‖) • η‖ = r := by
      rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_div, abs_mul, hσ1, one_mul, abs_of_nonneg hr0,
        abs_norm, div_mul_cancel₀ _ hη.ne']
  · rw [hnorm]
    refine Real.rpow_le_rpow (by positivity) ?_ (by positivity)
    rw [hv, div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) (by positivity)]
    nlinarith
  · rw [hnorm]
    refine Real.rpow_le_rpow hv0 ?_ (by positivity)
    rw [hv, div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) (by positivity)]
    nlinarith
  · rw [hnorm, smul_smul]
    have hrm' : r ^ (2 * d - 2) * r = v := by rw [← pow_succ, show 2 * d - 2 + 1 = m by omega, hrm]
    have htσ : t * σ = |t| := by
      rw [hσ, mul_div_assoc', div_eq_iff hT.ne', ← sq, ← sq_abs t]; ring
    have : t * (2 * d * r ^ (2 * d - 2)) * (σ * r / ‖η‖) = 1 := by
      calc t * (2 * d * r ^ (2 * d - 2)) * (σ * r / ‖η‖) =
          2 * d * (t * σ) * (r ^ (2 * d - 2) * r) / ‖η‖ := by ring
        _ = 1 := by rw [htσ, hrm', hv]; field_simp
    rw [this, one_smul]

/-- Helper: the phase at `z₀ + s u` around the critical point `z₀` (`t ∇P(z₀) = η`):
`φ(z₀ + s u) = φ(z₀) + t s² Q(s, z₀, u)` with `φ(z) = t P(z) - z·η`. -/
lemma radialOsc_phase_eq {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) (t s : ℝ) (z₀ u η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))
    (hη : η = (t * (2 * d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2))) • z₀) :
    t * radialPoly n d (z₀ + s • u) - ⟪z₀ + s • u, η⟫ =
      (t * radialPoly n d z₀ - ⟪z₀, η⟫) + t * s ^ 2 * radialOscQ d s z₀ u := by
  have h := radialOscQ_spec hd s z₀ u
  have hi : ⟪z₀ + s • u, η⟫ = ⟪z₀, η⟫ + s * (t * (2 * d * ‖z₀‖ ^ (2 * d - 2) * ⟪z₀, u⟫)) := by
    rw [inner_add_left, real_inner_smul_left]
    congr 2
    rw [hη, real_inner_smul_right, real_inner_comm]; ring
  rw [hi]
  linear_combination t * h

/-- Helper: a smooth real cutoff times `e(φ) a` is integrable. -/
lemma radialOsc_integrable_cut {d : ℕ} {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))
    {g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ} (hg : Continuous g) :
    Integrable (fun z => eC (t * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, η⟫) * (a z * (g z : ℂ))) := by
  refine osc_integrable_of_vanish ?_ isCompact_radialOscAnnulus (fun z hz => by simp [ha.2.1 z hz])
  exact (osc_contDiff_eC.continuous.comp ((continuous_const.mul
    (contDiff_radialPoly d).continuous).sub (continuous_id.inner continuous_const))).mul
    (ha.1.continuous.mul (Complex.continuous_ofReal.comp hg))

/-- Helper: `η` is integrable. -/
lemma integrable_dyadicEta : Integrable (dyadicEta (n := n)) :=
  contDiff_dyadicEta.continuous.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport
    (HasCompactSupport.intro (isCompact_closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) 2)
      (fun z hz => dyadicEta_eq_zero (by
        rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, not_le] at hz; exact hz.le)))

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.1) middle line, for arbitrary constants: for
every admissible amplitude `a` and all `0 < c₀`, `C₀`, there is `C` with
`|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C |t|^{-n/2}` whenever `t ≠ 0` and `c₀ |t| ≤ |η| ≤ C₀ |t|`. (Proof: critical point
`z₀` with `t ∇P(z₀) = η`, inner ball `|z - z₀| ≲ ρ₀ = |t|^{-1/2}` bounded trivially, dyadic
shells `|z - z₀| ≍ 2^k ρ₀` bounded by `radialOsc_shell_bound` with `N = n`, and summed.) -/
theorem norm_radialOscInt_le_stationary_of {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) (hn : 1 ≤ n)
    {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) {c₀ : ℝ} (hc₀ : 0 < c₀)
    (C₀ : ℝ) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)), t ≠ 0 → c₀ * |t| ≤ ‖η‖ →
      ‖η‖ ≤ C₀ * |t| → ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C * |t| ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) := by
  obtain ⟨r₀, r₁, hr₀, hcrit⟩ := radialOsc_exists_crit (n := n) hd hc₀ C₀
  set smax := 2 * (2 + r₁) with hsmax
  obtain ⟨Cs, hCs0, hCs⟩ := radialOsc_shell_bound hd ha hr₀ r₁ smax n
  obtain ⟨M, hM⟩ := ha.1.continuous.bounded_above_of_compact_support
    (HasCompactSupport.intro isCompact_radialOscAnnulus ha.2.1)
  have hM0 : 0 ≤ M := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hM 0)
  set Iη := ∫ u, dyadicEta (n := n) u with hIη
  have hIη0 : 0 ≤ Iη := integral_nonneg fun u => (dyadicEta_mem_Icc u).1
  refine ⟨M * Iη + Cs, by positivity, fun t η ht h1 h2 => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨z₀, hz0, hz1, hηeq⟩ := hcrit t η ht h1 h2
  have hr₁ : 0 ≤ r₁ := hr₀.le.trans (hz0.trans hz1)
  set T := |t| with hTdef
  have hT : 0 < T := abs_pos.2 ht
  set ρ := T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) with hρdef
  have hρ : 0 < ρ := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hT _
  have hTρ : T * ρ ^ 2 = 1 := by
    rw [hρdef, ← Real.rpow_natCast, ← Real.rpow_mul hT.le]
    norm_num
    rw [Real.rpow_neg_one, mul_inv_cancel₀ hT.ne']
  have hρn : ρ ^ n = T ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) := by
    rw [hρdef, ← Real.rpow_natCast, ← Real.rpow_mul hT.le]
    ring_nf
  obtain ⟨J, hJ⟩ := pow_unbounded_of_one_lt ((2 + r₁) / ρ) (one_lt_two : (1 : ℝ) < 2)
  set φ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ := fun z => t * radialPoly n d z - ⟪z, η⟫ with hφ
  have hdec : ∀ z, eC (φ z) * a z = eC (φ z) * (a z * (dyadicEta (ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) : ℂ)) +
      ∑ j ∈ Finset.range J, eC (φ z) *
        (a z * (dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-((j : ℤ) + 1)) • ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) : ℂ)) := by
    intro z
    by_cases hz : z ∈ radialOscAnnulus n
    · have hs := sum_dyadicPsi (ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) J
      have hle : ‖(2 : ℝ) ^ (-(J : ℤ)) • ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)‖ ≤ 1 := by
        rw [norm_smul, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by positivity),
          abs_of_pos (inv_pos.2 hρ), zpow_neg, zpow_natCast, ← mul_assoc, ← mul_inv]
        rw [inv_mul_le_iff₀ (by positivity), mul_one]
        have : ‖z - z₀‖ ≤ 2 + r₁ := (norm_sub_le _ _).trans (add_le_add hz.2 hz1)
        rw [div_lt_iff₀ hρ] at hJ
        linarith
      rw [dyadicEta_eq_one hle] at hs
      rw [← Finset.mul_sum, ← mul_add, ← Finset.mul_sum, ← mul_add]
      congr 2
      rw [← Complex.ofReal_sum, hs]
      push_cast; ring
    · simp [ha.2.1 z hz]
  have hcont_psi : ∀ j : ℕ, Continuous fun z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
      dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-((j : ℤ) + 1)) • ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) := fun j =>
    contDiff_dyadicPsi.continuous.comp (by fun_prop)
  have hcont_eta : Continuous fun z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) => dyadicEta (ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) :=
    contDiff_dyadicEta.continuous.comp (by fun_prop)
  have hI : radialOscInt d a t η = (∫ z, eC (φ z) * (a z * (dyadicEta (ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) : ℂ))) +
      ∑ j ∈ Finset.range J, ∫ z, eC (φ z) *
        (a z * (dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-((j : ℤ) + 1)) • ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) : ℂ)) := by
    rw [radialOscInt]
    refine (integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hdec)).trans ?_
    rw [integral_add, integral_finsetSum]
    · exact fun j _ => radialOsc_integrable_cut ha t η (hcont_psi j)
    · exact radialOsc_integrable_cut ha t η hcont_eta
    · exact integrable_finsetSum _ fun j _ => radialOsc_integrable_cut ha t η (hcont_psi j)
  -- the inner ball
  have hA : ‖∫ z, eC (φ z) * (a z * (dyadicEta (ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) : ℂ))‖ ≤ ρ ^ n * (M * Iη) := by
    rw [osc_integral_eq_smul_integral_affine _ z₀ hρ]
    simp only [add_sub_cancel_left, inv_smul_smul₀ hρ.ne']
    rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
    gcongr
    refine (norm_integral_le_of_norm_le (integrable_dyadicEta.const_mul M)
      (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun u => ?_)).trans (by rw [integral_const_mul])
    rw [norm_mul, osc_norm_eC, one_mul, norm_mul, Complex.norm_real,
      Real.norm_of_nonneg (dyadicEta_mem_Icc _).1]
    exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hM _) (dyadicEta_mem_Icc _).1
  -- the shells
  have hB : ∀ j ∈ Finset.range J, ‖∫ z, eC (φ z) *
      (a z * (dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-((j : ℤ) + 1)) • ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) : ℂ))‖ ≤
        Cs * ρ ^ n * (1 / 2) ^ (j + 1) := by
    intro j _
    set X : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) with hX
    have hX1 : 1 ≤ X := one_le_pow₀ (by norm_num)
    set s := X * ρ with hsdef
    have hs : 0 < s := by positivity
    have hsc : ∀ z : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
        (2 : ℝ) ^ (-((j : ℤ) + 1)) • ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀) = s⁻¹ • (z - z₀) := by
      intro z
      rw [smul_smul, hsdef, mul_inv, hX, zpow_neg, show ((j : ℤ) + 1) = ((j + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ) by
        push_cast; ring, zpow_natCast]
    have hph : ∀ u, φ (z₀ + s • u) = φ z₀ + (T * s ^ 2) * ((t / T) * radialOscQ d s z₀ u) := by
      intro u
      simp only [hφ]
      rw [radialOsc_phase_eq hd t s z₀ u η hηeq]
      field_simp
    rw [osc_integral_eq_smul_integral_affine _ z₀ hs]
    simp only [hsc]
    simp only [add_sub_cancel_left, inv_smul_smul₀ hs.ne', hph, eC_add, mul_assoc (eC (φ z₀))]
    rw [integral_const_mul, norm_smul, norm_mul, osc_norm_eC, one_mul,
      Real.norm_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
    have hσ : |t / T| = 1 := by rw [abs_div, hTdef, abs_abs, div_self hT.ne']
    have hTs : T * s ^ 2 = X ^ 2 := by rw [hsdef, mul_pow, ← mul_assoc, mul_comm T, mul_assoc, hTρ,
      mul_one]
    have hbound : ‖∫ u, eC (T * s ^ 2 * (t / T * radialOscQ d s z₀ u)) *
        (a (z₀ + s • u) * (dyadicPsi u : ℂ))‖ ≤ Cs * ((T * s ^ 2) ^ n)⁻¹ := by
      rcases le_or_gt s smax with h | h
      · exact hCs _ hσ s ⟨hs.le, h⟩ z₀ hz0 hz1 _ (by positivity)
      · have h0 : ∀ u, eC (T * s ^ 2 * (t / T * radialOscQ d s z₀ u)) *
            (a (z₀ + s • u) * (dyadicPsi u : ℂ)) = 0 := by
          intro u
          rcases le_or_gt ‖u‖ (1 / 2) with hu | hu
          · simp [dyadicPsi_eq_zero_of_le hu]
          · have : a (z₀ + s • u) = 0 := by
              refine ha.2.1 _ (fun hm => ?_)
              have h3 : s * ‖u‖ ≤ ‖z₀ + s • u‖ + ‖z₀‖ := by
                have := norm_sub_le (z₀ + s • u) z₀
                rwa [add_sub_cancel_left, norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg hs.le] at this
              have h4 : smax * (1 / 2) < s * ‖u‖ := mul_lt_mul h hu.le (by norm_num) hs.le
              linarith [hm.2]
            simp [this]
        rw [integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall h0), integral_zero, norm_zero]
        positivity
    calc s ^ n * ‖∫ u, eC (T * s ^ 2 * (t / T * radialOscQ d s z₀ u)) *
          (a (z₀ + s • u) * (dyadicPsi u : ℂ))‖ ≤ s ^ n * (Cs * ((T * s ^ 2) ^ n)⁻¹) := by
          gcongr
      _ = Cs * ρ ^ n * (X ^ n)⁻¹ := by
          have hX2 : (X ^ 2) ^ n = X ^ n * X ^ n := by rw [← pow_mul, ← pow_add]; ring_nf
          rw [hTs, hsdef, mul_pow, hX2]
          field_simp
      _ ≤ Cs * ρ ^ n * (1 / 2) ^ (j + 1) := by
          rw [one_div_pow, one_div, ← hX]
          gcongr
          exact le_self_pow₀ hX1 (by omega)
  have hsum : ∑ j ∈ Finset.range J, Cs * ρ ^ n * (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) ≤ Cs * ρ ^ n := by
    rw [← Finset.mul_sum]
    have : ∑ j ∈ Finset.range J, (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 1) ≤ 1 := by
      have h := summable_geometric_two.sum_le_tsum (Finset.range J) (fun _ _ => by positivity)
      rw [tsum_geometric_two] at h
      simp only [pow_succ, ← Finset.sum_mul]
      linarith
    have : 0 ≤ Cs * ρ ^ n := by positivity
    nlinarith
  rw [hI, ← hρn]
  calc _ ≤ ‖(∫ z, eC (φ z) * (a z * (dyadicEta (ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) : ℂ)))‖ +
        ∑ j ∈ Finset.range J, ‖∫ z, eC (φ z) *
          (a z * (dyadicPsi ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-((j : ℤ) + 1)) • ρ⁻¹ • (z - z₀)) : ℂ))‖ :=
        (norm_add_le _ _).trans (by gcongr; exact norm_sum_le _ _)
    _ ≤ ρ ^ n * (M * Iη) + Cs * ρ ^ n := add_le_add hA ((Finset.sum_le_sum hB).trans hsum)
    _ = (M * Iη + Cs) * ρ ^ n := by ring

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.1) middle line: with `c = radialOscSmall d` and
`C = radialOscLarge d`, for every admissible amplitude `a` there is `C'` with
`|Ψ_a(t, η)| ≤ C' |t|^{-n/2}` whenever `|t| ≥ 1` and `c|t| ≤ |η| ≤ C|t|`. -/
theorem norm_radialOscInt_le_middle (hn : 1 ≤ n) {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d)
    {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)), 1 ≤ |t| →
      radialOscSmall d * |t| ≤ ‖η‖ → ‖η‖ ≤ radialOscLarge d * |t| →
        ‖radialOscInt d a t η‖ ≤ C * |t| ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_stationary_of hd hn ha (radialOscSmall_pos hd)
    (radialOscLarge d)
  exact ⟨C, hC0, fun t η ht h1 h2 =>
    hC t η (by rintro rfl; norm_num at ht) h1 h2⟩

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.1) middle line for `Ψ` and `∂_t Ψ`
(`∂_t Ψ(t, η) = radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d) t η`, see `hasDerivAt_radialOscPsi`):
`|F(t, η)| ≤ C |t|^{-n/2}` for `|t| ≥ 1`, `c|t| ≤ |η| ≤ C|t|` (same `c`, `C` as in
`radialOscPsi_estimates`). -/
theorem radialOscPsi_middle (hn : 1 ≤ n) {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ F ∈ ({radialOscPsi Ω d, radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d)} :
        Set (ℝ → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)), ∀ (t : ℝ) (η : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
        1 ≤ |t| → radialOscSmall d * |t| ≤ ‖η‖ → ‖η‖ ≤ radialOscLarge d * |t| →
          ‖F t η‖ ≤ C * |t| ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) := by
  obtain ⟨C1, hC1, h1⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_middle hn hd (isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmp hn hΩ d)
  obtain ⟨C2, hC2, h2⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_middle hn hd
    (isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmpDeriv hn hΩ d)
  refine ⟨C1 + C2, by positivity, fun F hF t η ht ha hb => ?_⟩
  have hp : 0 ≤ |t| ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) := Real.rpow_nonneg (abs_nonneg _) _
  rcases hF with rfl | rfl
  · exact (h1 t η ht ha hb).trans (by gcongr; linarith)
  · exact (h2 t η ht ha hb).trans (by gcongr; linarith)

end RadialStationary

/-! ### Lemma 5.2: the square sums (5.2) and (5.3) -/

section RadialSquare

/-- Helper: a geometric series over distinct nonnegative integer exponents is at most `2`. -/
lemma osc_sum_half_pow_le {S : Finset ℤ} {f : ℤ → ℤ} (hf : ∀ j ∈ S, 0 ≤ f j)
    (hinj : Set.InjOn f S) : ∑ j ∈ S, (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (f j).toNat ≤ 2 := by
  have hinj' : Set.InjOn (fun j => (f j).toNat) S := by
    intro j hj j' hj' h
    apply hinj hj hj'
    have := congrArg (fun k : ℕ => (k : ℤ)) h
    simpa [Int.toNat_of_nonneg (hf j hj), Int.toNat_of_nonneg (hf j' hj')] using this
  rw [← Finset.sum_image (f := fun k : ℕ => (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ k) hinj']
  exact (summable_geometric_two.sum_le_tsum _ (fun _ _ => by positivity)).trans_eq
    tsum_geometric_two

/-- Helper: `2^j = (1/2)^{(m - j)} · 2^m` for `j ≤ m`. -/
lemma osc_zpow_eq_half_pow {j m : ℤ} (h : j ≤ m) :
    (2 : ℝ) ^ j = (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat * 2 ^ m := by
  have hm : ((m - j).toNat : ℤ) = m - j := Int.toNat_of_nonneg (by omega)
  rw [one_div_pow, ← zpow_natCast, hm, one_div, ← zpow_neg, ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]
  congr 1; ring

/-- Helper: `∑_{j ∈ S} (2^j β)² ≤ 2 X²` when all `2^j β ≤ X`. -/
lemma osc_sum_sq_le_of_le {β X : ℝ} (hβ : 0 < β) (hX : 0 < X) (S : Finset ℤ)
    (h : ∀ j ∈ S, (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ X) : ∑ j ∈ S, ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2 ≤ 2 * X ^ 2 := by
  rcases S.eq_empty_or_nonempty with rfl | hne
  · rw [Finset.sum_empty]; positivity
  set m := S.max' hne
  have hmS : m ∈ S := S.max'_mem hne
  have hm : ∀ j ∈ S, j ≤ m := fun j hj => S.le_max' j hj
  have hmX : (2 : ℝ) ^ m * β ≤ X := h m hmS
  have key : ∀ j ∈ S, ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2 ≤ X ^ 2 * (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat := by
    intro j hj
    rw [osc_zpow_eq_half_pow (hm j hj)]
    have h1 : (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat ≤ 1 := pow_le_one₀ (by norm_num) (by norm_num)
    have h0 : 0 ≤ (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat := by positivity
    have h2 : 0 ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ m * β := by positivity
    calc ((1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat * 2 ^ m * β) ^ 2 =
        ((1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat) ^ 2 * ((2 : ℝ) ^ m * β) ^ 2 := by ring
      _ ≤ (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat * X ^ 2 := by
        gcongr
        · calc ((1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat) ^ 2 ≤ ((1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat) ^ 1 :=
              pow_le_pow_of_le_one h0 h1 (by norm_num)
            _ = _ := pow_one _
      _ = _ := by ring
  calc ∑ j ∈ S, ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2 ≤ ∑ j ∈ S, X ^ 2 * (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat :=
        Finset.sum_le_sum key
    _ = X ^ 2 * ∑ j ∈ S, (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (m - j).toNat := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
    _ ≤ X ^ 2 * 2 := by
        gcongr
        exact osc_sum_half_pow_le (fun j hj => by linarith [hm j hj])
          (fun j _ j' _ h => by simpa using h)
    _ = 2 * X ^ 2 := by ring

/-- Helper: `∑_{j ∈ S} (2^j β)^{-p} ≤ 2 X^{-p}` when all `2^j β ≥ X` (`p ≥ 1`). -/
lemma osc_sum_inv_pow_le_of_ge {β X : ℝ} (hβ : 0 < β) (hX : 0 < X) {p : ℕ} (hp : 1 ≤ p)
    (S : Finset ℤ) (h : ∀ j ∈ S, X ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) :
    ∑ j ∈ S, (((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ p)⁻¹ ≤ 2 * (X ^ p)⁻¹ := by
  rcases S.eq_empty_or_nonempty with rfl | hne
  · rw [Finset.sum_empty]; positivity
  set m := S.min' hne
  have hmS : m ∈ S := S.min'_mem hne
  have hm : ∀ j ∈ S, m ≤ j := fun j hj => S.min'_le j hj
  have hmX : X ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ m * β := h m hmS
  have key : ∀ j ∈ S, (((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ p)⁻¹ ≤ (X ^ p)⁻¹ * (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat := by
    intro j hj
    have e := osc_zpow_eq_half_pow (hm j hj)
    have h0 : 0 < (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat := by positivity
    have h1 : (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat ≤ 1 := pow_le_one₀ (by norm_num) (by norm_num)
    have hj2 : (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β = ((2 : ℝ) ^ m * β) / (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat := by
      rw [e]; field_simp
    rw [hj2, div_pow, inv_div]
    have hq : ((1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat) ^ p ≤ (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat := by
      calc ((1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat) ^ p ≤ ((1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat) ^ 1 :=
            pow_le_pow_of_le_one h0.le h1 hp
        _ = _ := pow_one _
    rw [div_eq_mul_inv, mul_comm]
    gcongr
  calc ∑ j ∈ S, (((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ p)⁻¹ ≤ ∑ j ∈ S, (X ^ p)⁻¹ * (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat :=
        Finset.sum_le_sum key
    _ = (X ^ p)⁻¹ * ∑ j ∈ S, (1 / 2 : ℝ) ^ (j - m).toNat := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
    _ ≤ (X ^ p)⁻¹ * 2 := by
        gcongr
        exact osc_sum_half_pow_le (fun j hj => by linarith [hm j hj])
          (fun j _ j' _ h => by simpa using h)
    _ = 2 * (X ^ p)⁻¹ := by ring

/-- Helper: at most `M + 1` terms of a geometric progression `2^j β` lie in `[X, 2^M X]`. -/
lemma osc_card_le_of_mem_Icc {β X : ℝ} (hβ : 0 < β) (M : ℕ) (S : Finset ℤ)
    (h : ∀ j ∈ S, X ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ∧ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 2 ^ M * X) : S.card ≤ M + 1 := by
  rcases S.eq_empty_or_nonempty with rfl | hne
  · simp
  set m := S.min' hne
  have hmS : m ∈ S := S.min'_mem hne
  have hsub : S ⊆ Finset.Icc m (m + M) := by
    intro j hj
    have hmj : m ≤ j := S.min'_le j hj
    refine Finset.mem_Icc.2 ⟨hmj, ?_⟩
    have h1 := (h j hj).2
    have h2 := (h m hmS).1
    have h3 : (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 2 ^ M * (2 ^ m * β) :=
      h1.trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h2 (by positivity))
    have h4 : (2 : ℝ) ^ j ≤ 2 ^ ((M : ℤ) + m) := by
      rw [zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero, zpow_natCast]
      have := (mul_le_mul_iff_of_pos_right hβ).1 (by linarith : (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 2 ^ M * 2 ^ m * β)
      exact this
    have := (zpow_le_zpow_iff_right₀ (one_lt_two : (1 : ℝ) < 2)).1 h4
    omega
  calc S.card ≤ (Finset.Icc m (m + M)).card := Finset.card_le_card hsub
    _ = M + 1 := by rw [Int.card_Icc]; omega

/-- Helper for Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.2): for an admissible amplitude there
is `C` with, for every `t`, `ξ` and every finite set `J` of integers,
`∑_{j ∈ J} |Ψ_a(t, 2^j ξ)|² ≤ C` if `|t| ≤ 2`, and `≤ C |t|^{-n}` if `|t| ≥ 1`
(all regions of (5.1), the radii `2^j |ξ|` forming a geometric progression). -/
theorem radialOscInt_square_of {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) (hn : 1 ≤ n)
    {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (t : ℝ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (J : Finset ℤ),
      (|t| ≤ 2 → ∑ j ∈ J, ‖radialOscInt d a t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2 ≤ C) ∧
      (1 ≤ |t| → ∑ j ∈ J, ‖radialOscInt d a t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2 ≤ C * (|t| ^ n)⁻¹) := by
  set c := radialOscSmall d with hc
  set Cl := radialOscLarge d with hCl
  have hc0 : 0 < c := radialOscSmall_pos hd
  have hCl0 : 0 < Cl := radialOscLarge_pos hd
  obtain ⟨C₀, hC₀, h₀⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_bounded hd ha 1
  obtain ⟨C₁, hC₁, h₁⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_small hd ha (n + 1)
  obtain ⟨C₃, hC₃, h₃⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_large hd ha n
  obtain ⟨C₂, hC₂, h₂⟩ := norm_radialOscInt_le_stationary_of hd hn ha hc0 Cl
  obtain ⟨M, hM⟩ := pow_unbounded_of_one_lt (Cl / c) (one_lt_two : (1 : ℝ) < 2)
  set K1 := 4 * C₀ ^ 2 with hK1
  set K2 := 2 * C₁ ^ 2 * c ^ 2 + (M + 1) * C₂ ^ 2 + 2 * C₃ ^ 2 * (Cl ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ with hK2
  have hK1' : 0 ≤ K1 := by positivity
  have hK2' : 0 ≤ K2 := by positivity
  refine ⟨K1 + K2, by positivity, fun t ξ J => ?_⟩
  rcases eq_or_ne ξ 0 with rfl | hξ
  · have h0 : ∑ j ∈ J, ‖radialOscInt d a t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)))‖ ^ 2
        = 0 := by simp [radialOscInt_zero ha]
    rw [h0]
    exact ⟨fun _ => by positivity, fun _ => by positivity⟩
  set β := ‖ξ‖ with hβ
  have hβ0 : 0 < β := norm_pos_iff.2 hξ
  have hnorm : ∀ j : ℤ, ‖(2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ‖ = 2 ^ j * β := fun j => by
    rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg (by positivity)]
  constructor
  · intro ht
    rw [← Finset.sum_filter_add_sum_filter_not J (fun j => (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 1)]
    have hA : ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 1),
        ‖radialOscInt d a t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2 ≤ C₀ ^ 2 * (2 * 1 ^ 2) := by
      calc _ ≤ ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 1), C₀ ^ 2 * ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2 := by
            refine Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => ?_
            have := (h₀ t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ) ht).trans
              (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (min_le_left _ _) hC₀)
            rw [hnorm] at this
            rw [← mul_pow]
            exact pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) this 2
        _ = C₀ ^ 2 * ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 1), ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2 := by
            rw [Finset.mul_sum]
        _ ≤ C₀ ^ 2 * (2 * 1 ^ 2) := by
            gcongr
            exact osc_sum_sq_le_of_le hβ0 one_pos _ fun j hj => (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).2
    have hB : ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => ¬ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 1),
        ‖radialOscInt d a t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2 ≤ C₀ ^ 2 * (2 * ((1 : ℝ) ^ 2)⁻¹) := by
      calc _ ≤ ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => ¬ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 1),
            C₀ ^ 2 * (((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2)⁻¹ := by
            refine Finset.sum_le_sum fun j _ => ?_
            have := (h₀ t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ) ht).trans
              (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (min_le_right _ _) hC₀)
            rw [hnorm, pow_one] at this
            calc ‖radialOscInt d a t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2 ≤ (C₀ * (2 ^ j * β)⁻¹) ^ 2 :=
                  pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) this 2
              _ = _ := by rw [mul_pow, inv_pow]
        _ = C₀ ^ 2 * ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => ¬ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 1),
            (((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2)⁻¹ := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
        _ ≤ C₀ ^ 2 * (2 * ((1 : ℝ) ^ 2)⁻¹) := by
            gcongr
            exact osc_sum_inv_pow_le_of_ge hβ0 one_pos (by norm_num) _
              fun j hj => (not_le.1 (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).2).le
    have : K1 = C₀ ^ 2 * (2 * 1 ^ 2) + C₀ ^ 2 * (2 * ((1 : ℝ) ^ 2)⁻¹) := by rw [hK1]; ring
    linarith
  · intro ht
    set T := |t| with hT
    have hT0 : 0 < T := by linarith
    have ht0 : t ≠ 0 := by rintro rfl; simp [hT] at ht; linarith
    have hTn : 1 ≤ T ^ n := one_le_pow₀ ht
    have hTn0 : 0 < T ^ n := by positivity
    have hT2n : (T ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ ≤ (T ^ n)⁻¹ :=
      inv_anti₀ hTn0 (pow_le_pow_right₀ ht (by omega))
    set f : ℤ → ℝ := fun j => ‖radialOscInt d a t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2 with hf
    set J' := J.filter (fun j => ¬ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ c * T) with hJ'
    rw [← Finset.sum_filter_add_sum_filter_not J (fun j => (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ c * T),
      ← Finset.sum_filter_add_sum_filter_not J' (fun j => Cl * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β)]
    -- small `|η|`
    have hA : ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ c * T), f j ≤
        2 * C₁ ^ 2 * c ^ 2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by
      calc _ ≤ ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ c * T),
            (C₁ * (T ^ (n + 1))⁻¹) ^ 2 * ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2 := by
            refine Finset.sum_le_sum fun j hj => ?_
            have hj' := (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).2
            have := h₁ t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ) ht0 (by rw [hnorm]; exact hj')
            rw [hnorm] at this
            rw [← mul_pow]
            refine pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) (this.trans (le_of_eq (by ring))) 2
        _ = (C₁ * (T ^ (n + 1))⁻¹) ^ 2 * ∑ j ∈ J.filter (fun j => (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ c * T),
            ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ 2 := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
        _ ≤ (C₁ * (T ^ (n + 1))⁻¹) ^ 2 * (2 * (c * T) ^ 2) := by
            gcongr
            exact osc_sum_sq_le_of_le hβ0 (by positivity) _ fun j hj => (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).2
        _ = 2 * C₁ ^ 2 * c ^ 2 * (T ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ := by
            field_simp
            ring
        _ ≤ 2 * C₁ ^ 2 * c ^ 2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by gcongr
    -- large `|η|`
    have hC : ∑ j ∈ J'.filter (fun j => Cl * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β), f j ≤
        2 * C₃ ^ 2 * (Cl ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ * (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by
      calc _ ≤ ∑ j ∈ J'.filter (fun j => Cl * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β),
            C₃ ^ 2 * (((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ := by
            refine Finset.sum_le_sum fun j hj => ?_
            have hj' := (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).2
            have := h₃ t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ) (by rw [hnorm]; exact hj')
            rw [hnorm] at this
            calc f j ≤ (C₃ * (((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ n)⁻¹) ^ 2 :=
                  pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) this 2
              _ = _ := by rw [mul_pow, inv_pow, ← pow_mul, mul_comm n 2]
        _ = C₃ ^ 2 * ∑ j ∈ J'.filter (fun j => Cl * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β),
            (((2 : ℝ) ^ j * β) ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ := by rw [Finset.mul_sum]
        _ ≤ C₃ ^ 2 * (2 * ((Cl * T) ^ (2 * n))⁻¹) := by
            gcongr
            exact osc_sum_inv_pow_le_of_ge hβ0 (by positivity) (by omega) _
              fun j hj => (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).2
        _ = 2 * C₃ ^ 2 * (Cl ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ * (T ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ := by
            rw [mul_pow, mul_inv]; ring
        _ ≤ 2 * C₃ ^ 2 * (Cl ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ * (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by gcongr
    -- the stationary middle region
    have hB : ∑ j ∈ J'.filter (fun j => ¬ Cl * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β), f j ≤
        (M + 1) * C₂ ^ 2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by
      have hsq : (T ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2)) ^ 2 = (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by
        rw [← Real.rpow_natCast, ← Real.rpow_mul hT0.le, ← Real.rpow_natCast T n,
          ← Real.rpow_neg hT0.le]
        congr 1; push_cast; ring
      have hmem : ∀ j ∈ J'.filter (fun j => ¬ Cl * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β),
          c * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ∧ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ 2 ^ M * (c * T) := by
        intro j hj
        have h1 := (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).2
        have h2 := (Finset.mem_filter.1 (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).1).2
        refine ⟨(not_le.1 h2).le, (not_le.1 h1).le.trans ?_⟩
        rw [div_lt_iff₀ hc0] at hM
        rw [← mul_assoc]
        exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hM.le hT0.le
      calc _ ≤ ∑ j ∈ J'.filter (fun j => ¬ Cl * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β), C₂ ^ 2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by
            refine Finset.sum_le_sum fun j hj => ?_
            obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := hmem j hj
            have h3 : (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β ≤ Cl * T :=
              (not_le.1 (Finset.mem_filter.1 hj).2).le
            have := h₂ t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ) ht0 (by rw [hnorm]; exact h1)
              (by rw [hnorm]; exact h3)
            calc f j ≤ (C₂ * T ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2)) ^ 2 := pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) this 2
              _ = _ := by rw [mul_pow, hsq]
        _ = (J'.filter (fun j => ¬ Cl * T ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ j * β)).card * (C₂ ^ 2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹) := by
            rw [Finset.sum_const, nsmul_eq_mul]
        _ ≤ (M + 1) * (C₂ ^ 2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹) := by
            gcongr
            exact_mod_cast osc_card_le_of_mem_Icc hβ0 M _ hmem
        _ = _ := by ring
    have : K2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹ ≤ (K1 + K2) * (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by gcongr; linarith
    have e : K2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹ = 2 * C₁ ^ 2 * c ^ 2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹ + (M + 1) * C₂ ^ 2 * (T ^ n)⁻¹ +
        2 * C₃ ^ 2 * (Cl ^ (2 * n))⁻¹ * (T ^ n)⁻¹ := by rw [hK2]; ring
    linarith

/-- Helper: the square sums at `t = σ u 2^ℓ` for a general admissible amplitude. -/
theorem radialOscInt_square_scale {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d) (hn : 1 ≤ n)
    {a : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (ha : IsRadialOscAmp d a) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ σ : ℝ, |σ| = 1 → ∀ u ∈ Icc (1 : ℝ) 2, ∀ (ℓ : ℤ) (J : Finset ℤ)
      (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ∑ j ∈ J, ‖radialOscInt d a (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2 ≤
        C * (if 0 ≤ ℓ then (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(n : ℤ) * ℓ) else 1) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := radialOscInt_square_of hd hn ha
  refine ⟨C, hC0, fun σ hσ u hu ℓ J ξ => ?_⟩
  have habs : |σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ| = u * 2 ^ ℓ := by
    rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, hσ, one_mul, abs_of_pos (by linarith [hu.1]),
      abs_of_pos (by positivity)]
  split_ifs with hℓ
  · have h1 : (1 : ℝ) ≤ 2 ^ ℓ := one_le_zpow₀ (by norm_num) hℓ
    have ht : 1 ≤ |σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ| := by rw [habs]; nlinarith [hu.1]
    refine ((hC _ ξ J).2 ht).trans ?_
    gcongr
    have e : (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(n : ℤ) * ℓ) = (((2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) ^ n)⁻¹ := by
      rw [neg_mul, zpow_neg, mul_comm, zpow_mul, zpow_natCast]
    rw [e, habs]
    gcongr
    exact le_mul_of_one_le_left (by positivity) hu.1
  · have h1 : (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ ≤ 2 ^ (-1 : ℤ) := zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) (by omega)
    have ht : |σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ| ≤ 2 := by
      rw [habs]
      rw [zpow_neg_one] at h1
      nlinarith [hu.2, (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ ℓ)]
    rw [mul_one]
    exact (hC _ ξ J).1 ht

/-- Helper: `Φ_{j, x 2^{ℓ - Dj}}(ξ) = Ψ(x 2^ℓ, 2^j ξ)`. -/
lemma radialOscPhi_eq_scale {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (d : ℕ)
    (j ℓ : ℤ) (x : ℝ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    radialOscPhi Ω d j (x * (2 : ℝ) ^ (ℓ - (2 * d : ℤ) * j)) ξ =
      radialOscPsi Ω d (x * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ) := by
  rw [radialOscPhi_eq hΩ, mul_assoc, ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero, sub_add_cancel]

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), the `u`-derivative in (5.3):
`∂_u Φ_{j, σ u 2^{ℓ - Dj}}(ξ) = σ 2^ℓ (∂_t Ψ)(σ u 2^ℓ, 2^j ξ)`, with `D = 2d`. -/
theorem hasDerivAt_radialOscPhi_u {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω)
    (d : ℕ) (σ : ℝ) (j ℓ : ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (u : ℝ) :
    HasDerivAt (fun u : ℝ => radialOscPhi Ω d j (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ (ℓ - (2 * d : ℤ) * j)) ξ)
      (((σ * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ : ℝ) : ℂ) *
        radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d) (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)) u := by
  have e : (fun u : ℝ => radialOscPhi Ω d j (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ (ℓ - (2 * d : ℤ) * j)) ξ) =
      (fun t => radialOscPsi Ω d t ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)) ∘ (fun u : ℝ => σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) := by
    funext u; simp only [Function.comp, radialOscPhi_eq_scale hΩ]
  have hlin : HasDerivAt (fun u : ℝ => σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) (σ * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) u := by
    simpa using ((hasDerivAt_id u).const_mul σ).mul_const ((2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ)
  rw [e]
  have := (hasDerivAt_radialOscPsi hΩ d (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)).scomp u hlin
  rwa [Complex.real_smul] at this

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.2): there is `C` such that for
`σ ∈ {-1, 1}`, `u ∈ [1, 2]`, `ℓ ∈ ℤ`, every finite set `J` of integers and every `ξ`,
`∑_{j ∈ J} |Φ_{j, σ u 2^{ℓ - Dj}}(ξ)|² ≤ C · (2^{-nℓ} if ℓ ≥ 0, 1 if ℓ < 0)`, with `D = 2d`. -/
theorem radialOscPhi_square (hn : 1 ≤ n) {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d)
    {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ σ : ℝ, (σ = 1 ∨ σ = -1) → ∀ u ∈ Icc (1 : ℝ) 2, ∀ (ℓ : ℤ)
      (J : Finset ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ∑ j ∈ J, ‖radialOscPhi Ω d j (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ (ℓ - (2 * d : ℤ) * j)) ξ‖ ^ 2 ≤
        C * (if 0 ≤ ℓ then (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(n : ℤ) * ℓ) else 1) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := radialOscInt_square_scale hd hn (isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmp hn hΩ d)
  refine ⟨C, hC0, fun σ hσ u hu ℓ J ξ => ?_⟩
  have hσ' : |σ| = 1 := by rcases hσ with rfl | rfl <;> norm_num
  simpa only [radialOscPhi_eq_scale hΩ, radialOscPsi_eq] using hC σ hσ' u hu ℓ J ξ

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.2 (`lem:radialFourier`), (5.3): there is `C` such that for
`σ ∈ {-1, 1}`, `u ∈ [1, 2]`, `ℓ ∈ ℤ`, every finite set `J` of integers and every `ξ`, the maps
`u ↦ Φ_{j, σ u 2^{ℓ - Dj}}(ξ)` have derivative `∂_u Φ_j = σ 2^ℓ (∂_t Ψ)(σ u 2^ℓ, 2^j ξ)` and
`∑_{j ∈ J} |∂_u Φ_{j, σ u 2^{ℓ - Dj}}(ξ)|² ≤ C · (2^{(2-n)ℓ} if ℓ ≥ 0, 2^{2ℓ} if ℓ < 0)`. -/
theorem radialOscPhi_deriv_square (hn : 1 ≤ n) {d : ℕ} (hd : 1 ≤ d)
    {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ σ : ℝ, (σ = 1 ∨ σ = -1) → ∀ u ∈ Icc (1 : ℝ) 2, ∀ (ℓ : ℤ)
      (J : Finset ℤ) (ξ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      (∀ j ∈ J, HasDerivAt
        (fun u : ℝ => radialOscPhi Ω d j (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ (ℓ - (2 * d : ℤ) * j)) ξ)
        (((σ * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ : ℝ) : ℂ) *
          radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d) (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)) u) ∧
      ∑ j ∈ J, ‖((σ * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ : ℝ) : ℂ) *
          radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d) (σ * u * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2 ≤
        C * (if 0 ≤ ℓ then (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 - n : ℤ) * ℓ) else (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * ℓ)) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC0, hC⟩ := radialOscInt_square_scale hd hn
    (isRadialOscAmp_radialOscAmpDeriv hn hΩ d)
  refine ⟨C, hC0, fun σ hσ u hu ℓ J ξ =>
    ⟨fun j _ => hasDerivAt_radialOscPhi_u hΩ d σ j ℓ ξ u, ?_⟩⟩
  have hσ' : |σ| = 1 := by rcases hσ with rfl | rfl <;> norm_num
  have hsq : ∀ z : ℂ, ‖((σ * (2 : ℝ) ^ ℓ : ℝ) : ℂ) * z‖ ^ 2 = (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * ℓ) * ‖z‖ ^ 2 := by
    intro z
    rw [norm_mul, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_mul, hσ', one_mul,
      abs_of_pos (by positivity), mul_pow, mul_comm (2 : ℤ) ℓ, zpow_mul]
    norm_num
  simp only [hsq]
  rw [← Finset.mul_sum]
  have h := hC σ hσ' u hu ℓ J ξ
  have h2 : (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ (2 * ℓ) := by positivity
  calc (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * ℓ) * ∑ j ∈ J, ‖radialOscInt d (radialOscAmpDeriv Ω d)
        (σ * u * 2 ^ ℓ) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j • ξ)‖ ^ 2
      ≤ 2 ^ (2 * ℓ) * (C * (if 0 ≤ ℓ then (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(n : ℤ) * ℓ) else 1)) := by gcongr
    _ = C * (if 0 ≤ ℓ then (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 - n : ℤ) * ℓ) else (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * ℓ)) := by
      split_ifs
      · rw [sub_mul, sub_eq_add_neg, zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero, ← neg_mul]; ring
      · ring

end RadialSquare

end RadialFourier

section ContinuousBand

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate Convolution

variable {n : ℕ}

/-- The modulated dyadic kernel `k_{j,μ}(y) = e(μ P(y)) K_j(y)`, `a = (j, μ)`, of Blueprint
Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`). -/
noncomputable def bandKer (n d : ℕ) (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (a : ℤ × ℝ)
    (y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  eC (a.2 * radialPoly n d y) * dyadicKernel Ω a.1 y

/-- The convolution `(e(μ P) K_j) * f (x) = ∫ e(μ P(y)) K_j(y) f(x - y) dy`, `a = (j, μ)`. -/
noncomputable def bandConv (n d : ℕ) (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (a : ℤ × ℝ)
    (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  ∫ y, bandKer n d Ω a y * f (x - y)

/-- The admissibility condition `T ≤ |μ| 2^{Dj} ≤ 2T` (`D = 2d`) for `a = (j, μ)`. -/
def IsBandAdm (d : ℕ) (T : ℝ) (a : ℤ × ℝ) : Prop :=
  T ≤ |a.2| * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * a.1) ∧ |a.2| * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * a.1) ≤ 2 * T

/-- The continuous annular maximal function of Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`):
`𝔥_T f(x) = sup_{j ∈ ℤ, T ≤ |μ| 2^{Dj} ≤ 2T} |(e(μ P) K_j) * f(x)|` (`D = 2d`, `P = radialPoly n d`,
`K_j = dyadicKernel Ω j`), valued in `[0, ∞]`. -/
noncomputable def contBandMax (n d : ℕ) (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (T : ℝ)
    (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ≥0∞ :=
  ⨆ (j : ℤ) (μ : ℝ) (_ : T ≤ |μ| * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * j) ∧
      |μ| * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * j) ≤ 2 * T),
    ‖∫ y, eC (μ * radialPoly n d y) * dyadicKernel Ω j y * f (x - y)‖ₑ

/-- Helper: `contBandMax` is the supremum of `|bandConv a f|` over admissible `a`. -/
lemma contBandMax_eq (n d : ℕ) (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (T : ℝ)
    (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    contBandMax n d Ω T f x = ⨆ (a : ℤ × ℝ) (_ : IsBandAdm d T a), ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ := by
  rw [contBandMax, iSup_prod]
  rfl

variable {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- Helper: `|k_{j,μ}| = |K_j|`. -/
lemma norm_bandKer (a : ℤ × ℝ) (y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖bandKer n d Ω a y‖ = ‖dyadicKernel Ω a.1 y‖ := by
  rw [bandKer, norm_mul, norm_eC, one_mul]

/-- Helper: `k_{j,μ}` is continuous. -/
lemma continuous_bandKer (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (a : ℤ × ℝ) :
    Continuous (bandKer n d Ω a) := by
  unfold bandKer
  have h1 : Continuous (radialPoly n d) := by
    unfold radialPoly; fun_prop
  exact (osc_contDiff_eC.continuous.comp (continuous_const.mul h1)).mul
    (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ a.1).continuous

/-- Helper: `k_{j,μ}` has compact support. -/
lemma hasCompactSupport_bandKer (a : ℤ × ℝ) : HasCompactSupport (bandKer n d Ω a) :=
  (hasCompactSupport_dyadicKernel a.1).mul_left

/-- Helper: the convolution integrand is integrable for locally integrable `f`. -/
lemma integrable_bandKer_mul (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (a : ℤ × ℝ)
    {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hf : LocallyIntegrable f volume)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    Integrable (fun y => bandKer n d Ω a y * f (x - y)) := by
  have := (hasCompactSupport_bandKer (d := d) (Ω := Ω) a).convolutionExists_left
    (ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ) (continuous_bandKer hΩ a) hf x
  simpa [ConvolutionExistsAt] using this

/-- Helper: `bandConv` is a Mathlib convolution. -/
lemma bandConv_eq_convolution (a : ℤ × ℝ) (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) :
    bandConv n d Ω a f = bandKer n d Ω a ⋆[ContinuousLinearMap.mul ℂ ℂ, volume] f := by
  funext x
  simp [bandConv, convolution_def]

/-- Helper: `(e(μ P) K_j) * f` is continuous for locally integrable `f`. -/
lemma continuous_bandConv (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (a : ℤ × ℝ)
    {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hf : LocallyIntegrable f volume) :
    Continuous (bandConv n d Ω a f) := by
  rw [bandConv_eq_convolution]
  exact (hasCompactSupport_bandKer a).continuous_convolution_left _
    (continuous_bandKer hΩ a) hf

/-- Helper: additivity of `bandConv` on locally integrable functions. -/
lemma bandConv_add (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (a : ℤ × ℝ)
    {f g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hf : LocallyIntegrable f volume)
    (hg : LocallyIntegrable g volume) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bandConv n d Ω a (f + g) x = bandConv n d Ω a f x + bandConv n d Ω a g x := by
  unfold bandConv
  rw [← integral_add (integrable_bandKer_mul hΩ a hf x) (integrable_bandKer_mul hΩ a hg x)]
  congr 1; funext y; simp [mul_add]

/-- Helper: `2^{-jn} (c 2^j)^n = c^n`. -/
lemma band_two_zpow_mul_pow (j : ℤ) (n : ℕ) (c : ℝ) :
    (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) * (c * 2 ^ j) ^ n = c ^ n := by
  rw [mul_pow, ← zpow_natCast ((2 : ℝ) ^ j), ← zpow_mul, mul_left_comm, ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]
  simp

/-- Helper: points outside the cube `|y|_∞ ≤ ρ` have Euclidean norm `> ρ`. -/
lemma band_lt_norm_of_not_mem_cube {y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)} {ρ : ℝ}
    (hy : y ∉ euclideanCube 0 ρ) : ρ < ‖y‖ := by
  simp only [euclideanCube, mem_ofPred_eq, not_forall, not_le] at hy
  obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := hy
  have := PiLp.norm_apply_le y i
  simp only [PiLp.zero_apply, sub_zero, Real.norm_eq_abs] at hi this
  linarith

/-- Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`), first step: pointwise domination
`|(e(μ P) K_j) * f(x)| ≤ C 𝖬 f(x)` by the cube maximal function, uniformly in `j ∈ ℤ` and `μ`
(all scales, including `2^j < 1`). -/
theorem enorm_bandConv_le_cubeMaximal (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (a : ℤ × ℝ) (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) x,
      ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal C * cubeMaximalEuclidean n f x := by
  obtain ⟨C0, hC0, hK⟩ := norm_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  refine ⟨C0 * 4 ^ n, by positivity, fun a f x => ?_⟩
  set ρ : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 1) with hρ
  have hρpos : 0 < ρ := by positivity
  have hpt : ∀ y, ‖bandKer n d Ω a y‖ₑ * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ ≤
      (euclideanCube 0 ρ).indicator (fun y => ENNReal.ofReal (C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n)) *
        ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ) y := by
    intro y
    by_cases hy : y ∈ euclideanCube 0 ρ
    · rw [indicator_of_mem hy]
      gcongr
      rw [← ofReal_norm, norm_bandKer]
      exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (hK _ _)
    · have h0 : bandKer n d Ω a y = 0 := by
        simp [bandKer, dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le a.1 (band_lt_norm_of_not_mem_cube hy).le]
      rw [indicator_of_notMem hy, h0]
      simp
  calc ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ ≤ ∫⁻ y, ‖bandKer n d Ω a y * f (x - y)‖ₑ :=
        enorm_integral_le_lintegral_enorm _
    _ = ∫⁻ y, ‖bandKer n d Ω a y‖ₑ * ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ := by simp_rw [enorm_mul]
    _ ≤ ∫⁻ y, (euclideanCube 0 ρ).indicator (fun y => ENNReal.ofReal (C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n)) *
        ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ) y := lintegral_mono hpt
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n)) * ∫⁻ y in euclideanCube 0 ρ, ‖f (x - y)‖ₑ := by
        rw [lintegral_indicator (measurableSet_euclideanCube 0 ρ), lintegral_const_mul' _ _
          ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top]
    _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n)) *
        (ENNReal.ofReal ((2 * ρ) ^ n) * cubeMaximalEuclidean n f x) := by
        gcongr; exact setLIntegral_euclideanCube_le f x hρpos
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (C0 * 4 ^ n) * cubeMaximalEuclidean n f x := by
        rw [← mul_assoc, ← ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity)]
        congr 2
        rw [hρ, zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero, show (2 : ℝ) * (2 ^ a.1 * 2) = 4 * 2 ^ a.1 by ring,
          mul_assoc, band_two_zpow_mul_pow]

/-- Helper: the `L^∞` bound `|(e(μ P) K_j) * f(x)| ≤ C s` for `|f| ≤ s`, uniformly in `j, μ`. -/
theorem norm_bandConv_le_of_bound (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (a : ℤ × ℝ) (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (s : ℝ),
      (∀ x, ‖f x‖ ≤ s) → ∀ x, ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ ≤ C * s := by
  refine ⟨∫ y, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 y‖, integral_nonneg fun _ => norm_nonneg _,
    fun a f s hs x => ?_⟩
  have hint : Integrable (fun y => ‖dyadicKernel Ω a.1 y‖ * s) :=
    (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ a.1).norm.mul_const s
  refine (norm_integral_le_of_norm_le hint (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_)).trans ?_
  · rw [norm_mul, norm_bandKer]
    exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hs _) (norm_nonneg _)
  · rw [integral_mul_const, integral_norm_dyadicKernel hΩ]

end ContinuousBand

section BandTTstar

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate

variable {α : Type*} [MeasurableSpace α] {μ : Measure α}

/-- Helper: Cauchy–Schwarz `∫ f g ≤ ‖f‖₂ ‖g‖₂` for `[0, ∞]`-valued functions. -/
lemma band_lintegral_mul_le_eLpNorm_two {f g : α → ℝ≥0∞} (hf : AEMeasurable f μ)
    (hg : AEMeasurable g μ) :
    ∫⁻ x, f x * g x ∂μ ≤ eLpNorm f 2 μ * eLpNorm g 2 μ := by
  have h := ENNReal.lintegral_mul_le_Lp_mul_Lq μ Real.HolderConjugate.two_two hf hg
  rw [eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal two_ne_zero ENNReal.ofNat_ne_top
      hf.aestronglyMeasurable,
    eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal two_ne_zero ENNReal.ofNat_ne_top
      hg.aestronglyMeasurable]
  simpa only [enorm_eq_self, ENNReal.toReal_ofNat, Pi.mul_apply] using h

/-- Helper: Cauchy–Schwarz `∫ |u| |w| ≤ ‖u‖₂ ‖w‖₂`. -/
lemma band_lintegral_enorm_mul_le {F G : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup F] [NormedAddCommGroup G]
    {u : α → F} {w : α → G} (hu : AEStronglyMeasurable u μ) (hw : AEStronglyMeasurable w μ) :
    ∫⁻ x, ‖u x‖ₑ * ‖w x‖ₑ ∂μ ≤ eLpNorm u 2 μ * eLpNorm w 2 μ := by
  have := band_lintegral_mul_le_eLpNorm_two hu.enorm hw.enorm
  rwa [eLpNorm_enorm u hu, eLpNorm_enorm w hw] at this

/-- Helper: `‖w‖₂² = |∫ w w̄|`. -/
lemma band_eLpNorm_sq_eq {w : α → ℂ} (hw : MemLp w 2 μ) :
    eLpNorm w 2 μ ^ 2 = ‖∫ x, w x * conj (w x) ∂μ‖ₑ := by
  have hi : Integrable (fun x => ‖w x‖ ^ 2) μ :=
    (memLp_two_iff_integrable_sq_norm hw.aestronglyMeasurable).1 hw
  have e1 : ∫ x, w x * conj (w x) ∂μ = ((∫ x, ‖w x‖ ^ 2 ∂μ : ℝ) : ℂ) := by
    rw [← integral_complex_ofReal]
    congr 1; funext x
    rw [Complex.mul_conj']
    push_cast; rfl
  rw [e1, ← ofReal_norm, Complex.norm_real,
    Real.norm_of_nonneg (integral_nonneg fun _ => by positivity),
    ofReal_integral_eq_lintegral_ofReal hi (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun _ => by positivity)]
  have h2 := eLpNorm_two_rpow_two hw.aestronglyMeasurable
  rw [← ENNReal.rpow_natCast, Nat.cast_ofNat, h2]
  congr 1; funext x
  rw [← ofReal_norm, ENNReal.ofReal_pow (norm_nonneg _), ← ENNReal.rpow_natCast]; norm_num

omit [MeasurableSpace α] in
/-- Helper: `a² ≤ A b²` implies `a ≤ A^{1/2} b` in `[0, ∞]`. -/
lemma band_le_of_sq_le {a b A : ℝ≥0∞} (h : a ^ 2 ≤ A * b ^ 2) : a ≤ A ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) * b := by
  have h' := ENNReal.rpow_le_rpow h (z := 1 / 2) (by norm_num)
  rwa [ENNReal.mul_rpow_of_nonneg _ _ (by norm_num), ← ENNReal.rpow_natCast,
    ← ENNReal.rpow_natCast, ← ENNReal.rpow_mul, ← ENNReal.rpow_mul, Nat.cast_ofNat,
    show (2 : ℝ) * (1 / 2) = 1 by norm_num, ENNReal.rpow_one, ENNReal.rpow_one] at h'

variable [SFinite μ]

/-- **Abstract `TT*` bound** (used for Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`), via Blueprint
Lemma 2.5 (`lem:ttstar`)): let `κ` be a strongly measurable kernel with row and column bounds
`∫ |κ(x, ·)| ≤ Q`, `∫ |κ(·, y)| ≤ Q` and `|κ| ≤ M`, and let `S g(x) = ∫ κ(x,y) g(y) dy`.
If the `TT*` kernel `H(x, x') = ∫ κ(x, y) conj κ(x', y) dy` satisfies the bilinear bound
`∫∫ |v(x)| |H(x,x')| |v(x')| ≤ A ‖v‖₂²` for all `v ∈ L²`, then `‖S f‖₂ ≤ A^{1/2} ‖f‖₂`. -/
theorem band_eLpNorm_kernel_le_of_ttstar {κ : α → α → ℂ}
    (hκ : StronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry κ)) {Q : ℝ≥0∞} (hQ : Q ≠ ∞) {M : ℝ}
    (hrow : ∀ x, ∫⁻ y, ‖κ x y‖ₑ ∂μ ≤ Q) (hcol : ∀ y, ∫⁻ x, ‖κ x y‖ₑ ∂μ ≤ Q)
    (hM : ∀ x y, ‖κ x y‖ ≤ M) {A : ℝ≥0∞}
    (hA : ∀ v : α → ℂ, MemLp v 2 μ →
      ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y) ∂μ‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ ∂μ ∂μ ≤
        A * eLpNorm v 2 μ ^ 2)
    {f : α → ℂ} (hf : MemLp f 2 μ) :
    eLpNorm (fun x => ∫ y, κ x y * f y ∂μ) 2 μ ≤ A ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) * eLpNorm f 2 μ := by
  -- the adjoint kernel
  set κs : α → α → ℂ := fun y x => conj (κ x y) with hκs
  have hκs_m : StronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry κs) := by
    have : Function.uncurry κs = (fun z => conj z) ∘ (Function.uncurry κ) ∘ Prod.swap := by
      funext p; rfl
    rw [this]
    exact Complex.continuous_conj.comp_stronglyMeasurable (hκ.comp_measurable measurable_swap)
  set S : (α → ℂ) → α → ℂ := fun g x => ∫ y, κ x y * g y ∂μ with hS
  set Sa : (α → ℂ) → α → ℂ := fun g y => ∫ x, κs y x * g x ∂μ with hSa
  have hQQ : (Q * Q) ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≠ ∞ :=
    ENNReal.rpow_ne_top_of_nonneg (by norm_num) (ENNReal.mul_ne_top hQ hQ)
  -- `L²` boundedness of `S` and `S*`
  have hSL2 : ∀ g, MemLp g 2 μ → MemLp (S g) 2 μ := by
    intro g hg
    change eLpNorm _ 2 μ < ∞
    refine (eLpNorm_integral_kernel_le_schur hκ.aestronglyMeasurable
      (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hrow) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hcol)
      hg.aestronglyMeasurable).trans_lt ?_
    exact ENNReal.mul_lt_top hQQ.lt_top hg
  have hSaL2 : ∀ g, MemLp g 2 μ → MemLp (Sa g) 2 μ := by
    intro g hg
    change eLpNorm _ 2 μ < ∞
    refine (eLpNorm_integral_kernel_le_schur (A := Q) (B := Q) hκs_m.aestronglyMeasurable
      (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => ?_)
      hg.aestronglyMeasurable).trans_lt ?_
    · simpa [hκs] using hcol y
    · simpa [hκs] using hrow x
    · exact ENNReal.mul_lt_top hQQ.lt_top hg
  -- duality: `∫ S g · conj v = ∫ g · conj (S* v)`
  have hdual : ∀ g v, MemLp g 2 μ → MemLp v 2 μ →
      ∫ x, S g x * conj (v x) ∂μ = ∫ y, g y * conj (Sa v y) ∂μ := by
    intro g v hg hv
    set F : α → α → ℂ := fun x y => κ x y * g y * conj (v x) with hF
    have hFm : AEStronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry F) (μ.prod μ) := by
      refine (hκ.aestronglyMeasurable.mul (hg.aestronglyMeasurable.comp_snd (μ := μ))).mul ?_
      exact (Complex.continuous_conj.comp_aestronglyMeasurable hv.aestronglyMeasurable).comp_fst
    have hFi : Integrable (Function.uncurry F) (μ.prod μ) := by
      refine ⟨hFm, ?_⟩
      rw [HasFiniteIntegral, lintegral_prod _ hFm.enorm]
      have hpt : ∀ x, ∫⁻ y, ‖Function.uncurry F (x, y)‖ₑ ∂μ =
          ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ y, ‖κ x y‖ₑ * ‖g y‖ₑ ∂μ := by
        intro x
        rw [← lintegral_const_mul' _ _ enorm_ne_top]
        congr 1; funext y
        simp only [Function.uncurry_apply_pair, hF, enorm_mul, RCLike.enorm_conj]
        ring
      simp_rw [hpt]
      have hmeas : AEMeasurable (fun x => ∫⁻ y, ‖κ x y‖ₑ * ‖g y‖ₑ ∂μ) μ :=
        (hκ.aestronglyMeasurable.enorm.mul
          (hg.aestronglyMeasurable.comp_snd (μ := μ)).enorm).lintegral_prod_right'
      refine (band_lintegral_mul_le_eLpNorm_two hv.aestronglyMeasurable.enorm hmeas).trans_lt ?_
      rw [eLpNorm_enorm v hv.aestronglyMeasurable]
      refine ENNReal.mul_lt_top hv ((eLpNorm_lintegral_kernel_le_schur hκ.aestronglyMeasurable
        (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hrow) (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hcol)
        hg.aestronglyMeasurable).trans_lt ?_)
      exact ENNReal.mul_lt_top hQQ.lt_top hg
    have hswap := integral_integral_swap hFi
    have hl : ∀ x, ∫ y, F x y ∂μ = S g x * conj (v x) := fun x => integral_mul_const _ _
    have hr : ∀ y, ∫ x, F x y ∂μ = g y * conj (Sa v y) := by
      intro y
      simp only [hF, hSa, hκs]
      rw [← integral_conj, ← integral_const_mul]
      congr 1; funext x
      simp only [map_mul, Complex.conj_conj]
      ring
    simp_rw [hl, hr] at hswap
    exact hswap
  -- measurability of columns
  have hκcol : ∀ y, AEStronglyMeasurable (fun x' => κ x' y) μ := fun y =>
    (hκ.comp_measurable (measurable_id.prodMk measurable_const)).aestronglyMeasurable
  have hcolL2 : ∀ y, eLpNorm (fun x' => κ x' y) 2 μ ≤ (ENNReal.ofReal M * Q) ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) := by
    intro y
    rw [eLpNorm_eq_lintegral_rpow_enorm_toReal two_ne_zero ENNReal.ofNat_ne_top (hκcol y),
      ENNReal.toReal_ofNat]
    gcongr
    calc ∫⁻ x', ‖κ x' y‖ₑ ^ (2 : ℝ) ∂μ ≤ ∫⁻ x', ENNReal.ofReal M * ‖κ x' y‖ₑ ∂μ := by
          refine lintegral_mono fun x' => ?_
          rw [show (2 : ℝ) = (2 : ℕ) by norm_num, ENNReal.rpow_natCast, sq]
          gcongr
          rw [← ofReal_norm]
          exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (hM _ _)
      _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal M * Q := by
          rw [lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top]
          gcongr
          exact hcol y
  have hK : (ENNReal.ofReal M * Q) ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≠ ∞ :=
    ENNReal.rpow_ne_top_of_nonneg (by norm_num) (ENNReal.mul_ne_top ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top hQ)
  -- pointwise bound for `S S* v`
  have hSSa : ∀ v, MemLp v 2 μ → ∀ x,
      ‖S (Sa v) x‖ₑ ≤ ∫⁻ x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y) ∂μ‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ ∂μ := by
    intro v hv x
    set G : α → α → ℂ := fun y x' => κ x y * (conj (κ x' y) * v x') with hG
    have hGm : AEStronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry G) (μ.prod μ) := by
      have h1 : StronglyMeasurable (fun p : α × α => κ x p.1) :=
        hκ.comp_measurable (measurable_const.prodMk measurable_fst)
      have h2 : StronglyMeasurable (fun p : α × α => conj (κ p.2 p.1)) :=
        Complex.continuous_conj.comp_stronglyMeasurable (hκ.comp_measurable measurable_swap)
      exact h1.aestronglyMeasurable.mul
        (h2.aestronglyMeasurable.mul (hv.aestronglyMeasurable.comp_snd (μ := μ)))
    have hGi : Integrable (Function.uncurry G) (μ.prod μ) := by
      refine ⟨hGm, ?_⟩
      rw [HasFiniteIntegral, lintegral_prod _ hGm.enorm]
      set K := (ENNReal.ofReal M * Q) ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) * eLpNorm v 2 μ with hKdef
      have hin : ∀ y, ∫⁻ x', ‖Function.uncurry G (y, x')‖ₑ ∂μ ≤ ‖κ x y‖ₑ * K := by
        intro y
        have e : ∫⁻ x', ‖Function.uncurry G (y, x')‖ₑ ∂μ =
            ‖κ x y‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', ‖κ x' y‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ ∂μ := by
          rw [← lintegral_const_mul' _ _ enorm_ne_top]
          congr 1; funext x'
          simp [hG, enorm_mul]
        rw [e]
        gcongr
        refine (band_lintegral_enorm_mul_le (hκcol y) hv.aestronglyMeasurable).trans ?_
        rw [hKdef]
        exact mul_le_mul_left (hcolL2 y) _
      calc ∫⁻ y, ∫⁻ x', ‖Function.uncurry G (y, x')‖ₑ ∂μ ∂μ ≤ ∫⁻ y, ‖κ x y‖ₑ * K ∂μ :=
            lintegral_mono hin
        _ = (∫⁻ y, ‖κ x y‖ₑ ∂μ) * K :=
            lintegral_mul_const' _ _ (ENNReal.mul_ne_top hK hv.ne)
        _ ≤ Q * K := by gcongr; exact hrow x
        _ < ∞ := ENNReal.mul_lt_top hQ.lt_top (ENNReal.mul_lt_top hK.lt_top hv)
    have e1 : S (Sa v) x = ∫ y, ∫ x', G y x' ∂μ ∂μ := by
      simp only [hS, hSa, hκs, hG]
      congr 1; funext y
      rw [integral_const_mul]
    have e2 : ∀ x', ∫ y, G y x' ∂μ = (∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y) ∂μ) * v x' := by
      intro x'
      rw [← integral_mul_const]
      congr 1; funext y
      simp only [hG]; ring
    rw [e1, integral_integral_swap hGi]
    simp_rw [e2]
    refine (enorm_integral_le_lintegral_enorm _).trans_eq ?_
    simp_rw [enorm_mul]
  -- the bound for `S*`
  have hSa_bound : ∀ v, MemLp v 2 μ → eLpNorm (Sa v) 2 μ ≤ A ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) * eLpNorm v 2 μ := by
    intro v hv
    have hw := hSaL2 v hv
    refine band_le_of_sq_le ?_
    rw [band_eLpNorm_sq_eq hw, ← hdual (Sa v) v hw hv]
    calc ‖∫ x, S (Sa v) x * conj (v x) ∂μ‖ₑ ≤ ∫⁻ x, ‖S (Sa v) x * conj (v x)‖ₑ ∂μ :=
          enorm_integral_le_lintegral_enorm _
      _ = ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ‖S (Sa v) x‖ₑ ∂μ := by
          congr 1; funext x; rw [enorm_mul, RCLike.enorm_conj, mul_comm]
      _ ≤ ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y) ∂μ‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ ∂μ ∂μ := by
          gcongr with x; exact hSSa v hv x
      _ ≤ A * eLpNorm v 2 μ ^ 2 := hA v hv
  -- conclusion
  have hSf := hSL2 f hf
  have h7 : eLpNorm (S f) 2 μ * eLpNorm (S f) 2 μ ≤
      (A ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) * eLpNorm f 2 μ) * eLpNorm (S f) 2 μ := by
    rw [← sq, band_eLpNorm_sq_eq hSf, hdual f (S f) hf hSf]
    refine (enorm_integral_mul_conj_le Real.HolderConjugate.two_two hf.aestronglyMeasurable
      (hSaL2 _ hSf).aestronglyMeasurable).trans ?_
    rw [ENNReal.ofReal_ofNat]
    calc eLpNorm f 2 μ * eLpNorm (Sa (S f)) 2 μ
        ≤ eLpNorm f 2 μ * (A ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) * eLpNorm (S f) 2 μ) := by
          gcongr; exact hSa_bound _ hSf
      _ = _ := by ring
  change eLpNorm (S f) 2 μ ≤ _
  rcases eq_or_ne (eLpNorm (S f) 2 μ) 0 with h0 | h0
  · rw [h0]; exact zero_le
  · exact (ENNReal.mul_le_mul_iff_left h0 hSf.ne).1 h7

end BandTTstar

section BandOsc

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate

variable {n : ℕ}

/-- Helper: the `i`-slice through `w` is the line `w + (t - wᵢ) eᵢ`. -/
lemma band_slice_eq (w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (i : Fin n) (t : ℝ) :
    WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t) =
      w + (t - w i) • EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : ℝ) := by
  ext l
  by_cases hl : l = i
  · subst hl; simp
  · simp [hl]

/-- Helper: the slice map has derivative `eᵢ`. -/
lemma band_hasDerivAt_slice (w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (i : Fin n) (t : ℝ) :
    HasDerivAt (fun s => WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i s))
      (EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : ℝ)) t := by
  have e : (fun s => WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i s)) =
      fun s => w + (s - w i) • EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : ℝ) := funext (band_slice_eq w i)
  rw [e]
  simpa using (((hasDerivAt_id t).sub_const (w i)).smul_const
    (EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : ℝ))).const_add w

/-- Helper: derivative of `t ↦ g(r · slice(t) + u)` for differentiable `g`. -/
lemma band_hasDerivAt_comp_slice {g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hg : Differentiable ℝ g)
    (r : ℝ) (u w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (i : Fin n) (t : ℝ) :
    HasDerivAt (fun s => g (r • WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i s) + u))
      (fderiv ℝ g (r • WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t) + u)
        (r • EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : ℝ))) t := by
  have hp := ((band_hasDerivAt_slice w i t).const_smul r).add_const u
  exact (hg _).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt t hp

/-- Helper: the box `{x | ∀ j, |x j| ≤ c}` is the cube of radius `c` centered at `0`. -/
lemma band_box_eq (c : ℝ) :
    {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) | ∀ j, |x j| ≤ c} = euclideanCube 0 c := by
  ext x; simp [euclideanCube]

/-- Helper: Blueprint Lemma 5.1 (`lem:oscint`), box version, for every `L > 0` (for `L < 1` the
trivial bound suffices). -/
lemma band_box_osc (n m : ℕ) (hm : 2 ≤ m) (c : ℝ) (hc : 0 < c) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (i : Fin n) (F : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ)
      (A A' : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (L M : ℝ), 0 < L →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) →
        ∃ P : ℝ[X], P.natDegree ≤ m ∧ (∃ k, 1 ≤ k ∧ L ≤ |P.coeff k|) ∧
          ∀ t, F (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t)) = P.eval t) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) →
        ContinuousOn (fun t => A (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t)))
          (Icc (-c) c)) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) → ∀ t ∈ Ioo (-c) c,
        HasDerivAt (fun s => A (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i s)))
          (A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t))) t) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) →
        IntervalIntegrable (fun t => A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t)))
          volume (-c) c) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) → ‖A x‖ ≤ M) →
      (∀ x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ j, |x j| ≤ c) →
        ∫ t in (-c)..c, ‖A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp x) i t))‖ ≤ M) →
      ‖∫ x in {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) | ∀ j, |x j| ≤ c}, eC (F x) * A x‖
        ≤ C * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * M := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC, hbox⟩ := norm_setIntegral_box_eC_mul_le n m hm c hc
  refine ⟨C + (2 * c) ^ n, by positivity, fun i F A A' L M hL hF hAc hAd hAi hM hA' => ?_⟩
  have h0 : (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ∈ {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) | ∀ j, |x j| ≤ c} :=
    fun j => by simp [hc.le]
  have hM0 : 0 ≤ M := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hM 0 h0)
  have hLm : 0 < L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hL _
  rcases le_or_gt 1 L with h1 | h1
  · refine (hbox i F A A' L M h1 hF hAc hAd hAi hM hA').trans ?_
    gcongr
    linarith [show (0 : ℝ) ≤ (2 * c) ^ n by positivity]
  · have hvol : volume {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) | ∀ j, |x j| ≤ c} < ∞ := by
      rw [band_box_eq, volume_euclideanCube 0 hc.le]; exact ENNReal.ofReal_lt_top
    have hvr : volume.real {x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) | ∀ j, |x j| ≤ c} = (2 * c) ^ n := by
      rw [measureReal_def, band_box_eq, volume_euclideanCube 0 hc.le,
        ENNReal.toReal_ofReal (by positivity)]
    have hone : 1 ≤ L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) :=
      Real.one_le_rpow_of_pos_of_le_one_of_nonpos hL h1.le (by
        have : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 1 / (m : ℝ) := by positivity
        linarith)
    refine (norm_setIntegral_le_of_norm_le_const (C := M) hvol (fun x hx => ?_)).trans ?_
    · rw [norm_mul, norm_eC, one_mul]; exact hM x hx
    · rw [hvr]
      calc M * (2 * c) ^ n ≤ (2 * c) ^ n * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * M := by
            have h2c : (0 : ℝ) ≤ (2 * c) ^ n := by positivity
            have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hone hM0) h2c
            linarith
        _ ≤ (C + (2 * c) ^ n) * L ^ (-(1 / (m : ℝ))) * M := by
            gcongr; linarith

/-- Helper: the slice map is continuous. -/
lemma band_continuous_slice (w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (i : Fin n) :
    Continuous (fun t => WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t)) := by
  rw [funext (band_slice_eq w i)]
  fun_prop

variable {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}

/-- Helper: the derivative bound `‖D K_j‖ ≤ C 2^{-j(n+1)}` (Blueprint (4.1)) with `C ≥ 0`. -/
lemma band_fderiv_dyadicKernel_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (j : ℤ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖fderiv ℝ (dyadicKernel Ω j) x‖ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC⟩ := norm_iteratedFDeriv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ 1
  have hC0 : 0 ≤ C := by
    have h := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hC 0 0)
    exact nonneg_of_mul_nonneg_left h (by positivity)
  refine ⟨C, hC0, fun j x => ?_⟩
  have := hC j x
  rwa [norm_iteratedFDeriv_one, Nat.cast_one] at this

/-- **Oscillatory bound for products of two dyadic kernels** (the two applications of Blueprint
Lemma 5.1 (`lem:oscint`) in the proof of Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`)): for scales
`j' ≤ j`, `r = 2^{j'}`, shifts `u, v`, a phase `F` whose `i`-slices through the box `|w|_∞ ≤ c`
are polynomials of degree `≤ D = 2d` with a coefficient of index `≥ 1` of modulus `≥ L > 0`,
and an amplitude `r^n K_j(r w + u) conj K_{j'}(r w + v)` vanishing for `|w| > c`,
`|∫ e(F(w)) r^n K_j(r w + u) conj K_{j'}(r w + v) dw| ≤ C L^{-1/D} 2^{-jn}`. -/
theorem band_amp_osc (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (d : ℕ) (hd : 1 ≤ d) (c : ℝ) (hc : 0 < c) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (j j' : ℤ), j' ≤ j → ∀ (u v : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (i : Fin n)
      (F : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ) (L : ℝ), 0 < L →
      (∀ w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), (∀ k, |w k| ≤ c) → ∃ P : ℝ[X], P.natDegree ≤ 2 * d ∧
        (∃ k, 1 ≤ k ∧ L ≤ |P.coeff k|) ∧
          ∀ t, F (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t)) = P.eval t) →
      (∀ w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n), c < ‖w‖ →
        dyadicKernel Ω j ((2 : ℝ) ^ j' • w + u) *
          conj (dyadicKernel Ω j' ((2 : ℝ) ^ j' • w + v)) = 0) →
      ‖∫ w, eC (F w) * (((((2 : ℝ) ^ j') ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ) *
          (dyadicKernel Ω j ((2 : ℝ) ^ j' • w + u) *
            conj (dyadicKernel Ω j' ((2 : ℝ) ^ j' • w + v))))‖ ≤
        C * L ^ (-(1 / (2 * d : ℝ))) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) := by
  obtain ⟨C0, hC0, hK⟩ := norm_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  obtain ⟨C1, hC1, hK1⟩ := band_fderiv_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  obtain ⟨Cb, hCb, hbox⟩ := band_box_osc n (2 * d) (by omega) c hc
  refine ⟨Cb * (C0 ^ 2 + 4 * c * C0 * C1), by positivity, ?_⟩
  intro j j' hjj u v i F L hL hF hvan
  set r : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ j' with hr
  have hr0 : 0 < r := by positivity
  set K := dyadicKernel Ω j with hKdef
  set K' := dyadicKernel Ω j' with hK'def
  set e : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) := EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : ℝ) with he
  have hKd : Differentiable ℝ K := (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ j).differentiable (by simp)
  have hK'd : Differentiable ℝ K' := (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ j').differentiable (by simp)
  have hKc : Continuous (fderiv ℝ K) := (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ j).continuous_fderiv (by simp)
  have hK'c : Continuous (fderiv ℝ K') :=
    (contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ j').continuous_fderiv (by simp)
  set A : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun w =>
    ((r ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ) * (K (r • w + u) * conj (K' (r • w + v))) with hA
  set A' : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun w =>
    ((r ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ) * (fderiv ℝ K (r • w + u) (r • e) * conj (K' (r • w + v)) +
      K (r • w + u) * conj (fderiv ℝ K' (r • w + v) (r • e))) with hA'
  -- the derivative along slices
  have hder : ∀ (w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (t : ℝ),
      HasDerivAt (fun s => A (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i s)))
        (A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t))) t := by
    intro w t
    have h1 := band_hasDerivAt_comp_slice hKd r u w i t
    have h2 := (band_hasDerivAt_comp_slice hK'd r v w i t).star
    have h3 := (h1.mul h2).const_mul ((r ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ)
    convert h3 using 1
    · funext s; rfl
    · rfl
  -- arithmetic of the scales
  have hrn : r ^ n * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * n) = 1 := by
    rw [hr, ← zpow_natCast, ← zpow_mul, ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]; simp
  have hr1 : (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r = (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * n) := by
    rw [hr, ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]; congr 1; ring
  have hr2 : (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) := by
    rw [hr, ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]
    exact zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) (by linarith)
  have hnorm_e : ‖r • e‖ = r := by
    rw [norm_smul, he, PiLp.norm_single, norm_one, mul_one,
      Real.norm_of_nonneg hr0.le]
  have hrn0 : (0 : ℝ) ≤ r ^ n := by positivity
  have hAb : ∀ w, ‖A w‖ ≤ C0 ^ 2 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) := by
    intro w
    simp only [hA, norm_mul, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_of_nonneg hrn0, Complex.norm_conj]
    calc r ^ n * (‖K (r • w + u)‖ * ‖K' (r • w + v)‖)
        ≤ r ^ n * ((C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n)) * (C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * n))) := by
          gcongr
          · exact hK _ _
          · exact hK _ _
      _ = C0 ^ 2 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) * (r ^ n * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * n)) := by ring
      _ = _ := by rw [hrn, mul_one]
  have hA'b : ∀ w, ‖A' w‖ ≤ 2 * C0 * C1 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) := by
    intro w
    have hd1 : ‖fderiv ℝ K (r • w + u) (r • e)‖ ≤ C1 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r := by
      refine (ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _).trans ?_
      rw [hnorm_e]; gcongr; exact hK1 _ _
    have hd2 : ‖fderiv ℝ K' (r • w + v) (r • e)‖ ≤
        C1 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r := by
      refine (ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _).trans ?_
      rw [hnorm_e]; gcongr; exact hK1 _ _
    simp only [hA', norm_mul, Complex.norm_real, Real.norm_of_nonneg hrn0]
    calc r ^ n * ‖fderiv ℝ K (r • w + u) (r • e) * conj (K' (r • w + v)) +
          K (r • w + u) * conj (fderiv ℝ K' (r • w + v) (r • e))‖
        ≤ r ^ n * (‖fderiv ℝ K (r • w + u) (r • e)‖ * ‖K' (r • w + v)‖ +
          ‖K (r • w + u)‖ * ‖fderiv ℝ K' (r • w + v) (r • e)‖) := by
          gcongr
          refine (norm_add_le _ _).trans_eq ?_
          rw [norm_mul, norm_mul, Complex.norm_conj, Complex.norm_conj]
      _ ≤ r ^ n * ((C1 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r) * (C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * n)) +
          (C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n)) * (C1 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r)) := by
          gcongr
          · exact hK _ _
          · exact hK _ _
      _ = C0 * C1 * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r * (r ^ n * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * n)) +
          (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) * (r ^ n * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j' * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r))) := by ring
      _ = C0 * C1 * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * ((n : ℤ) + 1)) * r + (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n)) := by
          rw [hr1, hrn]; ring
      _ ≤ C0 * C1 * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) + (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n)) := by gcongr
      _ = _ := by ring
  have hA'c : Continuous A' := by
    simp only [hA']
    have := hKd.continuous
    have := hK'd.continuous
    fun_prop
  -- reduction to the box
  have hzero : ∀ w, w ∉ {w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) | ∀ k, |w k| ≤ c} →
      eC (F w) * A w = 0 := by
    intro w hw
    simp only [mem_ofPred_eq, not_forall, not_le] at hw
    obtain ⟨k, hk⟩ := hw
    have hk' : c < ‖w‖ := by
      have := PiLp.norm_apply_le w k
      rw [Real.norm_eq_abs] at this
      linarith
    have := hvan w hk'
    simp only [hA]
    rw [this, mul_zero, mul_zero]
  change ‖∫ w, eC (F w) * A w‖ ≤ _
  rw [← setIntegral_eq_integral_of_forall_compl_eq_zero hzero]
  set M := (C0 ^ 2 + 4 * c * C0 * C1) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) with hMdef
  have h2 : (0 : ℝ) ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) := by positivity
  have hsl : ∀ w, Continuous fun t => A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t)) :=
    fun w => hA'c.comp (band_continuous_slice w i)
  have h := hbox i F A A' L M hL hF
    (fun w _ t _ => (hder w t).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt)
    (fun w _ t _ => hder w t)
    (fun w _ => (hsl w).intervalIntegrable _ _)
    (fun w _ => (hAb w).trans (by
      rw [hMdef]; nlinarith [mul_nonneg (mul_nonneg (mul_nonneg hc.le hC0) hC1) h2]))
    (fun w _ => by
      calc ∫ t in (-c)..c, ‖A' (WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t))‖
          ≤ ∫ t in (-c)..c, 2 * C0 * C1 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) :=
            intervalIntegral.integral_mono_on (by linarith) ((hsl w).norm.intervalIntegrable _ _)
              intervalIntegrable_const (fun t _ => hA'b _)
        _ = (c - -c) * (2 * C0 * C1 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n)) := by
            rw [intervalIntegral.integral_const, smul_eq_mul]
        _ ≤ M := by
            rw [hMdef]; nlinarith [mul_nonneg (sq_nonneg C0) h2])
  refine h.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
  rw [hMdef]
  push_cast
  ring

end BandOsc


section BandKernelTT

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate

variable {n : ℕ} {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- The `TT*` kernel profile `H(a, b; h) = ∫ k_a(z) conj k_b(z + h) dz` for `a = (j, μ)`,
`b = (j', μ')` (the blueprint's `H(x, y)` is `H(σ(x), σ(y); y - x)`). -/
noncomputable def bandTT (n d : ℕ) (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (a b : ℤ × ℝ)
    (h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℂ :=
  ∫ z, bandKer n d Ω a z * conj (bandKer n d Ω b (z + h))

/-- Helper: `H(b, a; -h) = conj H(a, b; h)`. -/
lemma bandTT_swap (a b : ℤ × ℝ) (h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bandTT n d Ω b a (-h) = conj (bandTT n d Ω a b h) := by
  unfold bandTT
  rw [← integral_conj, ← integral_add_right_eq_self (μ := volume)
    (fun z => bandKer n d Ω b z * conj (bandKer n d Ω a (z + -h))) h]
  congr 1; funext z
  simp only [add_neg_cancel_right, map_mul, Complex.conj_conj]
  ring

/-- Helper: the integrand of `H` as phase times amplitude. -/
lemma bandKer_mul_conj (a b : ℤ × ℝ) (z z' : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bandKer n d Ω a z * conj (bandKer n d Ω b z') =
      eC (a.2 * radialPoly n d z - b.2 * radialPoly n d z') *
        (dyadicKernel Ω a.1 z * conj (dyadicKernel Ω b.1 z')) := by
  simp only [bandKer, map_mul, conj_eC, sub_eq_add_neg, eC_add]
  ring

/-- Helper: rescaling `z = r w + u` in `H(a, b; h)`. -/
lemma bandTT_eq_rescale (a b : ℤ × ℝ) (h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) {r : ℝ} (hr : 0 < r)
    (u : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    bandTT n d Ω a b h = ∫ w, eC (a.2 * radialPoly n d (r • w + u) -
        b.2 * radialPoly n d (r • w + (u + h))) *
      (((r ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ) * (dyadicKernel Ω a.1 (r • w + u) *
        conj (dyadicKernel Ω b.1 (r • w + (u + h))))) := by
  set g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ := fun z =>
    eC (a.2 * radialPoly n d z - b.2 * radialPoly n d (z + h)) *
      (dyadicKernel Ω a.1 z * conj (dyadicKernel Ω b.1 (z + h))) with hg
  have e1 : bandTT n d Ω a b h = ∫ z, g z := by
    unfold bandTT; congr 1; funext z; rw [bandKer_mul_conj]
  have e2 : ∫ z, g z = ∫ z, g (z + u) := (integral_add_right_eq_self (μ := volume) g u).symm
  have e3 := Measure.integral_comp_smul (μ := volume) (fun z => g (z + u)) r
  rw [finrank_euclideanSpace_fin] at e3
  have hrn : (0 : ℝ) < r ^ n := by positivity
  rw [e1, e2]
  have e4 : ∫ z, g (z + u) = ((r ^ n : ℝ) : ℂ) * ∫ w, g (r • w + u) := by
    rw [e3, Complex.real_smul, abs_of_pos (inv_pos.2 hrn), ← mul_assoc]
    push_cast
    rw [mul_inv_cancel₀ (by exact_mod_cast hrn.ne'), one_mul]
  rw [e4, ← integral_const_mul]
  congr 1; funext w
  simp only [hg, add_assoc]
  ring

/-- Helper: `P(r v + g) = r^{2d} ∑ₗ (vₗ + r⁻¹ gₗ)^2)^d`, in the form used by
`sliceRadialPoly_sub_eval`. -/
lemma band_radialPoly_smul_add {r : ℝ} (hr : r ≠ 0) (v g : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    radialPoly n d (r • v + g) =
      r ^ (2 * d) * (∑ l, (WithLp.ofLp v - fun l => -(r⁻¹ * g l)) l ^ 2) ^ d := by
  simp only [radialPoly, PiLp.add_apply, PiLp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, Pi.sub_apply]
  rw [pow_mul, ← mul_pow, Finset.mul_sum]
  congr 1; refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun l _ => ?_
  field_simp
  ring

/-- Helper: the slice polynomial of the phase `α P(r w + u) - β P(r w + u')` along coordinate
`i`: degree `≤ 2d`, top coefficient `(α - β) r^{2d}`, and next coefficient
`-2d r^{2d} (α (-(r⁻¹ uᵢ)) - β (-(r⁻¹ u'ᵢ)))`. -/
lemma band_slice_poly (hd : 1 ≤ d) {r : ℝ} (hr : r ≠ 0) (α β : ℝ)
    (u u' w : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) (i : Fin n) :
    ∃ P : ℝ[X], P.natDegree ≤ 2 * d ∧
      P.coeff (2 * d) = α * r ^ (2 * d) - β * r ^ (2 * d) ∧
      P.coeff (2 * d - 1) = -(2 * d * (α * r ^ (2 * d) * (-(r⁻¹ * u i)) -
        β * r ^ (2 * d) * (-(r⁻¹ * u' i)))) ∧
      ∀ t, α * radialPoly n d (r • WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t) + u) -
          β * radialPoly n d (r • WithLp.toLp 2 (Function.update (WithLp.ofLp w) i t) + u') =
        P.eval t := by
  set x : Fin n → ℝ := fun l => -(r⁻¹ * u l)
  set y : Fin n → ℝ := fun l => -(r⁻¹ * u' l)
  refine ⟨C (α * r ^ (2 * d)) * sliceRadialPoly n d i (WithLp.ofLp w) (-x) -
    C (β * r ^ (2 * d)) * sliceRadialPoly n d i (WithLp.ofLp w) (-y), ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩
  · refine (natDegree_sub_le _ _).trans (max_le ?_ ?_)
    · exact (natDegree_C_mul_le _ _).trans (sliceRadialPoly_natDegree_le n d i _ _)
    · exact (natDegree_C_mul_le _ _).trans (sliceRadialPoly_natDegree_le n d i _ _)
  · exact sliceRadialPoly_sub_coeff_top n d i _ x y _ _
  · rw [sliceRadialPoly_sub_coeff_top_sub_one n (by omega) i _ x y]
  · intro t
    rw [sliceRadialPoly_sub_eval, band_radialPoly_smul_add hr, band_radialPoly_smul_add hr,
      WithLp.ofLp_toLp]
    ring

/-- Helper: the elementary bound `|H(a, b; h)| ≤ C 2^{-jn}`, `j = a.1`. -/
lemma norm_bandTT_le_elem (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ (a b : ℤ × ℝ) (h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)),
      ‖bandTT n d Ω a b h‖ ≤ C * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n) := by
  obtain ⟨C0, hC0, hK⟩ := norm_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  set CL := ∫ y, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 y‖ with hCL
  have hCL0 : 0 ≤ CL := integral_nonneg fun _ => norm_nonneg _
  refine ⟨C0 * CL, by positivity, fun a b h => ?_⟩
  have hint : Integrable (fun z => C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n) * ‖dyadicKernel Ω b.1 (z + h)‖) :=
    (((integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ b.1).comp_add_right h).norm).const_mul _
  refine (norm_integral_le_of_norm_le hint (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)).trans ?_
  · rw [norm_mul, Complex.norm_conj, norm_bandKer, norm_bandKer]
    gcongr
    exact hK _ _
  · rw [integral_const_mul, integral_add_right_eq_self (fun z => ‖dyadicKernel Ω b.1 z‖) h,
      integral_norm_dyadicKernel hΩ]
    apply le_of_eq; ring

/-- Helper: `H(a, b; h) = 0` for `j' ≤ j` and `|h| ≥ 2^{j+2}` (`a = (j, μ)`, `b = (j', μ')`). -/
lemma bandTT_eq_zero_of_le (a b : ℤ × ℝ) (hab : b.1 ≤ a.1) {h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)}
    (hh : (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 2) ≤ ‖h‖) : bandTT n d Ω a b h = 0 := by
  unfold bandTT
  refine integral_eq_zero_of_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun z => ?_)
  simp only [Pi.zero_apply]
  by_cases hz : (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 1) ≤ ‖z‖
  · simp [bandKer, dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le a.1 hz]
  · push Not at hz
    have hb : (2 : ℝ) ^ (b.1 + 1) ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 1) :=
      zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) (by linarith)
    have h2 : (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 2) = 2 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 1) := by
      rw [show a.1 + 2 = (a.1 + 1) + 1 by ring, zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero]; ring
    have hzh : (2 : ℝ) ^ (b.1 + 1) ≤ ‖z + h‖ := by
      have := norm_sub_norm_le h (-z)
      rw [norm_neg, sub_neg_eq_add, add_comm] at this
      linarith
    simp [bandKer, dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le b.1 hzh]

end BandKernelTT


section BandKernelCases

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate

variable {n : ℕ} {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- Helper: `(2^j)^{2d} = 2^{(2d) j}`. -/
lemma band_zpow_pow (j : ℤ) (d : ℕ) : ((2 : ℝ) ^ j) ^ (2 * d) = (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * j) := by
  rw [← zpow_natCast, ← zpow_mul]; push_cast; ring_nf

/-- Helper: `(T/2)^{-1/(2d)} ≤ 2 T^{-1/(4d)}` for `T ≥ 1`. -/
lemma band_half_rpow_le {T : ℝ} (hT : 1 ≤ T) (hd : 1 ≤ d) :
    (T / 2) ^ (-(1 / (2 * d : ℝ))) ≤ 2 * T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ))) := by
  have hd' : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
  have hs0 : 0 ≤ 1 / (2 * d : ℝ) := by positivity
  have hs1 : 1 / (2 * d : ℝ) ≤ 1 := by rw [div_le_one (by positivity)]; linarith
  rw [Real.div_rpow (by linarith) (by norm_num), Real.rpow_neg (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2),
    div_inv_eq_mul, mul_comm]
  have h1 : (2 : ℝ) ^ (1 / (2 * d : ℝ)) ≤ 2 := by
    calc (2 : ℝ) ^ (1 / (2 * d : ℝ)) ≤ 2 ^ (1 : ℝ) :=
          Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_exponent_le (by norm_num) hs1
      _ = 2 := Real.rpow_one 2
  have h2 : T ^ (-(1 / (2 * d : ℝ))) ≤ T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ))) := by
    refine Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_exponent_le hT ?_
    rw [neg_le_neg_iff]
    exact one_div_le_one_div_of_le (by positivity) (by linarith)
  exact mul_le_mul h1 h2 (by positivity) (by norm_num)

/-- **Kernel bound, far scales** (Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`), case `R/r ≥ 4`):
for admissible `a = (j, μ)`, `b = (j', μ')` with `j' + 2 ≤ j`,
`|H(a, b; h)| ≤ C T^{-1/(2D)} 2^{-jn}` (the blueprint obtains `T^{-1/D}`). -/
theorem norm_bandTT_le_far (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hd : 1 ≤ d) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ T : ℝ, 1 ≤ T → ∀ a b : ℤ × ℝ, IsBandAdm d T a → IsBandAdm d T b →
      b.1 + 2 ≤ a.1 → ∀ h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
        ‖bandTT n d Ω a b h‖ ≤ C * T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ))) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n) := by
  obtain ⟨Co, hCo, hosc⟩ := band_amp_osc (n := n) (Ω := Ω) hΩ d hd 2 two_pos
  refine ⟨2 * Co, by positivity, fun T hT a b ha hb hab h => ?_⟩
  set r : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ b.1 with hr
  have hr0 : 0 < r := by positivity
  rw [bandTT_eq_rescale a b h hr0 (-h)]
  have hL : 0 < T / 2 := by positivity
  -- the top coefficient
  have hB : T ≤ |b.2| * r ^ (2 * d) := by rw [hr, band_zpow_pow]; exact hb.1
  have hA : |a.2| * r ^ (2 * d) ≤ T / 8 := by
    have e : r ^ (2 * d) =
        (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * a.1) * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * (b.1 - a.1)) := by
      rw [hr, band_zpow_pow, ← zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]; congr 1; ring
    have hd' : (1 : ℤ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
    have h16 : (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * (b.1 - a.1)) ≤ 1 / 16 := by
      calc (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * (b.1 - a.1)) ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (-4 : ℤ) :=
            zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) (by nlinarith)
        _ = 1 / 16 := by norm_num
    rw [e, ← mul_assoc]
    calc |a.2| * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * a.1) * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * (b.1 - a.1))
        ≤ (2 * T) * (1 / 16) := mul_le_mul ha.2 h16 (by positivity) (by linarith)
      _ ≤ T / 8 := by linarith
  refine (hosc a.1 b.1 (by linarith) (-h) (-h + h) ⟨0, hn⟩
    (fun w => a.2 * radialPoly n d (r • w + -h) - b.2 * radialPoly n d (r • w + (-h + h)))
    (T / 2) hL (fun w _ => ?_) (fun w hw => ?_)).trans ?_
  · obtain ⟨P, hdeg, htop, -, heval⟩ := band_slice_poly (n := n) hd hr0.ne' a.2 b.2 (-h) (-h + h) w
      ⟨0, hn⟩
    refine ⟨P, hdeg, ⟨2 * d, by omega, ?_⟩, heval⟩
    rw [htop]
    have h1 := abs_sub_abs_le_abs_sub (b.2 * r ^ (2 * d)) (a.2 * r ^ (2 * d))
    rw [abs_sub_comm, abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_of_pos (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) < r ^ (2 * d))] at h1
    linarith
  · have hz : (2 : ℝ) ^ (b.1 + 1) ≤ ‖r • w + (-h + h)‖ := by
      rw [neg_add_cancel, add_zero, norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg hr0.le, hr,
        zpow_add_one₀ two_ne_zero]
      nlinarith [show (0 : ℝ) < 2 ^ b.1 by positivity]
    rw [dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le b.1 hz, map_zero, mul_zero]
  · have := band_half_rpow_le hT hd
    calc Co * (T / 2) ^ (-(1 / (2 * d : ℝ))) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n)
        ≤ Co * (2 * T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ)))) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n) := by gcongr
      _ = 2 * Co * T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ))) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n) := by ring

/-- Helper: some coordinate satisfies `|h| ≤ n |hᵢ|`. -/
lemma band_exists_coord (hn : 1 ≤ n) (h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ∃ i : Fin n, ‖h‖ ≤ n * |h i| := by
  obtain ⟨i, -, hi⟩ := Finset.exists_max_image Finset.univ (fun k => |h k|)
    ⟨⟨0, hn⟩, Finset.mem_univ _⟩
  refine ⟨i, ?_⟩
  have hsum : ∑ k, ‖h k‖ ^ 2 ≤ (n * |h i|) ^ 2 := by
    calc ∑ k, ‖h k‖ ^ 2 ≤ ∑ _k : Fin n, |h i| ^ 2 := by
          refine Finset.sum_le_sum fun k _ => ?_
          rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]
          exact pow_le_pow_left₀ (abs_nonneg _) (hi k (Finset.mem_univ _)) 2
      _ = n * |h i| ^ 2 := by simp
      _ ≤ (n * |h i|) ^ 2 := by
          have hn' : (1 : ℝ) ≤ n := by exact_mod_cast hn
          nlinarith [sq_nonneg (h i), abs_nonneg (h i), sq_abs (h i)]
  rw [EuclideanSpace.norm_eq]
  calc √(∑ k, ‖h k‖ ^ 2) ≤ √((n * |h i|) ^ 2) := Real.sqrt_le_sqrt hsum
    _ = n * |h i| := Real.sqrt_sq (by positivity)

/-- **Kernel bound, comparable scales** (Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`), case
`R/r < 4`): for admissible `a = (j, μ)`, `b = (j', μ')` with `j' ≤ j ≤ j' + 1` and
`|h| ≥ 2^{j'} T^{-1/2}`, `|H(a, b; h)| ≤ C T^{-1/(2D)} 2^{-jn}`. -/
theorem norm_bandTT_le_near (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hd : 1 ≤ d) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ T : ℝ, 1 ≤ T → ∀ a b : ℤ × ℝ, IsBandAdm d T a → IsBandAdm d T b →
      b.1 ≤ a.1 → a.1 ≤ b.1 + 1 → ∀ h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
        (2 : ℝ) ^ b.1 * T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) ≤ ‖h‖ →
        ‖bandTT n d Ω a b h‖ ≤ C * T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ))) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n) := by
  obtain ⟨Co, hCo, hosc⟩ := band_amp_osc (n := n) (Ω := Ω) hΩ d hd 4 (by norm_num)
  have hn' : (0 : ℝ) < n := by exact_mod_cast hn
  have hd' : (0 : ℝ) < d := by exact_mod_cast hd
  set κ : ℝ := 2 * d / n with hκ
  have hκ0 : 0 < κ := by positivity
  refine ⟨Co * κ ^ (-(1 / (2 * d : ℝ))), by positivity,
    fun T hT a b ha hb hab hab' h hh => ?_⟩
  have hT0 : 0 < T := by linarith
  set r : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ b.1 with hr
  have hr0 : 0 < r := by positivity
  rw [bandTT_eq_rescale a b h hr0 0]
  obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := band_exists_coord hn h
  set s : ℝ := T ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) with hs
  have hs0 : 0 < s := by positivity
  have hss : s * s = T := by
    rw [hs, ← Real.rpow_add hT0]; norm_num
  have hsinv : T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) = s⁻¹ := by rw [Real.rpow_neg hT0.le]
  have hB : T ≤ |b.2| * r ^ (2 * d) := by rw [hr, band_zpow_pow]; exact hb.1
  have hL : 0 < κ * s := by positivity
  refine (hosc a.1 b.1 hab 0 (0 + h) i
    (fun w => a.2 * radialPoly n d (r • w + 0) - b.2 * radialPoly n d (r • w + (0 + h)))
    (κ * s) hL (fun w _ => ?_) (fun w hw => ?_)).trans ?_
  · obtain ⟨P, hdeg, -, hnext, heval⟩ := band_slice_poly (n := n) hd hr0.ne' a.2 b.2 0 (0 + h) w i
    refine ⟨P, hdeg, ⟨2 * d - 1, by omega, ?_⟩, heval⟩
    rw [hnext]
    have e : -(2 * (d : ℝ) * (a.2 * r ^ (2 * d) * -(r⁻¹ * (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) i) -
        b.2 * r ^ (2 * d) * -(r⁻¹ * (0 + h) i))) = -(2 * d * (b.2 * r ^ (2 * d)) * r⁻¹ * h i) := by
      simp only [PiLp.zero_apply, zero_add, mul_zero, neg_zero]; ring
    have eabs : |2 * (d : ℝ) * (b.2 * r ^ (2 * d)) * r⁻¹ * h i| =
        2 * d * (|b.2| * r ^ (2 * d)) * r⁻¹ * |h i| := by
      rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_of_pos (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 2),
        abs_of_pos hd', abs_of_pos (inv_pos.2 hr0),
        abs_of_pos (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) < r ^ (2 * d))]
    rw [e, abs_neg, eabs]
    -- `|h i| ≥ ‖h‖ / n ≥ r / (n s)`
    have hhi : r * s⁻¹ ≤ n * |h i| := by rw [← hsinv]; linarith
    have key : κ * s ≤ 2 * d * (|b.2| * r ^ (2 * d)) * r⁻¹ * |h i| := by
      have h1 : 2 * d * (s * s) * r⁻¹ * (r * s⁻¹) ≤
          2 * d * (|b.2| * r ^ (2 * d)) * r⁻¹ * (n * |h i|) := by
        rw [hss]; gcongr
      have h2 : 2 * d * (s * s) * r⁻¹ * (r * s⁻¹) = n * (κ * s) := by
        rw [hκ]; field_simp
      have h3 : 2 * d * (|b.2| * r ^ (2 * d)) * r⁻¹ * (n * |h i|) =
          n * (2 * d * (|b.2| * r ^ (2 * d)) * r⁻¹ * |h i|) := by ring
      rw [h2, h3] at h1
      exact le_of_mul_le_mul_left h1 hn'
    exact key
  · have hz : (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 1) ≤ ‖r • w + 0‖ := by
      rw [add_zero, norm_smul, Real.norm_of_nonneg hr0.le]
      calc (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 1) ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (b.1 + 2) :=
            zpow_le_zpow_right₀ (by norm_num) (by linarith)
        _ = r * 4 := by rw [hr, zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]; norm_num
        _ ≤ r * ‖w‖ := by gcongr
    rw [dyadicKernel_eq_zero_of_le a.1 hz, zero_mul]
  · apply le_of_eq
    rw [Real.mul_rpow hκ0.le hs0.le, hs, ← Real.rpow_mul hT0.le]
    have : (1 / 2 : ℝ) * -(1 / (2 * d : ℝ)) = -(1 / (4 * d : ℝ)) := by
      field_simp; ring
    rw [this]; ring

end BandKernelCases


section BandKernelBound

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate
open Metric

variable {n : ℕ} {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- The majorant `2^{-jn} (T^{-1/(2D)} 𝟙_{|h| ≤ 2^{j+2}} + 𝟙_{|h| ≤ 2^j T^{-1/2}})` (`D = 2d`) of
the `TT*` kernel in Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`). -/
noncomputable def bandG (n d : ℕ) (T : ℝ) (j : ℤ) (h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ≥0∞ :=
  ENNReal.ofReal ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n)) *
    (ENNReal.ofReal (T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ)))) *
        (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ((2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 2))).indicator 1 h +
      (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ((2 : ℝ) ^ j * T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)))).indicator 1 h)

/-- **Pointwise bound for the `TT*` kernel** (Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`)): for
admissible `a = (j, μ)`, `b = (j', μ')` with `j' ≤ j` (so `R = 2^j` is the larger scale),
`|H(a, b; h)| ≤ C 2^{-jn} (T^{-1/(2D)} 𝟙_{|h| ≤ 4R} + 𝟙_{|h| ≤ R T^{-1/2}})`. -/
theorem enorm_bandTT_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hd : 1 ≤ d) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ T : ℝ, 1 ≤ T → ∀ a b : ℤ × ℝ, IsBandAdm d T a → IsBandAdm d T b →
      b.1 ≤ a.1 → ∀ h : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n),
        ‖bandTT n d Ω a b h‖ₑ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal C * bandG n d T a.1 h := by
  obtain ⟨C1, hC1, hfar⟩ := norm_bandTT_le_far (Ω := Ω) hΩ hn hd
  obtain ⟨C2, hC2, hnear⟩ := norm_bandTT_le_near (Ω := Ω) hΩ hn hd
  obtain ⟨C3, hC3, helem⟩ := norm_bandTT_le_elem (n := n) (d := d) hΩ
  refine ⟨C1 + C2 + C3, by positivity, fun T hT a b ha hb hab h => ?_⟩
  set C := C1 + C2 + C3 with hC
  have hC0 : 0 ≤ C := by positivity
  set X : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n) with hX
  set Y : ℝ := T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ))) with hY
  have hX0 : 0 ≤ X := by positivity
  have hY0 : 0 ≤ Y := by positivity
  set I1 := (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ((2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 2))).indicator
    (1 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ≥0∞) h with hI1
  set I2 := (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n))
    ((2 : ℝ) ^ a.1 * T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)))).indicator
    (1 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ≥0∞) h with hI2
  have hG : bandG n d T a.1 h = ENNReal.ofReal X * (ENNReal.ofReal Y * I1 + I2) := rfl
  rw [hG, ← ofReal_norm]
  by_cases h1 : ‖h‖ ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (a.1 + 2)
  · have hI1' : I1 = 1 := by
      rw [hI1, indicator_of_mem (mem_closedBall_zero_iff.2 h1)]; rfl
    -- a bound of the form `C_i Y X` suffices
    have hsuff : ∀ Ci, Ci ≤ C → ‖bandTT n d Ω a b h‖ ≤ Ci * Y * X →
        ENNReal.ofReal ‖bandTT n d Ω a b h‖ ≤
          ENNReal.ofReal C * (ENNReal.ofReal X * (ENNReal.ofReal Y * I1 + I2)) := by
      intro Ci hCi hb'
      calc ENNReal.ofReal ‖bandTT n d Ω a b h‖ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (C * (X * Y)) := by
            refine ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (hb'.trans ?_)
            calc Ci * Y * X ≤ C * Y * X := by gcongr
              _ = C * (X * Y) := by ring
        _ = ENNReal.ofReal C * (ENNReal.ofReal X * (ENNReal.ofReal Y * I1)) := by
            rw [hI1', mul_one, ENNReal.ofReal_mul hC0, ENNReal.ofReal_mul hX0]
        _ ≤ _ := by gcongr; exact le_self_add
    by_cases hfar' : b.1 + 2 ≤ a.1
    · exact hsuff C1 (by linarith) (hfar T hT a b ha hb hfar' h)
    · by_cases hnear' : (2 : ℝ) ^ b.1 * T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) ≤ ‖h‖
      · exact hsuff C2 (by linarith) (hnear T hT a b ha hb hab (by linarith) h hnear')
      · push Not at hnear'
        have hle : (2 : ℝ) ^ b.1 * T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ a.1 * T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) := by
          gcongr
          · norm_num
        have hI2' : I2 = 1 := by
          rw [hI2, indicator_of_mem (mem_closedBall_zero_iff.2 (by linarith))]; rfl
        calc ENNReal.ofReal ‖bandTT n d Ω a b h‖ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (C * X) := by
              refine ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal ((helem a b h).trans ?_)
              gcongr; linarith
          _ = ENNReal.ofReal C * (ENNReal.ofReal X * I2) := by
              rw [hI2', mul_one, ENNReal.ofReal_mul hC0]
          _ ≤ _ := by gcongr; exact le_add_self
  · push Not at h1
    rw [bandTT_eq_zero_of_le a b hab h1.le, norm_zero, ENNReal.ofReal_zero]
    exact zero_le

end BandKernelBound


section BandL2

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate
open Metric

variable {n : ℕ} {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- Helper: a function built from a selection with measurable fibers and finitely many values is
measurable. -/
lemma band_measurable_select {X ι β : Type*} [MeasurableSpace X] [MeasurableSpace β]
    {F : Finset ι} {σ : X → ι} (hσF : ∀ x, σ x ∈ F) (hσm : ∀ a, MeasurableSet (σ ⁻¹' {a}))
    {φ : ι → X → β} (hφ : ∀ a ∈ F, Measurable (φ a)) : Measurable (fun x => φ (σ x) x) := by
  intro S hS
  have e : (fun x => φ (σ x) x) ⁻¹' S = ⋃ a ∈ F, (σ ⁻¹' {a}) ∩ (φ a) ⁻¹' S := by
    ext x
    simp only [mem_preimage, mem_iUnion, mem_inter_iff, mem_singleton_iff, exists_prop]
    exact ⟨fun h => ⟨σ x, hσF x, rfl, h⟩, fun ⟨a, _, ha, h⟩ => ha ▸ h⟩
  rw [e]
  exact Finset.measurableSet_biUnion F fun a ha => (hσm a).inter (hφ a ha hS)

/-- Helper: `∫ 𝟙_{|x' - x| ≤ ρ} |v(x')| dx' ≤ (2ρ)^n 𝖬 v(x)`. -/
lemma band_lintegral_indicator_ball_le (v : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) {ρ : ℝ} (hρ : 0 < ρ) :
    ∫⁻ x', (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ).indicator 1 (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal ((2 * ρ) ^ n) * cubeMaximalEuclidean n v x := by
  calc ∫⁻ x', (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ).indicator 1 (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ
      = ∫⁻ y, (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ).indicator 1 (x - y - x) *
          ‖v (x - y)‖ₑ :=
        (lintegral_sub_left_eq_self (fun x' =>
          (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ).indicator 1 (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ) x).symm
    _ ≤ ∫⁻ y, (euclideanCube 0 ρ).indicator (fun y => ‖v (x - y)‖ₑ) y := by
        refine lintegral_mono fun y => ?_
        by_cases hy : ‖y‖ ≤ ρ
        · have hc : y ∈ euclideanCube 0 ρ := fun i => by
            have := PiLp.norm_apply_le y i
            simp only [PiLp.zero_apply, sub_zero, Real.norm_eq_abs] at this ⊢
            linarith
          rw [indicator_of_mem hc]
          by_cases hb : x - y - x ∈ closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ
          · rw [indicator_of_mem hb]; simp
          · rw [indicator_of_notMem hb]; simp
        · have hb : x - y - x ∉ closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ := by
            rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, sub_sub_cancel_left, norm_neg]; exact hy
          rw [indicator_of_notMem hb]; simp
    _ = ∫⁻ y in euclideanCube 0 ρ, ‖v (x - y)‖ₑ :=
        lintegral_indicator (measurableSet_euclideanCube 0 ρ) _
    _ ≤ _ := setLIntegral_euclideanCube_le v x hρ

/-- Helper: the majorant integrates against `|v|` to at most `C T^{-1/(2D)} 𝖬 v`. -/
lemma band_lintegral_bandG_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hd : 1 ≤ d) {T : ℝ} (hT : 1 ≤ T) (j : ℤ)
    {v : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hv : AEStronglyMeasurable v volume)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ∫⁻ x', bandG n d T j (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ ≤
      ENNReal.ofReal ((8 ^ n + 2 ^ n) * T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ)))) * cubeMaximalEuclidean n v x := by
  have hT0 : 0 < T := by linarith
  set X : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (-j * n) with hX
  set Y : ℝ := T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ))) with hY
  set Z : ℝ := T ^ (-(1 / 2 : ℝ)) with hZ
  have hX0 : 0 ≤ X := by positivity
  have hY0 : 0 ≤ Y := by positivity
  have hZ0 : 0 < Z := by positivity
  set ρ1 : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ (j + 2) with hρ1
  set ρ2 : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ j * Z
  set M := cubeMaximalEuclidean n v x
  have hm1 : Measurable fun x' : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
      (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ1).indicator
        (1 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ≥0∞) (x' - x) :=
    (measurable_one.indicator measurableSet_closedBall).comp (measurable_id.sub_const x)
  have e : ∀ x', bandG n d T j (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ =
      ENNReal.ofReal X * (ENNReal.ofReal Y *
        ((closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ1).indicator 1 (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ)) +
      ENNReal.ofReal X *
        ((closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ2).indicator 1 (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ) := by
    intro x'; unfold bandG; ring
  simp_rw [e]
  erw [lintegral_add_left' (((hm1.aemeasurable.mul hv.enorm).const_mul (ENNReal.ofReal Y)).const_mul
      (ENNReal.ofReal X)),
    lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top, lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top,
    lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top]
  have h1 := band_lintegral_indicator_ball_le v x (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) < ρ1)
  have h2 := band_lintegral_indicator_ball_le v x (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) < ρ2)
  calc ENNReal.ofReal X * (ENNReal.ofReal Y *
        ∫⁻ x', (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ1).indicator 1 (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ) +
      ENNReal.ofReal X *
        ∫⁻ x', (closedBall (0 : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) ρ2).indicator 1 (x' - x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ
      ≤ ENNReal.ofReal X * (ENNReal.ofReal Y * (ENNReal.ofReal ((2 * ρ1) ^ n) * M)) +
        ENNReal.ofReal X * (ENNReal.ofReal ((2 * ρ2) ^ n) * M) := by gcongr
    _ = ENNReal.ofReal (X * (Y * (2 * ρ1) ^ n) + X * (2 * ρ2) ^ n) * M := by
        rw [ENNReal.ofReal_add (by positivity) (by positivity), ENNReal.ofReal_mul hX0,
          ENNReal.ofReal_mul hX0, ENNReal.ofReal_mul hY0]
        ring
    _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal ((8 ^ n + 2 ^ n) * Y) * M := by
        gcongr
        have e1 : X * (2 * ρ1) ^ n = 8 ^ n := by
          rw [show 2 * ρ1 = 8 * (2 : ℝ) ^ j by
            rw [hρ1, zpow_add₀ two_ne_zero]; norm_num; ring]
          exact band_two_zpow_mul_pow j n 8
        have e2 : X * (2 * ρ2) ^ n = (2 * Z) ^ n := by
          rw [show 2 * ρ2 = (2 * Z) * (2 : ℝ) ^ j by ring]
          exact band_two_zpow_mul_pow j n _
        have hZ1 : Z ≤ 1 := Real.rpow_le_one_of_one_le_of_nonpos hT (by norm_num)
        have hZY : Z ≤ Y := by
          refine Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_exponent_le hT ?_
          rw [neg_le_neg_iff]
          have hd' : (1 : ℝ) ≤ d := by exact_mod_cast hd
          rw [div_le_div_iff₀ (by positivity) (by norm_num)]
          linarith
        have hZn : Z ^ n ≤ Z := pow_le_of_le_one hZ0.le hZ1 (by omega)
        have e3 : X * (Y * (2 * ρ1) ^ n) + X * (2 * ρ2) ^ n = Y * 8 ^ n + 2 ^ n * Z ^ n := by
          rw [show X * (Y * (2 * ρ1) ^ n) = Y * (X * (2 * ρ1) ^ n) by ring, e1, e2, mul_pow]
        rw [e3]
        nlinarith [pow_pos (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 2) n]

end BandL2


section BandL2Main

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate
open Metric

variable {n : ℕ} {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- Helper: `|k_{j,μ}| = |K_j|` in `[0, ∞]`. -/
lemma enorm_bandKer (a : ℤ × ℝ) (y : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖bandKer n d Ω a y‖ₑ = ‖dyadicKernel Ω a.1 y‖ₑ := by
  rw [← ofReal_norm, ← ofReal_norm, norm_bandKer]

/-- Helper: the majorant `bandG` is measurable. -/
lemma measurable_bandG (n d : ℕ) (T : ℝ) (j : ℤ) : Measurable (bandG n d T j) := by
  unfold bandG
  refine Measurable.const_mul ?_ _
  exact ((measurable_one.indicator measurableSet_closedBall).const_mul _).add
    (measurable_one.indicator measurableSet_closedBall)

/-- **`L²` decay for finite linearizations** (Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`), the
`TT*` step): for every finite family `F` of admissible pairs `a = (j, μ)` (`T ≤ |μ| 2^{Dj} ≤ 2T`)
and every `f ∈ L²`, `‖max_{a ∈ F} |(e(μ P) K_j) * f|‖₂ ≤ C T^{-1/(4D)} ‖f‖₂` with `D = 2d`, `C`
independent of `T ≥ 1`, `F` and `f`. -/
theorem eLpNorm_bandMax_finset_le_two (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hd : 1 ≤ d) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ T : ℝ, 1 ≤ T → ∀ F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ), (∀ a ∈ F, IsBandAdm d T a) →
      ∀ f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ, MemLp f 2 volume →
        eLpNorm (fun x => F.sup fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ) 2 volume ≤
          ENNReal.ofReal (C * T ^ (-(1 / (8 * d : ℝ)))) * eLpNorm f 2 volume := by
  obtain ⟨Ck, hCk, hker⟩ := enorm_bandTT_le (Ω := Ω) hΩ hn hd
  obtain ⟨C0, hC0, hK⟩ := norm_dyadicKernel_le hΩ
  set Cm : ℝ := (hlMaximalConst (3 ^ n) 2).toReal with hCm
  have hCm' : ENNReal.ofReal Cm = hlMaximalConst (3 ^ n) 2 :=
    ENNReal.ofReal_toReal (hlMaximalConst_ne_top _ (by norm_num))
  have hCm0 : 0 ≤ Cm := ENNReal.toReal_nonneg
  set Cg : ℝ := 8 ^ n + 2 ^ n with hCg
  set K1 : ℝ := 2 * Ck * Cg * Cm with hK1def
  have hK1 : 0 ≤ K1 := by positivity
  set CL : ℝ := ∫ y, ‖dyadicKernel Ω 0 y‖ with hCL
  have hKL : ∀ j, ∫⁻ y, ‖dyadicKernel Ω j y‖ₑ = ENNReal.ofReal CL := by
    intro j
    rw [← ofReal_integral_norm_eq_lintegral_enorm (integrable_dyadicKernel hΩ j),
      integral_norm_dyadicKernel hΩ]
  refine ⟨K1 ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ), by positivity, fun T hT F hF f hf => ?_⟩
  have hT0 : 0 < T := by linarith
  set Y : ℝ := T ^ (-(1 / (4 * d : ℝ))) with hY
  have hY0 : 0 ≤ Y := by positivity
  have hfl : LocallyIntegrable f volume := hf.locallyIntegrable (by norm_num)
  have hA12 : ENNReal.ofReal (K1 * Y) ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) =
      ENNReal.ofReal (K1 ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) * T ^ (-(1 / (8 * d : ℝ)))) := by
    rw [ENNReal.ofReal_rpow_of_nonneg (by positivity) (by norm_num), Real.mul_rpow hK1 hY0, hY,
      ← Real.rpow_mul hT0.le]
    congr 3
    field_simp
    ring
  rw [← hA12]
  refine eLpNorm_finset_sup_le_of_linearization_op (fun a g x => bandConv n d Ω a g x) f F
    (fun a _ => (continuous_bandConv hΩ a hfl).aestronglyMeasurable) _ (fun σ hσF hσm => ?_)
  change eLpNorm (fun x => bandConv n d Ω (σ x) f x) 2 volume ≤ _
  -- the kernel of the linearized operator
  set κ : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ :=
    fun x y => bandKer n d Ω (σ x) (x - y) with hκ
  have hSf : (fun x => bandConv n d Ω (σ x) f x) = fun x => ∫ y, κ x y * f y := by
    funext x
    simp only [bandConv, hκ]
    rw [← integral_sub_left_eq_self (fun y => bandKer n d Ω (σ x) y * f (x - y)) volume x]
    simp only [sub_sub_cancel]
  rw [hSf]
  have hκm : StronglyMeasurable (Function.uncurry κ) := by
    have : Measurable (Function.uncurry κ) :=
      band_measurable_select (σ := fun p : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
          σ p.1) (F := F) (fun p => hσF p.1) (fun a => measurable_fst (hσm a))
        (φ := fun a p => bandKer n d Ω a (p.1 - p.2))
        (fun a _ => ((continuous_bandKer hΩ a).comp continuous_sub).measurable)
    exact this.stronglyMeasurable
  -- row, column and sup bounds
  set Q : ℝ≥0∞ := ∑ _a ∈ F, ENNReal.ofReal CL with hQ
  have hQt : Q ≠ ∞ := ENNReal.sum_ne_top.2 fun _ _ => ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top
  have hrow : ∀ x, ∫⁻ y, ‖κ x y‖ₑ ≤ Q := by
    intro x
    have e : ∫⁻ y, ‖κ x y‖ₑ = ENNReal.ofReal CL := by
      simp only [hκ, enorm_bandKer]
      rw [lintegral_sub_left_eq_self (fun y => ‖dyadicKernel Ω (σ x).1 y‖ₑ) x, hKL]
    rw [e, hQ]
    exact Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal CL) (fun _ _ => zero_le) (hσF x)
  have hcol : ∀ y, ∫⁻ x, ‖κ x y‖ₑ ≤ Q := by
    intro y
    calc ∫⁻ x, ‖κ x y‖ₑ ≤ ∫⁻ x, ∑ a ∈ F, ‖dyadicKernel Ω a.1 (x - y)‖ₑ := by
          refine lintegral_mono fun x => ?_
          rw [hκ]
          dsimp only
          rw [enorm_bandKer]
          exact Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun a : ℤ × ℝ => ‖dyadicKernel Ω a.1 (x - y)‖ₑ)
            (fun _ _ => zero_le) (hσF x)
      _ = ∑ a ∈ F, ∫⁻ x, ‖dyadicKernel Ω a.1 (x - y)‖ₑ := by
          refine lintegral_finsetSum' _ fun a _ => ?_
          exact ((contDiff_dyadicKernel hΩ a.1).continuous.comp
            (continuous_id.sub continuous_const)).measurable.enorm.aemeasurable
      _ = Q := by
          refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun a _ => ?_
          rw [lintegral_sub_right_eq_self (fun x => ‖dyadicKernel Ω a.1 x‖ₑ) y, hKL]
  have hM : ∀ x y, ‖κ x y‖ ≤ ∑ a ∈ F, C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n) := by
    intro x y
    simp only [hκ, norm_bandKer]
    exact (hK _ _).trans (Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun a : ℤ × ℝ => C0 * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-a.1 * n))
      (fun _ _ => by positivity) (hσF x))
  -- the `TT*` kernel and its majorant
  set G : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ≥0∞ :=
    fun x x' => bandG n d T (σ x).1 (x' - x) with hG
  have hGm : Measurable (Function.uncurry G) :=
    band_measurable_select (σ := fun p : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) × EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) =>
        σ p.1) (F := F) (fun p => hσF p.1) (fun a => measurable_fst (hσm a))
      (φ := fun a p => bandG n d T a.1 (p.2 - p.1))
      (fun a _ => (measurable_bandG n d T a.1).comp (measurable_snd.sub measurable_fst))
  have hH : ∀ x x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y)‖ₑ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (G x x' + G x' x) := by
    intro x x'
    have e : ∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y) = bandTT n d Ω (σ x) (σ x') (x' - x) := by
      simp only [hκ, bandTT]
      rw [← integral_sub_left_eq_self (fun z => bandKer n d Ω (σ x) z *
        conj (bandKer n d Ω (σ x') (z + (x' - x)))) volume x]
      congr 1; funext y
      congr 3
      abel
    rw [e]
    rcases le_total (σ x').1 (σ x).1 with hle | hle
    · refine (hker T hT _ _ (hF _ (hσF x)) (hF _ (hσF x')) hle _).trans ?_
      gcongr
      exact le_self_add
    · have hs := bandTT_swap (n := n) (d := d) (Ω := Ω) (σ x') (σ x) (x - x')
      rw [neg_sub] at hs
      rw [hs, RCLike.enorm_conj]
      refine (hker T hT _ _ (hF _ (hσF x')) (hF _ (hσF x)) hle _).trans ?_
      gcongr
      exact le_add_self
  -- the bilinear estimate
  have hA : ∀ v : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ, MemLp v 2 volume →
      ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y)‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (K1 * Y) * eLpNorm v 2 volume ^ 2 := by
    intro v hv
    have hvm := hv.aestronglyMeasurable
    have hMv := measurable_cubeMaximalEuclidean n hvm
    -- measurability of the partial integrals
    have hm1 : ∀ x, AEMeasurable (fun x' => ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ)) volume :=
      fun x => (((hGm.comp (measurable_const.prodMk measurable_id)).aemeasurable.mul
        hvm.enorm)).const_mul _
    have hI1m : AEMeasurable (fun x => ∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ) volume :=
      (hGm.aemeasurable.mul (hvm.comp_snd (μ := volume)).enorm).lintegral_prod_right'
    -- the inner integral
    have hinner : ∀ x, ∫⁻ x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y)‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ) +
          ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (∫⁻ x', G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ) := by
      intro x
      calc ∫⁻ x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y)‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ
          ≤ ∫⁻ x', (ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ) +
              ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ)) := by
            refine lintegral_mono fun x' => ?_
            calc ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y)‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ
                ≤ ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (G x x' + G x' x) * ‖v x'‖ₑ := by gcongr; exact hH x x'
              _ = _ := by ring
        _ = _ := by
            rw [lintegral_add_left' (hm1 x), lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top,
              lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top]
    -- symmetry of the two terms
    have hswap : ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ =
        ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ := by
      have hm : AEMeasurable (Function.uncurry fun x x' => ‖v x‖ₑ * (G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ))
          (volume.prod volume) :=
        (hvm.comp_fst (ν := volume)).enorm.mul
          ((hGm.comp measurable_swap).aemeasurable.mul (hvm.comp_snd (μ := volume)).enorm)
      calc ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ
          = ∫⁻ x, ∫⁻ x', ‖v x‖ₑ * (G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ) := by
            congr 1; funext x; rw [lintegral_const_mul' _ _ enorm_ne_top]
        _ = ∫⁻ x', ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * (G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ) := lintegral_lintegral_swap hm
        _ = ∫⁻ x', ‖v x'‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x, G x' x * ‖v x‖ₑ := by
            congr 1; funext x'
            rw [← lintegral_const_mul' _ _ enorm_ne_top]
            congr 1; funext x; ring
    -- the main term, via the maximal function
    have hmain : ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (Cg * Y) * (ENNReal.ofReal Cm * eLpNorm v 2 volume ^ 2) := by
      calc ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ
          ≤ ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * (ENNReal.ofReal (Cg * Y) * cubeMaximalEuclidean n v x) := by
            refine lintegral_mono fun x => ?_
            gcongr
            exact band_lintegral_bandG_le hn hd hT (σ x).1 hvm x
        _ = ENNReal.ofReal (Cg * Y) * ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * cubeMaximalEuclidean n v x := by
            rw [← lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top]
            congr 1; funext x; ring
        _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (Cg * Y) *
            (eLpNorm v 2 volume * eLpNorm (cubeMaximalEuclidean n v) 2 volume) := by
            gcongr
            have := band_lintegral_mul_le_eLpNorm_two hvm.enorm hMv.aemeasurable
            rwa [eLpNorm_enorm v hvm] at this
        _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (Cg * Y) *
            (eLpNorm v 2 volume * (ENNReal.ofReal Cm * eLpNorm v 2 volume)) := by
            gcongr
            have := eLpNorm_cubeMaximalEuclidean_le n (by norm_num : (1 : ℝ) < 2) hvm
            rwa [ENNReal.ofReal_ofNat, ← hCm'] at this
        _ = _ := by ring
    calc ∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y)‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ
        ≤ ∫⁻ x, (ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ) +
            ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ)) := by
          refine lintegral_mono fun x => ?_
          calc ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', ‖∫ y, κ x y * conj (κ x' y)‖ₑ * ‖v x'‖ₑ
              ≤ ‖v x‖ₑ * (ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ) +
                  ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (∫⁻ x', G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ)) := by gcongr; exact hinner x
            _ = _ := by ring
      _ = ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ) +
            ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x' x * ‖v x'‖ₑ) := by
          rw [lintegral_add_left'
              (f := fun x => ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ))
              ((hvm.enorm.mul hI1m).const_mul _),
            lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top,
            lintegral_const_mul' _ _ ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top]
      _ = 2 * ENNReal.ofReal Ck * (∫⁻ x, ‖v x‖ₑ * ∫⁻ x', G x x' * ‖v x'‖ₑ) := by
          rw [hswap]; ring
      _ ≤ 2 * ENNReal.ofReal Ck *
            (ENNReal.ofReal (Cg * Y) * (ENNReal.ofReal Cm * eLpNorm v 2 volume ^ 2)) := by
          gcongr
      _ = ENNReal.ofReal (K1 * Y) * eLpNorm v 2 volume ^ 2 := by
          rw [show K1 * Y = 2 * Ck * (Cg * Y) * Cm by rw [hK1def]; ring,
            ENNReal.ofReal_mul (show (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2 * Ck * (Cg * Y) by positivity),
            ENNReal.ofReal_mul (show (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2 * Ck by positivity),
            ENNReal.ofReal_mul (show (0 : ℝ) ≤ 2 by norm_num), ENNReal.ofReal_ofNat]
          ring
  exact band_eLpNorm_kernel_le_of_ttstar hκm hQt hrow hcol hM hA hf

end BandL2Main


section BandLp

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate

variable {n : ℕ} {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- The finite maximal function `max_{a ∈ F} |(e(μ P) K_j) * f|` as a real-valued function (for
interpolation). -/
noncomputable def bandMaxR (n d : ℕ) (Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ))
    (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : ℝ :=
  (F.sup fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ).toReal

/-- Helper: finite maxima of `|bandConv|` are finite. -/
lemma band_finset_sup_ne_top (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ)) (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) : (F.sup fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ) ≠ ∞ := by
  refine ne_of_lt ((Finset.sup_lt_iff ENNReal.zero_lt_top).2 fun a _ => enorm_lt_top)

/-- Helper: `|bandMaxR F f x| = max_{a ∈ F} |bandConv a f x|`. -/
lemma enorm_bandMaxR (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ)) (f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ)
    (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    ‖bandMaxR n d Ω F f x‖ₑ = F.sup fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ := by
  rw [bandMaxR, Real.enorm_eq_ofReal ENNReal.toReal_nonneg,
    ENNReal.ofReal_toReal (band_finset_sup_ne_top F f x)]

/-- Helper: measurability of the finite maximal function. -/
lemma measurable_bandMax (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ))
    {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hf : LocallyIntegrable f volume) :
    Measurable (fun x => F.sup fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ) := by
  simp_rw [Finset.sup_eq_iSup]
  exact Measurable.biSup _ F.countable_toSet fun a _ =>
    (continuous_bandConv hΩ a hf).measurable.enorm

/-- Helper: `bandMaxR` is measurable. -/
lemma measurable_bandMaxR (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ))
    {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hf : LocallyIntegrable f volume) :
    Measurable (bandMaxR n d Ω F f) :=
  (measurable_bandMax hΩ F hf).ennreal_toReal

/-- Helper: `bandMaxR` has the `L^p` norm of the finite maximal function. -/
lemma eLpNorm_bandMaxR (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ))
    {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} (hf : LocallyIntegrable f volume) (p : ℝ≥0∞) :
    eLpNorm (bandMaxR n d Ω F f) p volume =
      eLpNorm (fun x => F.sup fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ) p volume :=
  eLpNorm_congr_enorm_ae (measurable_bandMaxR hΩ F hf).aestronglyMeasurable
    (measurable_bandMax hΩ F hf).aestronglyMeasurable
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => by rw [enorm_bandMaxR, enorm_eq_self])

/-- Helper: the finite maximal operator is subadditive on `L^p`, `p ≥ 1`. -/
lemma isSublinearOn_bandMaxR (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ)) {q : ℝ≥0∞} (hq : 1 ≤ q) :
    IsSublinearOn (bandMaxR n d Ω F) {f | MemLp f q volume} volume := by
  intro f hf g hg
  refine Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun x => ?_
  have hfl : LocallyIntegrable f volume := MemLp.locallyIntegrable hf hq
  have hgl : LocallyIntegrable g volume := MemLp.locallyIntegrable hg hq
  simp only [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg ENNReal.toReal_nonneg, bandMaxR]
  rw [← ENNReal.toReal_add (band_finset_sup_ne_top F f x) (band_finset_sup_ne_top F g x)]
  refine ENNReal.toReal_mono (ENNReal.add_ne_top.2 ⟨band_finset_sup_ne_top F f x,
    band_finset_sup_ne_top F g x⟩) (Finset.sup_le fun a ha => ?_)
  rw [bandConv_add hΩ a hfl hgl]
  exact (enorm_add_le _ _).trans
    (add_le_add (Finset.le_sup (f := fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ) ha)
      (Finset.le_sup (f := fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a g x‖ₑ) ha))

/-- Helper: weak type `(1, 1)` of the finite maximal operator, uniformly in `F` (domination by
the cube maximal function). -/
lemma hasWeakTypeOn_one_bandMaxR (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ A : ℝ≥0, ∀ (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ)) (q : ℝ≥0∞),
      HasWeakTypeOn (bandMaxR n d Ω F) {f | MemLp f q volume} 1 A volume volume := by
  obtain ⟨Cd, hCd, hdom⟩ := enorm_bandConv_le_cubeMaximal (n := n) (d := d) hΩ
  set c : ℝ := Cd + 1 with hc
  have hc0 : 0 < c := by linarith
  refine ⟨(3 ^ n : ℝ≥0) * c.toNNReal, fun F q f hf t ht => ?_⟩
  have hfm : AEStronglyMeasurable f volume := hf.aestronglyMeasurable
  by_cases htop : t = ∞
  · simp [distributionFunction, htop]
  set c' : ℝ≥0∞ := ENNReal.ofReal c with hc'
  have hc'0 : c' ≠ 0 := by rw [hc']; simpa using hc0
  have hc't : c' ≠ ∞ := ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top
  have hsub : {x | t < ‖bandMaxR n d Ω F f x‖ₑ} ⊆ {x | t / c' < cubeMaximalEuclidean n f x} := by
    intro x hx
    simp only [mem_ofPred_eq] at hx ⊢
    rw [ENNReal.div_lt_iff (Or.inl hc'0) (Or.inl hc't)]
    refine hx.trans_le ?_
    rw [enorm_bandMaxR]
    refine Finset.sup_le fun a _ => (hdom a f x).trans ?_
    rw [mul_comm]
    gcongr
    exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (by linarith)
  have hw := cubeMaximalEuclidean_weak_one n hfm (t / c')
  calc distributionFunction (bandMaxR n d Ω F f) t volume
      ≤ volume {x | t / c' < cubeMaximalEuclidean n f x} := measure_mono hsub
    _ ≤ ((3 ^ n : ℝ≥0) : ℝ≥0∞) / (t / c') * ∫⁻ y, ‖f y‖ₑ := hw
    _ = ((((3 ^ n : ℝ≥0) * c.toNNReal : ℝ≥0) : ℝ≥0∞) * eLpNorm f (ENNReal.ofReal 1) volume / t)
          ^ (1 : ℝ) := by
        rw [ENNReal.rpow_one, ENNReal.ofReal_one, eLpNorm_one_eq_lintegral_enorm hfm,
          ENNReal.coe_mul]
        change _ = _ * c' * _ / t
        rw [ENNReal.div_eq_inv_mul (b := t / c'), ENNReal.inv_div (Or.inl hc't) (Or.inl hc'0)]
        simp only [div_eq_mul_inv]
        ring

end BandLp


section BandLpMain

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate

variable {n : ℕ} {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- Helper: `ofReal x · ofReal y ^ α · ofReal z ^ β = ofReal (x y^α z^β)`
for `x, y, z, α, β ≥ 0`. -/
lemma band_ofReal_mul_rpow {x y z α β : ℝ} (hx : 0 ≤ x) (hy : 0 ≤ y) (hz : 0 ≤ z) (hα : 0 ≤ α)
    (hβ : 0 ≤ β) :
    ENNReal.ofReal x * ENNReal.ofReal y ^ α * ENNReal.ofReal z ^ β =
      ENNReal.ofReal (x * y ^ α * z ^ β) := by
  rw [ENNReal.ofReal_rpow_of_nonneg hy hα, ENNReal.ofReal_rpow_of_nonneg hz hβ,
    ENNReal.ofReal_mul (by positivity), ENNReal.ofReal_mul hx]

/-- Helper: `((c T^{-s})^θ = c^θ T^{-sθ}`. -/
lemma band_mul_rpow_rpow {c T s θ : ℝ} (hc : 0 ≤ c) (hT : 0 < T) :
    (c * T ^ (-s)) ^ θ = c ^ θ * T ^ (-(s * θ)) := by
  rw [Real.mul_rpow hc (by positivity), ← Real.rpow_mul hT.le]
  ring_nf

/-- Helper: strong type `(2, 2)` of the finite maximal operator on `L^q`, with constant
`(C + 1) T^{-1/(4D)}`. -/
lemma hasStrongTypeOn_two_bandMaxR (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hd : 1 ≤ d) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ T : ℝ, 1 ≤ T → ∀ F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ), (∀ a ∈ F, IsBandAdm d T a) →
      ∀ q : ℝ≥0∞, 1 ≤ q →
      HasStrongTypeOn (bandMaxR n d Ω F) {f | MemLp f q volume} 2
        (Real.toNNReal ((C + 1) * T ^ (-(1 / (8 * d : ℝ))))) volume volume := by
  obtain ⟨C, hC, hL2⟩ := eLpNorm_bandMax_finset_le_two (Ω := Ω) hΩ hn hd
  refine ⟨C, hC, fun T hT F hF q hq f hf => ?_⟩
  have hfl : LocallyIntegrable f volume := MemLp.locallyIntegrable hf hq
  have hT0 : 0 < T := by linarith
  rw [ENNReal.ofReal_ofNat, eLpNorm_bandMaxR hΩ F hfl]
  change _ ≤ ENNReal.ofReal ((C + 1) * T ^ (-(1 / (8 * d : ℝ)))) * _
  by_cases hf2 : eLpNorm f 2 volume = ∞
  · rw [hf2, ENNReal.mul_top (by
      rw [ne_eq, ENNReal.ofReal_eq_zero, not_le]; positivity)]
    exact le_top
  · refine (hL2 T hT F hF f (lt_top_iff_ne_top.2 hf2)).trans ?_
    gcongr
    linarith

/-- Helper: the `L^∞` bound for the finite maximal operator. -/
lemma hasLinftyBoundOn_bandMaxR (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) :
    ∃ B : ℝ≥0, ∀ (F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ)) (q : ℝ≥0∞),
      HasLinftyBoundOn (bandMaxR n d Ω F) {f | MemLp f q volume} B volume := by
  obtain ⟨CL, hCL, hb⟩ := norm_bandConv_le_of_bound (n := n) (d := d) hΩ
  refine ⟨CL.toNNReal, fun F q f _ s hs => Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_⟩
  have hs0 : 0 ≤ s := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hs 0)
  rw [Real.coe_toNNReal _ hCL, Real.norm_eq_abs,
    abs_of_nonneg (show 0 ≤ bandMaxR n d Ω F f y from ENNReal.toReal_nonneg), bandMaxR]
  refine ENNReal.toReal_le_of_le_ofReal (by positivity) (Finset.sup_le fun a _ => ?_)
  rw [← ofReal_norm]
  exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal (hb a f s hs y)

/-- **`L^p` decay for finite families** (Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`), the
interpolation step): for `1 < p < ∞` there is `C` such that for all `T ≥ 1`, every finite family
`F` of admissible pairs and every `f ∈ L^p`,
`‖max_{a ∈ F} |(e(μ P) K_j) * f|‖_p ≤ C T^{-σ_p} ‖f‖_p`, `σ_p = (2D)^{-1} min(1/p, 1/p')`. -/
theorem eLpNorm_bandMax_finset_le (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hd : 1 ≤ d) {p : ℝ}
    (hp : 1 < p) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ ∀ T : ℝ, 1 ≤ T → ∀ F : Finset (ℤ × ℝ), (∀ a ∈ F, IsBandAdm d T a) →
      ∀ f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ, MemLp f (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume →
        eLpNorm (fun x => F.sup fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ) (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume ≤
          ENNReal.ofReal (C * T ^ (-(1 / (2 * (2 * d : ℝ)) * min (1 / p) (1 - 1 / p)))) *
            eLpNorm f (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume := by
  obtain ⟨A1, hA1⟩ := hasWeakTypeOn_one_bandMaxR (n := n) (d := d) hΩ
  obtain ⟨C2, hC2, hS2⟩ := hasStrongTypeOn_two_bandMaxR (Ω := Ω) hΩ hn hd
  obtain ⟨Binf, hBinf⟩ := hasLinftyBoundOn_bandMaxR (n := n) (d := d) hΩ
  obtain ⟨C2', hC2', hL2⟩ := eLpNorm_bandMax_finset_le_two (Ω := Ω) hΩ hn hd
  have hp0 : 0 < p := by linarith
  have hq : 1 ≤ ENNReal.ofReal p := by
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_one]; exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal hp.le
  have hd' : (0 : ℝ) < d := by exact_mod_cast hd
  set s : ℝ := 1 / (8 * d : ℝ) with hs
  rcases lt_trichotomy p 2 with hp2 | rfl | hp2
  · -- `1 < p < 2`: interpolate weak `(1,1)` with strong `(2,2)`
    set θ : ℝ := 2 - 2 / p with hθ
    have hθ0 : 0 ≤ θ := by
      rw [hθ, sub_nonneg, div_le_iff₀ hp0]; linarith
    have hθ1 : 0 ≤ 1 - θ := by
      rw [hθ]; have : 2 / p ≤ 2 := by rw [div_le_iff₀ hp0]; linarith
      have : 1 ≤ 2 / p := by rw [le_div_iff₀ hp0]; linarith
      linarith
    refine ⟨(marcinkiewiczConst 1 2 p : ℝ) * (A1 : ℝ) ^ (1 - θ) * (C2 + 1) ^ θ, by positivity,
      fun T hT F hF f hf => ?_⟩
    have hT0 : 0 < T := by linarith
    have hfl : LocallyIntegrable f volume := MemLp.locallyIntegrable hf hq
    have h := eLpNorm_le_of_hasWeakTypeOn (a := 1) (b := 2) (θ := θ) one_pos hp hp2
      (by rw [hθ]; field_simp; ring) (hA1 F (ENNReal.ofReal p))
      ((hS2 T hT F hF _ hq).hasWeakTypeOn two_pos) (isSublinearOn_bandMaxR hΩ F hq)
      isTruncationClosed_memLp hf hf.aestronglyMeasurable
      (measurable_bandMaxR hΩ F hfl).aestronglyMeasurable
    rw [eLpNorm_bandMaxR hΩ F hfl] at h
    refine h.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
    congr 1
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_coe_nnreal (p := marcinkiewiczConst 1 2 p),
      ← ENNReal.ofReal_coe_nnreal (p := A1)]
    change ENNReal.ofReal _ * ENNReal.ofReal _ ^ (1 - θ) *
      ENNReal.ofReal ((C2 + 1) * T ^ (-s)) ^ θ = _
    rw [band_ofReal_mul_rpow (NNReal.coe_nonneg _) (NNReal.coe_nonneg _) (by positivity) hθ1 hθ0,
      band_mul_rpow_rpow (by positivity) hT0]
    congr 1
    have hmin : min (1 / p) (1 - 1 / p) = 1 - 1 / p := by
      refine min_eq_right ?_
      have : 1 / 2 < 1 / p := one_div_lt_one_div_of_lt hp0 hp2
      linarith
    rw [hmin, hs, hθ]
    have : -(1 / (8 * (d : ℝ)) * (2 - 2 / p)) = -(1 / (2 * (2 * d)) * (1 - 1 / p)) := by
      field_simp; ring
    rw [this]; ring
  · -- `p = 2`
    refine ⟨C2', hC2', fun T hT F hF f hf => ?_⟩
    rw [ENNReal.ofReal_ofNat] at hf ⊢
    refine (hL2 T hT F hF f hf).trans (le_of_eq ?_)
    congr 3
    rw [min_eq_left (by norm_num), hs]
    congr 1
    field_simp; ring
  · -- `p > 2`: interpolate strong `(2,2)` with `L^∞`
    have hθ0 : 0 ≤ 2 / p := by positivity
    have hθ1 : 0 ≤ 1 - 2 / p := by
      rw [sub_nonneg, div_le_one hp0]; linarith
    refine ⟨(marcinkiewiczConstTop 2 p : ℝ) * (C2 + 1) ^ (2 / p) * (Binf : ℝ) ^ (1 - 2 / p),
      by positivity, fun T hT F hF f hf => ?_⟩
    have hT0 : 0 < T := by linarith
    have hfl : LocallyIntegrable f volume := MemLp.locallyIntegrable hf hq
    have h := eLpNorm_le_of_hasWeakTypeOn_of_linfty (a := 2) two_pos hp2
      ((hS2 T hT F hF _ hq).hasWeakTypeOn two_pos) (hBinf F (ENNReal.ofReal p))
      (isSublinearOn_bandMaxR hΩ F hq) isTruncationClosed_memLp hf hf.aestronglyMeasurable
      (measurable_bandMaxR hΩ F hfl).aestronglyMeasurable (Or.inr hf.ne)
    rw [eLpNorm_bandMaxR hΩ F hfl] at h
    refine h.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
    congr 1
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_coe_nnreal (p := marcinkiewiczConstTop 2 p),
      ← ENNReal.ofReal_coe_nnreal (p := Binf)]
    change ENNReal.ofReal _ * ENNReal.ofReal ((C2 + 1) * T ^ (-s)) ^ (2 / p) *
      ENNReal.ofReal _ ^ (1 - 2 / p) = _
    rw [band_ofReal_mul_rpow (NNReal.coe_nonneg _) (by positivity) (NNReal.coe_nonneg _) hθ0 hθ1,
      band_mul_rpow_rpow (by positivity) hT0]
    have hmin : min (1 / p) (1 - 1 / p) = 1 / p := by
      refine min_eq_left ?_
      have : 1 / p < 1 / 2 := one_div_lt_one_div_of_lt two_pos hp2
      linarith
    rw [hmin, hs]
    have : -(1 / (8 * (d : ℝ)) * (2 / p)) = -(1 / (2 * (2 * d)) * (1 / p)) := by
      ring
    rw [this]; ring_nf

end BandLpMain


section BandFinal

open scoped ENNReal NNReal ComplexConjugate

variable {n : ℕ} {Ω : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ} {d : ℕ}

/-- Helper: `μ ↦ (e(μ P) K_j) * f(x)` is continuous for locally integrable `f` (dominated
convergence). -/
lemma continuous_bandConv_param (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) (j : ℤ) {f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ}
    (hf : LocallyIntegrable f volume) (x : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n)) :
    Continuous (fun μ : ℝ => bandConv n d Ω (j, μ) f x) := by
  unfold bandConv
  refine continuous_of_dominated (bound := fun y => ‖bandKer n d Ω (j, 0) y * f (x - y)‖)
    (fun μ => (integrable_bandKer_mul hΩ (j, μ) hf x).aestronglyMeasurable)
    (fun μ => Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => le_of_eq ?_)
    (integrable_bandKer_mul hΩ (j, 0) hf x).norm (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun y => ?_)
  · rw [norm_mul, norm_mul, norm_bandKer, norm_bandKer]
  · unfold bandKer
    have h1 : Continuous (fun μ : ℝ => eC (μ * radialPoly n d y)) :=
      osc_contDiff_eC.continuous.comp (continuous_id.mul continuous_const)
    fun_prop

/-- The clamp `u ↦ max 1 (min 2 u)` onto `[1, 2]`, used to parametrize admissible parameters by
rationals. -/
noncomputable def bandClamp (u : ℝ) : ℝ := max 1 (min 2 u)

/-- Helper: the clamp is continuous. -/
lemma continuous_bandClamp : Continuous bandClamp := by
  unfold bandClamp; fun_prop

/-- **Continuous annular maximal decay.** Blueprint Lemma 5.3 (`lem:continuousband`): let
`n ≥ 1`, `d ≥ 1`, `D = 2d`, `P = radialPoly n d`, `K_j = dyadicKernel Ω j` for an admissible
profile `Ω`, and for `T ≥ 1` let
`𝔥_T f(x) = sup_{j ∈ ℤ, T ≤ |μ| 2^{Dj} ≤ 2T} |(e(μ P) K_j) * f(x)|` (`contBandMax`). For every
`1 < p < ∞` there is `C_p` such that for all `T ≥ 1` and `f ∈ L^p(E)`,
`‖𝔥_T f‖_{L^p(E)} ≤ C_p T^{-σ_p} ‖f‖_p` with `σ_p = (2D)^{-1} min(1/p, 1/p')`. -/
theorem eLpNorm_contBandMax_le (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hd : 1 ≤ d) (hΩ : IsSWProfile Ω) {p : ℝ}
    (hp : 1 < p) :
    ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ T : ℝ, 1 ≤ T → ∀ f : EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℂ,
      MemLp f (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume →
      eLpNorm (contBandMax n d Ω T f) (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume ≤
        ENNReal.ofReal (C * T ^ (-(1 / (2 * (2 * d : ℝ)) * min (1 / p) (1 - 1 / p)))) *
          eLpNorm f (ENNReal.ofReal p) volume := by
  classical
  obtain ⟨C, -, hfin⟩ := eLpNorm_bandMax_finset_le (Ω := Ω) hΩ hn hd hp
  refine ⟨C, fun T hT f hf => ?_⟩
  have hT0 : 0 < T := by linarith
  have hq : 1 ≤ ENNReal.ofReal p := by
    rw [← ENNReal.ofReal_one]; exact ENNReal.ofReal_le_ofReal hp.le
  have hfl : LocallyIntegrable f volume := MemLp.locallyIntegrable hf hq
  -- the rational parametrization of the admissible parameters
  set m : ℤ × Bool × ℚ → ℤ × ℝ := fun i => (i.1, (if i.2.1 then 1 else -1) *
    bandClamp i.2.2 * T * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-((2 * d : ℤ) * i.1))) with hm
  have hclamp : ∀ u, 1 ≤ bandClamp u ∧ bandClamp u ≤ 2 := fun u =>
    ⟨le_max_left _ _, max_le (by norm_num) (min_le_left _ _)⟩
  have hmadm : ∀ i, IsBandAdm d T (m i) := by
    intro i
    obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := hclamp i.2.2
    have hX : (0 : ℝ) < (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * i.1) := by positivity
    have e : |(m i).2| * (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * (m i).1) = bandClamp i.2.2 * T := by
      simp only [hm]
      rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_mul,
        abs_of_pos (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) < (2 : ℝ) ^ (-((2 * d : ℤ) * i.1))),
        abs_of_pos hT0, abs_of_pos (by linarith : (0 : ℝ) < bandClamp i.2.2), zpow_neg]
      have hs : |(if i.2.1 then (1 : ℝ) else -1)| = 1 := by split_ifs <;> simp
      rw [hs]
      field_simp
    unfold IsBandAdm
    rw [e]
    constructor <;> nlinarith
  set g : ℤ × Bool × ℚ → EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin n) → ℝ≥0∞ :=
    fun i x => ‖bandConv n d Ω (m i) f x‖ₑ with hg
  have heq : contBandMax n d Ω T f = fun x => ⨆ i, g i x := by
    funext x
    rw [contBandMax_eq]
    refine le_antisymm (iSup₂_le fun a ha => ?_)
      (iSup_le fun i => le_iSup₂_of_le (m i) (hmadm i) le_rfl)
    obtain ⟨j, μ⟩ := a
    set X : ℝ := (2 : ℝ) ^ ((2 * d : ℤ) * j) with hX
    have hX0 : 0 < X := by positivity
    set sgn : Bool := decide (0 ≤ μ) with hsgn
    set u : ℝ := |μ| * X / T with hu
    have hu1 : 1 ≤ u := by rw [hu, le_div_iff₀ hT0]; linarith [ha.1]
    have hu2 : u ≤ 2 := by rw [hu, div_le_iff₀ hT0]; linarith [ha.2]
    have hcu : bandClamp u = u := by
      unfold bandClamp; rw [min_eq_right hu2, max_eq_right hu1]
    have hμ : μ = (if sgn then 1 else -1) * bandClamp u * T * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-((2 * d : ℤ) * j)) := by
      rw [hcu, hu, zpow_neg, ← hX]
      by_cases h0 : 0 ≤ μ
      · have : sgn = true := by rw [hsgn]; exact decide_eq_true h0
        rw [this, ite_eq_left rfl, abs_of_nonneg h0]; field_simp
      · have : sgn = false := by rw [hsgn]; exact decide_eq_false h0
        push Not at h0
        rw [this, ite_eq_right (by simp), abs_of_neg h0]; field_simp
    set φ : ℝ → ℝ≥0∞ := fun u' => ‖bandConv n d Ω (j, (if sgn then 1 else -1) * bandClamp u' * T *
      (2 : ℝ) ^ (-((2 * d : ℤ) * j))) f x‖ₑ with hφ
    have hφc : Continuous φ :=
      ((continuous_bandConv_param hΩ j hfl x).comp (((continuous_const.mul continuous_bandClamp).mul
        continuous_const).mul continuous_const)).enorm
    have hle : φ u ≤ ⨆ i, g i x :=
      Rat.denseRange_cast.induction_on (p := fun u' => φ u' ≤ ⨆ i, g i x) u
        (isClosed_le hφc continuous_const) (fun q => le_iSup (fun i => g i x) (j, sgn, q))
    have e : ‖bandConv n d Ω (j, μ) f x‖ₑ = φ u := by
      simp only [hφ]; rw [← hμ]
    rw [e]; exact hle
  rw [heq]
  refine eLpNorm_iSup_le_of_finset_countable ENNReal.ofReal_ne_top g
    (fun i => (continuous_bandConv hΩ (m i) hfl).measurable.enorm.aemeasurable) _ (fun F' => ?_)
  have e : (fun x => F'.sup fun i => g i x) =
      fun x => (F'.image m).sup fun a => ‖bandConv n d Ω a f x‖ₑ := by
    funext x; rw [Finset.sup_image]; rfl
  rw [e]
  refine hfin T hT (F'.image m) ?_ f hf
  intro a ha
  obtain ⟨i, -, rfl⟩ := Finset.mem_image.1 ha
  exact hmadm i

end BandFinal

